  ('565493406692398403', 'Sanjay and Craig', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Jim Dirschberger, Andreas Trolf, Jay Howell', null, 'Maulik Pancholy, Chris Hardwick, Linda Cardellini, Grey DeLisle', 'TV-Y7', 'Sanjay and Craig is an American animated television series produced by Nickelodeon. The show is about a 12-year-old boy named Sanjay Patel who owns a talking pet snake named Craig.', 'Sanjay and Craig is an American animated television series produced by Nickelodeon. The show is about a 12-year-old boy named Sanjay Patel who owns a talking pet snake named Craig.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uFBWQcMe79V5xKWML8HX6dYRwG8.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:61520'),
  ('1045589911544400438', 'Sankarea: Undying Love', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Maaya Uchida, Ryohei Kimura, Sayuri Yahagi, Yuka Iguchi, Misato Fukuen, Mayumi Asano, Seiro Ogino, Shuhei Iwase', 'TV-MA', 'Zombie-obsessed Furuya is making a potion to reanimate his dead cat when he meets Rea. She’s about as miserable as a girl can get, thanks to her creepy, domineering father. When the pain becomes too much, she tries to commit suicide with a sip of Furuya’s weird elixir. The potion doesn’t kill her – but it does turn her into a zombie after she falls from a cliff. Now that Rea’s undead and ready to finally live, she hides out with Furuya, who’s always dreamed of having a zombie girlfriend. Their one-of-a-kind relationship comes with some challenges, like the fact that Rea is decomposing. Even worse, her freak-show dad is dangerously determined to get her back under his control. As Furuya fights to keep his ghoulfriend safe, Rea finds the secret to resurrecting her happiness: Live like you’re dying – even if you’re already dead.', 'Zombie-obsessed Furuya is making a potion to reanimate his dead cat when he meets Rea. She’s about as miserable as a girl can get, thanks to her creepy, domineering father. When the pain becomes too much, she tries to commit suicide with a sip of Furuya’s weird elixir. The potion doesn’t kill her – but it does turn her into a zombie after she falls from a cliff. Now that Rea’s undead and ready to finally live, she hides out with Furuya, who’s always dreamed of having a zombie girlfriend. Their one-of-a-kind relationship comes with some challenges, like the fact that Rea is decomposing. Even worse, her freak-show dad is dangerously determined to get her back under his control. As Furuya fights to keep his ghoulfriend safe, Rea finds the secret to resurrecting her happiness: Live like you’re dying – even if you’re already dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/onnBtLYwC1snOARDGhGoJ4x3ZX6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62742'),
  ('976982557654511664', 'SanPa: Sins of the Savior', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Gianluca Neri', 'Paolo Bernardelli, Carlo Giuseppe Gabardini, Gianluca Neri', 'Vincenzo Andreucci, Angelo Battistini, Walter Delogu, Vincenzo Muccioli, Andrea Delogu, Red Ronnie', 'TV-MA', 'Amidst a heroin crisis, Vincenzo Muccioli cared for the addicted, earning him fierce public devotion — even as charges of violence began to mount.', 'Amidst a heroin crisis, Vincenzo Muccioli cared for the addicted, earning him fierce public devotion — even as charges of violence began to mount.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5g0WtC4p934xq4ppZp6g0VWsmN6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:115569'),
  ('677930437250823041', 'Sanremo Music Festival', 1951, 'Family, Reality', null, null, 'Carlo Conti, Laura Pausini', 'TV-G', 'The Sanremo Music Festival is the most popular Italian song contest and awards, held annually in the town of Sanremo, Imperia, Italy, and consisting of a competition amongst previously unreleased songs. The Festival was the inspiration for the Eurovision Song Contest.', 'The Sanremo Music Festival is the most popular Italian song contest and awards, held annually in the town of Sanremo, Imperia, Italy, and consisting of a competition amongst previously unreleased songs. The Festival was the inspiration for the Eurovision Song Contest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ohqDyr5Wx9jYx3jhsiPqOYAUo65.jpg', 76, 'tmdb:tv:66550'),
  ('775340977538201544', 'Sanrio Boys', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Takuya Eguchi, Soma Saito, Jun Osuka, Kitsune Kagura, Yuma Uchida, Daisuke Kishio, Chihiro Suzuki, Makoto Furukawa', 'TV-14', 'Hasegawa Kouta, 17 years old, is a second-year high school student. His days are unremarkable and average when Kouta meets Mizuno Yuu, Yoshino Shunsuke, Nishimiya Ryo, and Minamoto Seiichiro, who are fellow students attending Hijirikawa High School. In an instant, Kouta''s average life begins to be awash with sparkling light. A tale of a sparkling youth and his encounter with the Sanrio Boys. Our story begins.', 'Hasegawa Kouta, 17 years old, is a second-year high school student. His days are unremarkable and average when Kouta meets Mizuno Yuu, Yoshino Shunsuke, Nishimiya Ryo, and Minamoto Seiichiro, who are fellow students attending Hijirikawa High School. In an instant, Kouta''s average life begins to be awash with sparkling light. A tale of a sparkling youth and his encounter with the Sanrio Boys. Our story begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Po0rXazSixCJtj3XU19Dv7XjkW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76140'),
  ('953403551501607098', 'Santa Barbara', 1984, 'Soap', 'Bridget Dobson, Jerome Dobson', 'Charles Pratt, Jr., Lynda Myles, Frank Salisbury', 'Jed Allan, Robin Mattson, Nancy Lee Grahn, Nicolas Coster, Judith McConnell, Gordon Thomson, Jack Wagner, Eileen Davidson', null, 'Santa Barbara is an American television soap opera, first broadcast in the United States on NBC on July 30, 1984, and last aired on January 15, 1993. The show revolves around the eventful lives of the wealthy Capwell family of Santa Barbara, California. Other prominent families featured on the soap were the rival Lockridge family, and the more modest Andrade and Perkins families. Santa Barbara aired in over 40 countries around the world and is best remembered for its witty dialogue and sometimes tongue-in-cheek situations that often seemed like an affectionate parody of the genre. The show won 24 Daytime Emmy Awards and 18 Soap Opera Digest Awards among various other awards.', 'Santa Barbara is an American television soap opera, first broadcast in the United States on NBC on July 30, 1984, and last aired on January 15, 1993. The show revolves around the eventful lives of the wealthy Capwell family of Santa Barbara, California. Other prominent families featured on the soap were the rival Lockridge family, and the more modest Andrade and Perkins families. Santa Barbara aired in over 40 countries around the world and is best remembered for its witty dialogue and sometimes tongue-in-cheek situations that often seemed like an affectionate parody of the genre. The show won 24 Daytime Emmy Awards and 18 Soap Opera Digest Awards among various other awards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e0WiWrzTWq9cZRToypA5ak6ulq6.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:1451'),
  ('905868167306836229', 'Santa Bárbara', 2015, 'Soap', 'Artur Ribeiro', 'Nuno Duarte, Sarah Lemonnier', 'Benedita Pereira, Albano Jerónimo, São José Correia, António Capelo, Luísa Cruz, Luís Esparteiro, Manuela Couto, João Lagarto', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cnAnhxRkTLGkkSB0HV3XjPNr6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117920'),
  ('779842636296085367', 'Santa Clarita Diet', 2017, 'Comedy, Mystery, Crime', 'Victor Fresco', null, 'Drew Barrymore, Timothy Olyphant, Liv Hewson, Skyler Gisondo', 'TV-MA', 'They''re ordinary husband and wife realtors until she undergoes a dramatic change that sends them down a road of death and destruction. In a good way.', 'They''re ordinary husband and wife realtors until she undergoes a dramatic change that sends them down a road of death and destruction. In a good way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rBjNm2sRubaXKBnU904NInFi7P.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:69470'),
  ('1060080105461527404', 'Santa Evita', 2022, 'Drama', 'Rodrigo García, Alejandro Maci', 'Marcela Guerty, Pamela Rementería', 'Natalia Oreiro, Ernesto Alterio, Diego Velázquez, Francesc Orella, Darío Grandinetti, Diego Cremonesi, María Eugenia Rigón', null, 'After Eva Perón’s death in 1952, her corpse is held for three years awaiting the construction of a mausoleum — a resting place that would never be built. In 1955, the military seized control of Argentina and hid Perón’s body from the public, fearing that it would unite the country against them. But they never imagined that in doing so she would become more dangerous in death than she was in life.', 'After Eva Perón’s death in 1952, her corpse is held for three years awaiting the construction of a mausoleum — a resting place that would never be built. In 1955, the military seized control of Argentina and hid Perón’s body from the public, fearing that it would unite the country against them. But they never imagined that in doing so she would become more dangerous in death than she was in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6rxfcUBS4vvYppcI93NjJH7UIlP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122048'),
  ('389686828515873121', 'Santa Inc.', 2021, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Alexandra Rushfield', null, 'Sarah Silverman, Seth Rogen, Maria Bamford, Joel Kim Booster, Leslie Grossman, Craig Robinson, Gabourey Sidibe', 'TV-MA', 'The story of Candy Smalls, the highest-ranking female elf in the North Pole. When the successor to Santa Claus is poached by Amazon on Christmas Eve, Candy goes for her ultimate dream— to become the first woman Santa Claus in the history of Christmas.', 'The story of Candy Smalls, the highest-ranking female elf in the North Pole. When the successor to Santa Claus is poached by Amazon on Christmas Eve, Candy goes for her ultimate dream— to become the first woman Santa Claus in the history of Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kDrs3u2AXFYdbu42ZnKCcWmF9uQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103214'),
  ('520008469002875275', 'Santo', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Carlos López', null, 'Raúl Arévalo, Bruno Gagliasso, Victoria Guerra, Greta Fernández, Thomás Aquino, María Vázquez', 'TV-MA', 'Two cops must learn to work together to catch the world''s most-wanted drug dealer, whose face has never been revealed.', 'Two cops must learn to work together to catch the world''s most-wanted drug dealer, whose face has never been revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQszDXGfiM0FLZ1ZQ1M5vkpv9OT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128013'),
  ('1039277003101468990', 'Sapne vs Everyone', 2023, 'Drama', 'Ambrish Verma', 'Ambrish Verma', 'Paramvir Singh Cheema, Ambrish Verma, Naveen Kasturia, Vaisakh Shankar, Vijayant Kohli, Sukhwinder Chahal, Jairoop Jeevan, Ishan Anuan Singh', null, 'Two obsessive dreamers collide with the resistance of expectations, morality and each other.', 'Two obsessive dreamers collide with the resistance of expectations, morality and each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BQRzXTX0tEaglmbwEffk7peEmv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:240983'),
