  ('586345501608385214', 'Sapphire & Steel', 1979, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Peter J. Hammond', 'Peter J. Hammond', 'Joanna Lumley, David McCallum, David Collings, Christopher Fairbank', null, 'Sapphire & Steel is a British television science-fiction fantasy series starring David McCallum as Steel and Joanna Lumley as Sapphire. Produced by ATV, it ran from 1979 to 1982 on the ITV network. The series was created by Peter J. Hammond who conceived the programme under the working title The Time Menders, after a stay in an allegedly haunted castle. Hammond also wrote all the stories except for the fifth, which was co-written by Don Houghton and Anthony Read. None of the stories had onscreen titles, or any official titles assigned by the writers. The Region 1 Complete Series DVD release gives the titles "Escape Through a Crack in Time", "The Railway Station", "The Creature''s Revenge", "The Man Without a Face", "Dr. McDee Must Die" and "The Trap", respectively. These titles have often been cited as having been created by science fiction magazine Time Screen.', 'Sapphire & Steel is a British television science-fiction fantasy series starring David McCallum as Steel and Joanna Lumley as Sapphire. Produced by ATV, it ran from 1979 to 1982 on the ITV network. The series was created by Peter J. Hammond who conceived the programme under the working title The Time Menders, after a stay in an allegedly haunted castle. Hammond also wrote all the stories except for the fifth, which was co-written by Don Houghton and Anthony Read. None of the stories had onscreen titles, or any official titles assigned by the writers. The Region 1 Complete Series DVD release gives the titles "Escape Through a Crack in Time", "The Railway Station", "The Creature''s Revenge", "The Man Without a Face", "Dr. McDee Must Die" and "The Trap", respectively. These titles have often been cited as having been created by science fiction magazine Time Screen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6wWM8yP4TmQX60BC42iaak5g6b7.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:2697'),
  ('673840483382944851', 'Sara - Woman in the Shadows', 2025, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Carmine Elia', null, 'Teresa Saponangelo, Claudia Gerini, Flavio Furno, Chiara Celotto, Massimo Popolizio, Antonio Gerardi, Carmine Recano, Giacomo Giorgio', 'TV-MA', 'The suspicious death of her son pushes a former secret agent back into action, investigating a series of crimes that grows increasingly sinister.', 'The suspicious death of her son pushes a former secret agent back into action, investigating a series of crimes that grows increasingly sinister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nqKP7dOzbtP2Pmvec0ntOJDM6mb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:291256'),
  ('1120960044426819055', 'Sarabhai vs Sarabhai', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Aatish Kapadia', null, 'Ratna Pathak Shah, Rupali Ganguly, Satish Shah, Sumeet Raghvan, Rajesh Kumar, Deven Bhojani, Vaibhavi Upadhyay', 'TV-14', 'The show revolves around the lives of the members of an Uber Wealthy - High Society Gujarati family of Cuffe Parade - South Mumbai, whose daughter-in-law is from a middle class Delhi background.', 'The show revolves around the lives of the members of an Uber Wealthy - High Society Gujarati family of Cuffe Parade - South Mumbai, whose daughter-in-law is from a middle class Delhi background.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4YbLCWGeaY0YTy2vawNccLmTE6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4165'),
  ('1014069530349996067', 'Sarah', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mahdy Youssef', 'Mahdy Youssef', 'Hanan Turk, Ahmed Rizq, Sawsan Badr, Tarek Lotfy, Ragaa Al-Giddawy, Entesar, Ahmad Rateb, Hanan Metaweh', 'TV-G', 'Sarah is a girl whose mental development stopped at a very young age. After she slips into a coma that lasts for years, she crosses paths with a dedicated young doctor who decides to wake her up from her coma. When she wakes up, he ends up falling with her, not knowing what he is signing up for.', 'Sarah is a girl whose mental development stopped at a very young age. After she slips into a coma that lasts for years, she crosses paths with a dedicated young doctor who decides to wake her up from her coma. When she wakes up, he ends up falling with her, not knowing what he is signing up for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bhoirUhjKNFQRongaPwuRIkB2m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:53981'),
  ('726284414830250795', 'Sarah & Duck', 2013, 'Animation, Kids, Family', null, null, 'Tasha Lawrence, Roger Allam', 'TV-Y', 'Sarah is a 7-year-old girl with big eyes and a green hat. She lives with her best friend, a quacky, slightly manic fowl appropriately named Duck. Each episode features the pair setting out on simple but exciting adventures as they explore the world in their own imaginative way.', 'Sarah is a 7-year-old girl with big eyes and a green hat. She lives with her best friend, a quacky, slightly manic fowl appropriately named Duck. Each episode features the pair setting out on simple but exciting adventures as they explore the world in their own imaginative way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4SwnXjUFDiyRPPBc4st9TGQefm.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:46866'),
  ('940228306527679235', 'Sarah Kuttner – Die Show', 2004, 'Talk', null, null, 'Sarah Kuttner, Sven Schuhmacher', null, 'Sarah Kuttner – Die Show was a German television talk show that ran on VIVA and was then transferred to MTV under the title Kuttner. in mid-2005. It ran from August 2, 2004 to August 3, 2006. Hosted by Sarah Kuttner, it was a more youthful variation on the traditional late show concept with a sidekick, Sven Schuhmacher, and various national as well as international celebrity guests. The show also featured humorous reports by Michael Wigge and Caroline Korneli, its own band and musical guests performing live on stage. When MTV took over other German music channel VIVA in 2004, it was suggested, the show would be cancelled, which drew massive protests from fans. It was then cut from four shows per week to just two shows and later transferred to MTV and renamed Kuttner. Production was relocated from Cologne to Berlin. MTV cancelled Kuttner. in summer 2006 due to low ratings and high production costs.', 'Sarah Kuttner – Die Show was a German television talk show that ran on VIVA and was then transferred to MTV under the title Kuttner. in mid-2005. It ran from August 2, 2004 to August 3, 2006. Hosted by Sarah Kuttner, it was a more youthful variation on the traditional late show concept with a sidekick, Sven Schuhmacher, and various national as well as international celebrity guests. The show also featured humorous reports by Michael Wigge and Caroline Korneli, its own band and musical guests performing live on stage. When MTV took over other German music channel VIVA in 2004, it was suggested, the show would be cancelled, which drew massive protests from fans. It was then cut from four shows per week to just two shows and later transferred to MTV and renamed Kuttner. Production was relocated from Cologne to Berlin. MTV cancelled Kuttner. in summer 2006 due to low ratings and high production costs.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:20426'),
  ('835757071094047632', 'Sarazanmai', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ayumu Murase, Koki Uchiyama, Shun Horie, Mamoru Miyano, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Teiko Nanahara, Junichi Suwabe, Rie Kugimiya', 'TV-14', 'After accidentally breaking a statue of the guardian god of the Asakusa district, middle school students Kazuki, Toi and Enta are transformed into kappas -creatures from japanese folklore- by Keppi, self-proclaimed prince of the Kappa Kingdom. If they want to regain their human form, they must collect the five Dishes of Hope for him, which fulfill the wishes of whoever possesses them. To do so, they will fight against the kappa-zombies and extract their "shirikodama", the mythical organ containing humans'' deepest desires. Two policemen, Reo and Mabu, are the ones behind this evil scheme, turning humans into zombies as agents of the Otter Empire, enemy of the Kappa Kingdom since ancient times. In the guise of "Kappazon, Inc.", they control society by manipulating the desires of the masses for their own goals. To succeed in their mission, the boys must be connected through the "Sarazanmai", revealing their most intimate secrets in the process...', 'After accidentally breaking a statue of the guardian god of the Asakusa district, middle school students Kazuki, Toi and Enta are transformed into kappas -creatures from japanese folklore- by Keppi, self-proclaimed prince of the Kappa Kingdom. If they want to regain their human form, they must collect the five Dishes of Hope for him, which fulfill the wishes of whoever possesses them. To do so, they will fight against the kappa-zombies and extract their "shirikodama", the mythical organ containing humans'' deepest desires. Two policemen, Reo and Mabu, are the ones behind this evil scheme, turning humans into zombies as agents of the Otter Empire, enemy of the Kappa Kingdom since ancient times. In the guise of "Kappazon, Inc.", they control society by manipulating the desires of the masses for their own goals. To succeed in their mission, the boys must be connected through the "Sarazanmai", revealing their most intimate secrets in the process...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRWF8xDA9ZGuvbFE8NLGZoBRuqK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86919'),
  ('900130944164260867', 'SAS Rogue Heroes', 2022, 'Drama, War & Politics, Action & Adventure', 'Steven Knight', null, 'Connor Swindells, Jack O''Connell, Sofia Boutella, Corin Silva, Theo Barklem-Biggs, Jacob Ifan, Jacob McCarthy, Bobby Schofield', 'TV-MA', 'The dramatised account of how the world’s greatest Special Forces unit, the SAS, was formed under extraordinary circumstances in the darkest days of World War Two.', 'The dramatised account of how the world’s greatest Special Forces unit, the SAS, was formed under extraordinary circumstances in the darkest days of World War Two.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Tc1mRuP5QrGaetGKcitZkhTU9g.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:93870'),
  ('790940511897620924', 'Sasaki and Miyano', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yusuke Shirai, Soma Saito, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Yuki Ono, Yuma Uchida, Ryohei Arai, Mitsuhiro Ichiki', 'TV-14', 'When bashful Miyano meets brash Sasaki, it feels like a teen romance manga come to life — but for these boys, real-world love is messier than fiction.', 'When bashful Miyano meets brash Sasaki, it feels like a teen romance manga come to life — but for these boys, real-world love is messier than fiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNAdyqOwROeKf82iyzGGnNbvHDr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127549'),
  ('166368576191867943', 'Sasaki and Peeps', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tomokazu Sugita, Aoi Yuuki, Rie Takahashi, Akari Kito, Miyu Tomita, Inori Minase, Ryotaro Okiayu, Naomi Ohzora', null, 'Sasaki is a middle-aged office worker living in Japan. Feeling drained by the vapid corporate world, he heads to the pet shop in search of a new companion. There he finds an adorable bird named Peeps and takes him home. But Sasaki quickly learns that Peeps isn’t your average bird…he’s a powerful mage from another world! Together, they embark on a magical adventure filled with swords and sorcery.', 'Sasaki is a middle-aged office worker living in Japan. Feeling drained by the vapid corporate world, he heads to the pet shop in search of a new companion. There he finds an adorable bird named Peeps and takes him home. But Sasaki quickly learns that Peeps isn’t your average bird…he’s a powerful mage from another world! Together, they embark on a magical adventure filled with swords and sorcery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVp4PsyB8V839mGQjkn6kevBwKV.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:206630'),
  ('554862715817684116', 'SashaTanya', 2013, 'Comedy, Family', 'Vyacheslav Dusmukhametov, Semyon Slepakov', 'Kirill Yarovitsyn', 'Andrey Gaydulyan, Valentina Rubtsova, Alina Lanina, Andrey Sviridov, Sergey Rudzevich, Artemiy Shirokov, Shamil Mukhamedov, Larisa Baranova', null, 'Sasha and Tanya have graduated and moved out of the dormitory. They now live with their son Alyosha in their own two-room apartment in the Moscow suburb of Yuzhnoe Butovo. And, boy, are their neighbors ever weird.', 'Sasha and Tanya have graduated and moved out of the dormitory. They now live with their son Alyosha in their own two-room apartment in the Moscow suburb of Yuzhnoe Butovo. And, boy, are their neighbors ever weird.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPeTmxol8JhoOBgxngcbpO0qbnf.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:68726'),
  ('920835621622863062', 'Sasmos', 2021, 'Drama', 'Spiros Petroulakis', 'Kostas Kostopoulos', 'Maria Tzobanaki, Olga Damani, Orfeas Avgoustidis, Dimitris Lalos, Maria Protopappa, Hristina Heila-Fameli, Dimitris Imellos, Marilita Lambropoulou', null, 'Two young people from opposing families fall in love and reawaken the vendetta from years ago in a mountain village in Crete.', 'Two young people from opposing families fall in love and reawaken the vendetta from years ago in a mountain village in Crete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/laSxkaKDlcuvji79ge6VHvGcaST.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:132982'),
  ('309046944234566365', 'Sasquatch', 2021, 'Documentary, Mystery, Crime', 'Joshua Rofé', null, 'David Holthouse', 'TV-MA', 'Investigative journalist David Holthouse attempts to solve a bizarre twenty-five year old triple homicide that was said to be the work of a mythical creature.', 'Investigative journalist David Holthouse attempts to solve a bizarre twenty-five year old triple homicide that was said to be the work of a mythical creature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNQseYNU7JOVThxMrRTpAIaDLOl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:118556'),
  ('474334066176165795', 'Sassy Girl Chun-Hyang', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hong Mi-ran, Hong Jeong-eun', 'Hong Mi-ran, Hong Jeong-eun', 'Han Chae-young, Jae Hee, Uhm Tae-woong, Park Si-eun, Lee In-hye, Ahn Suk-hwan, Park Si-hoo, Choi Ran', null, 'Lee Mong-ryong is transferred from Seoul to a high school in Namwon, North Jeolla Province. Chun-hyang does her best to help Mong-ryong, her first love and the son of the Namwon Police Station chief, to enter a prestigious university. However, after meeting with Mong-ryong’s first love, Chae-rin, Mong-ryong’s love toward Chun-hyang is shattered, although Chun-hyang’s love remains unwavering.', 'Lee Mong-ryong is transferred from Seoul to a high school in Namwon, North Jeolla Province. Chun-hyang does her best to help Mong-ryong, her first love and the son of the Namwon Police Station chief, to enter a prestigious university. However, after meeting with Mong-ryong’s first love, Chae-rin, Mong-ryong’s love toward Chun-hyang is shattered, although Chun-hyang’s love remains unwavering.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZq67QqtHQTO7BGmM5SDBY8msgN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12081'),
  ('891087527639068190', 'Sasuke', 1997, null, null, null, null, null, 'Sasuke is a Japanese sports entertainment television special in which 100 competitors attempt to complete a four stage obstacle course. An edited version, renamed Ninja Warrior, is screened in at least 18 other countries. To date, Sasuke content has been shown in 157 countries. Shot on location at Midoriyama studio in Yokohama, it airs on the Tokyo Broadcasting System between Japanese television drama seasons. Each 3-hour special covers an entire competition; there are normally 100 participants. There have been 29 specials, approximately one new special per season. The show is produced by Monster9 and is one of the spin-offs of Muscle Ranking, another sports entertainment competition, which currently airs on G4 under the name Unbeatable Banzuke. Until the 10th competition, Sasuke was broadcast as a special part of Muscle Ranking, but it became an independent program when Muscle Ranking was discontinued. The first competition was held indoors, marking the only time Sasuke did not take place outside. Competitions generally start in the daytime and continue until completed regardless of weather or darkness. After Monster9''s bankruptcy on November 2011, all rights to the show fell completely into the hands of its broadcaster, Tokyo Broadcasting System. Following their acquisition of all rights to Sasuke, TBS renamed the show, Sasuke Rising.', 'Sasuke is a Japanese sports entertainment television special in which 100 competitors attempt to complete a four stage obstacle course. An edited version, renamed Ninja Warrior, is screened in at least 18 other countries. To date, Sasuke content has been shown in 157 countries. Shot on location at Midoriyama studio in Yokohama, it airs on the Tokyo Broadcasting System between Japanese television drama seasons. Each 3-hour special covers an entire competition; there are normally 100 participants. There have been 29 specials, approximately one new special per season. The show is produced by Monster9 and is one of the spin-offs of Muscle Ranking, another sports entertainment competition, which currently airs on G4 under the name Unbeatable Banzuke. Until the 10th competition, Sasuke was broadcast as a special part of Muscle Ranking, but it became an independent program when Muscle Ranking was discontinued. The first competition was held indoors, marking the only time Sasuke did not take place outside. Competitions generally start in the daytime and continue until completed regardless of weather or darkness. After Monster9''s bankruptcy on November 2011, all rights to the show fell completely into the hands of its broadcaster, Tokyo Broadcasting System. Following their acquisition of all rights to Sasuke, TBS renamed the show, Sasuke Rising.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7pEzudjTqTXwuTk8LM8oOfW4Jkr.jpg', 42, 'tmdb:tv:1121'),
  ('774882438153725839', 'Satisfaction', 2007, 'Drama', 'Roger Simpson', null, 'Kestie Morassi, Madeleine West, Alison Whyte, Dustin Clare, Camille Keenan, Renai Caruso', null, 'Set in and around 232, an up-market city brothel, Satisfaction reveals the world of five high class escorts and their manager as they juggle the pressures of their private lives with their secret profession.', 'Set in and around 232, an up-market city brothel, Satisfaction reveals the world of five high class escorts and their manager as they juggle the pressures of their private lives with their secret profession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLeD1RyX4bdSWRpv8S6gqxlMlAg.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:15280'),
  ('562092503290455562', 'Satisfaction', 2014, 'Drama', 'Sean Jablonski', null, 'Stephanie Szostak, Matt Passmore, Blair Redford, Katherine LaNasa, Michelle DeShon, Deanna Russo', 'TV-PG', 'A provocative drama that explores modern marriage at its midpoint. Through the lens of one couple, Neil Truman and his wife, Grace, this series answers the question, “What do you do when having it all is not enough?” by delving into their shocking and unconventional choices.', 'A provocative drama that explores modern marriage at its midpoint. Through the lens of one couple, Neil Truman and his wife, Grace, this series answers the question, “What do you do when having it all is not enough?” by delving into their shocking and unconventional choices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gcE4YyvHVg9KxrwIvzMhVH0SO3z.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61213'),
  ('185822263220896386', 'Saturday Kitchen Live', 2002, 'Talk', null, null, null, null, 'Saturday Kitchen Live is a 90 minute cookery programme, which is broadcast live on BBC One on Saturday mornings. Matt Tebbutt is the predominant presenter. Andi Oliver and Michel Roux Jr. have also presented several episodes. Previous presenters have included Antony Worrall Thompson and Gregg Wallace. The programme is currently produced by Cactus TV. The programme has also aired on RTÉ One in Ireland on Saturday mornings, the episodes shown are several months old.', 'Saturday Kitchen Live is a 90 minute cookery programme, which is broadcast live on BBC One on Saturday mornings. Matt Tebbutt is the predominant presenter. Andi Oliver and Michel Roux Jr. have also presented several episodes. Previous presenters have included Antony Worrall Thompson and Gregg Wallace. The programme is currently produced by Cactus TV. The programme has also aired on RTÉ One in Ireland on Saturday mornings, the episodes shown are several months old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPLZzHv04LYek3WyUVe1N6jzgkE.jpg', 18, 'tmdb:tv:13752'),
  ('603021162982535363', 'Saturday Morning All Star Hits!', 2021, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Ben Jones, Kyle Mooney', 'Ben Jones, Kyle Mooney, Scott Gairdner', 'Kyle Mooney, Beck Bennett, Maurice LaMarche, Eric Bauza, Cree Summer, Pamela Adlon, Paul Rudd, Ben Jones', 'TV-14', 'Wildly irreverent and slightly disturbing, this adult animation, live-action hybrid celebrates the campy, Saturday-morning shows of the ''80s and ''90s.', 'Wildly irreverent and slightly disturbing, this adult animation, live-action hybrid celebrates the campy, Saturday-morning shows of the ''80s and ''90s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHB2sMGWVjknajaKYhRPutJyQDd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138600'),
  ('109509290890882105', 'Saturday Night Live', 1975, 'Comedy, News', 'Dick Ebersol, Lorne Michaels', null, 'Michael Che, Mikey Day, Andrew Dismukes, Chloe Fineman, Marcello Hernández, James Austin Johnson, Colin Jost, Sarah Sherman', 'TV-14', 'A late-night live television sketch comedy and variety show created by Lorne Michaels. The show''s comedy sketches, which parody contemporary culture and politics, are performed by a large and varying cast of repertory and newer cast members. Each episode is hosted by a celebrity guest, who usually delivers an opening monologue and performs in sketches with the cast, and features performances by a musical guest.', 'A late-night live television sketch comedy and variety show created by Lorne Michaels. The show''s comedy sketches, which parody contemporary culture and politics, are performed by a large and varying cast of repertory and newer cast members. Each episode is hosted by a celebrity guest, who usually delivers an opening monologue and performs in sketches with the cast, and features performances by a musical guest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1cZBqbMwAF3w8S3Yo0j5nr2Yuo.jpg', 51, 'tmdb:tv:1667'),
  ('838581182974055665', 'Saturday Night Live UK', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Lorne Michaels', 'Al Roberts, Ayo Adenekan, Bella Hull', 'Al Nash, Ania Magliano, Annabel Marlow, Ayoade Bamgboye, Celeste Dring, Emma Sidi, George Fouracres, Hammed Animashaun', 'TV-MA', 'British incarnation of NBC''s legendary late-night comedy showcase. Broadcast live each week, this UK version brings the high-wire, anything-can-happen energy that makes ''SNL'' a cultural force, now reimagined through a distinctly British lens.', 'British incarnation of NBC''s legendary late-night comedy showcase. Broadcast live each week, this UK version brings the high-wire, anything-can-happen energy that makes ''SNL'' a cultural force, now reimagined through a distinctly British lens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48j16bIyIkeUIRFYfwZ6nWovQE2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:288670'),
  ('568917684844118199', 'Saturday Night Live Weekend Update Thursday', 2008, 'News, Comedy', 'Lorne Michaels', null, null, null, 'Saturday Night Live Weekend Update Thursday is an American limited-run series broadcast on NBC. It is a political satire news show spin-off from Saturday Night Live, featuring that show''s "Weekend Update" segment. It initially ran for three 30-minute episodes in October 2008, during the lead-up to the 2008 United States presidential election.', 'Saturday Night Live Weekend Update Thursday is an American limited-run series broadcast on NBC. It is a political satire news show spin-off from Saturday Night Live, featuring that show''s "Weekend Update" segment. It initially ran for three 30-minute episodes in October 2008, during the lead-up to the 2008 United States presidential election.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iyw6xbQnRQ80eDKU9QSCVBm62vb.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:7227'),
  ('508544858529442508', 'Saturday Night''s Main Event', 1985, 'Drama, Family, Action & Adventure', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'A professional wrestling television program produced by the World Wrestling Federation banner on NBC airing in place of Saturday Night Live. The series was made up entirely of star vs. star bouts in a time when weekly programming consisted primarily of established stars dominating enhancement talent.', 'A professional wrestling television program produced by the World Wrestling Federation banner on NBC airing in place of Saturday Night Live. The series was made up entirely of star vs. star bouts in a time when weekly programming consisted primarily of established stars dominating enhancement talent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vG1ORAaghrGgf9LC45bNTeUYMu8.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:477'),
  ('924561709561022732', 'Saturday Supercade', 1983, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Kids', null, null, 'Arthur Burghardt, Nancy Cartwright, Peter Renaday, Sparky Marcus, Jim Piper', null, 'Saturday Supercade is an animated television series produced for Saturday mornings by Ruby-Spears Productions. It ran for two seasons on CBS beginning in 1983. Each episode is composed of several shorter segments featuring video game characters from the Golden age of video arcade games.', 'Saturday Supercade is an animated television series produced for Saturday mornings by Ruby-Spears Productions. It ran for two seasons on CBS beginning in 1983. Each episode is composed of several shorter segments featuring video game characters from the Golden age of video arcade games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPqJEQMGgAoiGRu8eHfLSSoTl0x.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:11001'),
  ('823680582645298825', 'Satyamev Jayate', 2012, 'Talk, Documentary', 'Aamir Khan', null, null, null, 'Satyamev Jayate is an Indian television talk show that aired on various channels within Star Network along with Doordarshan''s DD National. The first season of the show premiered on 6 May 2012 and marked the television debut of popular Bollywood actor and filmmaker Aamir Khan. The show highlights sensitive social issues prevalent in India such as female foeticides, child sexual abuse, dowry, medical malpractice, honor killings, insensitivity towards the physically disabled, domestic violence, overuse of pesticides leading to pesticide poisoning, alcoholism, untouchability, plight of senior citizens and water crisis. Satyamev Jayate received an overwhelming positive response and feedback from both the critics as well as the public. The show was widely appreciated by several film and television personalities, politicians and social activists for its research, format, presentation and content.', 'Satyamev Jayate is an Indian television talk show that aired on various channels within Star Network along with Doordarshan''s DD National. The first season of the show premiered on 6 May 2012 and marked the television debut of popular Bollywood actor and filmmaker Aamir Khan. The show highlights sensitive social issues prevalent in India such as female foeticides, child sexual abuse, dowry, medical malpractice, honor killings, insensitivity towards the physically disabled, domestic violence, overuse of pesticides leading to pesticide poisoning, alcoholism, untouchability, plight of senior citizens and water crisis. Satyamev Jayate received an overwhelming positive response and feedback from both the critics as well as the public. The show was widely appreciated by several film and television personalities, politicians and social activists for its research, format, presentation and content.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJGst5nJO9tGzWZeq8D1xAaI5Bl.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:43261'),
  ('1070478148871016220', 'Sausage Party: Foodtopia', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Evan Goldberg, Seth Rogen, Kyle Hunter', null, 'Seth Rogen, Kristen Wiig, Edward Norton, Michael Cera', 'TV-MA', 'After the foods win their war against the humans at the end of the film, they create Cibopolis, a city of their own ruled entirely by foods. But soon, problems arise, including rain, crows, and internal discord among the foods. To find answers, Frank, Brenda, and Barry set out to find a human.', 'After the foods win their war against the humans at the end of the film, they create Cibopolis, a city of their own ruled entirely by foods. But soon, problems arise, including rain, crows, and internal discord among the foods. To find answers, Frank, Brenda, and Barry set out to find a human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPLk5uvh0Am0UQlxRP4xqNcVQD3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:213249'),
  ('865147505424503328', 'SAV des émissions', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Fred Testot, Omar Sy, Bertrand Delaire', null, 'Omar Sy, Fred Testot', null, 'Le Service après-vente des émissions or SAV des émissions is a French short comedy television series hosted by the comic duo Omar and Fred since 2005 on Canal+. The show is a segment of Le Grand Journal, a news show hosted by Michel Denisot. The series is rebroadcast, in the morning, on Virgin Radio.', 'Le Service après-vente des émissions or SAV des émissions is a French short comedy television series hosted by the comic duo Omar and Fred since 2005 on Canal+. The show is a segment of Le Grand Journal, a news show hosted by Michel Denisot. The series is rebroadcast, in the morning, on Virgin Radio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c63Rppw9IVB79A8Sx8jqOeuXbg5.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:39945'),
  ('494365748918679156', 'Savage Beauty', 2022, 'Drama', 'Lebogang Mogashoa', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Seeking revenge for her tragic past, a mysterious woman embeds herself in a powerful family who possess a global beauty empire — and dark secrets.', 'Seeking revenge for her tragic past, a mysterious woman embeds herself in a powerful family who possess a global beauty empire — and dark secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nT9TdyMkIp9UpsmWbwIWdTUFS9Q.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:197427'),
  ('44190235153534124', 'Savage Builds', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Adam Savage', 'TV-PG', 'Adam Savage combines his insatiable curiosity and nearly unparalleled inventiveness as he attempts to build working, innovative items. Each episode will focus on one project as Adam collaborates with notable experts in their fields, friends, colleagues and others.', 'Adam Savage combines his insatiable curiosity and nearly unparalleled inventiveness as he attempts to build working, innovative items. Each episode will focus on one project as Adam collaborates with notable experts in their fields, friends, colleagues and others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6SZiOMAf6fQ8Ti9wlqWRGrS3vmX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88765'),
  ('287048507752243098', 'Savage Kingdom', 2016, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Charles Dance', 'TV-14', 'A rare look at warring animal clans battling for survival in a remote region of Africa, which is drying up after years of flood-soaked abundance.', 'A rare look at warring animal clans battling for survival in a remote region of Africa, which is drying up after years of flood-soaked abundance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1CZhxbKA8NzPmCbWMzdLcvwu9CY.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:74911'),
  ('1073935821260451956', 'Savage Rhythm', 2022, 'Drama', 'Juliana Barrera', null, 'Paulina Dávila, Greeicy Rendón, Andrés Juan Hernández, Martina la Peligrosa, Sashua López, Elisa Torriente, Guaynaa, Juan Manuel Guilera', 'TV-MA', 'The opposite worlds of two dancers in Colombia clash on and off the dance floor when their ambition to succeed leads them down a treacherous path.', 'The opposite worlds of two dancers in Colombia clash on and off the dance floor when their ambition to succeed leads them down a treacherous path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fNgjy8rDEprVWqeGfzgQ5E0yyIv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156135'),
  ('929378937072090145', 'Savage River', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Belinda Bradley, Franz Docherty, Giula Sandler', null, 'Katherine Langford, Virginia Gay, Mark Coles Smith, Robert Grubb, Daniel Henshall, Cooper van Grootel, Nadine Garner, Jacqueline McKenzie', null, 'When thirty-year-old Miki Anderson returns to her home town in rural Victoria after fifteen years in prison, she wants nothing more than to put her life back together. To figure out who she is on the outside. But her presence dredges up long-held secrets from the past and Miki realizes everything she thought she knew was wrong. And it is far from over.', 'When thirty-year-old Miki Anderson returns to her home town in rural Victoria after fifteen years in prison, she wants nothing more than to put her life back together. To figure out who she is on the outside. But her presence dredges up long-held secrets from the past and Miki realizes everything she thought she knew was wrong. And it is far from over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKzfsH0xzO43mR8A0mJ7IlmIP0M.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207372'),
  ('311252076708222887', 'Savages', 2019, 'Drama', 'Rebecca Zlotowski, Sabri Louatah', 'Sabri Louatah', 'Roschdy Zem, Hassan Kachach, Marina Foïs, Amira Casar, Dali Benssalah, Souheila Yacoub, Lyna Khoudri, Shaïn Boumedine', null, 'On the verge of an historic election victory, an Arabic candidate for the French presidency sees his ambitions threatened by a perfect storm of religious, cultural, and family politics.', 'On the verge of an historic election victory, an Arabic candidate for the French presidency sees his ambitions threatened by a perfect storm of religious, cultural, and family politics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w09T4KO1usVsO1eR6iM2HKz1Gwj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92390'),
  ('904629837626203971', 'Savannah', 1996, 'Soap, Drama', 'Constance M. Burge', null, 'Jamie Luner, Shannon Sturges, Robyn Lively, David Gail, Paul Satterfield, Beth Toussaint, Ray Wise, George Eads', null, 'Follows the lives of three best friends--Reese, Peyton, and Lane--who grew up together in Savannah, Georgia. SAVANNAH was an American prime time television drama that ran from January 21, 1996 to February 24, 1997 on The WB. It was created by Constance M. Burge and produced by Aaron Spelling.', 'Follows the lives of three best friends--Reese, Peyton, and Lane--who grew up together in Savannah, Georgia. SAVANNAH was an American prime time television drama that ran from January 21, 1996 to February 24, 1997 on The WB. It was created by Constance M. Burge and produced by Aaron Spelling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5E5zq6Ppot7UQFOxKp5tbjgvP6P.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4526'),
  ('41018838785025709', 'Savaşçı', 2017, 'War & Politics', 'Volkan Kocatürk, Eray Koçak', null, 'Berk Oktay, Alican Albayrak, Uğur Biçer, Bahadır Vatanoğlu, Doğan Bayraktar, Ali Tarık Fındık, Yıldız Bozok, Murat Serezli', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b2IvcQrcq3he4zpGcn3VFipwQDv.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:76500'),
  ('593821468709307996', 'Save Me', 2013, 'Comedy', 'John Scott Shepherd', null, 'Anne Heche, Michael Landes, Alexandra Breckenridge, Madison Davenport, Heather Burns, Joy Osmanski', 'TV-PG', 'After choking on a hero sandwich in her kitchen and suffering a dramatic near-death experience, Beth Harper - an absentee wife and mother - is revived and claims she can now talk to God. Her teenage daughter, Emily, is horrified and her husband, Tom, is skeptical. To make matters worse, Tom''s ex-mistress, Carly McKenna, is in a coma after a close encounter with lightning in the Harpers'' front yard.', 'After choking on a hero sandwich in her kitchen and suffering a dramatic near-death experience, Beth Harper - an absentee wife and mother - is revived and claims she can now talk to God. Her teenage daughter, Emily, is horrified and her husband, Tom, is skeptical. To make matters worse, Tom''s ex-mistress, Carly McKenna, is in a coma after a close encounter with lightning in the Harpers'' front yard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9bpcWOlpI0MPQJVQuE2diGkyYiM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44459'),
  ('1011393960949112305', 'Save Me', 2017, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama', 'Jung Yi-do', 'Jung Yi-do', 'Um Tae-goo, Cheon Ho-jin, Esom, Kim Young-min, Im Ha-ryong, Oh Yeon-ah, Woo Hyeon, Baek Soo-jang', 'TV-PG', 'Four young men come to the rescue of a former classmate whose family has been sucked into the clutches of a religious cult and its charismatic leader.', 'Four young men come to the rescue of a former classmate whose family has been sucked into the clutches of a religious cult and its charismatic leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNbrGcMxClqvSLZo7OwkRn5jEmv.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:72690'),
  ('202983635702544130', 'Save Me', 2018, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Lennie James', null, 'Lennie James, Suranne Jones', 'NR', 'Nelson "Nelly" Rowe''s life is turned upside down when he is arrested on suspicion of kidnapping his thirteen-year-old daughter Jody, whom he hasn''t seen in ten years. After convincing the police of his innocence, and frustrated with the way the case is progressing, he decides to take matters into his own hands and track down Jody himself.', 'Nelson "Nelly" Rowe''s life is turned upside down when he is arrested on suspicion of kidnapping his thirteen-year-old daughter Jody, whom he hasn''t seen in ten years. After convincing the police of his innocence, and frustrated with the way the case is progressing, he decides to take matters into his own hands and track down Jody himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uc7TY2yKnXz3DFPkyGRa3eIWyMA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:75789'),
  ('470294180669157141', 'Save Our Squad with David Beckham', 2022, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, 'David Beckham', 'TV-14', 'David Beckham is coming home. Over the course of a season David joins East London club, Westward Boys, a team playing in the league where it all began for him as a boy – the Echo Premier League. Westward haven''t won a game all season, and the threat of being relegated from the league looms large. David has a mammoth task at hand. Will he be able to save their squad?', 'David Beckham is coming home. Over the course of a season David joins East London club, Westward Boys, a team playing in the league where it all began for him as a boy – the Echo Premier League. Westward haven''t won a game all season, and the threat of being relegated from the league looms large. David has a mammoth task at hand. Will he be able to save their squad?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2o7DjmsuO0zQD2b5T9otj1YO8TT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204667'),
  ('779242839760570101', 'Saved by the Bell', 1989, 'Family, Comedy', 'Sam Bobrick', null, 'Mark-Paul Gosselaar, Mario López, Dustin Diamond, Lark Voorhies, Dennis Haskins', 'TV-G', 'Lovable schemer Zack Morris leads his pals on adventures at California''s Bayside High School. The friends navigate relationships, final exams, school dances, breakups and more while frequently frustrating their principal, Mr. Richard Belding, who does his best to keep them in check.', 'Lovable schemer Zack Morris leads his pals on adventures at California''s Bayside High School. The friends navigate relationships, final exams, school dances, breakups and more while frequently frustrating their principal, Mr. Richard Belding, who does his best to keep them in check.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YC576fs6XQR2pfPDJn4kcmG8T5.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:4345'),
  ('720096623937362073', 'Saved by the Bell', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Tracey Wigfield', 'Beth Coyle', 'Haskiri Velazquez, Mitchell Hoog, Josie Totah, Alycia Pascual-Peña, Belmont Cameli, Dexter Darden, John Michael Higgins, Elizabeth Berkley', 'TV-14', 'When California governor Zack Morris gets into hot water for closing too many low-income high schools, he proposes they send the affected students to the highest performing schools in the state – including Bayside High. The influx of new students gives the over privileged Bayside kids a much needed and hilarious dose of reality.', 'When California governor Zack Morris gets into hot water for closing too many low-income high schools, he proposes they send the affected students to the highest performing schools in the state – including Bayside High. The influx of new students gives the over privileged Bayside kids a much needed and hilarious dose of reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9iIIRPetuBmOl0gd7KC5dNcK7bX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:93825'),
  ('342030455520963123', 'Saved by the Bell: The College Years', 1993, 'Family, Comedy', 'Sam Bobrick', null, 'Mark-Paul Gosselaar, Mario López, Dustin Diamond, Anne Tremko, Kiersten Warren, Bob Golic, Tiffani-Amber Thiessen', 'TV-G', 'The gang from Bayside High is leaving home and heading to the campus of California University for four years of new challenges, new faces and wild, new adventures.', 'The gang from Bayside High is leaving home and heading to the campus of California University for four years of new challenges, new faces and wild, new adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4uqN0B2R06vJEx221SLtpBAhaN2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2014'),
  ('753095166143055941', 'Saved by the Bell: The New Class', 1993, 'Family, Comedy', 'Sam Bobrick', null, 'Dennis Haskins, Dustin Diamond, Lindsey McKeon, Ashley Tesoro, Tom Wade Huntington, Samantha Esteban, Ben Gould, Anthony Harrell', 'TV-G', 'Six friends grow and learn at Bayside High.', 'Six friends grow and learn at Bayside High.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTOki7qHWZW6Cav67TIOEXnJoqY.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:531'),
  ('777737700425665654', 'Saving 80,000 Gold in Another World for My Retirement', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Rika Nagae, Rika Tachibana, Kaori Maeda, Jun Fukuyama, Ruriko Aoki, Yuji Kameyama, Kenyu Horiuchi', 'TV-14', 'One day, Mitsuha falls off a cliff and is transported to a medieval Europe–type world! After a near-death encounter with a pack of wolves, she then realizes that she''s able to transport between two worlds—this one and her own. Taking advantage of this ability, Mitsuha decides to live in both worlds and calculates that she''ll need 80,000 gold coins to be able to retire! Mitsuha now has to come up with different ways to collect her gold coins!', 'One day, Mitsuha falls off a cliff and is transported to a medieval Europe–type world! After a near-death encounter with a pack of wolves, she then realizes that she''s able to transport between two worlds—this one and her own. Taking advantage of this ability, Mitsuha decides to live in both worlds and calculates that she''ll need 80,000 gold coins to be able to retire! Mitsuha now has to come up with different ways to collect her gold coins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/heAGJJHVkYmGJnj5xJZg60HZHXf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206748'),
  ('464746823190129979', 'Saving Grace', 2007, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Nancy Miller', null, 'Holly Hunter, Leon Rippy, Kenny Johnson, Bailey Chase, Dylan Minnette, Laura San Giacomo, Lorraine Toussaint, Yaani King Mondschein', 'TV-MA', 'Grace Hanadarko is a tormented, fast-living Oklahoma City police detective who, despite having an excellent career in solving crimes, takes self-destruction to new heights. After seeing tremendous tragedy, both professionally and personally, Grace reaches a turning point one night and meets a rough-hewn angel with a similar past who wants to help lead her back to the right path.', 'Grace Hanadarko is a tormented, fast-living Oklahoma City police detective who, despite having an excellent career in solving crimes, takes self-destruction to new heights. After seeing tremendous tragedy, both professionally and personally, Grace reaches a turning point one night and meets a rough-hewn angel with a similar past who wants to help lead her back to the right path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kxasURRX1FHh1el6XYpSM2LGSVR.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:9899'),
  ('469029654889402545', 'Saving Hope', 2012, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Morwyn Brebner, Malcolm MacRury', null, 'Erica Durance, Julia Chan, Michael Shanks, Wendy Crewson, Benjamin Ayres, Husein Madhavji, Michelle Nolden, Dejan Loyola', 'TV-14', 'When Charlie Harris ends up in a coma, he leaves the Hope-Zion Hospital in chaos - and his fiancée and fellow surgeon, Alex Reid, in a state of shock. As the staff of Hope-Zion races to save lives, comatose Dr. Harris wanders the halls of Hope-Zee in "spirit" form, not sure if he''s a ghost or a figment of his own imagination.', 'When Charlie Harris ends up in a coma, he leaves the Hope-Zion Hospital in chaos - and his fiancée and fellow surgeon, Alex Reid, in a state of shock. As the staff of Hope-Zion races to save lives, comatose Dr. Harris wanders the halls of Hope-Zee in "spirit" form, not sure if he''s a ghost or a figment of his own imagination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OGQisCT1T5ChkzZVdFqhX4O1G.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:43097'),
  ('177496872593495397', 'Saving My Stupid Youth', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Kankuro Kudo', 'Ryo Nishikido, Hikari Mitsushima, Kento Nagayama, Daiki Shigeoka, Katsuhisa Namase, Yuki Saito, Haru, Maki Sakai', null, 'Heisuke teaches at his alma mater, an all-boy’s Buddhist high school and leads a very ordinary life, except for the fact that he is still tortured by the memory of an unfortunate incident that took place there involving him and his school 14 years ago. In hopes of closure, he strikes upon a plan to jointly hold this year’s Culture Festival with a nearby girl’s school, with which there are chilly relations. Determined at all costs to make the event a success, Heisuke finds himself dealing with a constant stream of problems along the way.', 'Heisuke teaches at his alma mater, an all-boy’s Buddhist high school and leads a very ordinary life, except for the fact that he is still tortured by the memory of an unfortunate incident that took place there involving him and his school 14 years ago. In hopes of closure, he strikes upon a plan to jointly hold this year’s Culture Festival with a nearby girl’s school, with which there are chilly relations. Determined at all costs to make the event a success, Heisuke finds himself dealing with a constant stream of problems along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ead1J727R4Nvi10yoq34miLPSh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62572'),
  ('897251190430518359', 'Saving the King', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Juan Carlos I, Bárbara Rey, Jaime Peñafiel, Ana Pardo de Vera, Sofía of Spain, Pedro J. Ramírez, Queca Campillo, José Bono', null, 'A story of spies and silent pacts, this fascinating docuseries, told in first person by witnesses and experts, exposes how the machinery of the state is keen to protect the former King of Spain, Juan Carlos I, and conceal his scandals.', 'A story of spies and silent pacts, this fascinating docuseries, told in first person by witnesses and experts, exposes how the machinery of the state is keen to protect the former King of Spain, Juan Carlos I, and conceal his scandals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFkr9zHVYqACkNu60JjIYP8AW7a.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209489'),
  ('899751933392139164', 'Savior Complex', 2023, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'An investigation into an American missionary accused of dangerously treating sick children in Uganda despite having no medical training.', 'An investigation into an American missionary accused of dangerously treating sick children in Uganda despite having no medical training.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7C3X0K0f7xj6XrvPeeK4lc8KHm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233600'),
  ('265381169200709225', 'Saxondale', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Steve Coogan', 'Neil MacLennan, Steve Coogan', 'Steve Coogan, Ruth Jones, Rasmus Hardiker, Morwenna Banks, James Bachman, Darren Boyd, Rosie Cavaliero', null, 'Steve Coogan plays Tommy Saxondale: an ex-roadie with anger management issues and a pest-control business. Tommy is a little arrogant, a little egotistical and feels the world owes him more respect than it typically shows him. He has an assistant named Raymond who lives in a spare room in Tommy''s house, a live-in girlfriend named Magz who owns a T-shirt business, and a receptionist named Vicky who has a tendency to drive him up the wall.', 'Steve Coogan plays Tommy Saxondale: an ex-roadie with anger management issues and a pest-control business. Tommy is a little arrogant, a little egotistical and feels the world owes him more respect than it typically shows him. He has an assistant named Raymond who lives in a spare room in Tommy''s house, a live-in girlfriend named Magz who owns a T-shirt business, and a receptionist named Vicky who has a tendency to drive him up the wall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKTCNu6uwL4HlB3hddGL8teZ6q.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2510'),
  ('206372599537507711', 'Say "I Love You."', 2012, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Ai Kayano, Takahiro Sakurai, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Minako Kotobuki, Yumi Uchiyama, Tomoaki Maeno, Risa Taneda', 'TV-14', 'To trust is to set yourself up for failure. That’s the lesson Mei Tachibana learned when her heart was broken. She found a solution: never make any more friends. It’s not as easy as it sounds, but it works for Mei. At least it did until handsome and charming Yamato Kurosawa showed up to complicate everything. Mei’s not looking for a white knight. So why did he have to kiss her and ruin everything? Between heartbeats and behind trembling lips the specter of betrayals past, future, and present haunt them both in Say "I Love You"!', 'To trust is to set yourself up for failure. That’s the lesson Mei Tachibana learned when her heart was broken. She found a solution: never make any more friends. It’s not as easy as it sounds, but it works for Mei. At least it did until handsome and charming Yamato Kurosawa showed up to complicate everything. Mei’s not looking for a white knight. So why did he have to kiss her and ruin everything? Between heartbeats and behind trembling lips the specter of betrayals past, future, and present haunt them both in Say "I Love You"!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jCTTTaVz2a6f7T9mvJu5zQgxMEU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:52878'),
  ('94385173622288876', 'Say Nothing', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'Joshua Zetumer', null, 'Lola Petticrew, Maxine Peake, Hazel Doupe, Anthony Boyle, Tom Vaughan-Lawlor, Josh Finan, Rory Kinnear', 'TV-MA', 'Through the eyes of various Irish Republican Army (IRA) members, explore the extremes some people will go to in the name of their beliefs, the way a deeply divided society can suddenly tip over into armed conflict, the long shadow of radical violence for both victims and perpetrators, and the emotional and psychological costs of a code of silence.', 'Through the eyes of various Irish Republican Army (IRA) members, explore the extremes some people will go to in the name of their beliefs, the way a deeply divided society can suddenly tip over into armed conflict, the long shadow of radical violence for both victims and perpetrators, and the emotional and psychological costs of a code of silence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bAF3gTGuFNDdzGUIAnDqi5nbFf3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:245256'),
  ('326086438035859007', 'Say Yes to the Dress', 2007, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Welcome to the world’s premier bridal salon, Kleinfeld Bridal. Part fashion show, part bridal story, part family therapy…Randy Fenoli &amp; a team of specialists guide brides through the process of selecting, altering &amp; delivering each dress in time for their perfect day.', 'Welcome to the world’s premier bridal salon, Kleinfeld Bridal. Part fashion show, part bridal story, part family therapy…Randy Fenoli &amp; a team of specialists guide brides through the process of selecting, altering &amp; delivering each dress in time for their perfect day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mP8C5czmUnTdVQDokmSUNj95tP.jpg', 23, 'tmdb:tv:31306'),
  ('666644785203221609', 'Say Yes to the Dress: Atlanta', 2010, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Set in the nation''s largest full service bridal salon, viewers go behind the scenes at Bridal''s by Lori to see what each bride goes through to find the perfect wedding dress. Particular, fashionable and strong willed, these Southern brides keep the staff on their toes to make sure they get exactly what they want for one of the most important days of their life.', 'Set in the nation''s largest full service bridal salon, viewers go behind the scenes at Bridal''s by Lori to see what each bride goes through to find the perfect wedding dress. Particular, fashionable and strong willed, these Southern brides keep the staff on their toes to make sure they get exactly what they want for one of the most important days of their life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nXWZJhVmqlqTbIEUeae9ttwcsxV.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:33374'),
  ('790915868237368933', 'Sayonara Zetsubou Sensei', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Hiroshi Kamiya, Ai Nonaka, Marina Inoue, Asuka Tanii, Yuko Goto, Asami Sanada, Yu Kobayashi, Miyuki Sawashiro', null, 'A teacher takes all aspects of life, word and culture in the most negative light possible.', 'A teacher takes all aspects of life, word and culture in the most negative light possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/276AsHWttACemazdqLx9E9Iio2m.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:42887'),
  ('738307404379424822', 'Sazae-san', 1969, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Machiko Hasegawa', null, 'Midori Katō, Mina Tominaga, Makoto Tsumura, Takako Sasuga, Yorie Terauchi, Hideyuki Tanaka, Chafurin, Shinsuke Chikaishi', null, 'The adventures of Sazae Fuguta and her family and friends in their Tokyo suburb.', 'The adventures of Sazae Fuguta and her family and friends in their Tokyo suburb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovOdOiGr0xHxB8rCwLSXAchCrta.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:153485'),
  ('417600060567618249', 'Sazanami Soushi ni Junketsu wo Sasagu', 2023, 'Animation', null, 'Eeyo Kurosaki', 'Saho Shirasu, Satomi Miura, Yoshiki Nakajima, Dai Kuki, Daiki Hamano, Tetsu Watake, Kouta Mashiro, Shuuji Inozuki', 'TV-MA', '"If it''s a request from my precious wife, then I will give you the moon and the stars." He flashes his gorgeous tattoos at me as he makes passionate love to me. This is bad! Something''s coming...!!', '"If it''s a request from my precious wife, then I will give you the moon and the stars." He flashes his gorgeous tattoos at me as he makes passionate love to me. This is bad! Something''s coming...!!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6SHb6A2iAX05kNZug794VFEUt7J.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:220118'),
  ('182601309854566033', 'Scam 1992: The Harshad Mehta Story', 2020, 'Crime, Drama', 'Hansal Mehta', 'Karan Vyas, Vaibhav Vishal, Sumit Purohit', 'Pratik Gandhi, Shreya Dhanwanthary, Anjali Barot, Hemant Kher, Chirag Vohra, Jay Upadhyay, Satish Kaushik, K.K. Raina', 'TV-14', 'Set in 1980''s & 90''s Bombay, Scam 1992 follows the life of Harshad Mehta - a stockbroker who single-handedly took the stock market to dizzying heights & his catastrophic downfall. Being directed by National Award-winning filmmaker Hansal Mehta, the series is based on journalist Debashis Basu & Sucheta Dalal''s book "The Scam".', 'Set in 1980''s & 90''s Bombay, Scam 1992 follows the life of Harshad Mehta - a stockbroker who single-handedly took the stock market to dizzying heights & his catastrophic downfall. Being directed by National Award-winning filmmaker Hansal Mehta, the series is based on journalist Debashis Basu & Sucheta Dalal''s book "The Scam".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fiimZ9Xt5cPTPHNrbS4QautBXpU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111188'),
  ('382803884801445732', 'Scam 2003: The Telgi Story', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Hansal Mehta', 'Kiran Yadnyopavit, Kedar Patankar, Karan Vyas', 'Gagan Dev Riar, Sana Amin Sheikh, Shashank Ketkar, Mukesh Tiwari, Sameer Dharmadhikari, Nandu Madhav, Abhinay Bansod, Bharat Dabholkar', null, 'It will follow the life of Telgi, born in Khanapur in the state of Karnataka, as he became the mastermind behind one of India’s most ingenious scams, which spread across 18 states and shook the entire country', 'It will follow the life of Telgi, born in Khanapur in the state of Karnataka, as he became the mastermind behind one of India’s most ingenious scams, which spread across 18 states and shook the entire country', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsTVqPNNOOvUXKRJv0DstHUDIw8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229403'),
  ('148706870282435008', 'Scam City', 2012, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Scam City is a show which started airing on Travel + Escape in June 2012 which crosses the globe visiting ten of the world’s most popular cities in an effort to expose the darker side of tourism. The host, Conor Woodman, meets with questionable characters ranging from unethical cab drivers to aggressive pimps as he witnesses and experiences the travel experience of parting with personal property and money. He intentionally falls victim to these alleged scammers and says "yes" to every hooker and pocket jeweler in the city, giving up substantial quantities of cash in the process. The show aims to expose the local adaptations of common scams - from pick pockets, expensive cab fares, to bars luring people in with adult entertainment at a high cost. Scam City has also been aired on the National Geographic Channel. In Australia, Scam City is shown on subscription TV channel Nat Geo Adventure, which airs on channel 628 on the Foxtel network.', 'Scam City is a show which started airing on Travel + Escape in June 2012 which crosses the globe visiting ten of the world’s most popular cities in an effort to expose the darker side of tourism. The host, Conor Woodman, meets with questionable characters ranging from unethical cab drivers to aggressive pimps as he witnesses and experiences the travel experience of parting with personal property and money. He intentionally falls victim to these alleged scammers and says "yes" to every hooker and pocket jeweler in the city, giving up substantial quantities of cash in the process. The show aims to expose the local adaptations of common scams - from pick pockets, expensive cab fares, to bars luring people in with adult entertainment at a high cost. Scam City has also been aired on the National Geographic Channel. In Australia, Scam City is shown on subscription TV channel Nat Geo Adventure, which airs on channel 628 on the Foxtel network.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z3QVnLQ9CNK30DZtfRlfykwaDFU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:59580'),
  ('631525238163188800', 'Scandal', 2012, 'Drama', 'Shonda Rhimes', null, 'Kerry Washington, Darby Stanchfield, Katie Lowes, Guillermo Díaz, Jeff Perry, Tony Goldwyn, Joshua Malina, Bellamy Young', 'TV-14', 'Everyone has secrets and Olivia Pope has dedicated her life to protecting and defending the public images of the elite by keeping those secrets under wraps. Pope and her team are at the top of their game when it comes to getting the job done for their clients, but it becomes apparent that these "gladiators in suits," who specialize in fixing the lives of other people, have trouble fixing those closest at hand -- their own.', 'Everyone has secrets and Olivia Pope has dedicated her life to protecting and defending the public images of the elite by keeping those secrets under wraps. Pope and her team are at the top of their game when it comes to getting the job done for their clients, but it becomes apparent that these "gladiators in suits," who specialize in fixing the lives of other people, have trouble fixing those closest at hand -- their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4XmF8PMSqtHCGNoL15oHbjr5ZuO.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:39269'),
  ('585325126438253870', 'Scandal (2012)', 2012, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Tom Verica, Severiano Canales, Johanna Lee, Michelle Lirtzman, Shonda Rhimes', 'Tom Verica, Severiano Canales, Johanna Lee, Michelle Lirtzman, Shonda Rhimes, Zahir McGhee, Chris Van Dusen, Mark Fish, Austin Guzman, Jess Brownell, Jenna Bans, Nicholas Nardini, Ameni Rozsa, Heather Mitchell, Juan Carlos Fernandez, Tia Napolitano, Jeremy Gordon, Alison Schapker, Paul William Davies, Matt Byrne, Raamla Mohamed', 'Kerry Washington, Katie Lowes, Guillermo Díaz, Jeff Perry, Joshua Malina', 'TV-14', 'Everyone has secrets and Olivia Pope has dedicated her life to protecting and defending the public images of the elite by keeping those secrets under wraps. Pope and her team are at the top of their game when it comes to getting the job done for their clients, but it becomes apparent that these "gladiators in suits," who specialize in fixing the lives of other people, have trouble fixing those closest at hand -- their own.', 'Everyone has secrets and Olivia Pope has dedicated her life to protecting and defending the public images of the elite by keeping those secrets under wraps. Pope and her team are at the top of their game when it comes to getting the job done for their clients, but it becomes apparent that these "gladiators in suits," who specialize in fixing the lives of other people, have trouble fixing those closest at hand -- their own.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F4XmF8PMSqtHCGNoL15oHbjr5ZuO.jpg', 7, 'plex:tv:scandal-2012'),
  ('50708170180337069', 'Scandal love', 2026, 'Reality', null, null, 'Heo So Yoon, Kim Hyeon-soo', null, 'In the highly commercialized idol industry, emotions are often manufactured and sold as part of the brand. Scandal Love follows four women navigating different levels of power within a K-pop girl group system. As they struggle with strict contracts, overwhelming public scrutiny, and their own genuine feelings, each is forced to make impossible choices. The series explores one central question: can real love survive inside relationships that are carefully designed and controlled?', 'In the highly commercialized idol industry, emotions are often manufactured and sold as part of the brand. Scandal Love follows four women navigating different levels of power within a K-pop girl group system. As they struggle with strict contracts, overwhelming public scrutiny, and their own genuine feelings, each is forced to make impossible choices. The series explores one central question: can real love survive inside relationships that are carefully designed and controlled?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6CeXhf5xGbwlZCCwz8cwNh6wc9C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:313732'),
  ('419265349306519629', 'Scandal: Story of an Obsession', 2023, 'Drama', 'Aurora Guerra', null, 'Alexandra Jiménez, Fernando Lindez, Celia Freijeiro, Antonio Gil, Víctor Duplá, Alba Gutiérrez, Iñigo de la Iglesia, Carlos Serrano', null, 'Inés is a 42-year-old woman who, when times start to get tough, attempts to drown herself. She is saved by Hugo, a teenage boy who then becomes obsessed with her. A forbidden romance develops between the two, whose consequences end up affecting all those around them.', 'Inés is a 42-year-old woman who, when times start to get tough, attempts to drown herself. She is saved by Hugo, a teenage boy who then becomes obsessed with her. A forbidden romance develops between the two, whose consequences end up affecting all those around them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mra3tUkixvDE0lxQw1ZjuSkCa1U.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203505'),
  ('607708510467912372', 'Scar', 2024, 'Action & Adventure', 'Fernando Sancristóbal, Pablo Roa, Verónica Marzá', null, 'Milena Radulović, Juanlu González, Luis Fernández, Stefan Kapičić, Mladen Sovilj, Goran Šušljik, Maciej Stuhr, Adela Glisic', null, 'Simon Sax, a socially awkward computer genius poised to sell his groundbreaking algorithm and become a billionaire, ventures into online dating where he meets Irina—a mysterious Ukrainian/Russian woman marked by a chilling scar on her cheek.', 'Simon Sax, a socially awkward computer genius poised to sell his groundbreaking algorithm and become a billionaire, ventures into online dating where he meets Irina—a mysterious Ukrainian/Russian woman marked by a chilling scar on her cheek.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8E0J66unLfm1paO1hitnNk1TWfi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:238347'),
  ('887255702576125161', 'Scare PewDiePie', 2016, 'Comedy, Reality', 'Travis Draft', null, 'PewDiePie, David Storrs, Damon Zwicker', 'TV-MA', 'In this reality-adventure series from the creator and executive producers of "The Walking Dead," experience thrills, chills, and laughter as PewDiePie encounters terrifying situations inspired by his favorite video games.', 'In this reality-adventure series from the creator and executive producers of "The Walking Dead," experience thrills, chills, and laughter as PewDiePie encounters terrifying situations inspired by his favorite video games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3a3HTXPDbrUGIJlswCFOfKpbp5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68833'),
  ('941735978678322123', 'Scare Tactics', 2003, 'Comedy, Reality', 'Scott Hallock, Kevin Healey', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Scare Tactics is a hidden camera/comedy television show, produced by Kevin Healey and Scott Hallock. Its first two seasons aired from April 2003 to December 2004. After a hiatus, the show returned for a third season, beginning July 9, 2008. The first season of the show was hosted by Shannen Doherty. Stephen Baldwin took her place in the middle of the second season. Since the beginning of the third season, the show has been hosted by Tracy Morgan. The fourth season began on October 6, 2009. In Europe the first season of the program aired on MTV Central from 2003 to 2004. The show is also broadcast in Australia on FOX8, in Canada on MTV, in India on AXN, in Russia on MTV Russia, in Turkey on Dream TV, in Poland on TV Puls, in Finland on Jim, in South Korea on Q TV, in Sweden initially on TV6 and currently on TV11.', 'Scare Tactics is a hidden camera/comedy television show, produced by Kevin Healey and Scott Hallock. Its first two seasons aired from April 2003 to December 2004. After a hiatus, the show returned for a third season, beginning July 9, 2008. The first season of the show was hosted by Shannen Doherty. Stephen Baldwin took her place in the middle of the second season. Since the beginning of the third season, the show has been hosted by Tracy Morgan. The fourth season began on October 6, 2009. In Europe the first season of the program aired on MTV Central from 2003 to 2004. The show is also broadcast in Australia on FOX8, in Canada on MTV, in India on AXN, in Russia on MTV Russia, in Turkey on Dream TV, in Poland on TV Puls, in Finland on Jim, in South Korea on Q TV, in Sweden initially on TV6 and currently on TV11.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSdvAst4xBCf0GICYwOSjTFnE2G.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:351'),
  ('1016566502665813861', 'Scarecrow and Mrs. King', 1983, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Brad Buckner, Eugenie Ross-Leming', null, 'Kate Jackson, Bruce Boxleitner, Beverly Garland, Mel Stewart, Martha Smith, Paul Stout, Greg Morton', 'TV-14', 'Scarecrow and Mrs. King is an American television series that aired from October 3, 1983, to May 28, 1987 on CBS. The show stars Kate Jackson and Bruce Boxleitner as divorced housewife Amanda King and top-level "Agency" operative Lee Stetson who begin a strange association, and eventual romance, after encountering one another in a train station.', 'Scarecrow and Mrs. King is an American television series that aired from October 3, 1983, to May 28, 1987 on CBS. The show stars Kate Jackson and Bruce Boxleitner as divorced housewife Amanda King and top-level "Agency" operative Lee Stetson who begin a strange association, and eventual romance, after encountering one another in a train station.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36oUFRNJQORpL9fmnrSXdFqEGty.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:3414'),
  ('202785144511782367', 'Scaredy Cats', 2021, 'Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Kids', 'Anna McRoberts', null, 'Sophia Reid-Gantzert, Ava Augustin, Daphne Hoskins, Carolyn Taylor, Lauren McGibbon, April Telek, Michael Teigen, Zibby Allen', 'TV-G', 'On Willa Ward’s twelfth birthday, she inherits a beautiful charm necklace that belonged to her mother, who was a witch. She soon learns 2 bad witches, Wilma and Wanda are after her locket so they can have ultimate power, and she alongside her best friends Scout and Lily turn into cats to escape.', 'On Willa Ward’s twelfth birthday, she inherits a beautiful charm necklace that belonged to her mother, who was a witch. She soon learns 2 bad witches, Wilma and Wanda are after her locket so they can have ultimate power, and she alongside her best friends Scout and Lily turn into cats to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vhgh0RZgN3h54Xlpvuz6Atruq7W.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:133064'),
  ('1056708614063478606', 'Scaredy Squirrel', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Mélanie Watt, Jillian Ruby, Matt Ferguson', null, 'Terry McGurrin, Jonathan Gould, Patrick McKenna, Jayne Eastwood, David Berni, Linda Kash, Jamie Watson, Dwayne Hill', 'TV-Y7', 'With help from skunk Dave, the lovably geeky Scaredy Squirrel uses his quirks and creativity to tackle the challenges of daily life in Balsa City.', 'With help from skunk Dave, the lovably geeky Scaredy Squirrel uses his quirks and creativity to tackle the challenges of daily life in Balsa City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUNCnbJg4ahgfvCf1Nx7E4iZY2p.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:38997'),
  ('1098378811707374077', 'Scarlet', 2019, 'Drama', null, null, 'Erika Toda, Kazuki Kitamura, Yasuko Tomita, Hitomi Miyauchi, Mayuko Fukuda, Ryuta Sato, Yuko Oshima, Kento Hayashi', null, 'Born in 1937 in Osaka as the eldest daughter, Kawahara Kimiko moves to Shigaraki with her family at the age of 9. She works to support her family from a young age. Eventually, she jumps into the male world of pottery and becomes a pioneer of female ceramic arts. After marrying her husband who is also involved in ceramics and owning her own kiln, she raises her two children while struggling to create unique ware.', 'Born in 1937 in Osaka as the eldest daughter, Kawahara Kimiko moves to Shigaraki with her family at the age of 9. She works to support her family from a young age. Eventually, she jumps into the male world of pottery and becomes a pioneer of female ceramic arts. After marrying her husband who is also involved in ceramics and owning her own kiln, she raises her two children while struggling to create unique ware.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/muKCblbwJPKL6iuat2Dh3fmEy2H.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94333'),
  ('581595303443082186', 'Scarlet and Black', 1993, 'Drama', null, 'Stephen Lowe', 'Ewan McGregor, Christopher Fulford, Alice Krige, T. P. McKenna, Rachel Weisz, Clive Arrindell, Malcolm Sinclair, Crispin Bonham-Carter', null, 'An ambitious young man seduces women of high social standing in order to improve his prospects.', 'An ambitious young man seduces women of high social standing in order to improve his prospects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFyDmTlq1u429fQ9eqabPlEG8PV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39172'),
  ('208587848648827011', 'Scarlet Heart', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Liu Shishi, Nicky Wu, Sun Yizhou, Damian Lau Chung-Yan, Jiang Jinfu, Annie Liu Xin-You, Ye Zuxin, Ye Qing', null, 'Zhang Xiao, a 21st-century woman, is transported back to the Qing Dynasty during Emperor Kangxi''s reign after a bizarre accident. She awakens in the body of Maertai Rouxi, a teenage nobleman''s daughter, and must navigate life in a past world shaped by her mysterious connection to this historical figure.', 'Zhang Xiao, a 21st-century woman, is transported back to the Qing Dynasty during Emperor Kangxi''s reign after a bizarre accident. She awakens in the body of Maertai Rouxi, a teenage nobleman''s daughter, and must navigate life in a past world shaped by her mysterious connection to this historical figure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNVmYG7n50dsh08WFEheq5oURpi.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:37681'),
  ('918074680445352485', 'Scarlet Heart: Ryeo', 2016, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics', 'Tong Hua', null, 'IU, Lee Joon-gi, Kang Ha-neul, Hong Jong-hyun, Baekhyun, Nam Joo-hyuk, Kim Ji-soo, Yoon Sun-woo', null, 'A story of a 25-year-old Go Hajin who is transported back in time to the Goryeo Dynasty. She then wakes up in the body of Lady Hae Soo and finds herself amongst the ruling princes of the Wang Family.', 'A story of a 25-year-old Go Hajin who is transported back in time to the Goryeo Dynasty. She then wakes up in the body of Lady Hae Soo and finds herself amongst the ruling princes of the Wang Family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pjdPGHqUe60ZGQJR1TItVNaV4it.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66433'),
  ('67510809242101720', 'Scarlet Nexus', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Junya Enoki, Asami Seto, Tomomi Mineuchi, Marika Kouno, Ryota Takeuchi, Chinatsu Akasaki, Kengo Kawanishi, Yui Horie', 'TV-14', 'Saved by the Other Suppression Force as a child, psychokinetic Yuito enlists in this elite team formed to fight Earth’s enemy. Meanwhile, prodigy Kasane was scouted for her abilities. Kasane’s dreams tell her strange things, dragging the two into an unavoidable fate.', 'Saved by the Other Suppression Force as a child, psychokinetic Yuito enlists in this elite team formed to fight Earth’s enemy. Meanwhile, prodigy Kasane was scouted for her abilities. Kasane’s dreams tell her strange things, dragging the two into an unavoidable fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GsBzKAPbHY7HjGRkAN0svRpIQI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121131'),
  ('396411984384748491', 'Scarlett', 1994, 'Drama', 'William Hanley, Alexandra Ripley', 'William Hanley', 'Joanne Whalley, Timothy Dalton, Annabeth Gish, Julie Harris, Ann-Margret', null, 'Scarlett is a 1994 American television miniseries loosely based on Alexandra Ripley''s eponymous 1991 book of the same name, a sequel to Margaret Mitchell''s ''Gone with the Wind'' (1936). Filmed across the United States and abroad, the series stars Joanne Whalley and Timothy Dalton. The miniseries was broadcast in four parts on CBS from November 13-17, 1994. Following the death of her sister-in-law Melanie Wilkes, Scarlett O''Hara sets out to reclaim her doomed romance with Rhett Butler, as it takes her home to Tara to Charleston to Savannah to Ireland, where she learns of her family''s roots.', 'Scarlett is a 1994 American television miniseries loosely based on Alexandra Ripley''s eponymous 1991 book of the same name, a sequel to Margaret Mitchell''s ''Gone with the Wind'' (1936). Filmed across the United States and abroad, the series stars Joanne Whalley and Timothy Dalton. The miniseries was broadcast in four parts on CBS from November 13-17, 1994. Following the death of her sister-in-law Melanie Wilkes, Scarlett O''Hara sets out to reclaim her doomed romance with Rhett Butler, as it takes her home to Tara to Charleston to Savannah to Ireland, where she learns of her family''s roots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jUtnwi73486eKxdVoLzKbCbRP7i.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15724'),
  ('540825402412582576', 'Scarpetta', 2026, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Elizabeth Sarnoff', 'Matthew Zucker', 'Nicole Kidman, Jamie Lee Curtis, Bobby Cannavale, Simon Baker, Rosy McEwen, Jake Cannavale, Hunter Parrish, Ariana DeBose', 'TV-MA', 'Renowned forensic pathologist Dr. Kay Scarpetta returns to her position as Virginia''s Chief Medical Examiner, where she investigates a haunting murder with eerie reminders from her first big case decades ago. In 1998, Scarpetta works alongside Detective Pete Marino and FBI Agent Benton Wesley as they investigate a series of brutal stranglings. Based on the best-selling novels by Patricia Cornwell.', 'Renowned forensic pathologist Dr. Kay Scarpetta returns to her position as Virginia''s Chief Medical Examiner, where she investigates a haunting murder with eerie reminders from her first big case decades ago. In 1998, Scarpetta works alongside Detective Pete Marino and FBI Agent Benton Wesley as they investigate a series of brutal stranglings. Based on the best-selling novels by Patricia Cornwell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvkcHCJUPqv7R9ukaiDNkm75jy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:240740'),
  ('738912403601710625', 'Scars of Beauty', 2025, 'Soap, Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Raphael Montes', 'Raphael Montes, Mariana Torres, Victor Atherino', 'Camila Queiroz, Camila Pitanga, Giovanna Antonelli, Caio Blat, Marcelo Serrado, Julia Stockler, Enzo Romani, Breno Ferreira', null, 'Two families, two terrible injustices, and one common plan for revenge. A daughter who loses her mother is wrongly imprisoned and murdered in prison. A mother who loses her daughter is the victim of medical malpractice. Both join forces to take revenge on those who destroyed their families.', 'Two families, two terrible injustices, and one common plan for revenge. A daughter who loses her mother is wrongly imprisoned and murdered in prison. A mother who loses her daughter is the victim of medical malpractice. Both join forces to take revenge on those who destroyed their families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XoMNsaYs3mVF2JZL9ng1P4kAaZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158596'),
  ('478864135504086869', 'Scary World Tingz The Unexplainable', 2026, 'Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Axnie Raloysuis Jansen', null, null, null, 'Sent from the planet Axinia at 3 months old, S.W.T. is raised by Khoisan ancestors who protect the secret of his blood. Guided by visions of his mother, he must master his celestial powers to defend Earth from a rising ancient evil.', 'Sent from the planet Axinia at 3 months old, S.W.T. is raised by Khoisan ancestors who protect the secret of his blood. Guided by visions of his mother, he must master his celestial powers to defend Earth from a rising ancient evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qppo7QmLWnWO9AKXJVXnhk2g5Sp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:318956'),
  ('6133487799936822', 'Scavengers Reign', 2023, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Charles Huettner, Joseph Bennett, James Merrill', null, 'Sunita Mani, Wunmi Mosaku, Alia Shawkat, Bob Stephenson, Ted Travelstead', 'TV-MA', 'When a deep space freighter is damaged by a solar flare its surviving crew are stranded on a beautiful and unforgiving planet. They begin to learn the true nature of this planet as they try to survive long enough to escape or be rescued.', 'When a deep space freighter is damaged by a solar flare its surviving crew are stranded on a beautiful and unforgiving planet. They begin to learn the true nature of this planet as they try to survive long enough to escape or be rescued.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFlVZV8TQbs8hcIY7PVYonYFMgK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204154'),
