  ('135572469844868350', 'Schmigadoon!', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Ken Daurio, Cinco Paul', null, 'Keegan-Michael Key, Cecily Strong, Dove Cameron, Alan Cumming, Aaron Tveit, Kristin Chenoweth, Tituss Burgess', 'TV-14', 'Josh and Melissa are a struggling couple whose lives are transformed when they get trapped in a magical musical town—with a mission they must complete.', 'Josh and Melissa are a struggling couple whose lives are transformed when they get trapped in a magical musical town—with a mission they must complete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2Z5Rm7H0DFHX8cF0CQjIFOd6Am.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:98892'),
  ('588389235171597170', 'Schnell ermittelt', 2009, 'Crime, Drama', 'Eva Spreitzhofer', null, 'Ursula Strauss, Andreas Lust, Wolf Bachofner, Katharina Straßer, Morteza Tavakoli, Fiona Hauser, Simon Morzé, Helmut La', 'NR', 'Angelika Schnell is the head of homicide and living proof that chaos is just another form of order. Nevertheless, she is a brilliant investigator - even if her methods are sometimes quite unconventional: In addition to hard facts, she also allows her distinctive inner voice to apply, which often leads to incomprehensible but very important conclusions...', 'Angelika Schnell is the head of homicide and living proof that chaos is just another form of order. Nevertheless, she is a brilliant investigator - even if her methods are sometimes quite unconventional: In addition to hard facts, she also allows her distinctive inner voice to apply, which often leads to incomprehensible but very important conclusions...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3xLYypD0MKnVECqDCGzs3Kq77L.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:41336'),
  ('228119659261531756', 'School', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Valeriya Gay Germanika, Natalya Meshchaninova, Ruslan Malikov', 'Yury Klavdiev, Nataliia Vorozhbyt, Vyacheslav Durnenkov', 'Valentina Lukashchuk, Alexey Litvinenko, Anna Shepeleva, Mikhail Isakhanov, Konstantin Poyarkin, Aleksey Maslodudov, Sergey Kagakov, Tatyana Titova', null, '9 "A" was an exemplary class, while their class teacher was Nosov Anatoly Germanovich - a strong and experienced teacher, recognized in 2009 as the Teacher of the Year. After his sudden illness, 9 "A" is left without a strong hand. The myth of the exemplary class is crumbling, discipline is cracking at the seams. Nosov''s granddaughter, Anya Nosova, is perhaps the most difficult teenager of the school. A new student Ilya Epifanov provokes situations in which students manifest themselves from unexpected sides, turning upside down the usual idea of ​​them as classmates and teachers. None of the teachers want to take on the class, which of the model has become the most difficult.', '9 "A" was an exemplary class, while their class teacher was Nosov Anatoly Germanovich - a strong and experienced teacher, recognized in 2009 as the Teacher of the Year. After his sudden illness, 9 "A" is left without a strong hand. The myth of the exemplary class is crumbling, discipline is cracking at the seams. Nosov''s granddaughter, Anya Nosova, is perhaps the most difficult teenager of the school. A new student Ilya Epifanov provokes situations in which students manifest themselves from unexpected sides, turning upside down the usual idea of ​​them as classmates and teachers. None of the teachers want to take on the class, which of the model has become the most difficult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2py43uJZ5bRcHOmMB7xkBx3oRLU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46099'),
  ('164347486920003134', 'School 2013', 2012, 'Drama', 'Lee Eung-bok', 'Lee Hyun-joo, Go Jung-won', 'Lee Jong-suk, Kim Woo-bin, Jang Na-ra, Choi Daniel, Park Se-young, Jeon Soo-jin, Uhm Hyo-seop, Kwak Jung-wook', null, 'Go Nam-soon, a young boy, constantly gets bullied by a group in his class. Later, one of his old rivals joins his school. Eventually, they are able to sort out their differences.', 'Go Nam-soon, a young boy, constantly gets bullied by a group in his class. Later, one of his old rivals joins his school. Eventually, they are able to sort out their differences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XSHp0wBIGIZGtoFs5jSWVmVG62.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46596'),
  ('60990789796658333', 'School 2017', 2017, 'Drama', null, 'Kim Seung-Won, Jung Chan-mi', 'Kim Se-jeong, Kim Jung-hyun, Jang Dong-yoon, Seol In-a, Rowoon, Ji Hye-ran, Han Seon-hwa, Han Joo-wan', null, 'A coming-of-age story about the lives of 18-year-old high school students who are valued according to their ranking in school. Despite their frustrations, they find out how to make their own way in this world that seems to be a stagnant cycle of school and home.', 'A coming-of-age story about the lives of 18-year-old high school students who are valued according to their ranking in school. Despite their frustrations, they find out how to make their own way in this world that seems to be a stagnant cycle of school and home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3EGaQzyd4GwOy2CD4ORxRPItyH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72374'),
  ('447021242111891501', 'School 2021', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Dong Hee-sun, Jo Ah-ra', 'Kim Yo-han, Cho Yi-hyun, Choo Young-woo, Hwang Bo-reum-byeol, Kim Kang-min, Seo Hee-sun, Kim Nu-rim, Lee Sang-jun', null, 'The story of students attending a specialized high school and pursuing their own dreams rather than go off to college. It will delve into how these students learn about love, friendship, the things they like versus the things they’re good at, and growing up in an intense environment. Gong Ki Joon is a hardworking student who takes on work and school at the same time and achieves his dream job after learning about love and friendship. Jeong Young Joo is a transfer student with a hidden story and a past connection to Gong Ki Joon.', 'The story of students attending a specialized high school and pursuing their own dreams rather than go off to college. It will delve into how these students learn about love, friendship, the things they like versus the things they’re good at, and growing up in an intense environment. Gong Ki Joon is a hardworking student who takes on work and school at the same time and achieves his dream job after learning about love and friendship. Jeong Young Joo is a transfer student with a hidden story and a past connection to Gong Ki Joon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cMGunMajOip0Viu9QRvoFywhY12.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97765'),
  ('885751403155685053', 'School Babysitters', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', null, null, 'Koutaro Nishiyama, Nozomi Furuki, Yuuichirou Umehara, Yuko Sanpei, Konomi Kohara, Ayaka Saito, Atsumi Tanezaki, Kaede Hondo', 'TV-14', 'Ryuichi and Kotaro are brothers who lost their parents in an airplane crash. They''re taken in by the chairman of Morinomiya Academy, who lost her son and daughter-in-law in the same crash, on one condition: Ryuichi has to babysit the kids at the daycare room in the school! This room was opened to help the school''s teachers who had kids to take care of, but it suffers from a lack of staff until Ryuichi becomes the first member of the babysitter club formed to solve that problem.', 'Ryuichi and Kotaro are brothers who lost their parents in an airplane crash. They''re taken in by the chairman of Morinomiya Academy, who lost her son and daughter-in-law in the same crash, on one condition: Ryuichi has to babysit the kids at the daycare room in the school! This room was opened to help the school''s teachers who had kids to take care of, but it suffers from a lack of staff until Ryuichi becomes the first member of the babysitter club formed to solve that problem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEyLfALQ52fguNTwhJFSYEcQLRP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76124'),
  ('628886797412667893', 'School Days', 2007, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Daisuke Hirakawa, Tae Okajima, Shiho Kawaragi, Kei Imoto', 'TV-14', 'A rumor states that if you take a photo of someone you like with your cellphone and keep it hidden, they''ll fall for you. Will Makoto win his love by taking a picture of Kotonoha without anyone knowing?', 'A rumor states that if you take a photo of someone you like with your cellphone and keep it hidden, they''ll fall for you. Will Makoto win his love by taking a picture of Kotonoha without anyone knowing?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JhEzJIsBLXOshoTnBaX9499I8l.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:28061'),
  ('747863056379295053', 'School for Little Vampires', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jackie Niebisch', null, 'Gabriele Patriarca, Perla Liberatori, Mino Caprio, Alberto Angrisano, Barbara Pitotti, Letizia Ciampa, Emanuela Amato, Domenico Strati', 'TV-Y7', 'A vampire boy who can’t stand the sight of blood and who is, worst of all, in love with a human girl called Sunshine – the cards are stacked against Oskar, the vampire! His friends are shrill, charming, have names like Stoker, Gothetta, Klot, and Count Horrificus. All have one thing in common: They all are vampires and pupils.', 'A vampire boy who can’t stand the sight of blood and who is, worst of all, in love with a human girl called Sunshine – the cards are stacked against Oskar, the vampire! His friends are shrill, charming, have names like Stoker, Gothetta, Klot, and Count Horrificus. All have one thing in common: They all are vampires and pupils.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ApYgELDdjbNyOZYgxXFJ6Y0vY81.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:40751'),
  ('360460025878381919', 'School of Chocolate', 2021, 'Reality', null, null, 'Amaury Guichon', 'TV-PG', 'Eight professionals study the art of chocolate under the guidance of a well-known chocolatier. But only one can be the best in class and win a unique opportunity.', 'Eight professionals study the art of chocolate under the guidance of a well-known chocolatier. But only one can be the best in class and win a unique opportunity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJe4JUiH3qz40eXT6wQ1zd6dA3O.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137584'),
  ('1004476137701769696', 'School of Comedy', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Laura Lawson', null, 'Will Poulter, Beth Rylance, Jack Harries, Evie Henderson, Max Brown, Ella Ainsworth, Lilly Ainsworth, Phoebe Abbott', null, 'Follow the numerous acts of children pretending to be adults in various scenarios, including lesbian best friends, a cockney taxi driver, a perverted museum guide and South-African security guards.', 'Follow the numerous acts of children pretending to be adults in various scenarios, including lesbian best friends, a cockney taxi driver, a perverted museum guide and South-African security guards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1ZUzYFU3m6v6Cm0aOTBBbrlBpj.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:31208'),
  ('563286190327939639', 'School of Rock', 2016, 'Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Breanna Yde, Ricardo Hurtado, Jade Pettyjohn, Lance Lim, Aidan Miner, Tony Cavalero, Jama Williamson', 'TV-G', 'A group of rule-abiding prep school students – Zack, Lawrence, Freddy, Summer and Tomika – learn to take risks and reach new heights thanks to substitute teacher Dewey Finn, a down-on-his-luck musician who uses the language of rock ‘n’ roll to inspire his class to form a secret band. Throughout the school year, these middle-school classmates find themselves navigating relationships, discovering their unknown talents and learning lessons on loyalty and friendships.', 'A group of rule-abiding prep school students – Zack, Lawrence, Freddy, Summer and Tomika – learn to take risks and reach new heights thanks to substitute teacher Dewey Finn, a down-on-his-luck musician who uses the language of rock ‘n’ roll to inspire his class to form a secret band. Throughout the school year, these middle-school classmates find themselves navigating relationships, discovering their unknown talents and learning lessons on loyalty and friendships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2bgBpNELVO3FsE7iXwdJYeRDzyR.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:65876'),
  ('512164281847560130', 'School Rumble', 2004, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ami Koshimizu, Hiroki Takahashi, Yui Horie, Hitomi Nabatame, Kaori Shimizu, Mamiko Noto, Shinji Kawada, Yuu Asakawa', 'TV-PG', 'High school can be hard enough with just academics alone, but when love enters into the picture, it can unravel into a comedy of errors. Tenma has fallen for oblivious Karasama and class delinquent Harima has fallen for Tenma. While this unlikely trio winds their way through the pitfalls of love and high school life, their friends and classmates become caught up in the chaos.', 'High school can be hard enough with just academics alone, but when love enters into the picture, it can unravel into a comedy of errors. Tenma has fallen for oblivious Karasama and class delinquent Harima has fallen for Tenma. While this unlikely trio winds their way through the pitfalls of love and high school life, their friends and classmates become caught up in the chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uuldZxy7SRvSvOfRBZObKTMfmtP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:31665'),
  ('1062783644928768328', 'School Spirits', 2023, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Nate Trinrud, Megan Trinrud', null, 'Peyton List, Milo Manheim, Kristian Ventura, Spencer MacPherson, Kiara Pichardo, Sarah Yarkin, Nick Pugliese, Rainbow Wedell', 'TV-MA', 'Maddie, a teen stuck in the afterlife investigating her own mysterious disappearance, goes on a crime-solving journey as she adjusts to high school purgatory, but the closer she gets to discovering the truth, the more secrets and lies she uncovers.', 'Maddie, a teen stuck in the afterlife investigating her own mysterious disappearance, goes on a crime-solving journey as she adjusts to high school purgatory, but the closer she gets to discovering the truth, the more secrets and lies she uncovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcIsJ06LptDahicANKK5XTqobd3.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:208397'),
  ('744362354920949911', 'School Tales the Series', 2022, 'Mystery', null, 'Adirek Phothong', null, 'TV-MA', 'Unspeakable horrors roam the halls of high school in this anthology featuring ghost stories directed by seasoned Thai horror directors.', 'Unspeakable horrors roam the halls of high school in this anthology featuring ghost stories directed by seasoned Thai horror directors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OwFUerRIahvfnV7ADcJm8xX5fx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203502'),
  ('369147391340952798', 'School Trip: Joined a Group I''m Not Close To', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Kodai Fujimoto, Hideyoshi Kan, Masaya Sakuragi, Ayuta Fukuda, Kairi Shimizu', null, 'An awkward teen joins a group of popular classmates on a school trip, sparking an unexpected romance with the most popular and charming boy in school.', 'An awkward teen joins a group of popular classmates on a school trip, sparking an unexpected romance with the most popular and charming boy in school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlgLNj2vg7XHixFpg2EJRf9JIsZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:297710'),
  ('454792985105729434', 'SCHOOL-LIVE!', 2015, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Inori Minase, Ari Ozawa, Mao Ichimichi, Rie Takahashi, Ai Kayano', 'TV-14', 'Yuki Takeya, Kurumi Ebisuzawa, Yuri Wakasa, and Miki Naoki decide to stay over at school. Along with the school adviser Megumi Sakura, they suddenly find themselves to be the final survivors of a zombie attack, and continue to live and survive at the school.', 'Yuki Takeya, Kurumi Ebisuzawa, Yuri Wakasa, and Miki Naoki decide to stay over at school. Along with the school adviser Megumi Sakura, they suddenly find themselves to be the final survivors of a zombie attack, and continue to live and survive at the school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46C5g7zAN4KHfZQBaJamyWia8l0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63495'),
  ('990927149970692713', 'Schooled', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Marc Firek, Adam F. Goldberg', null, 'AJ Michalka, Bryan Callen, Tim Meadows, Brett Dier, Haneefah Wood', 'TV-PG', 'It’s 1990-something, and since Lainey still hasn’t achieved rock ‘n’ roll greatness, she returns to William Penn Academy as the new music teacher.', 'It’s 1990-something, and since Lainey still hasn’t achieved rock ‘n’ roll greatness, she returns to William Penn Academy as the new music teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3lhBc4mxdctDpA6GWxl4QTk0Oh.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:81924'),
  ('431734272506494810', 'Schoolhouse Rock!', 1973, 'Animation', null, null, 'Jack Sheldon, Bob Dorough, Lynn Ahrens, Essra Mohawk, Grady Tate', 'NR', 'Schoolhouse Rock! is an American interstitial programming series of animated musical educational short films that aired during the Saturday morning children''s programming on the U.S. television network ABC. The topics covered included grammar, science, economics, history, mathematics, and civics. The series'' original run lasted from 1973 to 1985, and was later revived with both old and new episodes airing from 1993 to 1999. Additional episodes were produced as recently as 2009 for direct-to-video release.', 'Schoolhouse Rock! is an American interstitial programming series of animated musical educational short films that aired during the Saturday morning children''s programming on the U.S. television network ABC. The topics covered included grammar, science, economics, history, mathematics, and civics. The series'' original run lasted from 1973 to 1985, and was later revived with both old and new episodes airing from 1993 to 1999. Additional episodes were produced as recently as 2009 for direct-to-video release.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4HCCVNl90rdcv1SJXCbktmVHTt4.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:10077'),
  ('988415723902363387', 'Schulz & Böhmermann', 2016, 'Talk', null, null, 'Olli Schulz, Jan Böhmermann, Sibylle Berg', null, 'Follow up of the Talkshow «Roche & Böhmermann»', 'Follow up of the Talkshow «Roche & Böhmermann»', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZYH2nAMIErFITI7MTMWsSyHutW.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:64827'),
  ('927206562316418048', 'Schulz Saves America', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Andrew Schulz, Mark Gagnon', null, 'Andrew Schulz', 'TV-MA', 'Comedian Andrew Schulz takes on the year''s most divisive topics in this fearlessly unfiltered and irreverent four-part special.', 'Comedian Andrew Schulz takes on the year''s most divisive topics in this fearlessly unfiltered and irreverent four-part special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggbN2lhQxtUXWAQo3tG9xJiNEEO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114604'),
  ('1131656423559398771', 'Schwarzes Marken', 2016, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kana Marutsuka, Kenichi Suzumura, Yoshino Nanjo, Chika Anzai, Kaori Fukuhara, Nozomi Yamamoto, Minami Tanaka, Emiri Kato', null, 'Germany was divided into East and West after WWII, where citizens of either treated the other side as enemies. In the midst of Cold War, however, the Earth was invaded by an alien life form landed on Kashgar, Xinjiang Uyghur Autonomous Region, known as "Beta." Now, ten years after the first contact, East Germany, formally German Democratic Republic, has become the front line.', 'Germany was divided into East and West after WWII, where citizens of either treated the other side as enemies. In the midst of Cold War, however, the Earth was invaded by an alien life form landed on Kashgar, Xinjiang Uyghur Autonomous Region, known as "Beta." Now, ten years after the first contact, East Germany, formally German Democratic Republic, has become the front line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1aADz1Xa4XEJ9RSElgxRMtUuAbe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65837'),
  ('7234068520751621', 'Science Fell in Love, So I Tried to Prove It', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yuma Uchida, Sora Amamiya, Natsuko Hara, Ryotaro Okiayu, Momo Asakura, Jun Fukushima, Nichika Omori', 'TV-14', 'Shinya Yukimura and Ayame Himuro are two scientists that want to find out if love can be solved by a scientific theory. These two scientists also have feelings for each other and want to be able to solve their feelings through similar theoretical facts. With this perfect opportunity, these scientists will attempt to solve the theory of the love they express for each other.', 'Shinya Yukimura and Ayame Himuro are two scientists that want to find out if love can be solved by a scientific theory. These two scientists also have feelings for each other and want to be able to solve their feelings through similar theoretical facts. With this perfect opportunity, these scientists will attempt to solve the theory of the love they express for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/njxYwSx92QS6l5n7L1KWVDQoTqD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:90999'),
  ('204735902231524840', 'Science Ninja Team Gatchaman', 1972, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Tatsuo Yoshida', 'Jinzo Toriumi, Hirohisa Soda', 'Katsuji Mori, Isao Sasaki, Kazuko Sugiyama, Yoku Shioya, Shingo Kanemoto, Nobuo Tanaka, Hisayoshi Yoshizawa, Tōru Ōhira', 'TV-PG', 'Science Ninja Team Gatchaman is a five-member superhero team that is composed of the main characters in several anime created by Tatsuo Yoshida and originally produced in Japan by Tatsunoko Productions and later adapted into several English-language versions. It is also known by the abbreviated name Gatchaman. The original series, produced in 1972, was eponymously named Kagaku Ninja Tai Gatchaman and is most well known to the English-speaking world as the adaptation titled Battle of the Planets. The series received additional English adaptations with G-Force: Guardians of Space and ADV Films'' uncut 2005 release. Tatsunoko also uses the official translation Science Commando Gatchaman, as shown in numerous related products and media. Because the English-language versions are notoriously inconsistent not only with one another but also with the original Japanese series, viewers most familiar with the English versions often experience some confusion upon re-examining the series after a long hiatus. The original 1972 Kagaku Ninja Tai Gatchaman series was followed by an animated film, two sequel series, Gatchaman II, and Gatchaman Fighter. In the 90''s, episodes from both series were dubbed into English by Saban as Eagle Riders. In 1994, the original series was remade as a condensed OVA series.', 'Science Ninja Team Gatchaman is a five-member superhero team that is composed of the main characters in several anime created by Tatsuo Yoshida and originally produced in Japan by Tatsunoko Productions and later adapted into several English-language versions. It is also known by the abbreviated name Gatchaman. The original series, produced in 1972, was eponymously named Kagaku Ninja Tai Gatchaman and is most well known to the English-speaking world as the adaptation titled Battle of the Planets. The series received additional English adaptations with G-Force: Guardians of Space and ADV Films'' uncut 2005 release. Tatsunoko also uses the official translation Science Commando Gatchaman, as shown in numerous related products and media. Because the English-language versions are notoriously inconsistent not only with one another but also with the original Japanese series, viewers most familiar with the English versions often experience some confusion upon re-examining the series after a long hiatus. The original 1972 Kagaku Ninja Tai Gatchaman series was followed by an animated film, two sequel series, Gatchaman II, and Gatchaman Fighter. In the 90''s, episodes from both series were dubbed into English by Saban as Eagle Riders. In 1994, the original series was remade as a condensed OVA series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qPFWl6LUbA18kBkV6Hi19Pi0Tf.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:13549'),
  ('142982466157606702', 'Science of Stupid', 2014, 'Documentary, Reality, Comedy', 'Richard Hammond', null, 'Dallas Campbell', 'TV-14', 'This show combines cold hard science with some of the craziest, most spectacular and painful user generated clips ever recorded. Richard Hammond introduces all manner of mishaps featuring brave, if misguided individuals from around the world and then explains the science behind their failure and humiliation with the use of bespoke animations and super slo-mo cinematography. Every episode features between 50 and 60 clips of misadventure – ordinary folk making extraordinary mistakes. Each week watch stunts involving weightlifting, shooting guns or jumping over cars, that have gone wrong, paused, re-wound, and re-played and analysed to determine exactly what went wrong and why. Richard explains the physics, chemistry and biology at play, then presents forensic details to explain the stupidity that resulted in failure. He’ll look at everything including weight, volume, momentum, combustion and even how the brain operates. This is misadventure explained. This is the Science of Stupid.', 'This show combines cold hard science with some of the craziest, most spectacular and painful user generated clips ever recorded. Richard Hammond introduces all manner of mishaps featuring brave, if misguided individuals from around the world and then explains the science behind their failure and humiliation with the use of bespoke animations and super slo-mo cinematography. Every episode features between 50 and 60 clips of misadventure – ordinary folk making extraordinary mistakes. Each week watch stunts involving weightlifting, shooting guns or jumping over cars, that have gone wrong, paused, re-wound, and re-played and analysed to determine exactly what went wrong and why. Richard explains the physics, chemistry and biology at play, then presents forensic details to explain the stupidity that resulted in failure. He’ll look at everything including weight, volume, momentum, combustion and even how the brain operates. This is misadventure explained. This is the Science of Stupid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vzpJ7JNMaDrPYAWBN1HAFmsMC0.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:64905'),
  ('971832538868364893', 'Scissor Seven', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Xiaofeng He', null, 'Xiaofeng He, Duan Yixuan, Jiang Guangtao, Zhao Han', 'TV-PG', 'Seeking to recover his memory, a scissor-wielding, hairdressing, bungling quasi-assassin stumbles into a struggle for power among feuding factions.', 'Seeking to recover his memory, a scissor-wielding, hairdressing, bungling quasi-assassin stumbles into a struggle for power among feuding factions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSLSrOndwNoompAARPHBaxF2E6E.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:79141'),
