  ('1132519884686735611', 'Scooby-Doo and Guess Who?', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy, Mystery, Family', null, null, 'Frank Welker, Matthew Lillard, Grey DeLisle, Kate Micucci', 'TV-PG', 'The Mystery Inc. gang solve bigger mysteries while also encountering many memorable celebrities.', 'The Mystery Inc. gang solve bigger mysteries while also encountering many memorable celebrities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7vQXsELihik4oHJwqhL6WuTJ3j.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:88367'),
  ('1139110977053328637', 'Scooby-Doo and Scrappy-Doo', 1979, 'Animation, Mystery, Comedy, Family, Kids', 'Ken Spears, Joe Ruby, William Hanna', null, 'Casey Kasem, Don Messick', null, 'Everyone’s favorite mystery-solving Great Dane is here to find clues, along with a little help from his energetic nephew and four human companions.', 'Everyone’s favorite mystery-solving Great Dane is here to find clues, along with a little help from his energetic nephew and four human companions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctxdYzdqSlrfKrqEo3bLSrrMLSP.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:6005'),
  ('960838225276453250', 'Scooby-Doo, Where Are You!', 1969, 'Animation, Mystery, Comedy, Kids, Family', 'Joe Ruby, Ken Spears', null, 'Casey Kasem, Don Messick, Frank Welker, Heather North, Patricia Stevens', 'TV-G', 'Fred, Daphne, Velma, Shaggy, and the talking dog, Scooby-Doo, travel on the Mystery Machine van, in search of weird mysteries to solve.', 'Fred, Daphne, Velma, Shaggy, and the talking dog, Scooby-Doo, travel on the Mystery Machine van, in search of weird mysteries to solve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lTzUSCtXR77CmGmEHcaxpxu2b4h.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:926'),
  ('391042003904731591', 'Scooby-Doo! Behind the Scenes', 1998, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Scott Innes, Frank Welker, Mary Kay Bergman, B.J. Ward', 'TV-Y7', 'Mystery Inc. details bits of "behind the scenes" trivia about their work and personal lives. A series of eight shorts that aired on Cartoon Network during commercial breaks in the 25 Hours of Doo marathon on October 24, 1998.', 'Mystery Inc. details bits of "behind the scenes" trivia about their work and personal lives. A series of eight shorts that aired on Cartoon Network during commercial breaks in the 25 Hours of Doo marathon on October 24, 1998.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fuUbTN4jocXYhtO526wCZLqPzLU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105696'),
  ('1090626718633249615', 'Scooby-Doo! Mystery Incorporated', 2010, 'Animation, Mystery, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Tony Cervone, Spike Brandt, Mitch Watson', null, 'Frank Welker, Grey DeLisle, Mindy Cohn, Matthew Lillard', 'TV-Y7', 'This incarnation of the popular cartoon series finds Scooby and the gang living in Crystal Cove, a small town with a long history of ghost sightings, monster tales and other mysteries ripe for the sleuths to solve once and for all. But the longstanding Crystal Cove residents, who bank on the town''s reputation to attract tourists, are prepared to do what it takes to protect their turf.', 'This incarnation of the popular cartoon series finds Scooby and the gang living in Crystal Cove, a small town with a long history of ghost sightings, monster tales and other mysteries ripe for the sleuths to solve once and for all. But the longstanding Crystal Cove residents, who bank on the town''s reputation to attract tourists, are prepared to do what it takes to protect their turf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/crKsdtMuN7Y2JdXmmkzIrQzzo36.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:18123'),
  ('474787795639269972', 'Scooby''s Laff-A Lympics', 1977, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Family, Mystery', 'Joe Ruby, Ken Spears', null, 'Don Messick, Daws Butler, John Stephenson, Casey Kasem, Scatman Crothers, Frank Welker, Mel Blanc, Julie Bennett', 'TV-G', 'Each episode of this series include multiple segments: The first and last were "Laff-A-Lympics" segments, the other ones were "Captain Caveman and the Teen Angels", "Scooby-Doo" and "Dynomutt" segments. The "Laff-A-Lympics" segments feature 45 Hanna-Barbera cartoon characters (classic and otherwise) competing for gold medals in wacky events. Events include racing on ostriches, camels, kangaroos, rickshaws and unicycles, as well as scavenging for creatures like the Abominable Snowman, vampires, and the Loch Ness Monster.', 'Each episode of this series include multiple segments: The first and last were "Laff-A-Lympics" segments, the other ones were "Captain Caveman and the Teen Angels", "Scooby-Doo" and "Dynomutt" segments. The "Laff-A-Lympics" segments feature 45 Hanna-Barbera cartoon characters (classic and otherwise) competing for gold medals in wacky events. Events include racing on ostriches, camels, kangaroos, rickshaws and unicycles, as well as scavenging for creatures like the Abominable Snowman, vampires, and the Loch Ness Monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xnOyqYYx81buw4YZI6xuqxPaD6C.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1072'),
  ('33473291707181268', 'Scoop', 2005, 'News, Reality, Documentary', 'Cheung Ka-Ling', null, null, null, 'Scoop is a comprehensive information programme of Television Broadcasts Limited. The content of the program is mainly based on entertainment news and personal follow-up of the artists, and will also be interspersed with the latest trends of TVB dramas and artists. Some entertainment news content clips will be rebroadcast on the next day''s "Entertainment Live". This program will be broadcast on Jade Channel from 19:30-20:00 (Hong Kong time) from June 6, 2005, and will be broadcast every day from March 3, 2019, and will be broadcast on myTV (later myTV SUPER) to provide "Program Review".', 'Scoop is a comprehensive information programme of Television Broadcasts Limited. The content of the program is mainly based on entertainment news and personal follow-up of the artists, and will also be interspersed with the latest trends of TVB dramas and artists. Some entertainment news content clips will be rebroadcast on the next day''s "Entertainment Live". This program will be broadcast on Jade Channel from 19:30-20:00 (Hong Kong time) from June 6, 2005, and will be broadcast every day from March 3, 2019, and will be broadcast on myTV (later myTV SUPER) to provide "Program Review".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qo6y0XvSBlKM3XCbYVdcR3a6qyQ.jpg', 20, 'tmdb:tv:203599'),
  ('545151695072626832', 'Scoop', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Hansal Mehta', null, 'Karishma Tanna, Mohammed Zeeshan Ayyub, Prosenjit Chatterjee, Harman Baweja, Danish Sait, Eshaan Pereira, Tanmay Dhanania, Tannishtha Chatterjee', 'TV-MA', 'The shocking murder of a journalist thrusts a leading crime reporter into a nexus of police, media and the Mumbai underworld as she fights for justice.', 'The shocking murder of a journalist thrusts a leading crime reporter into a nexus of police, media and the Mumbai underworld as she fights for justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/my4imieiLP02unyU6OnF4pmIDBi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:226531'),
  ('40382832972616958', 'Scooped Up by an S-Rank Adventurer!', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Gakuto Kajiwara, Rina Hidaka, Haruka Shiraishi, Daisuke Hirose, Yuuichirou Umehara, Ryohei Kimura, Yui Ishikawa, Mizuki Mano', 'TV-14', 'Lloyd is a white mage who was unexpectedly banished from the hero''s party. As he was lost and uncertain, he happened to cross paths with an S-rank adventurer party in need of a white mage, so he joined them on their quest. Little did anyone know at the time that the hero''s party would fall apart and Lloyd would rise to fame.', 'Lloyd is a white mage who was unexpectedly banished from the hero''s party. As he was lost and uncertain, he happened to cross paths with an S-rank adventurer party in need of a white mage, so he joined them on their quest. Little did anyone know at the time that the hero''s party would fall apart and Lloyd would rise to fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6QZie7hNdSvqPSIsZtMiX2CRbYY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:284771'),
  ('291195457505697919', 'Scorpion', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Nick Santora', null, 'Elyes Gabel, Katharine McPhee, Jadyn Wong, Eddie Kaye Thomas, Ari Stidham, Riley B. Smith, Robert Patrick', 'TV-14', 'Eccentric genius Walter O’Brien and his team of brilliant misfits comprise the last line of defense against complex, high-tech threats of the modern age. As Homeland Security’s new think tank, O’Brien’s “Scorpion” team includes Toby Curtis, an expert behaviorist who can read anyone; Happy Quinn, a mechanical prodigy; and Sylvester Dodd, a statistics guru.', 'Eccentric genius Walter O’Brien and his team of brilliant misfits comprise the last line of defense against complex, high-tech threats of the modern age. As Homeland Security’s new think tank, O’Brien’s “Scorpion” team includes Toby Curtis, an expert behaviorist who can read anyone; Happy Quinn, a mechanical prodigy; and Sylvester Dodd, a statistics guru.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hzeirSF6bRjssDh5JFrm5WRwFLd.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:60797'),
  ('526051437814076008', 'Scott & Bailey', 2011, 'Crime, Drama', 'Sally Wainwright, Diane Taylor', null, 'Lesley Sharp, Suranne Jones, Sally Lindsay, Delroy Brown, Jing Lusi, Tony Mooney, David Prosho, Judith Barker', 'TV-14', 'D.C. Rachel Bailey and D.C. Janet Scott have a robust and engaging friendship which enables them to draw upon each other’s strengths and investigate murders for the Manchester Metropolitan Police.', 'D.C. Rachel Bailey and D.C. Janet Scott have a robust and engaging friendship which enables them to draw upon each other’s strengths and investigate murders for the Manchester Metropolitan Police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2WD6BxjA2ZE1DejMXenZXnlm1Fz.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:39551'),
  ('386440904654447733', 'Scott Pilgrim Takes Off', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Bryan Lee O''Malley, BenDavid Grabinski', 'Mal S. Smith', 'Michael Cera, Mary Elizabeth Winstead, Satya Bhabha, Kieran Culkin, Chris Evans, Anna Kendrick, Brie Larson, Alison Pill', 'TV-MA', 'Scott Pilgrim meets the girl of his dreams, Ramona Flowers, only to find out her seven evil exes stand in the way of their love.', 'Scott Pilgrim meets the girl of his dreams, Ramona Flowers, only to find out her seven evil exes stand in the way of their love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHROk2C6bv8LqtvyYd0tCMURbxC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155292'),
  ('683029340817470276', 'Scoundrels', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rachel Lang, James Griffin', null, 'Virginia Madsen, Patrick John Flueger, Carlos Bernard, Vanessa Marano, David James Elliott, Leven Rambin, Greg Serano', 'TV-14', 'A family of small-time criminals try to go straight after the father is sent to prison.', 'A family of small-time criminals try to go straight after the father is sent to prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wnwvetK7k7pcr6ZyxeV8xMOXlJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32441'),
  ('423154845883187631', 'Scrabble', 2024, 'Reality', null, null, 'Craig Ferguson', null, 'Wordsmiths compete in challenging word games to score points and control a giant Scrabble board, displaying strategic skill and mastery of language.', 'Wordsmiths compete in challenging word games to score points and control a giant Scrabble board, displaying strategic skill and mastery of language.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPyOMo2sAgntdUdnRY4hnfvgMIa.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:261108'),
  ('449313173724484703', 'Scrapheap Challenge', 1998, 'Reality, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Robert Llewellyn, Lisa Rogers, Dick Strawbridge', null, 'Scrapheap Challenge is an engineering game show produced by RDF Media and broadcast on Channel 4 in the United Kingdom. In the show, teams of contestants had 10 hours in which to build a working machine that could do a specific task, using materials available in a scrapheap. The format was exported to the United States, where it was known as Junkyard Wars as a completely different TV series. The US show was also produced by RDF Media, and was originally shown on The Learning Channel. Repeats have aired on another Discovery network, the Science Channel.', 'Scrapheap Challenge is an engineering game show produced by RDF Media and broadcast on Channel 4 in the United Kingdom. In the show, teams of contestants had 10 hours in which to build a working machine that could do a specific task, using materials available in a scrapheap. The format was exported to the United States, where it was known as Junkyard Wars as a completely different TV series. The US show was also produced by RDF Media, and was originally shown on The Learning Channel. Repeats have aired on another Discovery network, the Science Channel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLWN1dXEtLSPS2UwWjloW3O6tom.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:11057'),
  ('980794279627190498', 'Scrapped Princess', 2003, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Fumiko Orikasa, Shin-ichiro Miki, Sayaka Ohara, Katsuyuki Konishi, Kaori Mizuhashi, Takahiro Mizushima, Takashi Kondo, Daisuke Ono', null, 'Pacifica Casull is the most feared and hated person by the followers of the God Mauser. Known as the Scrapped Princess, she is the poison that will destroy the world. To avoid being killed by the zealots of Mauser, Pacifica and her adoptive brother and sister leave the village of Manhurin. Her brother, Shannon, is an expert with the sword while Racquel is proficient with magic. At every step of the way, however, someone is constantly trying to kill Pacifica, hoping to somehow avert the catastrophe that is supposed to befall the world on her 16th birthday.', 'Pacifica Casull is the most feared and hated person by the followers of the God Mauser. Known as the Scrapped Princess, she is the poison that will destroy the world. To avoid being killed by the zealots of Mauser, Pacifica and her adoptive brother and sister leave the village of Manhurin. Her brother, Shannon, is an expert with the sword while Racquel is proficient with magic. At every step of the way, however, someone is constantly trying to kill Pacifica, hoping to somehow avert the catastrophe that is supposed to befall the world on her 16th birthday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3bg5yxmvEYcIFm2JWvchHEq7wz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45544'),
  ('596945340709937512', 'Scream Queens', 2008, 'Reality', null, null, 'John Homa, Jaime King, Tim Sullivan, Gabby West', null, 'Scream Queens is an American reality series on VH1 produced by Joke Productions and Lionsgate Television that premiered in October 2008. The show chronicles a group of unknown actresses competing for a role in the Saw franchise. Tanedra Howard won the first season and gained a role in Saw VI. The second season began airing on August 2, 2010 and the winner, Gabby West, won a role in Saw 3D.', 'Scream Queens is an American reality series on VH1 produced by Joke Productions and Lionsgate Television that premiered in October 2008. The show chronicles a group of unknown actresses competing for a role in the Saw franchise. Tanedra Howard won the first season and gained a role in Saw VI. The second season began airing on August 2, 2010 and the winner, Gabby West, won a role in Saw 3D.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sDcdSzxtDE29vaBJt2nj0tRC4ah.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:8256'),
  ('979613325972610280', 'Scream Queens', 2015, 'Mystery, Comedy', 'Ryan Murphy, Ian Brennan, Dante Di Loreto', null, 'Emma Roberts, Lea Michele, Taylor Lautner, Keke Palmer, Jamie Lee Curtis, Billie Lourd, Abigail Breslin, John Stamos', 'TV-14', 'The super-charged comedy-horror series is a modern take on the classic whodunit with a killer cast.', 'The super-charged comedy-horror series is a modern take on the classic whodunit with a killer cast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yeayXZYSU8xdmC8i5g5jTdxeggp.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62046'),
  ('339002086982110211', 'Scream: The TV Series', 2015, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Jill E. Blotevogel, Dan Dworkin, Jay Beattie', null, 'RJ Cyler, Jessica Sula, Keke Palmer, Giorgia Whigham, Tyga', 'TV-MA', 'What starts as a YouTube video going viral, soon leads to problems for the teenagers of Lakewood and serves as the catalyst for a murder that opens up a window to the town''s troubled past. Everyone has secrets. Everyone tells lies. Everyone is fair game.', 'What starts as a YouTube video going viral, soon leads to problems for the teenagers of Lakewood and serves as the catalyst for a murder that opens up a window to the town''s troubled past. Everyone has secrets. Everyone tells lies. Everyone is fair game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cTRUcUnAydqboYfis0IhhY1edDt.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:62823'),
  ('878234823056637893', 'Screechers Wild!', 2016, 'Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure, Drama', '王薇, 刘月峰', '王文妍, Qiu Jun Ya, 王忠', 'Ji Ying, Ding Ling, 郭亚维, Xuqiao Li, Deng Yuting, Hongyun Liu, Limeng Zhang, 梁晶晶', 'TV-Y', 'Screechers Wild is a Chinese-American animated series, produced by Alpha Group in coproduction with Man of Action and Wexworks Media. As of now, it consists of one season and one web series. It was first broadcasted in China on March 14, 2016, and on the United States on June 15, 2018.', 'Screechers Wild is a Chinese-American animated series, produced by Alpha Group in coproduction with Man of Action and Wexworks Media. As of now, it consists of one season and one web series. It was first broadcasted in China on March 14, 2016, and on the United States on June 15, 2018.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmnYsZZAgGI43I1P6fw2I8CZddh.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:83509'),
  ('972430055940387258', 'Screen Play', 2001, null, null, null, 'Bobby Au-Yeung Tsan-Wah, Sheren Tang Shui-Man, Michael Tse Tin-Wah, May Kwong Man-Chun, Louis Yuen Siu-Cheung, Angela Tong Ying-Ying, Power Chan Kwok-Pong, Kingdom Yuen King-Tan', null, 'In an unexpected incident, Bai Chuangshi (played by Bobby Au-Yeung) meets Gai Yingjing (played by Sheren Tang), the daughter of a famous figure in the film industry, Gai Lan. Due to some misunderstandings between them, they have quite an unpleasant encounter. Bai Chuangshi secretly harbors feelings for the tea restaurant owner, Gu Zhenqing (played by Power Chan Kwok-Pong), but he chooses to bury this sincere affection deep within his heart. Lan Guangchang (played by Michael Tse) is a children''s program host who has always dreamed of becoming a movie star. However, given his current situation, it seems his dream is still a long way off. Gai Lan sees great potential in Lan Guangchang and signs a contract with him, promising to help him rise to stardom. Unfortunately, just after the contract is signed, Gai Lan unexpectedly passes away. Helpless, Lan Guangchang has no choice but to pin his hopes for success on Gai Yingjing.', 'In an unexpected incident, Bai Chuangshi (played by Bobby Au-Yeung) meets Gai Yingjing (played by Sheren Tang), the daughter of a famous figure in the film industry, Gai Lan. Due to some misunderstandings between them, they have quite an unpleasant encounter. Bai Chuangshi secretly harbors feelings for the tea restaurant owner, Gu Zhenqing (played by Power Chan Kwok-Pong), but he chooses to bury this sincere affection deep within his heart. Lan Guangchang (played by Michael Tse) is a children''s program host who has always dreamed of becoming a movie star. However, given his current situation, it seems his dream is still a long way off. Gai Lan sees great potential in Lan Guangchang and signs a contract with him, promising to help him rise to stardom. Unfortunately, just after the contract is signed, Gai Lan unexpectedly passes away. Helpless, Lan Guangchang has no choice but to pin his hopes for success on Gai Yingjing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wVzw3ic912gHLEBxMABp44rRv3T.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109121'),
  ('793587993859605302', 'Screen Two', 1985, 'Drama', null, null, null, null, 'Series of single made-for-television dramas.', 'Series of single made-for-television dramas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Dp0H8DVuY5fzZWpOIRyEJ8eanx.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:43712'),
  ('444048373731217568', 'Screw', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Rob Williams', null, 'Nina Sosanya, Jamie Lee O''Donnell, Laura Checkley, Faraz Ayub, Stephen Wight, Ron Donachie, Ben Tavassoli, Nicholas Lumley', null, 'Rob Williams'' darkly comic crime drama portrays prison as you''ve never seen it before: through the embattled and inspiring characters who work there.', 'Rob Williams'' darkly comic crime drama portrays prison as you''ve never seen it before: through the embattled and inspiring characters who work there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHGYdkcV8gLBi1TLVylyR4VUho.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:153425'),
  ('445652966193106782', 'Screwballs', 2025, 'Reality, Comedy', '박인석', null, 'Kim Sook, Hong Jin-kyung, Jo Se-ho, Joo Woo-jae, Jang Woo-young', null, 'Five siblings face endless missions in this pure entertainment variety show. With a few screws loose, they embrace chaos in their search for sanity.', 'Five siblings face endless missions in this pure entertainment variety show. With a few screws loose, they embrace chaos in their search for sanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDR7bSOSCz6N6ouytg9LHtkEQTM.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:283647'),
  ('905068978643638018', 'Scripting Your Destiny', 2021, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Kim Eun-sook', 'Eun Sun-woo', 'Ki Do-hun, Jeon So-nee, Kim Woo-seok, Park Sang-nam, Kal So-won, So Hee-jung, Lee Jung-jun, Geum Dong-hyun', null, 'A fantasy romance series between a god who writes people’s destinies, and a person living that life.', 'A fantasy romance series between a god who writes people’s destinies, and a person living that life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPIbUJII5sZvD7dbrbjiTBMKKWj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:119583'),
  ('320838590207864052', 'Scrublands', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Felicity Packard, Timothy Lee', null, 'Luke Arnold, Bella Heathcote', null, 'In a small town, a priest opens fire on his congregation, killing five parishioners. One year later, a journalist arrives to investigate the tragedy, and after digging beneath the surface finds himself in a life-and-death race to uncover the truth.', 'In a small town, a priest opens fire on his congregation, killing five parishioners. One year later, a journalist arrives to investigate the tragedy, and after digging beneath the surface finds himself in a life-and-death race to uncover the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iFRUtxh7OHLqoER6oflO6DWNaQJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:234212'),
  ('122174776579816058', 'Scrubs', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Bill Lawrence', null, 'Zach Braff, Donald Faison, John C. McGinley, Eliza Coupe, Kerry Bishé, Michael Mosley, Dave Franco', 'TV-14', 'In the unreal world of Sacred Heart Hospital, John "J.D." Dorian learns the ways of medicine, friendship and life.', 'In the unreal world of Sacred Heart Hospital, John "J.D." Dorian learns the ways of medicine, friendship and life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZfQcEErSPWNawVtY1ehOZYpcvf.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:4556'),
  ('451722081234596239', 'Scrubs', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Bill Lawrence', null, 'Zach Braff, Donald Faison, Sarah Chalke', 'TV-14', 'J.D. & Turk scrub in together for the first time in a long time–medicine has changed, interns have changed, but their bromance has stood the test of time. Characters new and old navigate the waters of Sacred Heart with laughter, heart and some surprises along the way.', 'J.D. & Turk scrub in together for the first time in a long time–medicine has changed, interns have changed, but their bromance has stood the test of time. Characters new and old navigate the waters of Sacred Heart with laughter, heart and some surprises along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNNM50G7p9C3n4vgidCiybsIdHA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:295778'),
  ('175250403345252608', 'Scrubs: Interns', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Bill Lawrence', null, null, null, 'A web series following four interns in their first year at Sacred Heart Hospital—Katie Collins, Denise "Jo" Mahoney, Howie Gelder and Sonja "Sunny" Dey, who "directs" the series as a video diary project.', 'A web series following four interns in their first year at Sacred Heart Hospital—Katie Collins, Denise "Jo" Mahoney, Howie Gelder and Sonja "Sunny" Dey, who "directs" the series as a video diary project.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLkyDFtUlxIG9lI6PWV0ytFfL8A.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:17486'),
  ('1072197006812122355', 'Scum of the Brave', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ryota Suzuki, Akari Kito, Momo Harumi, Yumiri Hanamori, Hinata Tadokoro, Daisuke Hirakawa, Yasuhiro Takato', 'TV-14', 'In the mid-21st century, Tokyo''s mafia can turn into ether-enhanced Demon Lords, and Braves hunt them down. Yashiro, the Grim Reaper, reluctantly takes a new apprentice named Aki Jogamine, a high school girl training to become a Brave. He soon finds himself dragged into one troublesome case after another. The supernatural story of a scumbag master and his self-proclaimed apprentice begins!', 'In the mid-21st century, Tokyo''s mafia can turn into ether-enhanced Demon Lords, and Braves hunt them down. Yashiro, the Grim Reaper, reluctantly takes a new apprentice named Aki Jogamine, a high school girl training to become a Brave. He soon finds himself dragged into one troublesome case after another. The supernatural story of a scumbag master and his self-proclaimed apprentice begins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSJv65fW98dUqRD5f0ahLLYoZQN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:284432'),
  ('8732964846303409', 'Scum''s Wish', 2017, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Chika Anzai, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Haruka Tomatsu, Shiori Izawa, Kenji Nojima, Aki Toyosaki', null, 'Seventeen-year-old Mugi Awaya and Hanabi Yasuraoka appear to be the ideal couple. They are both pretty popular, and they seem to suit each other well. However, outsiders don''t know of the secret they share. Both Mugi and Hanabi have hopeless crushes on someone else, and they are only dating each other to soothe their loneliness. Mugi is in love with Akane Minagawa, a young teacher who used to be his home tutor. Hanabi is also in love with a teacher, a young man who has been a family friend since she was little. In each other, they find a place where they can grieve for the ones they cannot have, and they share physical intimacy driven by loneliness. Will things stay like this for them forever?', 'Seventeen-year-old Mugi Awaya and Hanabi Yasuraoka appear to be the ideal couple. They are both pretty popular, and they seem to suit each other well. However, outsiders don''t know of the secret they share. Both Mugi and Hanabi have hopeless crushes on someone else, and they are only dating each other to soothe their loneliness. Mugi is in love with Akane Minagawa, a young teacher who used to be his home tutor. Hanabi is also in love with a teacher, a young man who has been a family friend since she was little. In each other, they find a place where they can grieve for the ones they cannot have, and they share physical intimacy driven by loneliness. Will things stay like this for them forever?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nKqw1zze4D1HfTaHDs6rxWii5bf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69292'),
  ('346624473371094626', 'SD GUNDAM WORLD HEROES', 2021, 'Animation', null, null, 'Aki Kanada, Shuhei Matsuda, Gakuto Kajiwara, Koki Uchiyama, Maxwell Powers, Kyousuke Ikeda, Taiten Kusunoki, Naomi Kusumi', null, 'The balance of the worlds is maintained by heroes. Suddenly, a red-hot meteor falls upon one of these worlds, called Neo World. An amnesiac youth named Wukong Impulse Gundam appears at the point where it landed. The chaos that starts with this incident spreads through the other worlds, one after another. At the same time, Zhuge Liang Freedom Gundam learns via astrology of an impending disaster. He and his sworn friend Liu Bei Unicorn Gundam take action to save the worlds from this crisis, and begin a journey along with Wukong. What will Wukong Impulse Gundam think as he meets the heroes of each world? Will this youth bring about peace or catastrophe? Now begins a new story of heroes!', 'The balance of the worlds is maintained by heroes. Suddenly, a red-hot meteor falls upon one of these worlds, called Neo World. An amnesiac youth named Wukong Impulse Gundam appears at the point where it landed. The chaos that starts with this incident spreads through the other worlds, one after another. At the same time, Zhuge Liang Freedom Gundam learns via astrology of an impending disaster. He and his sworn friend Liu Bei Unicorn Gundam take action to save the worlds from this crisis, and begin a journey along with Wukong. What will Wukong Impulse Gundam think as he meets the heroes of each world? Will this youth bring about peace or catastrophe? Now begins a new story of heroes!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7erAYO2Uj6aKYO3BkcESbGFEs4t.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122468'),
  ('1150129496113186311', 'Se llamaba Pedro Infante', 2023, 'Drama', 'Rubén Galindo Jr.', null, 'Mario Morán, Ana Claudia Talancón, Julio Bracho, Leticia Huijara', 'TV-14', 'A promise to his mother led him to become the best musical and movie star of the Golden Age of Mexican cinema; his songs and characters went around the world, and when he seemed to have everything, death tragically took him away.', 'A promise to his mother led him to become the best musical and movie star of the Golden Age of Mexican cinema; his songs and characters went around the world, and when he seemed to have everything, death tragically took him away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v4yoq9GST6crMxdEbpazWplDpcp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:240955'),
