  ('875830786720153308', 'Sea Hunt', 1958, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Ivan Tors', null, 'Lloyd Bridges', 'NR', 'Sea Hunt is an American adventure television series that aired in syndication from 1958 to 1961 and was popular in syndication for decades afterwards. The series originally aired for four seasons, with 155 episodes produced. It stars Lloyd Bridges as ex-Navy frogman Mike Nelson, and was produced by Ivan Tors.', 'Sea Hunt is an American adventure television series that aired in syndication from 1958 to 1961 and was popular in syndication for decades afterwards. The series originally aired for four seasons, with 155 episodes produced. It stars Lloyd Bridges as ex-Navy frogman Mike Nelson, and was produced by Ivan Tors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5aSZlCZ0zEvww83kmFFxlbCElPf.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:5050'),
  ('8803021909119653', 'Sea Monsters', 2003, 'Documentary', 'Tim Haines', null, 'Nigel Marven, Karen Hayley', null, 'Zoologist Nigel Marvin travels back in time to visit deadly creatures of the prehistoric oceans.', 'Zoologist Nigel Marvin travels back in time to visit deadly creatures of the prehistoric oceans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/32lS9aKKguqxk18ZtjejdwxLbGX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19835'),
  ('725576879030207977', 'Sea ​​of ​​fire', 2020, 'Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Poramin Siravanadorn, Parntotong Boontong, Jayjintai Vandrill, Kriengkrai Oonhanun, Savitree Samipak, Mik Thongraya, Stephany Auernig', null, 'The boat bombing of Anupong (Kriengkrai Unhanan), owner of the Andaman Pearl Resort and Hotel, leaves Techin (Mick Thongraya), his only son. She had to hurry back to Pearl Island with her mother Nalinee (Savitree Samipak) , as soon as she returned from a once peaceful island. was almost on fire When Nalinee meets Pasika (Seffani Awanik )A young woman she understands is the new wife of her ex-husband Anupong. Nalinee tried to expel Pasika from the island, but was unable to do so because the will stated that Pasika has to work here for 2 years and help Techin with his work. Techin and Pasika have to work together in the midst of many conflicts. He had met Phasika in a foreign country before. Phasika was Techin''s love at first sight, but Techin was deeply disappointed when the woman he loved became his father''s wife.', 'The boat bombing of Anupong (Kriengkrai Unhanan), owner of the Andaman Pearl Resort and Hotel, leaves Techin (Mick Thongraya), his only son. She had to hurry back to Pearl Island with her mother Nalinee (Savitree Samipak) , as soon as she returned from a once peaceful island. was almost on fire When Nalinee meets Pasika (Seffani Awanik )A young woman she understands is the new wife of her ex-husband Anupong. Nalinee tried to expel Pasika from the island, but was unable to do so because the will stated that Pasika has to work here for 2 years and help Techin with his work. Techin and Pasika have to work together in the midst of many conflicts. He had met Phasika in a foreign country before. Phasika was Techin''s love at first sight, but Techin was deeply disappointed when the woman he loved became his father''s wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOBpPBSAvRIWblBlN0YTminI5v7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135672'),
  ('666768739569419043', 'Sea of Hope', 2021, 'Reality, Talk', null, '정유진', 'Yoon Jong-shin, Lee Ji-ah, Lee Dong-wook, Onew, Kim Go-eun, Lee Soo-hyun, Jeong Dong-hwan', null, 'A healing program where celebrities will present their own music and homemade dishes at a live bar next to the mysterious and beautiful sea. The variety show revolves around three key words: sea, bar, and wish. The guests who visit will be able to get out of their daily lives and spend a special day with the cool ocean, music, and delicious food. Actress Lee Ji Ah will be heading the cast as the main chef of the seaside bar, while Lee Dong Wook will serve as the main bartender. Actress Kim Go Eun will demonstrate her love for the ocean as a lifeguard and server, while Yoon Jong Shin and Suhyun will handle the music. Last but not least, SHINee''s leader Onew will handle desserts as the baker of the team.', 'A healing program where celebrities will present their own music and homemade dishes at a live bar next to the mysterious and beautiful sea. The variety show revolves around three key words: sea, bar, and wish. The guests who visit will be able to get out of their daily lives and spend a special day with the cool ocean, music, and delicious food. Actress Lee Ji Ah will be heading the cast as the main chef of the seaside bar, while Lee Dong Wook will serve as the main bartender. Actress Kim Go Eun will demonstrate her love for the ocean as a lifeguard and server, while Yoon Jong Shin and Suhyun will handle the music. Last but not least, SHINee''s leader Onew will handle desserts as the baker of the team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36nupormKuzP7tjkelQvxnuiMIU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128398'),
  ('25061044897540630', 'Sea Patrol', 2007, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Hal McElroy, Di McElroy', null, 'John Batchelor, Conrad Coleby, Dominic Deutscher, Matthew Holmes, Danielle Horvat, Lisa McCune, Nikolai Nikolaeff, Kristian Schmid', 'TV-PG', 'Sea Patrol is an Australian television drama set on board HMAS Hammersley, a fictional patrol boat of the Royal Australian Navy. The series focuses on the ship and the lives of its crew members.', 'Sea Patrol is an Australian television drama set on board HMAS Hammersley, a fictional patrol boat of the Royal Australian Navy. The series focuses on the ship and the lives of its crew members.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c3GYo28VyRkc3zz4ivLa9Z9OK3E.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:4858'),
  ('409762230140953510', 'Sea Shadows', 2025, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jonathan Rio, Monica Rattazzi', 'Jonathan Rio, Monica Rattazzi', 'Fleur Geffrier, Jean-Marc Barr, Guillaume Labbé, Jonas Bocquet, Thierry Godard, Anne Loiret, Olivia Côte, Lucia Passaniti', null, 'Following the inexplicable sinking of a trawler and its fishermen who remain untraceable, Abigail, an oceanographer, is sent by IFREMER on a mission to Fécamp, her hometown, which she left a few years earlier following a family tragedy.', 'Following the inexplicable sinking of a trawler and its fishermen who remain untraceable, Abigail, an oceanographer, is sent by IFREMER on a mission to Fécamp, her hometown, which she left a few years earlier following a family tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eL8T0TTupugFRfi8qVdog8V6xU9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234820'),
  ('966542658406188137', 'SEAL Team', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, War & Politics', 'Benjamin Cavell', null, 'David Boreanaz, Neil Brown Jr., A.J. Buckley, Toni Trucks, Beau Knapp, Tyler Grey, Justin Melnick, Raffi Barsoumian', 'TV-14', 'Military drama following the professional and personal lives of the most elite unit of Navy SEALs as they train, plan and execute the most dangerous, high stakes missions our country can ask of them.', 'Military drama following the professional and personal lives of the most elite unit of Navy SEALs as they train, plan and execute the most dangerous, high stakes missions our country can ask of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6iSnec83UEMgLOXAtGYwaVNHLjR.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:71789'),
  ('138258997576645428', 'Sealab 2021', 2000, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Adam Reed, Matt Thompson', null, 'Erik Estrada, Kate Miller, Brett Butler, Ellis Henican, Bill Lobley, MC Chris, Michael Goz', 'TV-14', 'The year is 2021. Deep below the ocean''s surface, looms a vast, magnificently high-tech compound: Sealab. A multi-national scientific station with an annual budget in the trillions, manned by a motley collection of malcontents and screw-ups who were unfit for work in the private sector. They really don''t get any research done, but instead spend their time bickering among themselves or just plain goofing off. The crew have manipulated their luckless leader, Captain Murphy, into submission, and are content to ride the government clock, raking in fat, hazardous-duty paychecks.', 'The year is 2021. Deep below the ocean''s surface, looms a vast, magnificently high-tech compound: Sealab. A multi-national scientific station with an annual budget in the trillions, manned by a motley collection of malcontents and screw-ups who were unfit for work in the private sector. They really don''t get any research done, but instead spend their time bickering among themselves or just plain goofing off. The crew have manipulated their luckless leader, Captain Murphy, into submission, and are content to ride the government clock, raking in fat, hazardous-duty paychecks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eA4JJfHZ6DdfPd3BCu5qWm99Fl5.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:334'),
  ('717372660038021110', 'Sean Combs: The Reckoning', 2025, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Sean Combs', 'TV-MA', 'A revealing look at Sean ''Diddy'' Combs'' journey from music mogul to high-profile sexual offender, featuring footage and insider accounts that expose both his groundbreaking success with Bad Boy Entertainment and the troubling shadows behind his empire.', 'A revealing look at Sean ''Diddy'' Combs'' journey from music mogul to high-profile sexual offender, featuring footage and insider accounts that expose both his groundbreaking success with Bad Boy Entertainment and the troubling shadows behind his empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvozYQ1idmnkF0ugfTud82lpNIJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:255251'),
  ('627352677806667166', 'Sean Saves the World', 2013, 'Comedy, Family', 'Victor Fresco', null, 'Sean Hayes, Megan Hilty, Echo Kellum, Samantha Isler, Linda Lavin, Thomas Lennon', null, 'Sean Saves the World is an American television series starring Sean Hayes. The multi-camera comedy aired on NBC as part of the 2013–14 American television season.', 'Sean Saves the World is an American television series starring Sean Hayes. The multi-camera comedy aired on NBC as part of the 2013–14 American television season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4VqWPZIvUE0vXts1xiDRjrPt69l.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:58851'),
  ('821070183056514793', 'seaQuest DSV', 1993, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Rockne S. O''Bannon', null, 'Michael Ironside, Jonathan Brandis, Don Franklin, Michael DeLuise, Ted Raimi, Kathy Evison, Elise Neal, Peter DeLuise', 'TV-PG', 'In the early 21st century, mankind has colonized the oceans. The United Earth Oceans Organization enlists Captain Nathan Bridger and the submarine seaQuest DSV to keep the peace and explore the last frontier on Earth.', 'In the early 21st century, mankind has colonized the oceans. The United Earth Oceans Organization enlists Captain Nathan Bridger and the submarine seaQuest DSV to keep the peace and explore the last frontier on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azbnl41bGqTcp2ajyfm9JYekEHp.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2289'),
  ('1039312679049814748', 'Search', 1972, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Leslie Stevens', null, 'Anthony Franciosa, Burgess Meredith, Doug McClure, Hugh O''Brian, Angel Tompkins, Byron Chung', null, 'Search is an American science fiction series that aired on Wednesday nights on NBC at 10 pm ET, from September 1972 to August 1973. It ran for 23 episodes, not including the two-hour pilot film originally titled Probe. When picked up for series production, the title had to be changed because Probe was the name of an existing PBS series. In the UK the series aired on BBC 1 under the title Search Control. The show was created by Leslie Stevens, and produced by Leslie Stevens, Robert Justman, John Strong and Tony Spinner. The high concept was described as "science fiction in today''s world" and the episodes featured many high-tech elements which are considered common in current science fiction shows.', 'Search is an American science fiction series that aired on Wednesday nights on NBC at 10 pm ET, from September 1972 to August 1973. It ran for 23 episodes, not including the two-hour pilot film originally titled Probe. When picked up for series production, the title had to be changed because Probe was the name of an existing PBS series. In the UK the series aired on BBC 1 under the title Search Control. The show was created by Leslie Stevens, and produced by Leslie Stevens, Robert Justman, John Strong and Tony Spinner. The high concept was described as "science fiction in today''s world" and the episodes featured many high-tech elements which are considered common in current science fiction shows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rg0CMU0109heOKwWYVzIW94P963.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11398'),
  ('866579416515777788', 'Search', 2020, 'Mystery, Crime', null, null, 'Jang Dong-yoon, Lee Hyun-wook, Krystal Jung, Choi Yoon-je, Yeon Woo-jin, Yoon Park, Moon Jeong-hee, Choi Deok-moon', null, 'A survival story about a search party that battles against monstrous creatures. It will highlight the heartwarming bond between the members of the search party as they struggle to escape the demilitarized zone together. The story begins as a military dog handler who’s only a month away from his discharge date gets seconded to the search party and encounters a monster in the demilitarized zone.', 'A survival story about a search party that battles against monstrous creatures. It will highlight the heartwarming bond between the members of the search party as they struggle to escape the demilitarized zone together. The story begins as a military dog handler who’s only a month away from his discharge date gets seconded to the search party and encounters a monster in the demilitarized zone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWJ5TVhpeupQxpuvifsl0ndZizK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99492'),
  ('1080783597839445408', 'Search Party', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Sarah-Violet Bliss, Charles Rogers', null, 'Alia Shawkat, John Reynolds, John Early, Meredith Hagner', 'TV-MA', 'A dark comedy about four self-absorbed twenty-somethings who become entangled in an ominous mystery when a former college acquaintance suddenly disappears.', 'A dark comedy about four self-absorbed twenty-somethings who become entangled in an ominous mystery when a former college acquaintance suddenly disappears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ldHjc3Hx29NKK0bfgaYZkIwQWN.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:67697'),
  ('428609116538404016', 'Search: WWW', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kwon Do-eun, Kwon Yeong-il, Jung Jee-hyun', 'Kwon Do-eun', 'Lim Soo-jung, Lee Da-hee, Jeon Hye-jin, Jang Ki-yong, Lee Jae-wook, Ji Seung-hyun, Kwon Hae-hyo, Woo Ji-hyun', 'TV-14', 'The stories of ambitious career women working at the top of the best portal sites in the IT industry. Paved with wins and losses, their road to success takes a new turn when love comes along the way.', 'The stories of ambitious career women working at the top of the best portal sites in the IT industry. Paved with wins and losses, their road to success takes a new turn when love comes along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2noAzJLq5dYm2HXbpGlWrgMyNqm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89410'),
  ('908146386640743027', 'Seaside Hotel', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Stig Thorsboe, Hanna Lundblad', 'Stig Thorsboe, Hanna Lundblad', 'Morten Hemmingsen, Rosalinde Mynster, Anette Støvelbæk, Mads Wille, Amalie Dollerup, Peter Hesse Overgaard, Cecilie Stenspil, Anne Louise Hassing', 'TV-14', 'At Andersen’s Seaside Hotel by the North Sea dunes, meet three young people as they try to emancipate themselves from the plans other people have made on their behalf.', 'At Andersen’s Seaside Hotel by the North Sea dunes, meet three young people as they try to emancipate themselves from the plans other people have made on their behalf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2I0W7JPhs6UKA2USUmDjZRDoLWV.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:62474'),
  ('884089307762003838', 'Seasons of Blossom', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Park Yoon-sung', 'Seo Ji-hoon, So Joo-yeon, Kim Min-kyu, Kang Hye-won, Yoon Hyun-soo, Oh Yu-jin, Seo Ji-soo, Kang Jeong-won', null, 'A story of love and friendship between five high school students from Seoyeon High School. Lee Ha-Min (Seo Ji-Hoon) appears like a bright person, but there is also darkness within his mind. Han So-Mang ( So Ju-Yeon) is a warm-hearted person, but she is also quite timid. Lee Jae-Min (Kim Min-Kyu) is a popular student with a painful past. He is kind to everyone around him. Yoon Bo-Mi (Kang Hye-Won) is a sweet, model student. Choi Jin-Young (Yoon Hyun-Soo) loves playing games. He can seem unfriendly and has a delicate personality.', 'A story of love and friendship between five high school students from Seoyeon High School. Lee Ha-Min (Seo Ji-Hoon) appears like a bright person, but there is also darkness within his mind. Han So-Mang ( So Ju-Yeon) is a warm-hearted person, but she is also quite timid. Lee Jae-Min (Kim Min-Kyu) is a popular student with a painful past. He is kind to everyone around him. Yoon Bo-Mi (Kang Hye-Won) is a sweet, model student. Choi Jin-Young (Yoon Hyun-Soo) loves playing games. He can seem unfriendly and has a delicate personality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmT7FvzCC2ib8jCJUateiSG1CXs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:205454'),
  ('734022830386330816', 'Sebastian Fitzek''s Therapy', 2023, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Alexander M. Rümelin', 'Alexander M. Rümelin, Don Bohlinger, Christian Limmer', 'Stephan Kampwirth, Trystan Pütter, Emma Bading, Helena Zengel, Andrea Osvárt, Martina Eitner-Acheampong, Eva M. Hirschburger, Samir Fuchs', null, 'With no witnesses, no traces, and no corpse, Josy, the 13-year-old daughter of well-known psychiatrist Viktor Larenz, has disappeared in unexplained circumstances. Two years later, a mysterious woman appears. She forces Viktor to face up to his daughter''s disappearance and pushes him to his psychological limits.', 'With no witnesses, no traces, and no corpse, Josy, the 13-year-old daughter of well-known psychiatrist Viktor Larenz, has disappeared in unexplained circumstances. Two years later, a mysterious woman appears. She forces Viktor to face up to his daughter''s disappearance and pushes him to his psychological limits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mWrE3tCSTPfxbkZZZphlotAYV8T.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207713'),
  ('281505567443341851', 'Second Call', 2019, 'Drama', 'Carla Faour, Júlia Spadaccini, Jô Bilac', null, 'Débora Bloch, Thalita Carauta, Paulo Gorgulho, Hermila Guedes, Sílvio Guindane, Otávio Müller, Moacyr Franco, Ângelo Antônio', null, '''Second Call'' focuses on the resilience stories of teachers and students in a complex public education system. After some time off from teaching, Lúcia Helena returns to the classroom, now giving night classes to teenagers and adults. Along with other three teachers and the principal, she faces institutional adversities and the lack of appreciation without flinching. The conflicts involve both the faculty and the student body and, in this scenario, Education emerges as a hope, reminding everyone that it is never too late to have a second chance.', '''Second Call'' focuses on the resilience stories of teachers and students in a complex public education system. After some time off from teaching, Lúcia Helena returns to the classroom, now giving night classes to teenagers and adults. Along with other three teachers and the principal, she faces institutional adversities and the lack of appreciation without flinching. The conflicts involve both the faculty and the student body and, in this scenario, Education emerges as a hope, reminding everyone that it is never too late to have a second chance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gBQ1dIOZVy7ipPUEhIdIIAcZnCZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:94281'),
  ('1033327289530374752', 'Second chance', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Julio Jiménez', null, 'Diana Osorio, Mario Cimarro, Andrés García, Lorena Rojas, Erick Elías, Martín Karpan, Vanessa Villela, Roberto Moll', 'NR', 'El cuerpo del Deseo also known as Second Chance is a Spanish-language telenovela produced by Telemundo and Film in Florida. This limited-run series is about a man who comes back from the dead and discovers dark secrets about his beautiful widow. The first version of El cuerpo del Deseo was En Cuerpo Ajeno produced by RTI Colombia in 1992.This telenovela was aired in 25 countries around the world.', 'El cuerpo del Deseo also known as Second Chance is a Spanish-language telenovela produced by Telemundo and Film in Florida. This limited-run series is about a man who comes back from the dead and discovers dark secrets about his beautiful widow. The first version of El cuerpo del Deseo was En Cuerpo Ajeno produced by RTI Colombia in 1992.This telenovela was aired in 25 countries around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epD9q663aphzMXoxAo58zGu1oIc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4879'),
  ('572335858670221993', 'Second Chance', 2016, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Rand Ravich', null, 'Robert Kazinsky, Tim DeKay, Dilshad Vadsaria, Adhir Kalyan, Scott Menville, Philip Baker Hall, Ciara Bravo, Vanessa Lengies', 'TV-14', 'A disgraced, 75-year-old ex-sheriff, whose life ends at the hands of corrupt cops, is brought back to life and given a second chance by a pair of young tech scientists, as a 35-year-old with unpredictable near-superhuman abilities.', 'A disgraced, 75-year-old ex-sheriff, whose life ends at the hands of corrupt cops, is brought back to life and given a second chance by a pair of young tech scientists, as a 35-year-old with unpredictable near-superhuman abilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vXQXjPQ0qq5caOSvTElc9UMp6Rf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64434'),
  ('116370544200751151', 'Second Chance', 2018, 'Soap, Drama', 'João Emanuel Carneiro', 'Fábio Mendonça, Eliane Garcia, Lílian Garcia', 'Giovanna Antonelli, Emílio Dantas, Deborah Secco, Adriana Esteves, Vladimir Brichta, Fabrício Boliveira, Fabiula Nascimento, Chay Suede', 'NR', 'Luzia is a hard working mother whose life is turned upside down when she falls in love with Beto Falcão, a declining singer who regains his fame after taken for dead. But this romance jeopardizes the ambitious plans of Beto''s ex-girlfriend and a devious bawd who will do anything to put an end to the musician''s infatuation. In order to save her life, Luiza leaves her little children behind, flees the country and becomes DJ Ariella. Years later she comes back to fight fiercely for a second chance at reuniting her family, unaware she will soon meet again the love of her past and her tormentors.', 'Luzia is a hard working mother whose life is turned upside down when she falls in love with Beto Falcão, a declining singer who regains his fame after taken for dead. But this romance jeopardizes the ambitious plans of Beto''s ex-girlfriend and a devious bawd who will do anything to put an end to the musician''s infatuation. In order to save her life, Luiza leaves her little children behind, flees the country and becomes DJ Ariella. Years later she comes back to fight fiercely for a second chance at reuniting her family, unaware she will soon meet again the love of her past and her tormentors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtsTkRZkyCBlQgXt4ORQoQjafzf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79068'),
  ('71443019285362583', 'Second City Television', 1976, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Joe Flaherty, Eugene Levy, Andrea Martin, Martin Short, John Hemphill, Mary Charlotte Wilcox', null, 'Second City Television is a Canadian television sketch comedy show offshoot from Toronto''s Second City troupe that ran between 1976 and 1984.', 'Second City Television is a Canadian television sketch comedy show offshoot from Toronto''s Second City troupe that ran between 1976 and 1984.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTvV8fC0qsikn2x8OtHrweKzU3M.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:2548'),
  ('513375775817030067', 'Second Shot At Love', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Jeong Ji-hyeon, Myung Soo-Hyun', 'Sooyoung Choi, Gong Myoung, Jo Yoon-hee, Kim Sung-ryung, Kim Sang-ho, Kang Hyung-suk, Kim Tae-oh, Yeom Seung-yi', null, 'A woman who was born and raised in a family of alcoholics escaping from her drunkenness meets a man who believes alcohol is not a cure but an anesthetic.', 'A woman who was born and raised in a family of alcoholics escaping from her drunkenness meets a man who believes alcohol is not a cure but an anesthetic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9PKARV5qCoipkJ48QyQrhVPnE1B.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:261981'),
  ('130968034788112133', 'Second Sight', 2000, 'Drama', null, null, 'Clive Owen, Claire Skinner, Louise Atkins, Jonell Elliott, Rebecca Egan, Selina Boyack, Ben Smith, Donald Douglas', null, 'Maverick cop DCI Ross Tanner finds out that he has a rare disease which is causing him to go blind.', 'Maverick cop DCI Ross Tanner finds out that he has a rare disease which is causing him to go blind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t84D26dBLtBGCcimCMYAHkzokZ0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8174'),
  ('1121666383710261175', 'Second Spring', 1998, 'Family, Drama', 'Sulhi Dölek', null, 'Türkan Şoray, Şener Şen, Tarık Papuççuoğlu, Nedim Saban, Güven Hokna, Özkan Uğur, Gül Onat, Kemal İnci', null, 'Second Spring was a television series in Turkey broadcast between 1998-2001 by ATV. First 8 epidodes appeared between 29 October 1998-20 May 1999. The next 15 epidodes were between 17 February-25 May 2000 and the last 14 episodes were between 21 September 2000-11 January 2001. There were also reruns; in 2007 by Fox TV and in 2011-2012 by Star TV.', 'Second Spring was a television series in Turkey broadcast between 1998-2001 by ATV. First 8 epidodes appeared between 29 October 1998-20 May 1999. The next 15 epidodes were between 17 February-25 May 2000 and the last 14 episodes were between 21 September 2000-11 January 2001. There were also reruns; in 2007 by Fox TV and in 2011-2012 by Star TV.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3hxzYzovStb9I976zAJxviRRzU.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:44761'),
  ('494464188844147116', 'Second To Last Love', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Choi Yun-jeong', 'Ji Jin-hee, Kim Hee-ae, Kwak Si-yang, Kim Seul-gi, Lee Soo-min, Stephanie Lee, Kim Kwon, Jeong Soo-young', null, 'Ko Sang-Sik is in his 40''s and still single. He works as the environmental facility section chief at city hall. Ko Sang-Sik becomes involved with Kang Min-Joo. She is also in her 40''s and still single. She works as a PD at a broadcasting station.', 'Ko Sang-Sik is in his 40''s and still single. He works as the environmental facility section chief at city hall. Ko Sang-Sik becomes involved with Kang Min-Joo. She is also in her 40''s and still single. She works as a PD at a broadcasting station.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o59QlmbunCkzqXDHtoMjmoS52Yg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67180'),
  ('449024353713264953', 'Seconds from Disaster', 2005, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Ashton Smith', null, 'Seconds from Disaster is a US/UK-produced documentary television programme that investigates historically relevant man-made and natural disasters of the 20th century. Each episode aims to explain a single incidental by analyzing the causes and circumstances that ultimately effected the disaster. The program uses re-enactments, interviews, testimonies, and CGI to analyze the sequence of events second-by-second for the audience. Narrators for the show are Ashton Smith, Richard Vaughan and Peter Guinness.', 'Seconds from Disaster is a US/UK-produced documentary television programme that investigates historically relevant man-made and natural disasters of the 20th century. Each episode aims to explain a single incidental by analyzing the causes and circumstances that ultimately effected the disaster. The program uses re-enactments, interviews, testimonies, and CGI to analyze the sequence of events second-by-second for the audience. Narrators for the show are Ashton Smith, Richard Vaughan and Peter Guinness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/clHF8luMdEHSNkyv5bTp5bzXhRG.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:9311'),
  ('575359436590522479', 'Secrecy of the Investigation', 2000, 'Action & Adventure, Mystery, Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Anna Kovalchuk, Aleksey Komashko, Igor Nikolaev, Aleksandr Novikov, Vyacheslav Zakharov, Andrey Sharkov, Sergey Peregudov, Sergey Yushkevich', null, 'In the center of the plot is a senior investigator named Masha Shvetsova and her male colleagues. The plot is the most vital, but, like in “Streets of Broken Lanterns,” it is seasoned with a fair amount of humor - otherwise, how can the audience (and the heroes) endure countless morgues, identifications and other “cute” charms of the investigative routine?', 'In the center of the plot is a senior investigator named Masha Shvetsova and her male colleagues. The plot is the most vital, but, like in “Streets of Broken Lanterns,” it is seasoned with a fair amount of humor - otherwise, how can the audience (and the heroes) endure countless morgues, identifications and other “cute” charms of the investigative routine?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bEOqLQZ5F8cmcZ5aBfZWb2JL8x1.jpg', 25, 'tmdb:tv:76713'),
  ('626808695184094032', 'Secret', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Kim Min-uk', null, '김효섭, 전왕수, 강원', null, 'Jeongsu and Yuho awaken imprisoned in an unidentified locked room, forced to stand naked before one another. A mysterious man known only as X, camera in hand, coldly compels them to engage in forbidden acts of intimacy. Caught between fear and raw physical instinct, the two strangers are drawn into a distorted relationship shaped by coercion and desire. This is a brutal test of survival that pushes the limits of sensation. Before they are consumed by a cruel secret, they must uncover the true motive behind their captor''s twisted game.', 'Jeongsu and Yuho awaken imprisoned in an unidentified locked room, forced to stand naked before one another. A mysterious man known only as X, camera in hand, coldly compels them to engage in forbidden acts of intimacy. Caught between fear and raw physical instinct, the two strangers are drawn into a distorted relationship shaped by coercion and desire. This is a brutal test of survival that pushes the limits of sensation. Before they are consumed by a cruel secret, they must uncover the true motive behind their captor''s twisted game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2PXNesgj61eUbmtHQrwHkhShoP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:316234'),
  ('716934756897334741', 'Secret Africa: Into the Wild', 2026, null, null, null, 'Lucy Shepherd', null, 'Explorer Lucy Shepherd will embark on a trek across the wilderness of Tanzania, joining hunter gather nomadic tribes and facing predators and extreme terrains.', 'Explorer Lucy Shepherd will embark on a trek across the wilderness of Tanzania, joining hunter gather nomadic tribes and facing predators and extreme terrains.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:319069'),
  ('840704192794026987', 'Secret Army', 1977, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Gerard Glaister', null, 'Bernard Hepton, Angela Richards, Clifford Rose, Juliet Hammond-Hill', null, 'World War II drama about covert organisation Lifeline helping allied airmen escape after being shot down in occupied Europe, working with the Resistance and hiding from the Gestapo.', 'World War II drama about covert organisation Lifeline helping allied airmen escape after being shot down in occupied Europe, working with the Resistance and hiding from the Gestapo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xf1eqEBfXDH7a8b7jmi0cucCiOD.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2677'),
  ('419699083976956263', 'Secret Bridesmaids'' Business', 2019, 'Drama', null, null, 'Georgina Haig, Abbie Cornish, Katie McGrath, Dan Spielman, Oliver Ackland, Alexander England, Nicholas Bell, Rohan Browne', null, 'The lives of three friends are inextricably changed when one of them unwittingly invites a malevolent stranger into their world. A tangle of lies and laughter collides with a stalker''s chilling obsession in this contemporary adaptation of Elizabeth Coleman''s smash hit play. A celebration of female friendship reimagined as a high stakes thriller, Secret Bridesmaids'' Business will keep viewers on the edge of their seats.', 'The lives of three friends are inextricably changed when one of them unwittingly invites a malevolent stranger into their world. A tangle of lies and laughter collides with a stalker''s chilling obsession in this contemporary adaptation of Elizabeth Coleman''s smash hit play. A celebration of female friendship reimagined as a high stakes thriller, Secret Bridesmaids'' Business will keep viewers on the edge of their seats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8JotLuyfPvaOgI9O6Poe4Xm0oCz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94112'),
  ('588332411576141461', 'Secret Celebrity RuPaul''s Drag Race', 2020, 'Reality', 'RuPaul, Fenton Bailey, Randy Barbato', null, 'RuPaul, Michelle Visage, Monét X Change, Jujubee, Brooke Lynn Hytes', 'TV-14', 'Secret celebrities - from all walks of life - compete in full drag as they try to impress Emmy Award winning host, RuPaul. To save themselves from elimination, they have to lip sync for their lives. In the end, one celebrity will be crowned America''s Next Celebrity Drag Superstar.', 'Secret celebrities - from all walks of life - compete in full drag as they try to impress Emmy Award winning host, RuPaul. To save themselves from elimination, they have to lip sync for their lives. In the end, one celebrity will be crowned America''s Next Celebrity Drag Superstar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pIoGY1RxiXATrkoTDtSEQ9ODQGl.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:98888'),
  ('754520685328292285', 'Secret City', 2016, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, 'Steve Lewis, Chris Uhlmann', 'Anna Torv, Andrew McFarlane, Benedict Hardie, Robert Rabiah, Don Hany, Rob Collins, Danielle Cormack, Aleks Mikic', 'TV-MA', 'Beneath the placid facade of Canberra, amidst rising tension between China and America, senior political journalist Harriet Dunkley uncovers a secret city of interlocked conspiracies, putting innocent lives in danger including her own.', 'Beneath the placid facade of Canberra, amidst rising tension between China and America, senior political journalist Harriet Dunkley uncovers a secret city of interlocked conspiracies, putting innocent lives in danger including her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8MWyp6WuA3QT1WwTc3SmASEhN2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66357'),
  ('291891357581306312', 'Secret Confessions', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, null, null, 'Inspired by real-life experiences, this series unveils raw, unfiltered, and relatable stories that captivate audiences seeking authenticity.', 'Inspired by real-life experiences, this series unveils raw, unfiltered, and relatable stories that captivate audiences seeking authenticity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/peWWSYpZPyWyibb1oo7YlXvxFB3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:290042'),
  ('936179950116699982', 'Secret Crush On You', 2022, 'Drama', 'Darin', 'O Chanrit Saengworamet', 'Pittikorn Siripornsawan, Weerapong Odhoeng, Witsarut Khakham, Orntara Poolsak, Nitikorn Pankram, Patchanon Ounsa-ard, Wichai Saefant, Sarocha Chankimha', null, 'A shy student who’s never been in love falls for his senior after capturing a fateful photo that brings them closer together.', 'A shy student who’s never been in love falls for his senior after capturing a fateful photo that brings them closer together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mOJPUwZ7AQOUIOs3w6yU22IuGT3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157430'),
  ('276130972784506232', 'Secret Diary of a Call Girl', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lucy Prebble', null, 'Billie Piper, Iddo Goldberg, Lily James, Gemma Chan', null, 'It''s her business doing pleasure with you. A witty and provocative series based on the real-life adventures of a high-class escort. Juggling her own reality with her clients'' fantasies can be difficult, but this savvy sweetheart knows every trick in the book, and she''s doing it in style.', 'It''s her business doing pleasure with you. A witty and provocative series based on the real-life adventures of a high-class escort. Juggling her own reality with her clients'' fantasies can be difficult, but this savvy sweetheart knows every trick in the book, and she''s doing it in style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewp0mtvdtb1QLq8CRzlL2MMdTss.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:14315'),
  ('1068300367350530353', 'Secret Door', 2014, 'Drama, History, Mystery', null, null, 'Lee Je-hoon, Kim Yoo-jung, Yoon So-hee, Han Suk-kyu, Park Eun-bin, Kim Min-jong, Lee Won-jong, Kwon Hae-hyo', 'NR', 'A re-imagining of the legendary tale of the troubled father-son relationship between King Yeongjo and his only son Prince Sado. While his father insists on a strong and centralized government, Crown Prince Sado promotes social justice and equality throughout the kingdom. Throughout eight fateful years, the strain on their relationship — both familial and political — eventually evolves into a total breakdown, ending with one of the most tragic stories in Joseon history.', 'A re-imagining of the legendary tale of the troubled father-son relationship between King Yeongjo and his only son Prince Sado. While his father insists on a strong and centralized government, Crown Prince Sado promotes social justice and equality throughout the kingdom. Throughout eight fateful years, the strain on their relationship — both familial and political — eventually evolves into a total breakdown, ending with one of the most tragic stories in Joseon history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4XAt4Kv21qhdd6niXdLRr2kLxpl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61488'),
  ('204035299848314665', 'Secret For a Million', 2016, 'Reality, Drama', 'Valeriya Kudryavtseva', null, 'Valeriya Kudryavtseva', null, '«Secret for a Million» is a game show for celebrities. Guest stars win money for disclosing personal secrets. Guest has to answer 10 hardball questions from the host. The last question is the hardest one and a truthful answer will be awarded by 1 million rubles. Only the most honest and brave of the guests dare to answer it telling the ugly truth they hid from their fans for years.', '«Secret for a Million» is a game show for celebrities. Guest stars win money for disclosing personal secrets. Guest has to answer 10 hardball questions from the host. The last question is the hardest one and a truthful answer will be awarded by 1 million rubles. Only the most honest and brave of the guests dare to answer it telling the ugly truth they hid from their fans for years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78miWdx6PoXdCKHQdWouSK3yBvW.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:117419'),
  ('724364958636708038', 'Secret Garden', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kim Eun-sook', null, 'Hyun Bin, Ha Ji-won, Yoon Sang-hyun, Kim Sa-rang, Lee Philip, Yoo In-na, Lee Jong-suk, Park Joon-geum', 'NR', 'A wealthy young man and a poor stunt woman fall for each other, but when their souls swap they soon learn how different their two worlds are.', 'A wealthy young man and a poor stunt woman fall for each other, but when their souls swap they soon learn how different their two worlds are.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2G5m6cMGN5DR5GsGGdg9OcgNNlG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37636'),
  ('155841795151623606', 'Secret Garden', 2026, 'Documentary', null, null, 'David Attenborough', null, 'David Attenborough reveals the drama unfolding in the hidden wild world of Britain''s backyards. Because even in familiar surroundings, the rules of the wild are still in force.', 'David Attenborough reveals the drama unfolding in the hidden wild world of Britain''s backyards. Because even in familiar surroundings, the rules of the wild are still in force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbtISsHeacnJH5ZvKodqCf9Dk2S.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274403'),
  ('682031304160610581', 'Secret Healer', 2016, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Yang Hyuk-moon', 'Yang Hyuk-moon', 'Yoon Shi-yoon, Kim Sae-ron, Lee Sung-jae, Yum Jung-ah, Kwak Si-yang, Jang Hee-jin, Jo Dal-hwan, Choi Seong-won', null, 'Seo-Ri''s mother Queen Sim was unable to have a child. She went to a shaman to help her have a child. With the help of shaman Hong-Joo''s black magic, Queen Sim was able to have a boy and girl twins. The girl, Seo-Ri, was put under a curse and abandoned deep in the mountains. She meets Heo Jun, a young man, there.', 'Seo-Ri''s mother Queen Sim was unable to have a child. She went to a shaman to help her have a child. With the help of shaman Hong-Joo''s black magic, Queen Sim was able to have a boy and girl twins. The girl, Seo-Ri, was put under a curse and abandoned deep in the mountains. She meets Heo Jun, a young man, there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lmDzxj8c0PTpSuxBqwtAZtEtDeO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66306'),
  ('527480689789031583', 'Secret Invasion', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Kyle Bradstreet', 'Beto Dantas, Matt McRee', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Ben Mendelsohn, Kingsley Ben-Adir, Killian Scott, Samuel Adewunmi, Dermot Mulroney, Emilia Clarke, Olivia Colman', 'TV-14', 'Nick Fury and Talos discover a faction of shapeshifting Skrulls who have been infiltrating Earth for years.', 'Nick Fury and Talos discover a faction of shapeshifting Skrulls who have been infiltrating Earth for years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f5ZMzzCvt2IzVDxr54gHPv9jlC9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114472'),
  ('825220431038737310', 'Secret Jouju', 2015, 'Animation, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, null, null, 'When a fairy gets locked out of Fairy Tale Land, she''s sent to the human world where she tackles different challenges with the power of magic and friendship.', 'When a fairy gets locked out of Fairy Tale Land, she''s sent to the human world where she tackles different challenges with the power of magic and friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ARSU9RT754bamSD1CD6PnlbToa.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:232366'),
  ('824913302272784918', 'Secret Level', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Tim Miller', null, null, 'TV-14', 'Adult animated series of original short stories which are set within the worlds of beloved video games. Each episode serves as a gateway to a new adventure, unlocking exciting worlds from beloved gaming classics and highly anticipated new titles.', 'Adult animated series of original short stories which are set within the worlds of beloved video games. Each episode serves as a gateway to a new adventure, unlocking exciting worlds from beloved gaming classics and highly anticipated new titles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/856MRq23grNxpeVl1PdFgmmLiT0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:261579'),
  ('337272178251316352', 'Secret Lives', 1999, 'Soap, Drama', 'Jason Daniel, Anne Harris, Greg Stevens', null, null, 'NR', 'Salatut elämät (Secret Lives) is a Finnish television soap opera that premiered on MTV3 on 25 January 1999. The series'' storylines follow the daily lives of several families who live in the same apartment block in Helsinki.', 'Salatut elämät (Secret Lives) is a Finnish television soap opera that premiered on MTV3 on 25 January 1999. The series'' storylines follow the daily lives of several families who live in the same apartment block in Helsinki.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ugYAGyxwajuplDUUYT8Bzbj8eNR.jpg', 28, 'tmdb:tv:14610'),
  ('60048807153353731', 'Secret Love', 2013, 'Drama', null, 'Choi Ho-chul, Yu Bo-ra', 'Hwang Jung-eum, Ji Sung, Bae Soo-bin, Lee Da-hee, Lee Duck-hwa, Yang Jin-sung, Kang Nam-gil, Lee Seung-joon', 'NR', 'A falsely accused Yoo Jung fights her innocence against her prosecutor''s fiancée and an insane heir to a conglomerate.', 'A falsely accused Yoo Jung fights her innocence against her prosecutor''s fiancée and an insane heir to a conglomerate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zeL1acoA8ygEOJn7kUI1FItsYl0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:57278'),
  ('999468904322981960', 'Secret Love Affair', 2014, 'Drama', 'Ahn Pan-seok', 'Jung Sung-joo', 'Kim Hee-ae, Yoo Ah-in, Park Hyuk-kwon, Kim Hye-eun, Jang So-yeon, Kim Kwon, Shim Hye-jin, Kim Chang-wan', 'NR', 'Despite being married and having a fulfilling career as a sophisticated arts foundation director, something is missing in Oh Hye Won''s life. When she meets twenty-something Lee Seon Jae, Hye Won''s appetite for passion is awakened, and she soon falls for the impoverished piano prodigy. Though they risk everything, Hye Won and Seon Jae can''t help but embark on an affair that threatens to destroy both their lives. Based on the 2005 Japanese film Tokyo Tower, this romance aches with the desperate struggle between love and reality.', 'Despite being married and having a fulfilling career as a sophisticated arts foundation director, something is missing in Oh Hye Won''s life. When she meets twenty-something Lee Seon Jae, Hye Won''s appetite for passion is awakened, and she soon falls for the impoverished piano prodigy. Though they risk everything, Hye Won and Seon Jae can''t help but embark on an affair that threatens to destroy both their lives. Based on the 2005 Japanese film Tokyo Tower, this romance aches with the desperate struggle between love and reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYhZngGQaOGeYtISWjN3AMeSr1Q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61146'),
