  ('557129182182029086', 'Secret Mission - Undercover Agents Never Back Down!', 2023, 'Animation', null, null, 'Sahomi Koyama, Jun Osuka', null, 'Narcotics Enforcement Agent Riko Ikazuchi is undercover with her junior colleague Noma in an apartment that serves as the hideout for a criminal organization. Despite Riko and Noma posing as a newlywed couple, the criminals begin to suspect them after not hearing any marital intimacy during the night. To convince them that they are a loving couple, Noma starts touching Riko''s body...', 'Narcotics Enforcement Agent Riko Ikazuchi is undercover with her junior colleague Noma in an apartment that serves as the hideout for a criminal organization. Despite Riko and Noma posing as a newlywed couple, the criminals begin to suspect them after not hearing any marital intimacy during the night. To convince them that they are a loving couple, Noma starts touching Riko''s body...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZV8e1iKi85PFZlbQBdznvtpAVJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233643'),
