  ('106664475384482768', 'Segodon', 2018, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Ryohei Suzuki, Eita Nagayama', null, 'Saigo Takamori, the hero of the Meiji Restoration, was born to a poor, low-ranking samurai family in the Satsuma domain (present day Kagoshima Prefecture). His simple honesty caught the attention of its charismatic feudal lord of Satsuma, Shimazu Nariakira. Nariakira’s assertion that the love of people is what will enrich and strengthen the nation captivated Saigo who took on Nariakira’s secret mission and eventually became a key person for Satsuma. Not a portrait of him survives today and much of his life is a mystery. He is a man who was twice exiled and thrice married. He overthrew the Tokugawa Shogunate with exceptional bravery and action. Although he accomplished the restoration, he lost his life in a fight with the new Meiji government.', 'Saigo Takamori, the hero of the Meiji Restoration, was born to a poor, low-ranking samurai family in the Satsuma domain (present day Kagoshima Prefecture). His simple honesty caught the attention of its charismatic feudal lord of Satsuma, Shimazu Nariakira. Nariakira’s assertion that the love of people is what will enrich and strengthen the nation captivated Saigo who took on Nariakira’s secret mission and eventually became a key person for Satsuma. Not a portrait of him survives today and much of his life is a mystery. He is a man who was twice exiled and thrice married. He overthrew the Tokugawa Shogunate with exceptional bravery and action. Although he accomplished the restoration, he lost his life in a fight with the new Meiji government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9r4YQcnjCf36Hu87lc2oUcwdEgX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76948'),
  ('90715722919091503', 'Segunda muerte', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Agustín Martínez', null, 'Georgina Amorós, Karra Elejalde, Joel Bosqued, Aria Bedmar, Paula Morado, Antonio Navarro, Fernando Guallar, Maribel Salas', null, 'In a small town in Cantabria, a young auxiliary police officer finds the body of an elderly lady who has recently passed away. The mystery lies in the fact that it is the body of Juliana Cobián, who had passed away seven years ago. Who was buried in her place, then? When Juliana’s coffin is exhumed, another woman’s body is found inside: it is Soledad’s, Juliana’s daughter that, according to all the neighbours, had left the town twenty years before. What lies behind this second death?', 'In a small town in Cantabria, a young auxiliary police officer finds the body of an elderly lady who has recently passed away. The mystery lies in the fact that it is the body of Juliana Cobián, who had passed away seven years ago. Who was buried in her place, then? When Juliana’s coffin is exhumed, another woman’s body is found inside: it is Soledad’s, Juliana’s daughter that, according to all the neighbours, had left the town twenty years before. What lies behind this second death?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppj95ijirOWDZVa3fYPv4xr7Ak1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:238251'),
  ('550866846021052031', 'Seher Hone Ko Hai', 2025, 'Drama', 'Richa Yamini', null, 'Parth Samthaan, Mahhi Vij, Rishita Kothari, Vaquar Shaikh, Apurva Agnihotri, Deepak Qazir, Nidhi Gangta, Falak Khan', null, 'Strong-willed Kausar defies societal barriers for her daughter Seher’s big dreams, but will destiny stand by their side?', 'Strong-willed Kausar defies societal barriers for her daughter Seher’s big dreams, but will destiny stand by their side?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thC2dgPsSNYVVvNb2SPAolThndQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:307017'),
  ('184969585518849770', 'Seijuu Sentai Gingaman', 1998, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Kids', null, null, 'Kazuki Maehara, Koji Sueyoshi, Shôei, Nobuaki Takahashi, Juri Miyazawa, Teruaki Ogawa, Hidekatsu Shibata, Takeshi Watabe', null, 'Three millennia after the first invasion of the Space Pirates Barban, a new set of Gingamen — Hyuuga, Gouki, Hayate, Hikaru, Saya — have been selected to protect the Earth. That is, unless the Barban are able to disrupt the ceremony!', 'Three millennia after the first invasion of the Space Pirates Barban, a new set of Gingamen — Hyuuga, Gouki, Hayate, Hikaru, Saya — have been selected to protect the Earth. That is, unless the Barban are able to disrupt the ceremony!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oIF3MuLFEwWptVV6ghWx7UzEPgA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:410'),
  ('668884224022000225', 'Seikimatsu Occult Academy', 2010, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Kana Hanazawa, Hiroki Takahashi, Takahiro Mizushima, Yu Kobayashi, Minori Chihara, Sayuri Yahagi, Yoko Hikasa, Masaaki Yajima', null, 'Occult Academy is a Japanese anime television series produced by A-1 Pictures and Aniplex and directed by Tomohiko Itō. The 13-episode anime premiered in Japan on the TV Tokyo television network on July 6, 2010. Occult Academy is the third project of Anime no Chikara. It was shown by Crunchyroll an hour after the Japanese broadcast. A manga adaptation of the anime is currently serialized in Media Factory''s Monthly Comic Alive. A series of DVD/Blu-ray releases are made over six volumes. Volumes one through five each contain two episodes from the series and comes with extras, such as bonus songs sung by various voice actors for the characters. The final volume covers the last three episodes There are also four spinoff episodes, the first of which is included with the second volume. The series has been picked up in North America by NIS America, who released the series on Blu-ray on May 8, 2012.', 'Occult Academy is a Japanese anime television series produced by A-1 Pictures and Aniplex and directed by Tomohiko Itō. The 13-episode anime premiered in Japan on the TV Tokyo television network on July 6, 2010. Occult Academy is the third project of Anime no Chikara. It was shown by Crunchyroll an hour after the Japanese broadcast. A manga adaptation of the anime is currently serialized in Media Factory''s Monthly Comic Alive. A series of DVD/Blu-ray releases are made over six volumes. Volumes one through five each contain two episodes from the series and comes with extras, such as bonus songs sung by various voice actors for the characters. The final volume covers the last three episodes There are also four spinoff episodes, the first of which is included with the second volume. The series has been picked up in North America by NIS America, who released the series on Blu-ray on May 8, 2012.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Vz1goAvLqq87FC8BI1DSlt6TKI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37575'),
  ('229308405396159978', 'Seinfeld', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Jerry Seinfeld, Larry David', null, 'Jerry Seinfeld, Jason Alexander, Michael Richards, Julia Louis-Dreyfus', 'TV-PG', 'A stand-up comedian and his three offbeat friends weather the pitfalls and payoffs of life in New York City in the ''90s. It''s a show about nothing.', 'A stand-up comedian and his three offbeat friends weather the pitfalls and payoffs of life in New York City in the ''90s. It''s a show about nothing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCw8ONfyz3AhngVQa1E2Ss4KSUQ.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:1400'),
  ('969587519128188047', 'Seirei Gensouki: Spirit Chronicles', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Ayaka Suwa, Akane Fujita, Yuuki Kuwahara', 'TV-14', 'His past life and current life are intersecting--a boy with memories of two lives faces his destiny! After his mother was killed at an early age, the orphaned Rio fought his hardest to survive in the slums. One day, he awakens to the memories of Haruto Amakwa, who died in an accident while dreaming of being reunited with his childhood friend, and Rio realizing he has reincarnated in a world of swords and sorcery.', 'His past life and current life are intersecting--a boy with memories of two lives faces his destiny! After his mother was killed at an early age, the orphaned Rio fought his hardest to survive in the slums. One day, he awakens to the memories of Haruto Amakwa, who died in an accident while dreaming of being reunited with his childhood friend, and Rio realizing he has reincarnated in a world of swords and sorcery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNki26bfC3ad6mRQZOxY8ysosrb.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:113808'),
  ('29588691525833011', 'Seiren', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Atsushi Tamaru, Ayane Sakura, Juri Kimura, Shino Shimoji', 'TV-14', 'For high school students like Shouichi Kamita, university entrance exams and the future are common concerns. It is also during this time in life that a mysterious emotion that vexes people of all ages may begin to weigh upon one''s mind—love. At this point in his teenage years, Shouichi finds three girls he could see himself having a future with: the ever-cheerful Hikari Tsuneki, who teases Shouichi without mercy, but actually has a softer side; the competitive gamer, Tooru Miyamae, who has difficulty communicating with others; and Shouichi''s childhood friend, Kyouko Touno, the sometimes immature shoujo manga enthusiast. Seiren follows Shouichi''s relationships with these three girls across three separate arcs, as their feelings grow from mutual interest and blossom into something more beautiful.', 'For high school students like Shouichi Kamita, university entrance exams and the future are common concerns. It is also during this time in life that a mysterious emotion that vexes people of all ages may begin to weigh upon one''s mind—love. At this point in his teenage years, Shouichi finds three girls he could see himself having a future with: the ever-cheerful Hikari Tsuneki, who teases Shouichi without mercy, but actually has a softer side; the competitive gamer, Tooru Miyamae, who has difficulty communicating with others; and Shouichi''s childhood friend, Kyouko Touno, the sometimes immature shoujo manga enthusiast. Seiren follows Shouichi''s relationships with these three girls across three separate arcs, as their feelings grow from mutual interest and blossom into something more beautiful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thSofF8CfOBllCYhuP8RFg4PkHB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69342'),
  ('1121998935537737488', 'Seis Manos', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Brad Graeber, Álvaro Rodríguez', null, 'Aislinn Derbez, Mike Colter, Jonny Cruz, Angélica Vale, Vic Chao, Danny Trejo', 'TV-MA', 'Orphans raised by a martial arts master are plunged into a mystery involving demonic powers, drug cartels, ancient rituals and blood sacrifice.', 'Orphans raised by a martial arts master are plunged into a mystery involving demonic powers, drug cartels, ancient rituals and blood sacrifice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gLIC5AigbrUYP2vHoBhmm687nnF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93953'),
