  ('68011142543085191', 'Seitokai Yakuindomo', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Shintaro Asanuma, Yoko Hikasa, Satomi Sato, Sayuri Yahagi, Satomi Arai, Emiri Kato, Chiaki Omigawa, Minoru Shiraishi', 'TV-MA', 'Ousai Academy is a former all-girls private high school which has recently been integrated for both genders. Takatoshi Tsuda is pushed into becoming the vice-president of the student council, where he is the lone male member surrounded by three beautiful girls.', 'Ousai Academy is a former all-girls private high school which has recently been integrated for both genders. Takatoshi Tsuda is pushed into becoming the vice-president of the student council, where he is the lone male member surrounded by three beautiful girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/htcCw1HrElxHV9GQ5KLapm4CjlA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:36697'),
  ('205376524254329643', 'Seiyu''s Life!', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Rie Takahashi, Yuki Nagaku, Marika Kouno, Hitomi Nabatame, Kenta Miyake, Ami Koshimizu, Nozomi Furuki, Ayane Sakura', 'TV-PG', 'The series is centered on three friends who are all rookie voice actresses; Futaba Ichinose, Ichigo Moesaki and Rin Kohana. As the girls go through their individual troubles of working in voice acting, they end up hosting a web radio show together and form the unit, Earphones.', 'The series is centered on three friends who are all rookie voice actresses; Futaba Ichinose, Ichigo Moesaki and Rin Kohana. As the girls go through their individual troubles of working in voice acting, they end up hosting a web radio show together and form the unit, Earphones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1dHP1La2G4vaPzaSznQzs0bmYbi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80878'),
  ('1007413500062112185', 'Seize the Day', 2009, 'Soap, Drama', 'Manoel Carlos', 'Angela Chaves, Claudia Lage, Daisy Chaves', 'Taís Araújo, José Mayer, Alinne Moraes, Mateus Solano, Lília Cabral, Giovanna Antonelli, Thiago Lacerda, Bárbara Paz', null, 'Helena and Luciana are two supermodels with completely opposite personalities: the first is stormy and spoiled, while the second - being older - is patient and restrained. Their fate changes when Helena becomes involved with Marcos, Luciana''s father, an older man recently divorced from a former model, Tereza, who does not accept the end of the marriage.', 'Helena and Luciana are two supermodels with completely opposite personalities: the first is stormy and spoiled, while the second - being older - is patient and restrained. Their fate changes when Helena becomes involved with Marcos, Luciana''s father, an older man recently divorced from a former model, Tereza, who does not accept the end of the marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMgASlyaHMTU4oGkIJWJfv4goSf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31556'),
  ('309670276784782510', 'Sekai Ichi Hatsukoi: The World''s Greatest First Love', 2011, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, 'Rika Nakase', 'Tomoaki Maeno, Hiroshi Kamiya, Shinnosuke Tachibana, Yuichi Nakamura, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Koji Yusa, Katsuyuki Konishi, Takashi Kondo', 'TV-14', 'Sekaiichi Hatsukoi follows three couples that are interconnected within the manga industry, with each being subject to the budding of first love.', 'Sekaiichi Hatsukoi follows three couples that are interconnected within the manga industry, with each being subject to the budding of first love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Ald4WukHy8TeqacR6pbeIs1adO.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:42554'),
  ('624847289888644618', 'Sekirei', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Kana Hanazawa, Katsuyuki Konishi, Kana Ueda, Kana Asumi, Saori Hayami, Shinnosuke Tachibana, Aya Endo, Marina Inoue', 'TV-MA', 'Struggling yet brilliant, 19-year-old Minato Sahashi has failed his college entrance exams for the second time, resulting in him being regarded as worthless by those around him. However, the course of his seemingly bleak future is altered dramatically when a beautiful, supernatural woman falls from the sky and into his life. That woman, Musubi, is a "Sekirei," an extraterrestrial with extraordinary abilities. Recognizing the potential of the Ashikabi gene within Minato, Musubi kisses him, initiating a bond between the two of them. This drags him into the high-stakes world of the Sekirei, where he and his new partner must compete against others in a battle for survival called the "Sekirei Plan." However, unbeknownst to the contestants, there is far more at risk that what the competition initially entailed. Manga series by Sakurako Gokurakuin.', 'Struggling yet brilliant, 19-year-old Minato Sahashi has failed his college entrance exams for the second time, resulting in him being regarded as worthless by those around him. However, the course of his seemingly bleak future is altered dramatically when a beautiful, supernatural woman falls from the sky and into his life. That woman, Musubi, is a "Sekirei," an extraterrestrial with extraordinary abilities. Recognizing the potential of the Ashikabi gene within Minato, Musubi kisses him, initiating a bond between the two of them. This drags him into the high-stakes world of the Sekirei, where he and his new partner must compete against others in a battle for survival called the "Sekirei Plan." However, unbeknownst to the contestants, there is far more at risk that what the competition initially entailed. Manga series by Sakurako Gokurakuin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5lGhwt2M3RHXPgfqgEHRvGM8F.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:34805'),
  ('876377128069177221', 'Seksenler', 2012, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Birol Güven', 'Murat Aras', 'Özlem Türkad, Şoray Uzun, İlker Ayrık, Ayşe Tolga, Berat Yenilmez, Necmi Yapıcı, Tahsin Taşkın, Aşkın Şenol', null, 'Turkey''s series about the events experienced in the 1980s', 'Turkey''s series about the events experienced in the 1980s', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRFRmCUmD8UzLhG4MnbJptX8FTL.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:50666'),
  ('170932751842293470', 'Selection Day', 2018, 'Drama', 'Marston Bloom', 'Marston Bloom, Karan Agarwal, Aravind Adega', 'Mohammad Samad, Yash Shashank Dholye, Karanvir Malhotra, Rajesh Tailang, Mahesh Manjrekar, Ratna Pathak Shah, Shiv Panditt, Akshay Oberoi', 'TV-14', 'Two teen cricket prodigies struggle against their overbearing father and a system stacked against them to realize their own ambitions and identities.', 'Two teen cricket prodigies struggle against their overbearing father and a system stacked against them to realize their own ambitions and identities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vzDZD4vvhsC5zLHrkQAYYp1idJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84310'),
  ('806880579476539938', 'Selection Project', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Hinaki Yano, Saku Mizuno, Nozomi Nagumi, Ruri Arai, Hina Youmiya, Yuka Iwahashi, Mizuna Shirakawa, Miharu Hanai', 'TV-14', 'A group of nine determined girls enter the 7th Annual “Selection Project,” a television show where they’ll audition to become idols…and pursue their dreams!', 'A group of nine determined girls enter the 7th Annual “Selection Project,” a television show where they’ll audition to become idols…and pursue their dreams!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uw1i4ePhVgEot2KE1VvwGJYMkI7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114202'),
  ('581006614464592649', 'Selector Infected WIXOSS', 2014, 'Mystery, Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Ai Kakuma, Ayane Sakura, Ai Kayano, Chinatsu Akasaki, Asami Seto, Mako Morino, Minami Takahashi, Saori Onishi', 'TV-MA', 'WIXOSS is a card game that''s popular with teenagers. Supposedly there exist "LRIG Cards," female character cards with wills of their own. Special girls can hear the voices of the LRIGs, and those who possess them are called "Selectors." These Selectors have card battles in a dimension that other humans cannot access. It''s said that whoever triumphs in these battles will have their wish granted. Ruko Kominato is the latest girl to find a LRIG card. She names hers Tama, and without any further explanation is thrown into her life as a Selector.', 'WIXOSS is a card game that''s popular with teenagers. Supposedly there exist "LRIG Cards," female character cards with wills of their own. Special girls can hear the voices of the LRIGs, and those who possess them are called "Selectors." These Selectors have card battles in a dimension that other humans cannot access. It''s said that whoever triumphs in these battles will have their wish granted. Ruko Kominato is the latest girl to find a LRIG card. She names hers Tama, and without any further explanation is thrown into her life as a Selector.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZ3pPGNts57Ygi2FM7sQb6PUyoM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:60816'),
  ('1132478758655267842', 'Selena & Yolanda: The Secrets Between Them', 2024, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Nearly 30 years ago, the tragic murder of Tejano superstar and Mexican-American cultural icon Selena Quintanilla Perez sent shockwaves through the world and bore a legacy that remains relevant today. Her killer, Yolanda Saldivar, is eligible for parole next year. This examines Saldivar’s interpretation of events that ended in Selena’s death and her claims that everything wasn’t as it seemed.', 'Nearly 30 years ago, the tragic murder of Tejano superstar and Mexican-American cultural icon Selena Quintanilla Perez sent shockwaves through the world and bore a legacy that remains relevant today. Her killer, Yolanda Saldivar, is eligible for parole next year. This examines Saldivar’s interpretation of events that ended in Selena’s death and her claims that everything wasn’t as it seemed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymVQUyDsCj76oyVU1a1vIXjDjKE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:245525'),
  ('391923573464204789', 'Selena + Chef', 2020, 'Reality', 'Selena Gomez', null, 'Selena Gomez', 'TV-PG', 'Since social distancing at home, Selena Gomez has been spending more time in the kitchen than she ever imagined. But despite her many talents, it remains to be seen if cooking is one of them. In each episode, Selena will be joined remotely by a different master chef.', 'Since social distancing at home, Selena Gomez has been spending more time in the kitchen than she ever imagined. But despite her many talents, it remains to be seen if cooking is one of them. In each episode, Selena will be joined remotely by a different master chef.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97TlFTlUOMcqOeY8XXHw5N1LcLL.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:106978'),
  ('23753809106750097', 'Selena + Chef: Home for the Holidays', 2023, 'Reality', 'Aaron Saidman', null, 'Selena Gomez', 'TV-G', 'Selena Gomez is at the top of her game as a musical artist, actor, businesswoman, and philanthropist, but she calls in the experts to help amp up her kitchen skills for the holidays. This year she has invited all-star chefs Eric Adjepong, Alex Guarnaschelli, Michael Symon, and Claudette Zepeda to bring their favorite dishes and culinary wisdom to her home kitchen so they can cook up perfect holiday meals to share with friends and family.', 'Selena Gomez is at the top of her game as a musical artist, actor, businesswoman, and philanthropist, but she calls in the experts to help amp up her kitchen skills for the holidays. This year she has invited all-star chefs Eric Adjepong, Alex Guarnaschelli, Michael Symon, and Claudette Zepeda to bring their favorite dishes and culinary wisdom to her home kitchen so they can cook up perfect holiday meals to share with friends and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xlxfOdtYHIhM9QVFT31bvmwitkb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:236298'),
  ('626468879387560791', 'Selena + Restaurant', 2024, 'Reality', null, null, 'Selena Gomez', 'TV-PG', 'Selena Gomez heads out of her home kitchen and into the kitchens of some of LA’s hottest restaurants, with chefs teaching and testing Gomez to see how quickly she can learn the ropes with the ultimate goal of creating a dish good enough to make each restaurant’s menu.', 'Selena Gomez heads out of her home kitchen and into the kitchens of some of LA’s hottest restaurants, with chefs teaching and testing Gomez to see how quickly she can learn the ropes with the ultimate goal of creating a dish good enough to make each restaurant’s menu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jhfeLMnjGQY7CDp1QEoLFz3aINT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:250590'),
  ('844626404216200767', 'Selena: The Series', 2020, 'Drama', 'Moisés Zamora', null, 'Christian Serratos, Gabriel Chavarria, Ricardo Chavira, Noemi Gonzalez, Seidy López', 'TV-PG', 'As Mexican-American Tejano singer Selena comes of age and realizes her dreams, she and her family make tough choices to hold on to love and music.', 'As Mexican-American Tejano singer Selena comes of age and realizes her dreams, she and her family make tough choices to hold on to love and music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQ9liJVd07zSOFECJ0actCzaXZd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97180'),
  ('684432397390761629', 'Selenkay', 2024, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'After constantly traveling due to her parents'' work, sixteen-year-old Sofía wants stability: to go to school and have friends. When they move to Río Vivo, a small town in the mountains, she finally gets what she wants, until a strange water-bound power threatens the normal teenage life she''s worked so hard to achieve.', 'After constantly traveling due to her parents'' work, sixteen-year-old Sofía wants stability: to go to school and have friends. When they move to Río Vivo, a small town in the mountains, she finally gets what she wants, until a strange water-bound power threatens the normal teenage life she''s worked so hard to achieve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2oCXH9pDFfU7bpyxyusCjYIgeGO.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:153577'),
  ('733687426901510086', 'Self Made: Inspired by the Life of Madam C.J. Walker', 2020, 'Drama', null, 'Tyger Williams', 'Octavia Spencer, Tiffany Haddish, Carmen Ejogo, Garrett Morris, Kevin Carroll, J. Alphonse Nicholson, Blair Underwood', 'TV-MA', 'This limited series chronicles the incredible true story of Madam C.J. Walker, who was the first African American self-made millionaire.', 'This limited series chronicles the incredible true story of Madam C.J. Walker, who was the first African American self-made millionaire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2TMkFGAbsTfN3DHJu5AemEpdcEE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97539'),
  ('877975157330145506', 'Selfie', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Emily Kapnek', null, 'Karen Gillan, John Cho, David Harewood, Allyn Rachel, Da''Vine Joy Randolph', 'TV-14', 'After being the subject of an embarrassing viral video, a self-involved 20-something enlists the help of a marketing expert to revamp her image in the real world.', 'After being the subject of an embarrassing viral video, a self-involved 20-something enlists the help of a marketing expert to revamp her image in the real world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wMHyfRltVBvmlkDqMZgMGURnwHn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60793'),
  ('346710920853743380', 'Sell Your Haunted House', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Ha Soo-jin', 'Ha Soo-jin', 'Jang Na-ra, Jung Yong-hwa, Kang Mal-geum, Kang Hong-suk, An Kil-kang, Heo Dong-won, Baek Ji-won, Lee Chae-kyung', null, 'A real estate agent who rids haunted buildings of vengeful ghosts, partners with a con man to solve a 20-year-old case that is close to her heart.', 'A real estate agent who rids haunted buildings of vengeful ghosts, partners with a con man to solve a 20-year-old case that is close to her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHjLfJScdNrFWXd15nZfsqHgkNx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121695'),
  ('423084406285197269', 'Selling Houses Australia', 2008, null, null, null, null, null, 'Selling Houses Australia is an Australian TV show, based on the British show of the same name. The series follows property owners who are having difficulty selling their home. Led by property expert Andrew Winter, the team initially assess the property, and then proceed with a renovation to boost the property''s appeal and saleability. The property is then put up for sale and the result is shown at the end of each episode.', 'Selling Houses Australia is an Australian TV show, based on the British show of the same name. The series follows property owners who are having difficulty selling their home. Led by property expert Andrew Winter, the team initially assess the property, and then proceed with a renovation to boost the property''s appeal and saleability. The property is then put up for sale and the result is shown at the end of each episode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kK8dqnDzqiecpNZcuYaw3fRF9N7.jpg', 18, 'tmdb:tv:56578'),
  ('535162581216572235', 'Selling Sunset', 2019, 'Reality', 'Adam DiVello', null, 'Brett Oppenheim, Jason Oppenheim, Chrishell Stause, Mary Fitzgerald, Emma Hernan, Amanza Smith, Chelsea Lazkani, Bre Tiesi', 'TV-MA', 'The elite agents at The Oppenheim Group sell the luxe life to affluent buyers in LA. Relationships are everything, and that often means major drama.', 'The elite agents at The Oppenheim Group sell the luxe life to affluent buyers in LA. Relationships are everything, and that often means major drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wUtoD67q4BnRUwikUbT6M38d5oj.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:87826'),
  ('44074982066615674', 'Selling Tampa', 2021, 'Reality', null, null, 'Sharelle Rosado, Juawana Colbert, Rena Frazier, Colony Reeves, Anne-Sophie Petit-Frere, Tennille Moore, Karla Giorgio, Alexis Williams', null, 'The agents at the all-female, Black-owned Allure Realty mix business with fun as they rule the waterfront of a hot Tampa luxury real estate market.', 'The agents at the all-female, Black-owned Allure Realty mix business with fun as they rule the waterfront of a hot Tampa luxury real estate market.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/okYu24m3j0GqI8yxdaIhSRpKu51.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:139301'),
  ('737120515891753525', 'Selling the OC', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Brett Oppenheim, Jason Oppenheim, Alexandra Hall, Alexandra Jarvis, Alexandra Rose, Austin Victoria, Tyler Stanaland, Polly Brindle', 'TV-MA', 'A fresh set of realtors square off, competing to establish themselves at The Oppenheim Group’s second office on the Orange County coast. Will the pressure prove too much for these agents to handle?', 'A fresh set of realtors square off, competing to establish themselves at The Oppenheim Group’s second office on the Orange County coast. Will the pressure prove too much for these agents to handle?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFXa0EJy8FD7chTN7u7YNMHpDDw.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:139566'),
  ('1147491650880209507', 'Semantic Error', 2022, 'Drama', 'Jeo Soo-ri', 'Jeo Soo-ri', 'Park Seo-ham, Park Jae-chan, Song Ji-oh, Kim No-jin, Kim Won-gi, Choi Su-geon, Cha Jae-hoon, Jung Joon-gyo', null, 'Chu Sang U, a strict computer science student, clashes with design major Jang Jae Yeong after removing his name from a project, leading to unexpected sparks.', 'Chu Sang U, a strict computer science student, clashes with design major Jang Jae Yeong after removing his name from a project, leading to unexpected sparks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pe3w2PnXAdGyilHNuyLHNFVASnp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157208'),
  ('588500029266937186', 'Semi-Detached', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Ben Palmer', null, 'Lee Mack, Ellie White, Patrick Baladi, Neil Fitzmaurice, Sarah Hoare, Geoffrey McGivern, Clive Russell, Samantha Spiro', null, 'Unfolding in real time, divorcé Stuart''s life is complicated by his ex-wife living across the street, leading to farcical situations as he tries to navigate his new family life.', 'Unfolding in real time, divorcé Stuart''s life is complicated by his ex-wife living across the street, leading to farcical situations as he tries to navigate his new family life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sD6ZOta0LrLA46Nw6omyniuNAcG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107841'),
  ('758950699851228315', 'Sen Anlat Karadeniz', 2018, 'Drama', 'Nehir Erdem, Ayse Ferda Eryilmaz, Erkan Birgören', null, 'İrem Helvacıoğlu, Ulaş Tuna Astepe, Öykü Gürman, Sinan Tuzcu, Furkan Aksoy, Cem Kenar, Nalan Kuruçim, Erdal Cindoruk', 'NR', 'A victim of violence, Nefes fights with Vedat, a psychopath, for her son and herself. In this way, she will experience true love with Tahir, in the Black Sea Region, who will protect her from Vedat.', 'A victim of violence, Nefes fights with Vedat, a psychopath, for her son and herself. In this way, she will experience true love with Tahir, in the Black Sea Region, who will protect her from Vedat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1swrKrfaUbXvT9JqdI4XkXQUoK1.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:77026'),
  ('117280732197032064', 'Senda prohibida', 2023, 'Drama', 'Leticia López Margalli', null, null, 'TV-14', 'A girl leaves her town with the goal of succeeding in life. Upon arriving in Mexico City, thanks to her beauty and her good manners, she gets a job in an office where she falls in love with her boss.', 'A girl leaves her town with the goal of succeeding in life. Upon arriving in Mexico City, thanks to her beauty and her good manners, she gets a job in an office where she falls in love with her boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUn7V8q6nS76k9d4MsJjOdi94ZD.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:229373'),
  ('1152013370042197867', 'Sengoku BASARA: Samurai Kings', 2009, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, War & Politics', null, null, 'Kazuya Nakai, Soichiro Hoshi, Norio Wakamoto, Hiroki Shimowada, Ryuzou Ishino, Masakazu Morita, Takehito Koyasu', null, 'During the Sengoku period, there are many factions constantly at war. One of these is led by a one-eyed man named Date Masamune and another by the imposing Takeda Shingen. The latter has a fiercely loyal subordinate named Sanada Yukimura who goes head to head against Date Masamune multiple times, but the battles between them tend to get interrupted. One such battle occurs when both men try to go after another leader named Imagawa, and they’re forced to break off their heated duel when Imagawa attempts to flee the scene with his body doubles. Yukimura and Masamune go after separate Imagawas, but all of the doubles are killed by a third party, and when their paths cross again, they are in front of the menacing Oda Nobunaga and his army. It was Nobunaga’s subordinates that killed those body doubles, and Nobunaga himself proceeds to kill the real Imagawa with a shotgun blast to the head.', 'During the Sengoku period, there are many factions constantly at war. One of these is led by a one-eyed man named Date Masamune and another by the imposing Takeda Shingen. The latter has a fiercely loyal subordinate named Sanada Yukimura who goes head to head against Date Masamune multiple times, but the battles between them tend to get interrupted. One such battle occurs when both men try to go after another leader named Imagawa, and they’re forced to break off their heated duel when Imagawa attempts to flee the scene with his body doubles. Yukimura and Masamune go after separate Imagawas, but all of the doubles are killed by a third party, and when their paths cross again, they are in front of the menacing Oda Nobunaga and his army. It was Nobunaga’s subordinates that killed those body doubles, and Nobunaga himself proceeds to kill the real Imagawa with a shotgun blast to the head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFdT4pUHnUuACXiLTnzhTK75kpv.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:25492'),
  ('866217630365198785', 'Sengoku Youko', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Soma Saito, Yuuki Takada, Ryohei Kimura, Tomoyo Kurosawa, Hiroki Nanami, Maaya Uchida, Kenji Nomura, Aki Toyosaki', 'TV-14', 'Humans and katawara are at war, but there are those on each side who join forces. Tama is a fox spirit who loves humans, while her sendou brother, Jinka, despises them. Together, they use the power of spirit transformation to defeat the monstrous katawara and put an end to the evils of this chaotic age. What destiny awaits the duo at the end of their journey?', 'Humans and katawara are at war, but there are those on each side who join forces. Tama is a fox spirit who loves humans, while her sendou brother, Jinka, despises them. Together, they use the power of spirit transformation to defeat the monstrous katawara and put an end to the evils of this chaotic age. What destiny awaits the duo at the end of their journey?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLeQZRlvJmXnIIV65lNOO3RGrqP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:234995'),
  ('468617855734728906', 'Senior High', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Andrea Brillantes, Kyle Echarri, Daniela Stranner, Juan Karlos Labajo, Elijah Canlas, Zaijian Jaranilla, Xyriel Manabat, Miggy Jimenez', null, 'A student’s death causes a scandal at the prestigious Northford High. Investigations conclude it was a suicide. The victim’s twin sister thinks otherwise. As she searches for truth, she will unravel secrets that are far more shocking and dangerous.', 'A student’s death causes a scandal at the prestigious Northford High. Investigations conclude it was a suicide. The victim’s twin sister thinks otherwise. As she searches for truth, she will unravel secrets that are far more shocking and dangerous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k285iD6gZIoLsVSczSjc4WIXkdc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:226773'),
  ('1144672154268257060', 'Senior Secret Love', 2016, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Korn Sirisorn, Nachjaree Horvejkul, Atthaphan Phunsawat, Jumpol Adulkittiporn, Phakjira Kanrattanasoot, Phurikulkrit Chusakdiskulwibul, Harit Cheewagaroon, Perawat Sangpotirat', 'TV-G', 'Porsche is in danger of having his school club for taking care of stray cats and dogs shut down, by the school''s Dean. So Porsche and his best friend, Pik, try to recruit Emma and her best friend, Rome. This is because Emma''s uncle is the Dean. The catch--Emma loves cats but is terribly afraid of dogs. Will this be the end of Porsche''s dog and cat club or the start of a beautiful friendship between everyone? Or maybe even more?', 'Porsche is in danger of having his school club for taking care of stray cats and dogs shut down, by the school''s Dean. So Porsche and his best friend, Pik, try to recruit Emma and her best friend, Rome. This is because Emma''s uncle is the Dean. The catch--Emma loves cats but is terribly afraid of dogs. Will this be the end of Porsche''s dog and cat club or the start of a beautiful friendship between everyone? Or maybe even more?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hzQwsYIkhWuYBzd8kaBm9sWXkzv.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:69646'),
  ('370118489011854318', 'Senior Secret Love: Puppy Honey', 2016, 'Drama', null, null, 'Korn Sirisorn, Nachjaree Horvejkul, Jumpol Adulkittiporn, Atthaphan Phunsawat, Phurikulkrit Chusakdiskulwibul', null, 'Porsche is in danger of having his school club for taking care of stray cats and dogs shut down, by the school''s Dean. So Porsche and his best friend, Pik, try to recruit Emma and her best friend, Rome. This is because Emma''s uncle is the Dean. The catch--Emma loves cats but is terribly afraid of dogs. Will this be the end of Porsche''s dog and cat club or the start of a beautiful friendship between everyone? Or maybe even more?', 'Porsche is in danger of having his school club for taking care of stray cats and dogs shut down, by the school''s Dean. So Porsche and his best friend, Pik, try to recruit Emma and her best friend, Rome. This is because Emma''s uncle is the Dean. The catch--Emma loves cats but is terribly afraid of dogs. Will this be the end of Porsche''s dog and cat club or the start of a beautiful friendship between everyone? Or maybe even more?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5aZEv5svOjGK15oI6aF97MoEpyZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:125620'),
  ('298626054719038157', 'Senna', 2024, 'Drama', 'Vicente Amorim', 'Gustavo Bragança, Alvaro Campos, Álvaro Mamute', 'Gabriel Leone, Kaya Scodelario, Matt Mella, Patrick Kennedy, Arnaud Viard, Steven Mackintosh, Camila Márdila, Marco Ricca', 'TV-MA', 'Fascinated by cars since childhood, Brazilian racer Ayrton Senna became a sports legend — until tragedy struck, changing Formula 1 forever.', 'Fascinated by cars since childhood, Brazilian racer Ayrton Senna became a sports legend — until tragedy struck, changing Formula 1 forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmRfKme3j8mbTf4iTJd0L8wtaQa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211039'),
  ('660958895104833314', 'Senora Acero', 2014, 'Drama, Crime, Soap', 'Roberto Stopello', null, 'Carolina Miranda, Oscar Priego, Michel Duval, Alberto Agnesi, Blanca Soto, Diego Soldano, Rodrigo Guirao Díaz, Ana Lucía Domínguez', 'TV-MA', 'The adventures of Vicenta Acero, the feared coyote who now leads the dynasty of illicit dealings once under the control of her father.', 'The adventures of Vicenta Acero, the feared coyote who now leads the dynasty of illicit dealings once under the control of her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vXhBxsvpW2mGuXRbIK5Yazdp8Zg.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:63764'),
  ('718055272428006653', 'Señorita 89', 2022, 'Drama', 'Lucía Puenzo', null, 'Ximena Romo, Natasha Dupeyrón, Leidi Gutiérrez', null, 'A period drama set in the dark glamour of 1980s Mexico following the contestants training for the country’s Miss Mexico pageant as they vie not only to win - but to make it to the final contest alive.', 'A period drama set in the dark glamour of 1980s Mexico following the contestants training for the country’s Miss Mexico pageant as they vie not only to win - but to make it to the final contest alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Pe8NiIqGyavJdu0ujQr9PW2NBU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:155645'),
