  ('902576348872321043', 'Senpai Is an Otokonoko', 2024, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Shuichiro Umeda, Akira Sekine, Yuma Uchida', 'TV-14', 'For Makoto Hanaoka, life’s about to get more complicated. Saki Aoi, a lively girl with loads of confidence, confesses her love for Makoto one day. When he fails to reciprocate, Saki declares she will be his first love! She shares her goal with a mutual friend, Ryuji Taiga, who also confesses his crush on Makoto. Stuck in a love triangle, Makoto must find a way to make it work and have fun.', 'For Makoto Hanaoka, life’s about to get more complicated. Saki Aoi, a lively girl with loads of confidence, confesses her love for Makoto one day. When he fails to reciprocate, Saki declares she will be his first love! She shares her goal with a mutual friend, Ryuji Taiga, who also confesses his crush on Makoto. Stuck in a love triangle, Makoto must find a way to make it work and have fun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ZHylyosB06pSmBNCwY4lhFAjFq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:239761'),
  ('675244895225084004', 'Senpai, This Can''t Be Love!', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Shinta Harekawa', null, 'Shuichiro Naito, Toshiki Seto, Junya Asada, Satoshi Matsuda, Shu Watanabe, Taisuke Niihara, Rikako Sakata, Hitomi Uneda', null, 'Follow the unexpected romance between a new hire at a computer graphics company and a skilled designer over the course of 14 months.', 'Follow the unexpected romance between a new hire at a computer graphics company and a skilled designer over the course of 14 months.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozhg7PFiLgrIXcpGNr8US92jmfQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:202265'),
  ('462411126574106323', 'Senran Kagura: Ninja Flash', 2013, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Hitomi Harada, Asami Imai, Yu Kobayashi, Kaori Mizuhashi, Eri Kitamura', 'TV-14', 'The Hanzo Academy is a prestigious prep school with a secret known only to a select few. Behind its walls is a training course for shinobi; trained spies and assassins that centuries ago had served the shoguns for their political and military needs. Today the tradition continues with five young female trainees with diverse personalities: the care-free Asuka, fierce yet perverted Katsuragi, the sweet and innocent Hibari, stoic and protective Yagyuu, and their mature, class representative, Ikaruga.', 'The Hanzo Academy is a prestigious prep school with a secret known only to a select few. Behind its walls is a training course for shinobi; trained spies and assassins that centuries ago had served the shoguns for their political and military needs. Today the tradition continues with five young female trainees with diverse personalities: the care-free Asuka, fierce yet perverted Katsuragi, the sweet and innocent Hibari, stoic and protective Yagyuu, and their mature, class representative, Ikaruga.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v04svAk6eI1ptjmfjYeC4KIJYp9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:46065'),
  ('523399639221138442', 'Senryu Girl', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Tasuku Hatanaka, Misaki Kuno, Sumire Uesaka, Kana Hanazawa, Sayuri Yahagi, Rikako Aida, Suzuko Hara', null, 'At first glance Yukishiro Nanako seems like a normal high school girl, but she has a notable eccentricity: instead of speaking, she communicates only through written senryu poetry! This means she expresses herself only in 5-7-5 syllables. To most this might seem like an inconvenience, but for Nanako and her ex-delinquent bestie, Busujima Eiji, it adds to the experience of their high school lives as they run the Literature Club.', 'At first glance Yukishiro Nanako seems like a normal high school girl, but she has a notable eccentricity: instead of speaking, she communicates only through written senryu poetry! This means she expresses herself only in 5-7-5 syllables. To most this might seem like an inconvenience, but for Nanako and her ex-delinquent bestie, Busujima Eiji, it adds to the experience of their high school lives as they run the Literature Club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4W2mdiVE6vKnSumIQyD3g2S7Mw0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87445'),
  ('912076422320997147', 'Sense and Sensibility', 1981, 'Drama', 'Barry Letts', null, 'Irene Richard, Tracey Childs, Annie Leon', null, 'A story of two sisters attempting to find happiness in the tightly structured society of 18th century England. Elinor, disciplined, restrained and very conscious of the manners of the day, represents sense. Outspoken, impetuous, emotional Marianne represents sensibility.', 'A story of two sisters attempting to find happiness in the tightly structured society of 18th century England. Elinor, disciplined, restrained and very conscious of the manners of the day, represents sense. Outspoken, impetuous, emotional Marianne represents sensibility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fAjue1bTpD8e8jELPXos7BchOcf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14201'),
  ('127802597567866275', 'Sense and Sensibility', 2008, 'Drama', 'Andrew Davies', 'Andrew Davies', 'Hattie Morahan, Charity Wakefield, Dan Stevens, David Morrissey, Lucy Boynton, Janet McTeer, Linda Bassett, Claire Skinner', null, 'Sense and Sensibility is a 2008 British television drama, based on Jane Austen''s 1811 novel of the same name. The screenplay was written by Andrew Davies, who said that the aim of the series was to make viewers forget Ang Lee''s 1995 film version. As such, this series was more overtly sexual than previous Austen adaptations, and Davies included scenes featuring a seduction and a duel that are suggested in Austen''s novel but absent from the feature film. A story of two sisters attempting to find happiness in the tightly structured society of 18th century England. Elinor, disciplined, restrained and very conscious of the manners of the day, represents sense. Outspoken, impetuous, emotional Marianne represents sensibility.', 'Sense and Sensibility is a 2008 British television drama, based on Jane Austen''s 1811 novel of the same name. The screenplay was written by Andrew Davies, who said that the aim of the series was to make viewers forget Ang Lee''s 1995 film version. As such, this series was more overtly sexual than previous Austen adaptations, and Davies included scenes featuring a seduction and a duel that are suggested in Austen''s novel but absent from the feature film. A story of two sisters attempting to find happiness in the tightly structured society of 18th century England. Elinor, disciplined, restrained and very conscious of the manners of the day, represents sense. Outspoken, impetuous, emotional Marianne represents sensibility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/orYPEKHsB734AFFINcCbjT57Ifa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13892'),
  ('610002648513662886', 'Sense8', 2015, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Lana Wachowski, Lilly Wachowski, J. Michael Straczynski', null, 'Miguel Ángel Silvestre, Max Riemelt, Jamie Clayton, Bae Doona, Brian J. Smith, Tuppence Middleton, Tina Desai, Freema Agyeman', 'TV-MA', 'One gunshot, one death, one moment out of time that irrevocably links eight minds in disparate parts of the world, putting them in each other''s lives, each other''s secrets, and in terrible danger. Ordinary people suddenly reborn as "Sensates."', 'One gunshot, one death, one moment out of time that irrevocably links eight minds in disparate parts of the world, putting them in each other''s lives, each other''s secrets, and in terrible danger. Ordinary people suddenly reborn as "Sensates."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmyvlQ9QKzgdZY31rXaUlgCnzrB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61664'),
  ('137840228390785991', 'Sensualità a corte', 2005, null, 'Marcello Cesena', 'Marcello Cesena', 'Marcello Cesena, Simona Garbarino, Simonetta Guarino, Marcella Silvestri, Fabrizio Lo Presti, Mauro Pirovano', null, 'Sensualità a corte is an Italian television series.', 'Sensualità a corte is an Italian television series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6W5XCwGAWfoBo9Pr3wA4LlamS5r.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:41487'),
  ('285346910321851708', 'Sentenced to Be a Hero', 2026, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yohei Azakami, Mayu Iizuka, Shizuka Ishigami, Shun Horie, Shunichi Toki, Yoji Ueda, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Jun Fukushima', 'TV-14', 'In a world where heroism is a punishment, Xylo Forbartz, a condemned goddess killer, battles endless hordes of monstrous abominations as part of Penal Hero Unit 9004. Death is no escape, only a cycle of resurrection and relentless combat. But when Xylo encounters a mysterious new goddess, their unlikely alliance sparks a rebellion that could shatter the chains of eternal punishment.', 'In a world where heroism is a punishment, Xylo Forbartz, a condemned goddess killer, battles endless hordes of monstrous abominations as part of Penal Hero Unit 9004. Death is no escape, only a cycle of resurrection and relentless combat. But when Xylo encounters a mysterious new goddess, their unlikely alliance sparks a rebellion that could shatter the chains of eternal punishment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzyNxTZFcWjkYJU9T9aJ8vXTAFN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:249907'),
  ('924877633454169715', 'Sentimientos Ajenos', null, null, null, null, null, null, 'Sentimientos Ajenos is a Mexican telenovela produced by Televisa in 1996 which starred Carlos Ponce and Yolanda Andrade. Although the plot was twisted and sometimes absurd, it successfully took rating away from the time''s toughest competitor in terms of telenovela ratings, TV Azteca. The theme song, Sin Amor, was sung by Aranza, who would later move to TV Azteca and sing the theme song for one of Mexico''s most important telenovelas, Mirada de Mujer.', 'Sentimientos Ajenos is a Mexican telenovela produced by Televisa in 1996 which starred Carlos Ponce and Yolanda Andrade. Although the plot was twisted and sometimes absurd, it successfully took rating away from the time''s toughest competitor in terms of telenovela ratings, TV Azteca. The theme song, Sin Amor, was sung by Aranza, who would later move to TV Azteca and sing the theme song for one of Mexico''s most important telenovelas, Mirada de Mujer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eiuTbmgCGgy2xA3BmdI2WfFpfoa.jpg', 0, 'tmdb:tv:16046'),
  ('750553985149174537', 'Senya Fedya', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Anton Fedotov', null, 'Sergey Lavygin, Mikhail Tarabukin, Anna Begunova, Anna Starshenbaum, Andrey Fedortsov, Anatoly Kot, Klim Poplavskiy, Boris Zverev', 'TV-MA', 'Famous chefs Senya and Fedya from the series Kukhnya, continue their independent business story', 'Famous chefs Senya and Fedya from the series Kukhnya, continue their independent business story', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26IDaWHuMlnR5JcJ7j4Ux2e3p8J.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:84315'),
  ('1021390793355511032', 'Senyu.', 2013, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuichi Nakamura, Hiro Shimono, Ai Kayano, Yumi Uchiyama, Hiroshi Okamoto, Yuka Terasaki, Kenichi Suzumura, Emiri Kato', null, 'In the story, a gigantic hole suddenly opened up in the world one day, and demons appeared. The king thinks that this portends the return of the demon king Rukimedesu, who was sealed away by the hero Kureashion a millenium ago. The king decreed that the descendants of the hero must take on the threat, and 75 people showed up. Hero No. 45 (Aruba) and a sadistic palace warrior (Ross) team up, and their adventure begins.', 'In the story, a gigantic hole suddenly opened up in the world one day, and demons appeared. The king thinks that this portends the return of the demon king Rukimedesu, who was sealed away by the hero Kureashion a millenium ago. The king decreed that the descendants of the hero must take on the threat, and 75 people showed up. Hero No. 45 (Aruba) and a sadistic palace warrior (Ross) team up, and their adventure begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y8dIPo8iW3qDqSINLdGhn2Dlxve.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:52883'),
  ('1041657835882537954', 'Seoksam Play', 2025, 'Reality', null, null, 'Jee Seok-jin, Jeon So-min, Lee Sang-yeob, Lee Mi-joo', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjw1Qf9TULqavNFmwFSefHLVfrR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:298177'),
  ('9127511892081419', 'Seoul Busters', 2024, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Lee Ok-gyu', 'Lee Young-chul, Lee Kwang-jae', 'Kim Dong-wook, Park Ji-hwan, Seo Hyun-woo, Park Se-wan, Lee Seung-woo, Son Eun-seo, Kim Seung-hwa, Kim Ra-on', null, 'Songwon Police Violent Crimes Unit 2 has the lowest arrest rate in the country. After their chief is demoted, the team is exiled to a closed daycare center. Enter Yubin, their new leader. Despite the team''s initial distrust, Yubin and the team start to bond as they solve cases together.', 'Songwon Police Violent Crimes Unit 2 has the lowest arrest rate in the country. After their chief is demoted, the team is exiled to a closed daycare center. Enter Yubin, their new leader. Despite the team''s initial distrust, Yubin and the team start to bond as they solve cases together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYDvkvutYQNKj2lhQTavGzgUE6L.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:239005'),
  ('1038384008799787424', 'Seoul Trip', 2026, 'Drama', '강이선', '강이선', '우기, 김도진', null, 'On the first day of my trip to Seoul, I chased down a man I mistook for a pickpocket, only to end up spending the night with him. To my horror, I later found my wallet tucked safely in my bag—and discovered he was actually waiting for an "outcall service." The moment I’m forced to pay my debt with my body instead of cash, a disastrous misunderstanding spirals into a dangerous Seoul affair.', 'On the first day of my trip to Seoul, I chased down a man I mistook for a pickpocket, only to end up spending the night with him. To my horror, I later found my wallet tucked safely in my bag—and discovered he was actually waiting for an "outcall service." The moment I’m forced to pay my debt with my body instead of cash, a disastrous misunderstanding spirals into a dangerous Seoul affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/enC0hkmDwBQIT0cz2V0vyIvKQwT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317277'),
  ('927695573129753398', 'September Mornings', 2021, 'Drama', null, 'Marcelo Montenegro', 'Liniker, Gustavo Coelho, Seu Jorge, Karine Teles, Thomás Aquino, Elisa Lucinda, Inara Dos Santos, Samantha Schmütz', null, 'The journey of Cassandra, who starts to see things get on track in her life with a place of her own for the first time, a boyfriend who she loves, Ivaldo, a job as a courier in downtown São Paulo, and fulfilling her dream of being a cover artist of Vanusa, a famous Brazilian singer from the 70s. Her life takes an unexpected turn, however, when her ex, Leide, shows up with Gersinho and claims he is Cassandra’s son.', 'The journey of Cassandra, who starts to see things get on track in her life with a place of her own for the first time, a boyfriend who she loves, Ivaldo, a job as a courier in downtown São Paulo, and fulfilling her dream of being a cover artist of Vanusa, a famous Brazilian singer from the 70s. Her life takes an unexpected turn, however, when her ex, Leide, shows up with Gersinho and claims he is Cassandra’s son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgwKqw4Q9Xk63T5iD9tHaMMkjb3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:118102'),
  ('504749390690349018', 'Sequestered', 2014, null, 'Aaron Tracy', null, 'Mustafa Elzein, Summer Glau, Patrick Warburton, Lindsay Bushman, Rhonda Aldrich, Bruce Davison, Jesse Bradford, Chum Ehelepola', null, 'A jury is sequestered in a hotel while deliberating a court case with massive implications.', 'A jury is sequestered in a hotel while deliberating a court case with massive implications.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jc7PG1JUnzsqcQIpKHq3iGLMya0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61187'),
  ('48870836397393732', 'Seraph of the End', 2015, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Miyu Irino, Kensho Ono, Yuichi Nakamura, Takahiro Sakurai, Saori Hayami, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Kaito Ishikawa, Yuka Iguchi', 'TV-14', 'After a mysterious virus wipes out ninety percent of humanity, vampires emerge from the recesses of the earth to enslave mankind, treating them like livestock. After growing tired of donating blood in exchange for protection, 12-year-old Yuichiro Hyakuya and his best friend Mikaela Hyakuya plot an escape along with the other orphans. After being the only successful runaway, Yuichiro joins the Moon Demon Company, an extermination unit of the Japanese Imperial Demon Army dedicated to killing off vampires.', 'After a mysterious virus wipes out ninety percent of humanity, vampires emerge from the recesses of the earth to enslave mankind, treating them like livestock. After growing tired of donating blood in exchange for protection, 12-year-old Yuichiro Hyakuya and his best friend Mikaela Hyakuya plot an escape along with the other orphans. After being the only successful runaway, Yuichiro joins the Moon Demon Company, an extermination unit of the Japanese Imperial Demon Army dedicated to killing off vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5IlxL2PfQ8CyY4TLRru9TcU56b3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62255'),
  ('612833470098069719', 'Serendipity', 2025, 'Drama', 'Luo Ri Qiang Wei', null, 'Wang Ziqi, Lu Yuxiao, Wang Hongyi, Kong Xue''er, Yang Shize, He Qiu, Wang Xichao, Liao Huijia', null, 'Jian Mingshu, the daughter of the Jian family, loses her memory after a fall and is saved by her beloved, Lu Shang. They travel to the capital for their studies, where Jian Mingshu uncovers clues about her identity. With Lu Shang''s silent support, their bond deepens as they face challenges together, leading to a lasting relationship.', 'Jian Mingshu, the daughter of the Jian family, loses her memory after a fall and is saved by her beloved, Lu Shang. They travel to the capital for their studies, where Jian Mingshu uncovers clues about her identity. With Lu Shang''s silent support, their bond deepens as they face challenges together, leading to a lasting relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8UI6TyuSUVVrc8Ed1XP8KzT0hvf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:252920'),
  ('59470645120164391', 'Serendipity''s Embrace', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nam Ji-eun, Song Hyun-wook', 'Park Geu-ro', 'Kim So-hyun, Chae Jong-hyeop, Yun Ji-on, Kim Da-som, Lee Won-jeong, Hwang Sung-bin, Choi Dae-chul, Yoon Jung-hee', 'TV-14', 'After 10 years in the US, Hu-young returns to Korea and meets his first love, Hong-ju, at a café by chance. Just as the window into which Peter Pan flew happened to be Wendy''s room. Just as the prince happened to find Cinderella''s glass shoes. As if nothing had changed in the past 10 years, Hu-young becomes clumsier only in front of Hong-ju. It’s like going back to the age of 19 when he met his first love, Hong-ju. Hu-young and Hong-ju’s days, which have faded a little, begin to turn into vivid rainbow colors again.', 'After 10 years in the US, Hu-young returns to Korea and meets his first love, Hong-ju, at a café by chance. Just as the window into which Peter Pan flew happened to be Wendy''s room. Just as the prince happened to find Cinderella''s glass shoes. As if nothing had changed in the past 10 years, Hu-young becomes clumsier only in front of Hong-ju. It’s like going back to the age of 19 when he met his first love, Hong-ju. Hu-young and Hong-ju’s days, which have faded a little, begin to turn into vivid rainbow colors again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOitjGRuMycmgMK7QdaHgt82fyF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211065'),
  ('659908187801577058', 'Serengeti', 2019, 'Documentary', 'John Downer, Simon Fuller', null, 'Adjoa Andoh', 'TV-PG', 'Capturing the high drama of the Serengeti’s distinctive wildlife up close.', 'Capturing the high drama of the Serengeti’s distinctive wildlife up close.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31ckbBXdYq9iMCrXVBgpBiTpMsU.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:90846'),
