  ('536282128005012744', 'Shachibato! President, It''s Time for Battle!', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Sumire Uesaka, Azumi Waki, Yui Horie, Yoshino Aoyama, Shun Horie, Kana Ichinose, Taku Yashiro', 'TV-14', 'Based on the popular strategy game, Minato has become the new president of the Kibou Company. In order to be a good president and help the company grow, he must lead his party of adventurers through the Gate and collect Kirakuri — a type of energy that is extremely valuable and fundamental to the city of Gatepia. However, there are other companies vying for the chance to gather the Kirakuri.', 'Based on the popular strategy game, Minato has become the new president of the Kibou Company. In order to be a good president and help the company grow, he must lead his party of adventurers through the Gate and collect Kirakuri — a type of energy that is extremely valuable and fundamental to the city of Gatepia. However, there are other companies vying for the chance to gather the Kirakuri.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPct2dcnBvGuS1prYtNyiI1TTgj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98584'),
