  ('1007380763340048229', 'Shades', 2025, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Sergio Cánovas, Javier Naya, Álex Meriweather', null, 'Elsa Pataky, Eusebio Poncela, Hovik Keuchkerian, Luis Tosar, Maxi Iglesias, Miriam Giovanelli, Enrique Arce, Juana Acosta', null, 'Matices tells the story of a renowned and charismatic psychiatrist who gathers six of his patients together at a remote winery to complete their treatment with his famous method, which has achieved a very high cure rate among the most complex and difficult-to-manage patients. After an unusual ceremonial tasting, an unexpected turn of events occurs with a fateful ending. Following the arrival of an astute police inspector who takes over the case, the truth is uncovered about the doctor and his patients’ traumas.', 'Matices tells the story of a renowned and charismatic psychiatrist who gathers six of his patients together at a remote winery to complete their treatment with his famous method, which has achieved a very high cure rate among the most complex and difficult-to-manage patients. After an unusual ceremonial tasting, an unexpected turn of events occurs with a fateful ending. Following the arrival of an astute police inspector who takes over the case, the truth is uncovered about the doctor and his patients’ traumas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvT0eKDjW9fs4Dmi6x9XCLGK3nA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259854'),
