  ('739456905271181077', 'Shark Tank México', 2016, 'Reality', 'Mark Burnett', null, 'Marcus Dantus, Amaury Vergara, Alejandra Ríos, Marisa Lazo', null, 'Entrepeneurs present their business breaktroughts to five of the biggest Mexican Investors in order to partner and grow their brands.', 'Entrepeneurs present their business breaktroughts to five of the biggest Mexican Investors in order to partner and grow their brands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjyqGWzbwSMDc9GMd8D8CMVUTvD.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:107347'),
  ('705302800300224516', 'Shark Week', 1988, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'The Discovery Channel''s Shark Week, first broadcast on July 17, 1987, is a weeklong series of feature television programs dedicated to sharks. Held annually, normally in July or August, Shark Week was originally developed to raise awareness and respect for sharks. It is the longest-running cable television programming event in history. Now broadcast in over 72 countries, Shark Week is promoted heavily via social networks like Facebook and Twitter.', 'The Discovery Channel''s Shark Week, first broadcast on July 17, 1987, is a weeklong series of feature television programs dedicated to sharks. Held annually, normally in July or August, Shark Week was originally developed to raise awareness and respect for sharks. It is the longest-running cable television programming event in history. Now broadcast in over 72 countries, Shark Week is promoted heavily via social networks like Facebook and Twitter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRAOmmAVxpYKHRT1ZIbcWz4pUTe.jpg', 38, 'tmdb:tv:15871'),
  ('120421931054253423', 'Shark: The Storm', 2025, 'Drama, Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Kim Geon', null, 'Kim Min-seok, Lee Hyun-wook, Jung Won-chang, Bae Myeong-jin, Lee Jung-hyun, Park Jin, Wi Ha-jun, Jo Yoon-seo', null, 'An action noir about the life of Cha Woo-sol, who was born again after meeting martial arts champion Jeong Do-hyeon in a juvenile prison.', 'An action noir about the life of Cha Woo-sol, who was born again after meeting martial arts champion Jeong Do-hyeon in a juvenile prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iG7BrHe92jVFNAHMsFxsvBA9NL8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:212957'),
  ('322358305418404518', 'Sharkdog', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Kids', 'Jacinth Tan', null, 'Dee Bradley Baker, Liam Mitchell, Kari Wahlgren, Judy Alice Lee, Liz Burnette, Donna Jay Fulks, Aly Mawji', 'TV-Y', '10 year old Max and his best friend Sharkdog - half shark, half dog, all appetite. Blissfully unaware of his own strength, stealth and general sharkiness, Sharkdog often leaves a trail of chaos in his wake.', '10 year old Max and his best friend Sharkdog - half shark, half dog, all appetite. Blissfully unaware of his own strength, stealth and general sharkiness, Sharkdog often leaves a trail of chaos in his wake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdkeBd7XZ6CmSE1a36rGG4bjqbb.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:130688'),
  ('153426248359202854', 'Sharp', 2003, null, null, 'Kim Kyeong-hee', null, null, 'Lee Ok Rim is 15 years old. She likes imaging and has bright personality. She is very frank about her feelings. She also knows that she is pretty and uses that. At home she is the second child who is placed between an older sister who studies well and a twin younger brother. Ok-Rim has a boyfriend Yoo Ah In who is studying painting in high school. Ok Rim also has a long time male friend named Jangwook. Between Yu Ah In and Jangwook she is not sure about her feelings. Jangwook is stubborn, shy, but cool. Since moving next door to Ok Rim, they have become best friends and knows all of her secrets. Like boys around his age, Jang-Wook likes soccer and gets into mischief. He is also warm and becasue of that Jangwook is popular among his peers. Yoo Ah In is a sophomore in high school studying painting and Ok-Rim''s boyfriend. He makes jokes and is sociable, but does not talk about what is really on his mind. Ah In started paining late, but with intelligence and persistence he has won the several contests. Ah In is mature and smarter than his girl friend Ok-Rim, so he controls their relationship. But, there is rival Jangwook and Ah In tries his best to hold onto Ok Rim''s affections. (Source: http://wiki.d-addicts.com/Sharp_1)', 'Lee Ok Rim is 15 years old. She likes imaging and has bright personality. She is very frank about her feelings. She also knows that she is pretty and uses that. At home she is the second child who is placed between an older sister who studies well and a twin younger brother. Ok-Rim has a boyfriend Yoo Ah In who is studying painting in high school. Ok Rim also has a long time male friend named Jangwook. Between Yu Ah In and Jangwook she is not sure about her feelings. Jangwook is stubborn, shy, but cool. Since moving next door to Ok Rim, they have become best friends and knows all of her secrets. Like boys around his age, Jang-Wook likes soccer and gets into mischief. He is also warm and becasue of that Jangwook is popular among his peers. Yoo Ah In is a sophomore in high school studying painting and Ok-Rim''s boyfriend. He makes jokes and is sociable, but does not talk about what is really on his mind. Ah In started paining late, but with intelligence and persistence he has won the several contests. Ah In is mature and smarter than his girl friend Ok-Rim, so he controls their relationship. But, there is rival Jangwook and Ah In tries his best to hold onto Ok Rim''s affections. (Source: http://wiki.d-addicts.com/Sharp_1)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRyIfudaIph10iTZgpKJDquQHtf.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:52723'),
  ('838720637410830620', 'Sharp Objects', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Marti Noxon', null, 'Amy Adams, Patricia Clarkson, Chris Messina, Eliza Scanlen, Matt Craven, Henry Czerny, Taylor John Smith, Madison Davenport', 'TV-MA', 'Reporter Camille Preaker confronts the psychological demons from her past when she returns to her hometown to investigate the murders of two young girls.', 'Reporter Camille Preaker confronts the psychological demons from her past when she returns to her hometown to investigate the murders of two young girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SGovj2qDdkJexvhFiXllj9EYfu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70453'),
  ('1041948155818924563', 'Sharpe', 1993, 'War & Politics, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Sean Bean, Daragh O''Malley', null, 'Sharpe is a British series of television dramas starring Sean Bean as Richard Sharpe, a fictional British soldier in the Napoleonic Wars. Sharpe is the hero of a number of novels by Bernard Cornwell; most, though not all, of the episodes are based on the books. Produced by Celtic Films and Picture Palace Films for the ITV network, the series was shot mainly in Turkey and the Crimea, although some filming was also done in England, Spain and Portugal. The series originally ran from 1993 to 1997. In 2004, as part of ITV''s new set of drama, ITV announced that it intended to produce new episodes of Sharpe, in co-production with BBC America, loosely based on his time in India, with Sean Bean continuing his role as Sharpe. Sharpe''s Challenge is a two-part adventure; part one premiered on ITV on 23 April 2006, with part two being shown the following night. With more gore than earlier episodes, the show was broadcast by BBC America in September 2006.', 'Sharpe is a British series of television dramas starring Sean Bean as Richard Sharpe, a fictional British soldier in the Napoleonic Wars. Sharpe is the hero of a number of novels by Bernard Cornwell; most, though not all, of the episodes are based on the books. Produced by Celtic Films and Picture Palace Films for the ITV network, the series was shot mainly in Turkey and the Crimea, although some filming was also done in England, Spain and Portugal. The series originally ran from 1993 to 1997. In 2004, as part of ITV''s new set of drama, ITV announced that it intended to produce new episodes of Sharpe, in co-production with BBC America, loosely based on his time in India, with Sean Bean continuing his role as Sharpe. Sharpe''s Challenge is a two-part adventure; part one premiered on ITV on 23 April 2006, with part two being shown the following night. With more gore than earlier episodes, the show was broadcast by BBC America in September 2006.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/adoq3P4qCeDquGXjtcwDDXECESH.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:225'),
  ('831013048151829613', 'Shaun the Sheep', 2007, 'Kids, Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Richard Starzak', null, null, 'TV-G', 'Shaun the Sheep thinks and acts like a person in a barnyard, which usually gets him into trouble. The farmer''s sheepdog, Bitzer, tries to keep Shaun and his friends out of trouble. The farmer is oblivious to the humanlike features of his flock, who are like one big, happy family.', 'Shaun the Sheep thinks and acts like a person in a barnyard, which usually gets him into trouble. The farmer''s sheepdog, Bitzer, tries to keep Shaun and his friends out of trouble. The farmer is oblivious to the humanlike features of his flock, who are like one big, happy family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2gPfTQd3I0JLWOAEdKYMQRLoun.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:3902'),
  ('494047810353671435', 'Shaun the Sheep Championsheeps', 2012, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Richard Starzak, Alison Snowden, David Fine', null, null, null, 'Shaun and friends are abuzz with sporting excitement and decide to stage their own competition on the farm. As tenacious and imaginative as ever, Shaun and friends perform a series of spectacular sporting events in their very own, self-built stadium. With all the thrills and spills of sport, Shaun and friends strive for victory – all the while making sure the Farmer doesn’t find out what they’re up to!', 'Shaun and friends are abuzz with sporting excitement and decide to stage their own competition on the farm. As tenacious and imaginative as ever, Shaun and friends perform a series of spectacular sporting events in their very own, self-built stadium. With all the thrills and spills of sport, Shaun and friends strive for victory – all the while making sure the Farmer doesn’t find out what they’re up to!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUhpRAYVdYNeRHkJBqkoVY26WUM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82679'),
  ('552824570512215573', 'Shaun the Sheep: Adventures from Mossy Bottom', 2020, 'Animation, Kids', 'Richard Starzak, Alison Snowden, David Fine', null, null, 'TV-Y7', 'Clever sheep Shaun, loyal dog Bitzer and the rest of the Mossy Bottom gang cook up oodles of fun and mischief on the farm.', 'Clever sheep Shaun, loyal dog Bitzer and the rest of the Mossy Bottom gang cook up oodles of fun and mischief on the farm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jaRbqGU3eGdSBycsqpopFHXzbnk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100605'),
  ('698141941834935917', 'Shazam!', 1974, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Michael Gray, Les Tremayne, John Davey', 'TV-G', 'The live-action adventures of Captain Marvel! By uttering a single magic word young Billy Batson transforms himself into the world''s mightiest mortal, Captain Marvel. The acronym of the first letters of the names of the six elders who train Billy with their respective special gifts: Solomon, wisdom; Hercules, strength; Atlas, stamina; Zeus, power; Achilles, courage; and Mercury, speed, in a word ... SHAZAM!', 'The live-action adventures of Captain Marvel! By uttering a single magic word young Billy Batson transforms himself into the world''s mightiest mortal, Captain Marvel. The acronym of the first letters of the names of the six elders who train Billy with their respective special gifts: Solomon, wisdom; Hercules, strength; Atlas, stamina; Zeus, power; Achilles, courage; and Mercury, speed, in a word ... SHAZAM!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXNoY4ThylStpcDKrGJ3LIYiasE.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:10444'),
  ('582212084311864742', 'Shazzan', 1967, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Alex Toth', null, 'Janet Waldo, Jerry Dexter, Barney Phillips, Don Messick', null, 'Shazzan is an American animated television series, created by Alex Toth and produced by Hanna-Barbera Productions in 1967 for CBS. The series follows the adventures of two teenage siblings, Chuck and Nancy, traveling around a mystical Arabian world, mounted on Kaboobie the flying camel. During their journey they face several dangers, but they are always helped by Shazzan, a genie with magical powers out of this world. Shazzan is not to be confused with Shazam!, the 1970s comic book/television revival of Golden Age super hero Captain Marvel, created by C. C. Beck and Bill Parker.', 'Shazzan is an American animated television series, created by Alex Toth and produced by Hanna-Barbera Productions in 1967 for CBS. The series follows the adventures of two teenage siblings, Chuck and Nancy, traveling around a mystical Arabian world, mounted on Kaboobie the flying camel. During their journey they face several dangers, but they are always helped by Shazzan, a genie with magical powers out of this world. Shazzan is not to be confused with Shazam!, the 1970s comic book/television revival of Golden Age super hero Captain Marvel, created by C. C. Beck and Bill Parker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2zpBnUPAosN5ijxtLLwwibPV0b.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10501'),
  ('881974390560327450', 'She', 2020, 'Crime, Drama', 'Imtiaz Ali', null, 'Aaditi Pohankar, Vishwas Kini, Shivani Rangole, Kishore, Sam Mohan, Resh Lamba, Mohammad Ali Baig, Yuvaraj Gupta', 'TV-MA', 'An undercover assignment to expose a drug ring becomes a timid Mumbai constable''s road to empowerment as she realizes her dormant sexuality''s potential.', 'An undercover assignment to expose a drug ring becomes a timid Mumbai constable''s road to empowerment as she realizes her dormant sexuality''s potential.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/YMDfnHowqwi4xRwbZhyFuz15J8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:100729'),
  ('893143628151591815', 'She and Her Cat: Everything Flows', 2016, 'Animation', null, null, 'Kana Hanazawa, Shintaro Asanuma, Sayuri Yahagi, Akiko Hiramatsu', null, 'The simple, charming series follows Kanojo as she job hunts and experiences various changes in her life, all while her cat Daru remains the supportive constant.', 'The simple, charming series follows Kanojo as she job hunts and experiences various changes in her life, all while her cat Daru remains the supportive constant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pn4NyadZRiEWEvWNBYXgszQ6xVO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67534'),
  ('351001253079293716', 'She and Her Perfect Husband', 2022, 'Family, Drama', null, 'Zhu Li', 'Yang Mi, Xu Kai, Li Zefeng, Tang Jingmei, Wang Zixuan, Zhang Bojia, Li Xiaofeng, He Fengtian', null, 'Elite lawyer Qin Shi and resident homebody Yang Hua who got "married" for their own purposes unexpectedly find true love in each other. Together, they walk hand in hand towards a happy and fruitful life.', 'Elite lawyer Qin Shi and resident homebody Yang Hua who got "married" for their own purposes unexpectedly find true love in each other. Together, they walk hand in hand towards a happy and fruitful life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgCMrQufjgATGKv1nYVGQnSfHB4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127814'),
  ('476357275392034226', 'She Knows Everything', 2020, 'Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Kang Sung-yeon, Jo Han-sun, Kim Do-wan, Park Shin-ah, Yang Jae-young, Kim So-min, Bae Yoon-kyung, Kim Kyu-seon', null, 'Mysterious cases take place at an apartment complex which is about to go under reconstruction. Lee Goong-Bok is a real estate agent that works with apartments there. She has a meddlesome type of personality. In Cheol-Ho is a veteran detective.', 'Mysterious cases take place at an apartment complex which is about to go under reconstruction. Lee Goong-Bok is a real estate agent that works with apartments there. She has a meddlesome type of personality. In Cheol-Ho is a veteran detective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pYbaPdAN3M5FJ6IFLJCoAwjUTBM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:104308'),
  ('332388661744759154', 'She Loves to Cook, and She Loves to Eat', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Yuri Yamada', 'Manami Higa, Nishino Emi, Misato Morita, Karin Fujiyoshi, Rie Tomosaka', null, 'Cooking is how Nomoto de-stresses, but one day, she finds herself making way more than she can eat by herself. And so, she invites her neighbor Kasuga, who also lives alone. What will come out of this impromptu dinner invitation...?', 'Cooking is how Nomoto de-stresses, but one day, she finds herself making way more than she can eat by herself. And so, she invites her neighbor Kasuga, who also lives alone. What will come out of this impromptu dinner invitation...?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHi0EOih6zhlgWJ34pnsf9Ii7P3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:212765'),
  ('206468365758633830', 'SHE Must Be Obeyed', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Funke Akindele, Lateef Adedimeji, Nancy Isime, Akah Anani, Patience Ozokwor, Mike Ezuronye, Rachael Okonkwo', null, 'The story of Victoria''s insatiable ambition to rise in the entertainment industry following her training as a personal assistant to a high-powered executive.', 'The story of Victoria''s insatiable ambition to rise in the entertainment industry following her training as a personal assistant to a high-powered executive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7qwfs9IIZLaGYSol4k6VITWUAQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:235728'),
  ('507320957736242239', 'She Professed Herself Pupil of the Wise Man', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Hirotsugu Ryusen', 'Nichika Omori, Ayumu Murase, Minami Hinata, Yui Horie, Ayane Sakura, Junichi Saito, Hiroki Yasumoto, Yae Sakura', 'TV-14', 'Kagami Sakamori was one of the top players in the VRMMO Ark Earth Online as Danblf, a veteran summoner with the gravitas to match his elite status. When he falls asleep playing one day, he''s transported to a world where the game is reality—but instead of his all-powerful avatar, he''s stuck in the body of a cute young girl! He can''t let anyone know that this little cutie is really Danblf, so he takes the name “Mira” and claims to be Danblf''s disciple. If this gets out, he''ll never live it down!', 'Kagami Sakamori was one of the top players in the VRMMO Ark Earth Online as Danblf, a veteran summoner with the gravitas to match his elite status. When he falls asleep playing one day, he''s transported to a world where the game is reality—but instead of his all-powerful avatar, he''s stuck in the body of a cute young girl! He can''t let anyone know that this little cutie is really Danblf, so he takes the name “Mira” and claims to be Danblf''s disciple. If this gets out, he''ll never live it down!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j8QFzP0Jh80hYZtwI6UF8R81Ahw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:104032'),
  ('267718883466538195', 'She Spies', 2002, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Steven Long Mitchell, Vince Manze, Craig W. Van Sickle', null, 'Natasha Henstridge, Kristen Miller, Natashia Williams', null, 'She Spies is an action-adventure television show that ran from September 9, 2002 until May 17, 2004, in two seasons. The show was sold into syndication but the first four episodes premiered on the NBC network, whose syndication arm was one of the producers. Disappointing ratings during the show''s second season led to its cancellation after season two ended. She Spies bore noticeable production and directive similarities with Charlie''s Angels.', 'She Spies is an action-adventure television show that ran from September 9, 2002 until May 17, 2004, in two seasons. The show was sold into syndication but the first four episodes premiered on the NBC network, whose syndication arm was one of the producers. Disappointing ratings during the show''s second season led to its cancellation after season two ended. She Spies bore noticeable production and directive similarities with Charlie''s Angels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5jLMLqMhFOq4zLr9bvEgPOaSzB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:476'),
  ('935597077077658512', 'She Was Pretty', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Jo Sung-hee', 'Hwang Jung-eum, Park Seo-jun, Choi Si-won, Go Joon-hee, Shin Dong-mi, Ahn Se-ha, Kang Soo Jin, Shin Hye-sun', 'NR', 'After a complete reversal of fortune and looks, childhood sweethearts reunite for the first time in 15 years as employees at a fashion magazine.', 'After a complete reversal of fortune and looks, childhood sweethearts reunite for the first time in 15 years as employees at a fashion magazine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sIsUgKIFYAASpvvV5Aaip2xa7Zd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63767'),
  ('73428338202001117', 'She Was Pretty', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Kento Nakajima, Fuka Koshiba, Eiji Akaso, Yui Sakuma, Nana Katase, Yuto Takahashi, Misato Ugaki, Murase Sae', null, 'Hasebe Sosuke is the deputy editor-in-chief for the Japanese version of the fashion magazine "The Most" which is released in 30 countries worldwide. He is an unfriendly and cool rationalist. He''s been transferred from the New York branch to complete a particular mission. When he was young, he was fat and often bullied. Now a handsome elite, he strives to meet his first love again. On the other hand, Sato Ai is unemployed and living with her best friend. After her company went bankrupt, she''s eventually hired as a helper. She''s a cheerful, energetic, and honest person. In her youth, she was a beautiful honor student who has now grown into a self-conscious person. Although she meets Sosuke again, she doesn''t want to reveal her identity.', 'Hasebe Sosuke is the deputy editor-in-chief for the Japanese version of the fashion magazine "The Most" which is released in 30 countries worldwide. He is an unfriendly and cool rationalist. He''s been transferred from the New York branch to complete a particular mission. When he was young, he was fat and often bullied. Now a handsome elite, he strives to meet his first love again. On the other hand, Sato Ai is unemployed and living with her best friend. After her company went bankrupt, she''s eventually hired as a helper. She''s a cheerful, energetic, and honest person. In her youth, she was a beautiful honor student who has now grown into a self-conscious person. Although she meets Sosuke again, she doesn''t want to reveal her identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXvBLXsEnNxHvxFsAnLNPzpiegI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128167'),
  ('986420159708932116', 'She Would Never Know', 2021, 'Drama', 'Ra Ha-na, Chae Yoon, Lee Dong-yoon', 'Chae Yoon', 'Won Jin-ah, Rowoon, Lee Hyun-wook, Lee Ju-bin, Lee Kyu-han, Wang Bit-na, Ha Yoon-kyung, Kang Hye-jin', 'TV-14', 'Yoon Song Ah works as a marketer for a cosmetics brand. She enjoys her job and dreams of launching her own brand someday. Chae Hyun Seung is a fellow marketer who becomes attracted to Yoon Song Ah. He tries to develop a romantic relationship but Yoon Song Ah rebuffs his advances, not wishing to date younger men.', 'Yoon Song Ah works as a marketer for a cosmetics brand. She enjoys her job and dreams of launching her own brand someday. Chae Hyun Seung is a fellow marketer who becomes attracted to Yoon Song Ah. He tries to develop a romantic relationship but Yoon Song Ah rebuffs his advances, not wishing to date younger men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28bAyZrTpy2HNWifSGr0qV31Ehm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113965'),
  ('1089476819102565502', 'She-Hulk: Attorney at Law', 2022, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jessica Gao', 'Cody Ziglar, Dana Schwartz', 'Tatiana Maslany, Ginger Gonzaga, Jameela Jamil, Renée Elise Goldsberry, Josh Segarra', 'TV-14', 'Jennifer Walters navigates the complicated life of a single, 30-something attorney who also happens to be a green 6-foot-7-inch superpowered hulk.', 'Jennifer Walters navigates the complicated life of a single, 30-something attorney who also happens to be a green 6-foot-7-inch superpowered hulk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xz2orV8f0usyrfGNshcoXHmiaV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92783'),
  ('879174534176669851', 'She-Ra and the Princesses of Power', 2018, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family, Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'ND Stevenson', null, 'Aimee Carrero, AJ Michalka, Marcus Scribner, Reshma Shetty, Lorraine Toussaint, Karen Fukuhara, Keston John, Lauren Ash', 'TV-Y7', 'Soldier Adora finds a magic sword -- and her identity as legendary hero She-Ra. She joins the Rebellion, but her best friend stays with the evil Horde.', 'Soldier Adora finds a magic sword -- and her identity as legendary hero She-Ra. She joins the Rebellion, but her best friend stays with the evil Horde.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6YLtlnV5FGh3Mhs5SUc80IQSV5.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:79732'),
  ('332592684948165089', 'She-Ra: Princess of Power', 1985, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Melendy Britt, George DiCenzo, John Erwin, Linda Gary, Alan Oppenheimer, Erika Scheimer, Lou Scheimer, Diane Pershing', 'TV-Y7', 'She-Ra, He-Man''s twin sister, is leading a group of freedom fighters known as the Great Rebellion in the hope of freeing their homeworld of Etheria from the tyrannical rule of Hordak and the Evil Horde.', 'She-Ra, He-Man''s twin sister, is leading a group of freedom fighters known as the Great Rebellion in the hope of freeing their homeworld of Etheria from the tyrannical rule of Hordak and the Evil Horde.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/49ZbBp4eUQnXYRvm6HjNI6sSrdW.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:14755'),
  ('838523228165116876', 'She''s Gotta Have It', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Spike Lee', null, 'DeWanda Wise, Anthony Ramos, Cleo Anthony, Lyriq Bent, Chyna Layne, Margot Bingham', 'TV-MA', 'Nola Darling struggles to define herself and divide her time among her friends, job and three lovers. A new take on Spike Lee''s film, in 10 episodes.', 'Nola Darling struggles to define herself and divide her time among her friends, job and three lovers. A new take on Spike Lee''s film, in 10 episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcbZ94T3eySDCMAlVfe3s69LiDJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:72633'),
  ('472731269259293146', 'She''s the One', 2024, 'Soap, Drama', 'Alessandra Poggi', 'Mariani Ferreira, Alessandra Poggi, Adriana Chevalier', 'Duda Santos, Pedro Novaes, Maisa Silva, Fábio Assunção, Lília Cabral, Carol Castro, Letícia Colin, Cauê Campos', null, 'Beatriz Dourado, a young black woman marked by abandonment, searches for answers about her past and discovers that her mother, Clarice, left her to pursue her career in Rio de Janeiro. With devastating revelations and a new love, Beatriz faces adversity and transforms her pain into power, fighting to conquer her place in the world.', 'Beatriz Dourado, a young black woman marked by abandonment, searches for answers about her past and discovers that her mother, Clarice, left her to pursue her career in Rio de Janeiro. With devastating revelations and a new love, Beatriz faces adversity and transforms her pain into power, fighting to conquer her place in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jFSkjQSZ5Td52igalpoTQRuHtk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:257048'),
  ('25282174663701543', 'Shed & Buried: Classic Cars', 2024, 'Reality', null, null, 'Henry Cole, Fuzz Townshend, Allen Millyard, Guy Willison (Skid)', null, 'Henry teams-up with Fuzz Townshend once again. The duo will be doing what they do best: digging in the nation''s sheds, barns and outbuildings, this time to (hopefully) find a tidy profit in some vintage motors', 'Henry teams-up with Fuzz Townshend once again. The duo will be doing what they do best: digging in the nation''s sheds, barns and outbuildings, this time to (hopefully) find a tidy profit in some vintage motors', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jKi7jTvUxAlJCMJn8xOXsn71o1g.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:249182'),
  ('690165597511000122', 'Sheena', 2000, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Douglas Schwartz, Steven L. Sears', null, 'Gena Lee Nolin, John Allen Nelson, Margo Moorer, Kevin Quigley', null, 'Sheena''s parents were archaeologists who died in the jungle when she was about six years old, leaving their daughter Shirley Hamilton. She was taken in by Kali, a local Shamaness of a tribe who brought her up, and five years ago she was taught how to morph into animals and birds, acquiring their abilities, even flight. Further, she became a mythical creature called "The Darachna" who relies on people'' fear of the unknown. For this she covers herself in a dark liquid mud which allows her to be largely unseen in the low light of the jungle, and with more than normal strength, agility and speed, and armed with a pair of gloves with bone claws, she is a formidable one woman fighting force. She does kill sometimes.', 'Sheena''s parents were archaeologists who died in the jungle when she was about six years old, leaving their daughter Shirley Hamilton. She was taken in by Kali, a local Shamaness of a tribe who brought her up, and five years ago she was taught how to morph into animals and birds, acquiring their abilities, even flight. Further, she became a mythical creature called "The Darachna" who relies on people'' fear of the unknown. For this she covers herself in a dark liquid mud which allows her to be largely unseen in the low light of the jungle, and with more than normal strength, agility and speed, and armed with a pair of gloves with bone claws, she is a formidable one woman fighting force. She does kill sometimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ftw63adsdXxjP82oUIdxBSJOhu3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11693'),
  ('992939598771908395', 'Sheep in the Big City', 2000, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Mo Willems', null, 'Kevin Seal, Ken Schatz, Stephanie D''Abruzzo, Mo Willems, Joey Mazzarino, Jerry Nelson, Fran Brill, James Godwin', 'TV-Y7', 'Sheep in the Big City is an American animated television series which ran on Cartoon Network for two seasons, from November 17, 2000, to April 7, 2002. The series'' pilot first premiered as part of Cartoon Network''s "Cartoon Cartoon Summer" on August 18, 2000. Created by Mo Willems, the bulk of the show follows a runaway sheep, Sheep, in its new life in "the Big City". It also features several unrelated sketches and shorts, similar to The Rocky & Bullwinkle Show. With an emphasis on more "sophisticated" humor, using multiple forms of rhetoric from the characters to the plots, it was more popular with older audiences. It was also unusual in featuring many comic references to film-making and television broadcasting. At the time, the premiere of Sheep in the Big City was the highest-rated premiere for a Cartoon Network original series.', 'Sheep in the Big City is an American animated television series which ran on Cartoon Network for two seasons, from November 17, 2000, to April 7, 2002. The series'' pilot first premiered as part of Cartoon Network''s "Cartoon Cartoon Summer" on August 18, 2000. Created by Mo Willems, the bulk of the show follows a runaway sheep, Sheep, in its new life in "the Big City". It also features several unrelated sketches and shorts, similar to The Rocky & Bullwinkle Show. With an emphasis on more "sophisticated" humor, using multiple forms of rhetoric from the characters to the plots, it was more popular with older audiences. It was also unusual in featuring many comic references to film-making and television broadcasting. At the time, the premiere of Sheep in the Big City was the highest-rated premiere for a Cartoon Network original series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8Odrud2q6rnkJM4qlzUQYsgBBX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1477'),
  ('846194250114215052', 'Shekhar Home', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'Srijit Mukherji, Aniruddha Guha', 'Aniruddha Guha, Niharika Puri', 'Kay Kay Menon, Ranvir Shorey, Rasika Dugal, Shernaz Patel, Kirti Kulhari, Rudranil Ghosh', null, 'Set in 1990s Lonpur, Bengal, “Shekhar Home” combines suspense & comedy as eccentric Shekhar and his new housemate Jayavrat solve a variety of cases while interacting with a vibrant cast of characters in a charming, pre-technology era.', 'Set in 1990s Lonpur, Bengal, “Shekhar Home” combines suspense & comedy as eccentric Shekhar and his new housemate Jayavrat solve a variety of cases while interacting with a vibrant cast of characters in a charming, pre-technology era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cO6Qz9R1C5rh4lGaT5YRvPc2IH3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:260203'),
  ('346808134422958566', 'Shelley', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Peter Tilbury', null, 'Josephine Tewson, Samantha Beckinsale, Garfield Morgan, Warren Clarke, Hywel Bennett, Belinda Sinclair', null, 'James Shelley, an educated, sardonic, permanently unemployed "professional freelance layabout," has many battles with authority, the tax-man, his landlady, and his girlfriend Fran.', 'James Shelley, an educated, sardonic, permanently unemployed "professional freelance layabout," has many battles with authority, the tax-man, his landlady, and his girlfriend Fran.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c40fcAxgv9fYSttMN4SCcYAeijl.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:12146'),
  ('467598753063070696', 'Shelved', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Anthony Q. Farrell', null, 'Lyndie Greenwood, Chris Sandiford, Dakota Ray Hebert, Paul Braunstein, Taylor Love', null, 'The eclectic staff and patrons in the underfunded Jameson branch of the Metropolitan Public Library deal with the community and each other’s eccentricities.', 'The eclectic staff and patrons in the underfunded Jameson branch of the Metropolitan Public Library deal with the community and each other’s eccentricities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjKpc3RMfWF8u4GO7c15cweq3qy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:220670'),
  ('829417087869490400', 'Shenbing Kids', 2007, 'Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Lv Qi, Xu Lixiang', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2A0ojY5qHLJtrV6QiMaZFlcwMXC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:133925'),
  ('338522073712144098', 'Shenmue the Animation', 2022, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Masaya Matsukaze', 'TV-14', 'After he witnesses his father’s murder at the family dojo, Ryo Hazuki dedicates his life to finding the man responsible — a mission that takes him from the streets of Yokosuka, Japan to the sprawling metropolis of Hong Kong, and beyond. Soon he’ll learn that larger, mystical forces are at play as he trains to become the ultimate martial artist in his quest for revenge.', 'After he witnesses his father’s murder at the family dojo, Ryo Hazuki dedicates his life to finding the man responsible — a mission that takes him from the streets of Yokosuka, Japan to the sprawling metropolis of Hong Kong, and beyond. Soon he’ll learn that larger, mystical forces are at play as he trains to become the ultimate martial artist in his quest for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owwTW4OVSG1IbU9gpVgRHbD6Dgz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108891'),
  ('887177204181173080', 'Sheriff Callie''s Wild West', 2013, 'Animation, Western', 'George Evelyn, Denis Morella', 'Ford Riley, Kent Redeker, Krista Tucker', 'Mandy Moore, Lucas Grabeel, Jessica DiCicco, Kevin Michael Richardson, Gary Anthony Williams, Cree Summer, Mo Collins, Jeff Bennett', 'TV-Y', 'A kids'' western centered on a kitty-cat sheriff whose job is to ensure that the town of Nice and Friendly Corners remains the friendliest town in the West.', 'A kids'' western centered on a kitty-cat sheriff whose job is to ensure that the town of Nice and Friendly Corners remains the friendliest town in the West.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKoVuDIkhFVjbhoGAi7vxUgrKRz.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61330'),
  ('66676116827908873', 'Sheriff Country', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Matt Lopez', null, 'Morena Baccarin, W. Earl Brown, Christopher Gorham, Michele Weaver, Matt Lauria', 'TV-14', 'Mickey Fox investigates criminal activity and patrols the streets of small-town Edgewater while contending with her ex-con father and a mysterious incident involving her wayward daughter.', 'Mickey Fox investigates criminal activity and patrols the streets of small-town Edgewater while contending with her ex-con father and a mysterious incident involving her wayward daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBrbAYp4SGMkNYZGPeFhEd0xW7Z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:253391'),
  ('552224347815215124', 'Sheriff Hoot Kloot', 1973, 'Animation, Comedy, Western', null, 'John W. Dunn', 'Bob Holt, Larry D. Mann', null, '"Hoot Kloot" was a series of 17 theatrical cartoon shorts produced by DePatie-Freleng Enterprises from 1973 to 1974. They featured Sheriff Hoot Kloot -- a diminutive, short-tempered lawman -- and his loyal horse Fester who try to maintain order in a remote western town. The series was later shown on television as part of the NBC Saturday morning cartoon series "Pink Panther and Friends."', '"Hoot Kloot" was a series of 17 theatrical cartoon shorts produced by DePatie-Freleng Enterprises from 1973 to 1974. They featured Sheriff Hoot Kloot -- a diminutive, short-tempered lawman -- and his loyal horse Fester who try to maintain order in a remote western town. The series was later shown on television as part of the NBC Saturday morning cartoon series "Pink Panther and Friends."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1JFWksWMkJxu5oDmz1LvFJKE0fx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:239871'),
  ('461232723450453628', 'Sherlock', 2010, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Mark Gatiss, Steven Moffat', null, 'Benedict Cumberbatch, Martin Freeman', 'TV-14', 'A modern update finds the famous sleuth and his doctor partner solving crime in 21st century London.', 'A modern update finds the famous sleuth and his doctor partner solving crime in 21st century London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WTsnHkbA0FaG6R9twfFde0I9hl.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:19885'),
  ('961291563294424201', 'SHErlock', 2023, 'Reality', 'Gan Yi', null, 'Qi Wei, Zhang Yuqi, Li Yitong, Li Xueqin, Tian Xiwei, Zhang Yifan, Wen Yingqian', null, '"SHErlock" is the first all-female immersive mystery program on Mango TV, a Chinese mainland online platform. The six female guests, Qi Wei, Zhang Yuqi, Li Yitong, Li Xueqin, Tian Xiwei, and Zhang Yifan, form the women''s mystery team. It is the first female-centric "puzzle-solving" show. The show explores workplace issues faced by women, such as workplace PUA, sexual harassment, yin-yang contracts, etc. The show features a legal education segment with a lawyer expert at the end of each episode.', '"SHErlock" is the first all-female immersive mystery program on Mango TV, a Chinese mainland online platform. The six female guests, Qi Wei, Zhang Yuqi, Li Yitong, Li Xueqin, Tian Xiwei, and Zhang Yifan, form the women''s mystery team. It is the first female-centric "puzzle-solving" show. The show explores workplace issues faced by women, such as workplace PUA, sexual harassment, yin-yang contracts, etc. The show features a legal education segment with a lawyer expert at the end of each episode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h08qJvkYscz05svAVULleqpgPvN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:224755'),
  ('101207137841495946', 'Sherlock & Daughter', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Brendan Foley', null, 'David Thewlis, Blu Hunt, Ardal O''Hanlon', 'TV-14', 'Sherlock Holmes faces a sinister case risking friends'' lives. American Amelia joins, seeking her father after her mother''s murder. Despite differences, they solve a conspiracy and her mother''s case.', 'Sherlock Holmes faces a sinister case risking friends'' lives. American Amelia joins, seeking her father after her mother''s murder. Despite differences, they solve a conspiracy and her mother''s case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifh5NNMzUEqErsHmeKjjGblbOav.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:246461'),
  ('1097883218108148443', 'Sherlock Holmes', 1954, 'Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Howard Marion-Crawford, Ronald Howard, Archie Duncan, Richard Larke', 'TV-PG', 'The first American television series of Sherlock Holmes adventures aired in syndication in the fall of 1954. The 39 half-hour mostly original stories were produced by Sheldon Reynolds and filmed in France by Guild Films, starring Ronald Howard as Holmes and Howard Marion Crawford as Watson. Archie Duncan appeared in many episodes as Inspector Lestrade. Richard Larke, billed as Kenneth Richards, played Sgt. Wilkins in about fifteen episodes. The series'' associate producer, Nicole Milinaire, was one of the first women to attain a senior production role in a television series.', 'The first American television series of Sherlock Holmes adventures aired in syndication in the fall of 1954. The 39 half-hour mostly original stories were produced by Sheldon Reynolds and filmed in France by Guild Films, starring Ronald Howard as Holmes and Howard Marion Crawford as Watson. Archie Duncan appeared in many episodes as Inspector Lestrade. Richard Larke, billed as Kenneth Richards, played Sgt. Wilkins in about fifteen episodes. The series'' associate producer, Nicole Milinaire, was one of the first women to attain a senior production role in a television series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eroaHmsBZXTsL64oo72Yi3eJaiz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6560'),
  ('570397284497683743', 'Sherlock Holmes', 1964, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Peter Cushing, Nigel Stock', null, 'Sherlock Holmes (also known as ''Sir Arthur Conan Doyle''s Sherlock Holmes'') is a series of Sherlock Holmes adaptations produced by British television company BBC between 1964 and 1968. This was the second screen adaption of Sherlock Holmes for BBC Television.', 'Sherlock Holmes (also known as ''Sir Arthur Conan Doyle''s Sherlock Holmes'') is a series of Sherlock Holmes adaptations produced by British television company BBC between 1964 and 1968. This was the second screen adaption of Sherlock Holmes for BBC Television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDEed6lENay31oQlDKW4gCjT6JT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:23027'),
  ('897960334045533837', 'Sherlock Holmes', 1984, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'John Hawkesworth', null, 'Jeremy Brett, Edward Hardwicke, Rosalie Williams', 'TV-PG', 'Sherlock Holmes uses his abilities to take on cases by private clients and those that the Scotland Yard are unable to solve, along with his friend Dr. Watson.', 'Sherlock Holmes uses his abilities to take on cases by private clients and those that the Scotland Yard are unable to solve, along with his friend Dr. Watson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ivUXXK80C8Uy4SKQ8IS0LB9zNDX.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:799'),
  ('745566614170305652', 'Sherlock Holmes', 2013, 'Crime, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Igor Petrenko, Andrei Panin', null, 'The action takes place in Victorian England in the last quarter of the 19th century. 27-year-old amateur detective Sherlock Holmes becomes a bystander to a crime along with Dr. John Watson, a military doctor who has just returned from the war in Afghanistan. During the investigation, Watson, not yet having an apartment in London, settles with Holmes in Mrs. Hudson''s «half board», and then takes part in the affairs of his new friend. Watson gives Holmes boxing lessons. Watson himself is an experienced boxer, able to deal with several opponents with his bare hands. In addition, he is an excellent marksman. Considering Holmes a genius, the doctor decides to tell the whole world about his talent and the mysteries he revealed in his stories, where he often embellishes the events («the true story» of which the series presents). Watson is taught to embellish events by the editor-in-chief of the «Morning Chronicle».', 'The action takes place in Victorian England in the last quarter of the 19th century. 27-year-old amateur detective Sherlock Holmes becomes a bystander to a crime along with Dr. John Watson, a military doctor who has just returned from the war in Afghanistan. During the investigation, Watson, not yet having an apartment in London, settles with Holmes in Mrs. Hudson''s «half board», and then takes part in the affairs of his new friend. Watson gives Holmes boxing lessons. Watson himself is an experienced boxer, able to deal with several opponents with his bare hands. In addition, he is an excellent marksman. Considering Holmes a genius, the doctor decides to tell the whole world about his talent and the mysteries he revealed in his stories, where he often embellishes the events («the true story» of which the series presents). Watson is taught to embellish events by the editor-in-chief of the «Morning Chronicle».', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1PXfeZPSGDMHjaHXlWzkAcIMHfp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64368'),
  ('349692677100336625', 'Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson', 1980, 'Action & Adventure, Mystery, Crime', null, null, 'Vasiliy Livanov, Vitali Solomin, Rina Zelyonaya', null, 'The first part of the Soviet series of television films based on the stories of Arthur Conan Doyle about Sherlock Holmes, filmed in 1979. The film consists of two parts and was filmed based on the story "The Speckled Band" (1st part "The Acquaintance") and the novella "A Study in Scarlet" (beginning of the 1st part and the 2nd part "Bloody Inscription").', 'The first part of the Soviet series of television films based on the stories of Arthur Conan Doyle about Sherlock Holmes, filmed in 1979. The film consists of two parts and was filmed based on the story "The Speckled Band" (1st part "The Acquaintance") and the novella "A Study in Scarlet" (beginning of the 1st part and the 2nd part "Bloody Inscription").', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Osgpim5GBXeDkdZ7fhYlgEf7br.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:261216'),
  ('1018018924304993007', 'Sherlock Holmes in the 22nd Century', 1999, 'Animation, Mystery, Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Sandy Ross', 'Phil Harnage', 'Jason Gray-Stanford, Akiko Morison, John Payne, Richard Newman, William Samples, Ian James Corlett, Viv Leacock, Jennifer Copping', 'TV-Y7', 'Sherlock Holmes fights crime in the 22nd Century with help from his loyal friend, Dr. Watson, who is programmed into the brain of an android.', 'Sherlock Holmes fights crime in the 22nd Century with help from his loyal friend, Dr. Watson, who is programmed into the brain of an android.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mwLwPQBOeS1ukxUMTh7Sq1aNM63.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:10684'),
  ('845429703921924488', 'Sherlock Hound', 1984, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Family', null, null, 'Taichiro Hirokawa, Chikao Ohtsuka, Yoko Asagami, Kosei Tomita, Shozo Iizuka, Hiroshi Masuoka, Mitsuo Senda, Hitomi Oikawa', null, 'In a steampunk London, the great detective Sherlock Holmes and Doctor Watson routinely crack the most challenging cases — perpetrated more often than not by their nemesis, the proud, bumbling genius Professor Moriarty.', 'In a steampunk London, the great detective Sherlock Holmes and Doctor Watson routinely crack the most challenging cases — perpetrated more often than not by their nemesis, the proud, bumbling genius Professor Moriarty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/65H05v4M20v88gnnu9JdnR6WcS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21296'),
  ('50229569872471657', 'Sherri', 2022, 'Talk', 'Sherri Shepherd', null, 'Sherri Shepherd, Rolonda Watts', 'TV-PG', 'Sherri Shepherd, actress, comic, and Emmy Award-winning longtime co-host of "The View", appears before a live audience with a daily dose of pop culture, comedy, conversations, and daytime talk staples, including celebrity and human interest interviews.', 'Sherri Shepherd, actress, comic, and Emmy Award-winning longtime co-host of "The View", appears before a live audience with a daily dose of pop culture, comedy, conversations, and daytime talk staples, including celebrity and human interest interviews.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w6K4LsGYTBbuYpDG9qR20g6p1NT.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:210081'),
  ('60383483645268629', 'Sherwood', 2019, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Megan Laughton, Diana Manson', null, 'Anya Chalotra, Tyler Posey, Aneurin Barnard, Jamie Chung, Rachel House, Adetokumboh M''Cormack, Joseph Fiennes, Neneh Conteh', null, 'All her life, teen-hacker Robin of Sherwood thought she was an orphan. But when a mysterious Gauntlet unlocks a secret that turns her world upside down, Robin joins forces with a group of renegades who teach her the true value of love, loyalty, and sacrifice. Through the flooded storm-lashed streets of 23rd century London, to the towering citadel of the floating Upper City, Robin and her new friends battle the elements and the odds to defeat the mad Sheriff of Nottingham.', 'All her life, teen-hacker Robin of Sherwood thought she was an orphan. But when a mysterious Gauntlet unlocks a secret that turns her world upside down, Robin joins forces with a group of renegades who teach her the true value of love, loyalty, and sacrifice. Through the flooded storm-lashed streets of 23rd century London, to the towering citadel of the floating Upper City, Robin and her new friends battle the elements and the odds to defeat the mad Sheriff of Nottingham.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Jjt7NT8a0oDopR12mCjSk6IEcG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:87399'),
  ('218329655296818130', 'Sherwood', 2022, 'Crime, Mystery', null, 'James Graham', 'Lesley Manville, Lorraine Ashbourne, Perry Fitzpatrick, Philip Jackson, David Morrissey, Michael Balogun, Christine Bottomley, Stephen Dillane', 'TV-MA', 'Old grudges, new rivalries. A tangled web of murder and revenge spirals in a fractured Nottinghamshire mining community. Powerful drama with Lesley Manville and David Morrissey.', 'Old grudges, new rivalries. A tangled web of murder and revenge spirals in a fractured Nottinghamshire mining community. Powerful drama with Lesley Manville and David Morrissey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rxjrfxGVzLNqvi4GSi7wuAGcJWg.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:155243'),
  ('419638561452832557', 'Shetland', 2013, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Ann Cleaves', 'Paul Logue', 'Alison O''Donnell, Steven Robertson, Lewis Howden', 'TV-PG', 'Created from the novels by award winning crime writer Ann Cleeves, Shetland follows DI Jimmy Perez and his team as they investigate crime within the close knit island community. In this isolated and sometimes inhospitable environment, the team have to rely on a uniquely resourceful style of policing.', 'Created from the novels by award winning crime writer Ann Cleeves, Shetland follows DI Jimmy Perez and his team as they investigate crime within the close knit island community. In this isolated and sometimes inhospitable environment, the team have to rely on a uniquely resourceful style of policing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKnxmir8m5I3RdSTdZr3jaQaCZi.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:46923'),
  ('163820558615940618', 'SheZow', 2012, 'Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Obie Scott Wade', null, 'Sam Vincent, Matt Hill, Diana Kaarina, Jacqueline Brennan', 'TV-Y7', 'A 12 year old boy named Guy Hamdon, discovers the superheroine Shezow''s power ring and puts it on. While the power ring does grant him super powers, it was only meant to be worn by a woman. Guy takes on the appearance of a female super hero and with the help of his sister, Kelly, and best friend, Maz, he protects the city of Megadale from supervillains and criminals.', 'A 12 year old boy named Guy Hamdon, discovers the superheroine Shezow''s power ring and puts it on. While the power ring does grant him super powers, it was only meant to be worn by a woman. Guy takes on the appearance of a female super hero and with the help of his sister, Kelly, and best friend, Maz, he protects the city of Megadale from supervillains and criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qENmcDddeM0zBugr20oeGVUQ6E0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:51710'),
  ('830369597253815069', 'SHIBOYUGI: Playing Death Games to Put Food on the Table', 2026, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Chiyuki Miura', 'TV-MA', 'Yuki plays death games for a living, but when she wakes in a mansion with five other women, can she survive a new lethal maze of locked rooms and traps?', 'Yuki plays death games for a living, but when she wakes in a mansion with five other women, can she survive a new lethal maze of locked rooms and traps?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vaNWEpgnmrzEiqapkRkCHiMB42i.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:263330'),
  ('424450792754306913', 'Shift the Thrift', 2026, 'Reality', null, null, 'Joanna Page', null, 'Couples scour the UK''s charity shops to see if they can make even more money at auction for the items they purchase and raise money for their chosen causes.', 'Couples scour the UK''s charity shops to see if they can make even more money at auction for the items they purchase and raise money for their chosen causes.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:318326'),
  ('473659582070998837', 'Shifting Gears', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Julie Thacker, Mike Scully', null, 'Tim Allen, Kat Dennings, Seann William Scott, Daryl Mitchell, Maxwell Simkins, Barrett Margolis', 'TV-PG', 'Matt is a stubborn, widowed owner of a classic car restoration shop. When Matt''s estranged daughter Riley and her teenage kids move into his house, the real restoration begins.', 'Matt is a stubborn, widowed owner of a classic car restoration shop. When Matt''s estranged daughter Riley and her teenage kids move into his house, the real restoration begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZnI8fWCtmJ9doCYSJwoJBITBiV.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:260471'),
  ('227916902334186927', 'Shigofumi: Letters from the Departed', 2008, 'Animation', null, 'Ichiro Okouchi', 'Rikiya Koyama, Takuma Terashima, Masumi Asano, Kana Ueda, Yuki Matsuoka, Masayuki Katou, Saeko Chiba', null, 'Fumika and Kanaka are mail carriers- but not the typical kind. For one, Kanaka is a talking staff and for two, Fumika delivers shigofumi: letters from the dead addressed to the living. These letters are a final, true, communication derived from hate, hope, and love. The story unfolds following this pair and their uncommon job as well as Fumika''s unique ''situation''.', 'Fumika and Kanaka are mail carriers- but not the typical kind. For one, Kanaka is a talking staff and for two, Fumika delivers shigofumi: letters from the dead addressed to the living. These letters are a final, true, communication derived from hate, hope, and love. The story unfolds following this pair and their uncommon job as well as Fumika''s unique ''situation''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jY6CkK0nAEg1uiUxeQMFlIRKbfp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89664'),
  ('468871296274167628', 'Shigurui: Death Frenzy', 2007, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Daisuke Namikawa, Nozomu Sasaki, Yusaku Yara, Seizo Kato, Houko Kuwashima, Emi Shinohara', 'TV-MA', 'At the beginning of the Edo Era, when people enjoyed a time of peace, Lord Tokugawa Tadanaga holds a fighting tournament. In the past, matches were fought with wooden swords. This time, real swords will be used. One-armed Fujiki Gennosuke and blind Irako Seigen will fight each other in this match. Both are disciples of Iwamoto Kogan, who is known as Japan''s greatest swordsman. Each of them are determined to prove himself the successor of Iwamoto''s school. However, there can only be one champion. So begins a story of intertwining fates, conflict, and strange destinies.', 'At the beginning of the Edo Era, when people enjoyed a time of peace, Lord Tokugawa Tadanaga holds a fighting tournament. In the past, matches were fought with wooden swords. This time, real swords will be used. One-armed Fujiki Gennosuke and blind Irako Seigen will fight each other in this match. Both are disciples of Iwamoto Kogan, who is known as Japan''s greatest swordsman. Each of them are determined to prove himself the successor of Iwamoto''s school. However, there can only be one champion. So begins a story of intertwining fates, conflict, and strange destinies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/noOICSvKXkz2lQqw778aQPXQJJ4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34144'),
  ('141479083429392137', 'Shiki', 2010, 'Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Tetsuro Amino', null, 'Nobuhiko Okamoto, Wataru Takagi, GACKT, Haruka Tomatsu, Kazuyuki Okitsu, Koki Uchiyama, Toru Okawa, Nozomi Sasaki', 'TV-MA', 'Sotobamura is a small village with around 1300 residents; so small the village isn''t even connected to a single highway. An isolated village in which old customs, such as the burial of the dead, are still practiced. One day, the bodies of three people are found dead. Although Ozaki Toshio, the village''s lone doctor, feels uncertain, he treats the deaths as a normal occurrence. However, in the days following, the villagers start to die one after the other.', 'Sotobamura is a small village with around 1300 residents; so small the village isn''t even connected to a single highway. An isolated village in which old customs, such as the burial of the dead, are still practiced. One day, the bodies of three people are found dead. Although Ozaki Toshio, the village''s lone doctor, feels uncertain, he treats the deaths as a normal occurrence. However, in the days following, the villagers start to die one after the other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zsWbTnNwNjqWvgZ9gqTcK9WLoWy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:36581'),
  ('2261049541787292', 'Shikimori''s Not Just a Cutie', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Saori Onishi, Shuichiro Umeda', 'TV-14', 'Shikimori seems like the perfect girlfriend: cute, fun to be around, sweet when she wants to be… but she has a cool dark side that comes out under the right circumstances. And her boyfriend Izumi loves to be around when that happens!', 'Shikimori seems like the perfect girlfriend: cute, fun to be around, sweet when she wants to be… but she has a cool dark side that comes out under the right circumstances. And her boyfriend Izumi loves to be around when that happens!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1F9uYsrq9nwSeyfMRYoyJiMm9zt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:115694'),
  ('124546996888229148', 'Shimmer and Shine', 2015, 'Animation, Family, Kids', null, null, 'Alina Foley, Isabella Crovetti, Eva Bella, Blake Bertrand, Dee Bradley Baker', 'TV-Y', 'Twins genies, Shimmer and Shine, grant their human friend Leah three wishes every day - unintentional chaos follows.', 'Twins genies, Shimmer and Shine, grant their human friend Leah three wishes every day - unintentional chaos follows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2zym6tVGMYugPWUHGEYko7FwO3y.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:67098'),
  ('302378275780295824', 'SHIMONETA: A Boring World Where the Concept of Dirty Jokes Doesn''t Exist', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Shizuka Ishigami, Satomi Arai, Yusuke Kobayashi, Yui Horie, Miyu Matsuki, Saori Goto, Kenta Miyake, Sayaka Ohara', 'TV-MA', 'Sixteen years after the "Law for Public Order and Morals in Healthy Child-Raising" banned coarse language in the country, Tanukichi Okuma enrolls in the country''s leading elite public morals school and is soon invited into the Anti-Societal Organization (SOX) by its founder, Ayame Kajou. As a member blackmailed into joining by Ayame, Tanukichi ends up taking part in obscene acts of terrorism against the talented student council president Anna (for whom Tanukichi has a crush on).', 'Sixteen years after the "Law for Public Order and Morals in Healthy Child-Raising" banned coarse language in the country, Tanukichi Okuma enrolls in the country''s leading elite public morals school and is soon invited into the Anti-Societal Organization (SOX) by its founder, Ayame Kajou. As a member blackmailed into joining by Ayame, Tanukichi ends up taking part in obscene acts of terrorism against the talented student council president Anna (for whom Tanukichi has a crush on).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eO4z0x1NPO0L6Spke6PHbqkKxFk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63323'),
  ('638673984818221299', 'Shin Captain Tsubasa', 1989, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Yoichi Takahashi', null, 'Akari Hibino, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Koichi Hashimoto, Nobuo Tobita', 'NR', 'Shin CT takes place at the U-16 word cup in France. After some friendly matches in Germany, Japan defeats one opponent after another and finally reaches the final round against Germany. After hard matches against Italian and French top players, the German team seems to be even more supreme. The giant goal keeper Moeller, the all round ace Kalz and Europe''s best player and forward Schneider offer the Japanese team an extremely hard match, but in the end Japan wins 3:2.', 'Shin CT takes place at the U-16 word cup in France. After some friendly matches in Germany, Japan defeats one opponent after another and finally reaches the final round against Germany. After hard matches against Italian and French top players, the German team seems to be even more supreme. The giant goal keeper Moeller, the all round ace Kalz and Europe''s best player and forward Schneider offer the Japanese team an extremely hard match, but in the end Japan wins 3:2.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pdJFjI7OFcNrUuQoslGKSKtUpZU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63102'),
  ('1094972110738565012', 'Shin Chan', 1992, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Akiko Yajima, Miki Narahashi, Keiji Fujiwara, Satomi Korogi, Mari Mashiba, Chie Sato, Rokuro Naya, Michie Tomizawa', 'TV-PG', 'Shin-chan, the boy next door, is a walking disaster, creating chaos wherever he goes. With the body of a child and the mind of an adult, Shinchan is wreaking more havoc than any child before. Shin-chan is carefree, optimistic and gets excited about everything. This 5 year-old likes to do things his way.', 'Shin-chan, the boy next door, is a walking disaster, creating chaos wherever he goes. With the body of a child and the mind of an adult, Shinchan is wreaking more havoc than any child before. Shin-chan is carefree, optimistic and gets excited about everything. This 5 year-old likes to do things his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zg19Paur3lVVSh8J4LJVO1wgBIg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:30623'),
  ('181851264753226632', 'Shin Chan', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jared Hedges, Joel Bergen, Alex Muniz', 'Joel Bergen, Jared Hedges, Alex Muniz', 'Laura Bailey, Cynthia Cranz, Colleen Clinkenbeard, Chuck Huber, Chris Cason, Brina Palencia, Carrie Savage', 'TV-MA', 'English language adult parody based on the Japanese series Shinchan (1992). Shin is a 5-year-old boy who is constantly doing and saying inappropriate things, much to the dismay and annoyance of those around him, with hilarious results. Shin along with his family including his little sister Hima and his dog Whitey, as well as his friends from kindergarten, ends up turning everyday situations into funny adventures. This entry is for the Funimation English dub which originally aired on CN''s Adult Swim between 2006 and 2011.', 'English language adult parody based on the Japanese series Shinchan (1992). Shin is a 5-year-old boy who is constantly doing and saying inappropriate things, much to the dismay and annoyance of those around him, with hilarious results. Shin along with his family including his little sister Hima and his dog Whitey, as well as his friends from kindergarten, ends up turning everyday situations into funny adventures. This entry is for the Funimation English dub which originally aired on CN''s Adult Swim between 2006 and 2011.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4lklbc3fzGhTe8IxhVQ1JFV8et.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:262657'),
  ('991899754675290119', 'Shin Ikki Tousen', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ayaka Ohashi, Atsumi Tanezaki, Masumi Asano, Yuhko Kaida, Hitomi Nabatame, Yuu Asakawa, Manami Numakura, Sayuri Yahagi', 'TV-14', 'The reincarnation of Himiko, the former queen of Yamatai, has decided to wage war against all magatama wielders of Kanto. In order to recover her lost kingdom, she must gather the true Three Sacred Treasures of Japan. When Himiko''s ally, Asaemon Yamada, ruthlessly attacks Nanyou Academy—which possesses the sacred sword Himiko is after—Chuubou Sonken, Hakufu Sonsaku''s newfound sister, awakens her dragon but loses consciousness. Determined to save her sibling, Hakufu must recover her magatama at the Jofuku Temple—a legendary place where she will receive training that may cost her her life. As the frontier between the living and the dead starts to vanish in Jofuku, the warriors of the Kanto region will have to unite in order to foil Himiko''s mysterious plans.', 'The reincarnation of Himiko, the former queen of Yamatai, has decided to wage war against all magatama wielders of Kanto. In order to recover her lost kingdom, she must gather the true Three Sacred Treasures of Japan. When Himiko''s ally, Asaemon Yamada, ruthlessly attacks Nanyou Academy—which possesses the sacred sword Himiko is after—Chuubou Sonken, Hakufu Sonsaku''s newfound sister, awakens her dragon but loses consciousness. Determined to save her sibling, Hakufu must recover her magatama at the Jofuku Temple—a legendary place where she will receive training that may cost her her life. As the frontier between the living and the dead starts to vanish in Jofuku, the warriors of the Kanto region will have to unite in order to foil Himiko''s mysterious plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/816zU3IELJlkmRqPt91uu9ty1Qf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128510'),
  ('436870721241110989', 'Shin''s Project', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Shin Kyung-soo', 'Ban Gi-ri', 'Han Suk-kyu, Bae Hyeon-seong, Lee Re, Kim Seung-o, Woo Mi-hwa, Kim Sang-ho, Jung Eun-pyo, Woo Hyeon', null, 'A comic drama that tells the story of CEO Shin, who mediates disputes for people who are on the edge of a cliff with a 0% chance of winning.', 'A comic drama that tells the story of CEO Shin, who mediates disputes for people who are on the edge of a cliff with a 0% chance of winning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iiBkY6mrYWdyosaHtJQm0pFXyBt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:286198'),
  ('867735609846408304', 'Shindig!', 1964, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'Shindig! is an American musical variety series which aired on ABC from September 16, 1964 to January 8, 1966. The show was hosted by Jimmy O''Neill, a disc jockey in Los Angeles at the time who also created the show along with his wife Sharon Sheeley and production executive Art Stolnitz. The original pilot was rejected by ABC and David Sontag, then Executive Producer of ABC, redeveloped and completely redesigned the show. A new pilot with a new cast of artists was shot starring Sam Cooke. That pilot aired as the premiere episode.', 'Shindig! is an American musical variety series which aired on ABC from September 16, 1964 to January 8, 1966. The show was hosted by Jimmy O''Neill, a disc jockey in Los Angeles at the time who also created the show along with his wife Sharon Sheeley and production executive Art Stolnitz. The original pilot was rejected by ABC and David Sontag, then Executive Producer of ABC, redeveloped and completely redesigned the show. A new pilot with a new cast of artists was shot starring Sam Cooke. That pilot aired as the premiere episode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHOlyoTZLEDacr0AiT58avi4GBr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11202'),
  ('537663425655397572', 'Shine', 2025, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Nattawin Wattanagitiphat, Phakphum Romsaithong, Yuke Songpaisan, Yotsawat Tawapee, Thanawat Shinawatra, Athens Werapatanakul, Pawat Akkradetsakul, Patiphan Fueangfunuwat', null, 'Five young Thais resist the strict social norms of 1969, risking everything as their interwoven forbidden loves defy an intolerant world.', 'Five young Thais resist the strict social norms of 1969, risking everything as their interwoven forbidden loves defy an intolerant world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRVei6yluFs8JrA1yP8FrEG5djy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:245159'),
  ('598251599774007080', 'Shine on Me', 2025, 'Drama', 'Gu Man', 'Gu Man, Shen Feixian', 'Song Weilong, Zhao Jinmai', null, 'Her heart was anchored in an unrequited love, while the one who truly saw her from the beginning waited in the wings. A tale of a fateful first encounter that changes everything—and a second chance at a love that was always meant to be.', 'Her heart was anchored in an unrequited love, while the one who truly saw her from the beginning waited in the wings. A tale of a fateful first encounter that changes everything—and a second chance at a love that was always meant to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cFBlFzOwh4C8wpuR4sYBIitvNiw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278577'),
  ('1039564224786259794', 'Shine On You', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mui Siu-Ching', null, 'Bobby Au-Yeung Tsan-Wah, Michael Tao Tai-Yu, Kenix Kwok Ho-Ying, Paul Chun Pui, Shirley Yeung Sze-Kei, Yu Chiu, Cerina da Graça, Rainbow Ching', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZL4vGhfUMY8a5BCdZmKcshM70t.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109131'),
  ('1126140010136494422', 'Shine On! Bakumatsu Bad Boys!', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Gen Sato, Shunichi Toki, Sumire Uesaka, Toshiyuki Toyonaga, Yuto Uemura, Shin-ichiro Miki, Wataru Takagi, Fukushi Ochiai', 'TV-14', 'In an era when samurai ruled Japan, the Zomen no Oni wiped out all but one member of the Shinsengumi. A top-secret replacement operation is executed to protect the security of Kyoto—seven criminals are chosen as doubles to replace the Shinsengumi while being led by Ichibanboshi, whose parents were also killed by the Zomen no Oni. Now’s their time to shine the brightest!', 'In an era when samurai ruled Japan, the Zomen no Oni wiped out all but one member of the Shinsengumi. A top-secret replacement operation is executed to protect the security of Kyoto—seven criminals are chosen as doubles to replace the Shinsengumi while being led by Ichibanboshi, whose parents were also killed by the Zomen no Oni. Now’s their time to shine the brightest!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n52m4tqLLn6CsI5vXIMDCNQvhMz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:195924'),
  ('693901790173683988', 'Shine or Go Crazy', 2015, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, 'Kwon In-chan', 'Jang Hyuk, Oh Yeon-seo, Lee Hanee, Lim Ju-hwan, Lee Duck-hwa, Ryu Seung-su, Ahn Suk-hwan, An Kil-kang', null, 'Wang So is the Prince of Goryeo who has a cursed fate. He had to get married with the Last Princess of Balhae, Shin Yool. She was born with the fate of becoming the light for another country. But because of this fate, she has to face death. Through their marriage life, Wang So and Shin Yool begin to grow closer and love each other.', 'Wang So is the Prince of Goryeo who has a cursed fate. He had to get married with the Last Princess of Balhae, Shin Yool. She was born with the fate of becoming the light for another country. But because of this fate, she has to face death. Through their marriage life, Wang So and Shin Yool begin to grow closer and love each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wheCHdXIHgnwjaLU4UbXujiJcIu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62299'),
  ('821447918176457886', 'Shine! Super Brothers', 2020, 'Reality', null, null, 'Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Dicky Cheung Wai-Kin, Vanness Wu, Nichkhun Horvejkul, Zhou Xiaoou, Sha Baoliang, Zhang Xiaolong, Zhang Aoyue', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUc9bnUkelzguCboJ7X6wjJi5Dp.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:113995'),
  ('719297551421251189', 'SHINEPOST', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Sayumi Suzushiro, Moeko Kanisawa, Yuko Natsuyoshi, Rimo Hasegawa, Rika Nakagawa, Daiki Yamashita, Mikako Komatsu, Ayaka Ohashi', 'TV-14', 'Although the idol group TiNgS is chasing after big dreams, so far their accomplishments have only been small — and now, suddenly, they''re facing a potential break up! Hope seems lost, but when a new manager with a special skillset takes them under his wing, the members of TiNgS find themselves shooting for the stars all over again.', 'Although the idol group TiNgS is chasing after big dreams, so far their accomplishments have only been small — and now, suddenly, they''re facing a potential break up! Hope seems lost, but when a new manager with a special skillset takes them under his wing, the members of TiNgS find themselves shooting for the stars all over again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qz0CWswDNsSsBkHjkcT6a98zo2e.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137194'),
  ('72886092826943639', 'Shining For One Thing', 2022, 'Mystery, Drama', null, 'Duan Yu Le, Xiaoming Chen, Pan Zhang', 'Qu Chuxiao, Karlina Zhang, Caesar Wu, Fu Jing, Luo Mingjie, Chiang Yun-Lin, Roada Xu', null, 'After her fiancé unexpectedly calls off their wedding, Lin Beixing is transported back to her high school years through a mysterious glitch on her old phone. There, she reconnects with Zhang Wansen, a brilliant classmate doomed to a tragic fate. Realizing she can alter the past by deleting old messages, Lin sets out to change both their destinies—and discovers a second chance at love and self-discovery.', 'After her fiancé unexpectedly calls off their wedding, Lin Beixing is transported back to her high school years through a mysterious glitch on her old phone. There, she reconnects with Zhang Wansen, a brilliant classmate doomed to a tragic fate. Realizing she can alter the past by deleting old messages, Lin sets out to change both their destinies—and discovers a second chance at love and self-discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1J4cANgkYDHsC6etlwMLatUDUWN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156103'),
  ('1051309577114500238', 'Shining Girls', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Silka Luisa', null, 'Elisabeth Moss, Wagner Moura, Phillipa Soo, Chris Chalk, Amy Brenneman, Jamie Bell', 'TV-MA', 'Years after a brutal attack left her in a constantly shifting reality, Kirby Mazrachi learns that a recent murder is linked to her assault. She teams with veteran reporter Dan Velazquez to understand her ever-changing present—and confront her past.', 'Years after a brutal attack left her in a constantly shifting reality, Kirby Mazrachi learns that a recent murder is linked to her assault. She teams with veteran reporter Dan Velazquez to understand her ever-changing present—and confront her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmN97JxhZHgCThRqgzaiSF7C2mj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106388'),
  ('954403328678256887', 'Shining Hearts', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', null, 'Itsuro Kawasaki', 'Rie Kugimiya, Hiroshi Kamiya, Mai Aizawa, Shiori Mikami, Kanae Itou, Ryo Hirohashi, Houko Kuwashima, Izumi Kitta', 'TV-14', 'One day, a mysterious girl named Kaguya was washed ashore the island of Wyndaria after a great storm. She encounters Rick, a swordsman who wound up working at the island''s bakery. Apparently, Kaguya is suffering from having lost her memories and emotions. In addition, the usually peaceful Wyndaria is now swarming with pirates who came seeking for the special spirit stone that is worn around Kaguya''s neck. Knowing the situation, Rick and his co-workers, Nellis, Amyl, and Aerie decided to bring back peace to island and help Kaguya regain her lost memories and emotions.', 'One day, a mysterious girl named Kaguya was washed ashore the island of Wyndaria after a great storm. She encounters Rick, a swordsman who wound up working at the island''s bakery. Apparently, Kaguya is suffering from having lost her memories and emotions. In addition, the usually peaceful Wyndaria is now swarming with pirates who came seeking for the special spirit stone that is worn around Kaguya''s neck. Knowing the situation, Rick and his co-workers, Nellis, Amyl, and Aerie decided to bring back peace to island and help Kaguya regain her lost memories and emotions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oeEneTqn0nxXNViOheziMkbI78P.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46387'),
  ('937970588678690509', 'Shining Vale', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jeff Astrof, Sharon Horgan', null, 'Courteney Cox, Greg Kinnear, Gus Birney, Dylan Gage', 'TV-MA', 'A dysfunctional family moves from the city to a small town into a house in which terrible atrocities have taken place. But no one seems to notice except for Patricia “Pat” Phelps, who’s convinced she’s either depressed or possessed – turns out, the symptoms are exactly the same.', 'A dysfunctional family moves from the city to a small town into a house in which terrible atrocities have taken place. But no one seems to notice except for Patricia “Pat” Phelps, who’s convinced she’s either depressed or possessed – turns out, the symptoms are exactly the same.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hp2W5D5rahuFsZbm4gkgUhpHLLr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:136745'),
  ('30936358900774176', 'Shinkalion Change the World', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Hiiro Ishibashi, Shimba Tsuchiya, Kensho Ono, Eri Kitamura, Kaede Hondo, Chikahiro Kobayashi, Hana Tamegai', 'TV-14', 'Once upon a time, an unidentified enemy, the Unknown, suddenly appeared. The "Super Evolutionary Railway Development Agency," had developed the "Shinkalion," a robot that transforms into a bullet train, as a countermeasure against this threat. "I want to be a cool person who can protect something..." Taisei Oonari, a second-year junior high school student, transfers to Shinkai Gakuen Middle School in search of clues about his older sister who disappeared two years ago. Just then, the Unknown appears for the first time in 10 years. Taisei happens to have a high aptitude value as a Shinkalion pilot, and is forced to make a decision to fight it. What is the true nature of the Unknown and what is its purpose? What is the truth that comes to light at the end of the fight? The story of the boys'' determination and growth begins now.', 'Once upon a time, an unidentified enemy, the Unknown, suddenly appeared. The "Super Evolutionary Railway Development Agency," had developed the "Shinkalion," a robot that transforms into a bullet train, as a countermeasure against this threat. "I want to be a cool person who can protect something..." Taisei Oonari, a second-year junior high school student, transfers to Shinkai Gakuen Middle School in search of clues about his older sister who disappeared two years ago. Just then, the Unknown appears for the first time in 10 years. Taisei happens to have a high aptitude value as a Shinkalion pilot, and is forced to make a decision to fight it. What is the true nature of the Unknown and what is its purpose? What is the truth that comes to light at the end of the fight? The story of the boys'' determination and growth begins now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzbIqmisP0CIDpuqbuguUBvgzJj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:245884'),
  ('230079294124849926', 'Shinkansen Henkei Robo Shinkalion: THE ANIMATION', 2018, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Takahiro Ikezoe', null, null, null, 'Hayato Hayasugi (his last name is a pun on the words for "too fast") and other children will serve as conductors to pilot the Shinkalion. The Shinkalion robots are various models of real-life Japanese bullet trains (shinkansen) that transform into robots to fight an unknown evil to protect the safety and peace of Japan. The children must work together with the adults of the Shinkansen Ultra Evolution Institute (SUEI) to defeat a monster that looks like a jet black bullet train.', 'Hayato Hayasugi (his last name is a pun on the words for "too fast") and other children will serve as conductors to pilot the Shinkalion. The Shinkalion robots are various models of real-life Japanese bullet trains (shinkansen) that transform into robots to fight an unknown evil to protect the safety and peace of Japan. The children must work together with the adults of the Shinkansen Ultra Evolution Institute (SUEI) to defeat a monster that looks like a jet black bullet train.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kRAEswoPMyvmfOT3bdfP5Cfd3q9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:76100'),
  ('158471628513057362', 'Shinobi no Ittoki', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Ryota Osaka, Katsuyuki Konishi, Haruka Shiraishi, Kikuko Inoue, Aoi Yuuki, Hitomi Sekine, Miyu Tomita', 'TV-14', 'A descendent of the Iga Ninja Clan trains to become a shinobi and fights against the rival Koga Clan!', 'A descendent of the Iga Ninja Clan trains to become a shinobi and fights against the rival Koga Clan!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2zg8z6krPm8sjfwPRyDVUgRvL9g.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158293'),
  ('460657962163014111', 'Shiny Happy People', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Amy King, Dillon King, Jeff Sharlet', 'TV-14', 'A limited docuseries exposing the truth beneath the wholesome Americana surface of reality tv’s favorite mega-family, The Duggars, and the radical organization behind them: The Institute in Basic Life Principles. As details of the family and their scandals unfold, we realize they’re part of an insidious, much larger threat already in motion, with democracy itself in peril.', 'A limited docuseries exposing the truth beneath the wholesome Americana surface of reality tv’s favorite mega-family, The Duggars, and the radical organization behind them: The Institute in Basic Life Principles. As details of the family and their scandals unfold, we realize they’re part of an insidious, much larger threat already in motion, with democracy itself in peril.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYoh3YfEkyqQbHZ8sRtJDMPELpx.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:226751'),
  ('1136183683529384843', 'Shinzanmono', 2010, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Hiroshi Abe, Tomokazu Miura, Junpei Mizobata, Meisa Kuroki, Mieko Harada, Takashi Sasano, Osamu Mukai, Yuichi Kimura', null, 'In the Ningyo-cho area of Nihonbashi, Tokyo - a woman was murdered. Detective Kaga Kyoichiro, who just transferred to the Nihonbashi police precinct, is placed in charge of the murder case. With virtually the entire residents of Ningyo-cho''s shopping street emerging as suspects, Detective Kaga must use his keen sense of deductive reasoning to uncover the truth.', 'In the Ningyo-cho area of Nihonbashi, Tokyo - a woman was murdered. Detective Kaga Kyoichiro, who just transferred to the Nihonbashi police precinct, is placed in charge of the murder case. With virtually the entire residents of Ningyo-cho''s shopping street emerging as suspects, Detective Kaga must use his keen sense of deductive reasoning to uncover the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7KGl9ZPdBiOK6I8WARhAiThGj5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45976'),
  ('717875640907330947', 'Shinzo', 2000, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Yuko Minaguchi, Minami Takayama, Yasuhiko Kawazu, Naoki Tatsuta, Tsutomu Kashiwakura, Fushigi Yamada, Chie Sawaguchi, Ai Maeda', null, 'Shinzo, known as Mushrambo in Japan, is an anime produced by Toei Animation and based on the Chinese legend Journey to the West. In the series, creatures known as Enterrans take over Earth and rename it in their own image: Enterra. Now three Enterrans have to protect the last human in order to restore the human race. The anime focuses primarily on the adventures they undergo while working to accomplish this task.', 'Shinzo, known as Mushrambo in Japan, is an anime produced by Toei Animation and based on the Chinese legend Journey to the West. In the series, creatures known as Enterrans take over Earth and rename it in their own image: Enterra. Now three Enterrans have to protect the last human in order to restore the human race. The anime focuses primarily on the adventures they undergo while working to accomplish this task.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oiAajUalnrbXDSFXjtD2LYSW2zg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21175'),
  ('729403950277478828', 'Shipping Wars', 2012, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, 'Dwight Fountain, Tyesha Fountain, Natasha Schneider, Doug Smith, Molly Rivero, Russell Rivero, Tamara Brock', 'TV-PG', 'Shipping Wars is a reality TV series on A&E that began airing on January 10, 2012. The show follows six independent carriers who have discovered that fortunes can be made transporting items that traditional carriers either cannot or will not haul. The series also features uShip, the world’s largest online auction house for independent truckers. For Season 1, the featured carriers are Marc Springer, Roy Garber, Jennifer Brennan, Jarrett Joyce, and Suzanne and Scott Bawcom. Starting with Season 2, the Bawcoms are replaced by the team of Christopher Hanna and Robbie Welsh. Season 3 premiered on December 12, 2012 . New shippers Johnny Chavez and the team of Chelsea Grant and Courtney Aguilera appear in Season 4.', 'Shipping Wars is a reality TV series on A&E that began airing on January 10, 2012. The show follows six independent carriers who have discovered that fortunes can be made transporting items that traditional carriers either cannot or will not haul. The series also features uShip, the world’s largest online auction house for independent truckers. For Season 1, the featured carriers are Marc Springer, Roy Garber, Jennifer Brennan, Jarrett Joyce, and Suzanne and Scott Bawcom. Starting with Season 2, the Bawcoms are replaced by the team of Christopher Hanna and Robbie Welsh. Season 3 premiered on December 12, 2012 . New shippers Johnny Chavez and the team of Chelsea Grant and Courtney Aguilera appear in Season 4.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcZTjWs5ajlLaHjsahSKP6R3JdP.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:50592'),
  ('720970296430708004', 'Shirley Temple''s Storybook', 1958, 'Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shirley Temple', null, 'Shirley Temple''s Storybook is an American children''s anthology series hosted and narrated by actress Shirley Temple. The series features adaptations of fairy tales like Mother Goose and other family-oriented stories performed by well-known actors, although one episode, an adaptation of The House of the Seven Gables, was meant for older youngsters. Temple''s three children made their acting debuts in the last episode of the first season, "Mother Goose".', 'Shirley Temple''s Storybook is an American children''s anthology series hosted and narrated by actress Shirley Temple. The series features adaptations of fairy tales like Mother Goose and other family-oriented stories performed by well-known actors, although one episode, an adaptation of The House of the Seven Gables, was meant for older youngsters. Temple''s three children made their acting debuts in the last episode of the first season, "Mother Goose".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/144kJt2W8rBEvG579ncQAS2X2wB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:18768'),
  ('997633841418846786', 'SHIROBAKO', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Juri Kimura', 'TV-14', 'In a school in northeastern Japan, five friends in the animation club, Aoi, Ema, Shizuka, Misa, and Midori swear to complete a new anime called "Shinbutsu Konkou SHICHIFUKUJIN" with some donuts. Since then, day after day, the five spend all of their time on anime production. The awe of going from rough sketches to animation, and the awkward acting in the after-recording session... The final product was finished at the cultural fair six months later. After they graduated they still pursued animation and swore on some donuts that they would make another anime together.', 'In a school in northeastern Japan, five friends in the animation club, Aoi, Ema, Shizuka, Misa, and Midori swear to complete a new anime called "Shinbutsu Konkou SHICHIFUKUJIN" with some donuts. Since then, day after day, the five spend all of their time on anime production. The awe of going from rough sketches to animation, and the awkward acting in the after-recording session... The final product was finished at the cultural fair six months later. After they graduated they still pursued animation and swore on some donuts that they would make another anime together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGcyyvixbsJpgMngSCULFvbnpBK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64492'),
  ('566838246039067192', 'Shironeko Project: Zero Chronicle', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuki Kaji, Yui Horie, Takuya Iwabata, Kensuke Matsui, Una Nagisa, Shogo Batori, Chise Nakamura, Katsuyuki Miura', null, 'In a world consisting of numerous isles, a young hero from the Astora Isle encounters the adventurer Kyle and follows him on an expedition on the isle. They meet a mysterious girl named Iris and a talking white cat, and together they make their way to the isle''s ruins, where they find a flying island. Kyle becomes consumed by darkness there, and the party resolves to travel to the ends of the world on the flying island in order to find the seven "Great Runes", following Kyle''s words before he disappeared.', 'In a world consisting of numerous isles, a young hero from the Astora Isle encounters the adventurer Kyle and follows him on an expedition on the isle. They meet a mysterious girl named Iris and a talking white cat, and together they make their way to the isle''s ruins, where they find a flying island. Kyle becomes consumed by darkness there, and the party resolves to travel to the ends of the world on the flying island in order to find the seven "Great Runes", following Kyle''s words before he disappeared.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4kC9XyXhOK7BLEDyDwQzGy0OS1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93649'),
  ('429108095317034812', 'Shirt Tales', 1982, 'Family, Animation, Kids', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna, Janet Elizabeth Manco', null, 'Ronnie Schell, Steven Schatzberg, Patricia Parris, Bob Ogle, Fred Travalena, Herb Vigran, Nancy Cartwright', 'TV-G', 'Shirt tales is an American animated series that aired on NBC from September 18, 1982 to January 21, 1984. The series featured animal characters, created in 1980 by greeting card designer Janet Elizabeth Manco, that were among Hallmark Cards'' best sellers at the time.', 'Shirt tales is an American animated series that aired on NBC from September 18, 1982 to January 21, 1984. The series featured animal characters, created in 1980 by greeting card designer Janet Elizabeth Manco, that were among Hallmark Cards'' best sellers at the time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/htaoChPiv08qVLyDS5UWd605mlr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:34868'),
  ('303663222348717831', 'Shitamachi Rocket', 2015, 'Drama', null, null, 'Hiroshi Abe, Soko Wada, Ken Yasuda, Tao Tsuchiya, Hiroki Konno, Tomoya Nakamura, Miki Maya, Koji Kikkawa', null, 'Tsukuda Kohei was once a researcher with the Aerospace and Science Exploration Agency and now runs Tsukuda Industries, a small factory which was left by his father. Although his relationship with his teenage daughter Rina is somewhat strained, business at Tsukuda Industries has gradually started to improve. But Tsukuda puts too much effort into his dream of developing a rocket engine and business declines little by little. One day, a major client suddenly declares that it is dropping Tsukuda Industries. Then, Tsukuda Industries gets sued by a big rival company, Nakashima Industries, for patent infringement. Tsukuda Industries’ reputation is hurt and financing from banks is also in a desperate situation. In the midst of this, Teikoku Heavy Industries, one of Japan’s leading corporations, offers to buy a patent which Tsukuda Industries possesses for 2 billion yen', 'Tsukuda Kohei was once a researcher with the Aerospace and Science Exploration Agency and now runs Tsukuda Industries, a small factory which was left by his father. Although his relationship with his teenage daughter Rina is somewhat strained, business at Tsukuda Industries has gradually started to improve. But Tsukuda puts too much effort into his dream of developing a rocket engine and business declines little by little. One day, a major client suddenly declares that it is dropping Tsukuda Industries. Then, Tsukuda Industries gets sued by a big rival company, Nakashima Industries, for patent infringement. Tsukuda Industries’ reputation is hurt and financing from banks is also in a desperate situation. In the midst of this, Teikoku Heavy Industries, one of Japan’s leading corporations, offers to buy a patent which Tsukuda Industries possesses for 2 billion yen', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wP17TxZrHmL8Tk0pewlIvJvVHc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69410'),
  ('471174385299665449', 'Shitsuren Karuta', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Minami Umezawa, Sho Nishigaki, Konatsu Kato, Jiei Wakabayashi, Gen Itô, Keishi Arai, Masaya Sakuragi, Alan Abe', null, 'After watching a friend run away from her own wedding, three former university board-game club friends are forced to confront their tangled love lives and what they really want from relationships.', 'After watching a friend run away from her own wedding, three former university board-game club friends are forced to confront their tangled love lives and what they really want from relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEnF7R3LUiOWCSHVfaSznvYipTV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:315507'),
  ('374544550672936224', 'Shock and Awe: The Story of Electricity', 2011, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Jim Al-Khalili', null, 'Professor Jim Al-Khalili tells the electrifying story of our quest to master nature''s most mysterious force - electricity. Until fairly recently, electricity was seen as a magical power, but it is now the lifeblood of the modern world and underpins every aspect of our technological advancements. Without electricity, we would be lost. This series tells of dazzling leaps of imagination and extraordinary experiments - a story of maverick geniuses who used electricity to light our cities, to communicate across the seas and through the air, to create modern industry and to give us the digital revolution.', 'Professor Jim Al-Khalili tells the electrifying story of our quest to master nature''s most mysterious force - electricity. Until fairly recently, electricity was seen as a magical power, but it is now the lifeblood of the modern world and underpins every aspect of our technological advancements. Without electricity, we would be lost. This series tells of dazzling leaps of imagination and extraordinary experiments - a story of maverick geniuses who used electricity to light our cities, to communicate across the seas and through the air, to create modern industry and to give us the digital revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f9K1KHYszHnzd1dojjlzWIeFCot.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43867'),
  ('1099561740945403916', 'Shockers', 1999, 'Drama', null, null, null, null, 'An anthology series of horror stories by contemporary British screenwriters.', 'An anthology series of horror stories by contemporary British screenwriters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjVL0eCMiHAlKMmWy6Wy8kHSUmi.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:299052'),
  ('200218242944519101', 'Shoestring', 1979, 'Crime, Drama', 'Robert Banks Stewart, Richard Harris', null, 'Trevor Eve, Doran Godwin, Liz Crowther, Michael Medwin', null, 'Shoestring is a BBC detective drana set in Bristol and starring Trevor Eve as private detective Eddie Shoestring, who operatee his own show on Radio West, the local radio station. The programme ran between 30 September 1979 and 21 December 1980, in two series with 21 hour-long episodes. Eve opted not to return after two series, as he wanted to diversify into theatre, so the production team changed the setting to Jersey and created Bergerac, also following a detective returning to work after a bad period in his life.', 'Shoestring is a BBC detective drana set in Bristol and starring Trevor Eve as private detective Eddie Shoestring, who operatee his own show on Radio West, the local radio station. The programme ran between 30 September 1979 and 21 December 1980, in two series with 21 hour-long episodes. Eve opted not to return after two series, as he wanted to diversify into theatre, so the production team changed the setting to Jersey and created Bergerac, also following a detective returning to work after a bad period in his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pW26431XZgK7QeYJmNrc7a0bf4y.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1943'),
  ('5113190383011793', 'Shōgun', 1980, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, War & Politics', 'James Clavell', null, 'Richard Chamberlain, Toshirō Mifune, Yoko Shimada, John Rhys-Davies, Damien Thomas, Frankie Sakai, Yūki Meguro, Hiromi Senno', 'TV-14', 'An English navigator becomes both a player and pawn in complex political games in feudal Japan.', 'An English navigator becomes both a player and pawn in complex political games in feudal Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfcbFozvKkC2dRqsNn0soIHGfBL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13862'),
  ('801391096321047046', 'Shōgun', 2024, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Rachel Kondo, Justin Marks', 'Emily Yoshida', 'Hiroyuki Sanada, Cosmo Jarvis, Anna Sawai, Tadanobu Asano, Takehiro Hira, Tommy Bastow, Fumi Nikaido', 'TV-MA', 'In Japan in the year 1600, at the dawn of a century-defining civil war, Lord Yoshii Toranaga is fighting for his life as his enemies on the Council of Regents unite against him, when a mysterious European ship is found marooned in a nearby fishing village.', 'In Japan in the year 1600, at the dawn of a century-defining civil war, Lord Yoshii Toranaga is fighting for his life as his enemies on the Council of Regents unite against him, when a mysterious European ship is found marooned in a nearby fishing village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7O4iVfOMQmdCSxhOg1WnzG1AgYT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126308'),
  ('365042949793322512', 'Shomin Sample', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Rika Tachibana, Yu Serizawa, Atsushi Tamaru, Kaito Ishikawa, Yuuki Kuwahara, Chitose Morinaga, Saori Onishi, Yumi Hara', 'TV-14', 'Kimito Kagurazaka is an ordinary high school boy who is kidnapped by an elite young lady''s academy to be a "sample of the common people." The school is full of sheltered girls who have never met male peers before.', 'Kimito Kagurazaka is an ordinary high school boy who is kidnapped by an elite young lady''s academy to be a "sample of the common people." The school is full of sheltered girls who have never met male peers before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bUCMLqtoYVywYcLu1XlxGGlRot5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64552'),
  ('431134359341260311', 'Shomuni', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Makiko Esumi, Tsubasa Honda, Becky, Sakura Ando, Kanna Mori, Keiko Horiuchi, Rika Izumi', null, 'Shomuni, that''s the common name given to General Affairs Section 2 of a trading company. Here are six women who have ended up in this department known as "the dump" for office ladies. But Chinatsu Tsuboi (Makiko Esumi) declares that the value of woman is equal to the number of men. With her as the central focus they create a totally new type of office lady drama that does away with those heartless men still caught up in worn-out social ideas and the class system within the company.', 'Shomuni, that''s the common name given to General Affairs Section 2 of a trading company. Here are six women who have ended up in this department known as "the dump" for office ladies. But Chinatsu Tsuboi (Makiko Esumi) declares that the value of woman is equal to the number of men. With her as the central focus they create a totally new type of office lady drama that does away with those heartless men still caught up in worn-out social ideas and the class system within the company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tX9H3zdrOZQMVkmTQJiRZPr6jw4.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:9279'),
  ('706062373998658480', 'Shonen Maid', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Natsumi Fujiwara, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Asuna Tomari, Kaede Hondo, Kazutomi Yamamoto, Taku Yashiro, Mitsuki Saiga, Yukari Tamura', 'TV-PG', 'After the loss of his mother, Chihiro is left alone. With no known family left, he has to find a way to move on. Things aren’t looking good until a chance encounter with the young and handsome Madoka—who turns out to be his wealthy uncle! Madoka offers him his home and all Chihiro has to do is clean up after the messy, irresponsible man. The problem? This job requires a uniform—a maid outfit!', 'After the loss of his mother, Chihiro is left alone. With no known family left, he has to find a way to move on. Things aren’t looking good until a chance encounter with the young and handsome Madoka—who turns out to be his wealthy uncle! Madoka offers him his home and all Chihiro has to do is clean up after the messy, irresponsible man. The problem? This job requires a uniform—a maid outfit!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bk7I3TJ4xfk3iXG0M9mOCN9zAKW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66112'),
  ('261321328049536207', 'Shooter', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, War & Politics, Drama', 'John Hlavin', null, 'Ryan Phillippe, Shantel VanSanten, Cynthia Addai-Robinson, Omar Epps, Jesse Bradford', 'TV-14', 'Bob Lee Swagger is an expert marksman living in exile who is coaxed back into action after learning of a plot to kill the president.', 'Bob Lee Swagger is an expert marksman living in exile who is coaxed back into action after learning of a plot to kill the president.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMmqtafm6Rdlka1ejJeC9BDWzyO.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:66857'),
  ('702417193818822904', 'Shooting Stars', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Bob Mortimer, Vic Reeves', null, 'Bob Mortimer, Ulrika Jonsson, Vic Reeves, Jack Dee, Dan Renton Skinner, Nico Tatarowicz', null, 'Shooting Stars is a British television comedy panel game broadcast on BBC Two as a pilot in 1993, then as 3 full series from 1995 to 1997, then on BBC Choice from January to December 2002 with 2 series before returning to BBC Two for another 3 series from 2008 until its cancellation in 2011. Created and hosted by double-act Vic Reeves and Bob Mortimer, it uses the panel show format but with the comedians'' often slapstick, surreal and anarchic humour does not rely on rules in order to function, with the pair apparently ignoring existing rules or inventing new ones as and when the mood takes them.', 'Shooting Stars is a British television comedy panel game broadcast on BBC Two as a pilot in 1993, then as 3 full series from 1995 to 1997, then on BBC Choice from January to December 2002 with 2 series before returning to BBC Two for another 3 series from 2008 until its cancellation in 2011. Created and hosted by double-act Vic Reeves and Bob Mortimer, it uses the panel show format but with the comedians'' often slapstick, surreal and anarchic humour does not rely on rules in order to function, with the pair apparently ignoring existing rules or inventing new ones as and when the mood takes them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ka9GgXvA2zUxiqiimA0O3AhOzBf.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:816'),
  ('1072168322580080502', 'Shooting Stars', 2021, 'Reality', null, null, 'Bae Seong-jae, Lee Su-geun, Lee Chun-soo, Nam Hyeon-hee, Oh Na-mi, Han Chae-a, Lee Sung-mi, Shin Bong-sun', null, 'Female soccer teams comprised of celebrities and non celebrities, working together to battle it out on the soccer field. Most have little soccer experience, but with the coaching from various Korean soccer legends, the team members grow with a fierce passion that leads to inspiring victories and regretful losses. Each team is grouped by certain types i.e. comedians, models, foreigners, actresses, etc. Unpredictable and exciting, the games are filled with fun intensity and emotions on high.', 'Female soccer teams comprised of celebrities and non celebrities, working together to battle it out on the soccer field. Most have little soccer experience, but with the coaching from various Korean soccer legends, the team members grow with a fierce passion that leads to inspiring victories and regretful losses. Each team is grouped by certain types i.e. comedians, models, foreigners, actresses, etc. Unpredictable and exciting, the games are filled with fun intensity and emotions on high.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJsELNZ2fJcI3tPuzM3wTZLjsWh.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:127231'),
  ('952599469493739525', 'Shooting Stars', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Lee Sung-kyung, Kim Young-dae, Yoon Jong-hoon, Kim Yoon-hye, Park So-jin, Lee Jung-shin, Ha Do-kwon, Lee Seung-hyub', null, 'Frustrations and feelings collide when a dynamic PR executive finds herself working with her irksome nemesis — who happens to be a megastar client.', 'Frustrations and feelings collide when a dynamic PR executive finds herself working with her irksome nemesis — who happens to be a megastar client.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wH8ZDJLFEIPsDHanefBEbt8FS3A.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:136732'),
  ('282769634264340289', 'Shopaholic Louis', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kim Sang-ho', null, 'Seo In-guk, Nam Ji-hyun, Yoon Sang-hyun, Lim Se-mi, Oh Dae-hwan, Kim Yeong-ok, Uhm Hyo-seop, Kim Sun-young', null, 'A romance takes place between Kang Ji-Sung aka Louie and Ko Bok-Sil. Louie is from a rich family, but he has lost his memory. Ko Bok-Sil is a woman with a heart like an angel. Louie learns about true love after meeting Ko Bok-Sil.', 'A romance takes place between Kang Ji-Sung aka Louie and Ko Bok-Sil. Louie is from a rich family, but he has lost his memory. Ko Bok-Sil is a woman with a heart like an angel. Louie learns about true love after meeting Ko Bok-Sil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxXgYXjBPr19ylM0f8kuY3bn8fM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67272'),
  ('209502053038654009', 'Shopping Queen', 2012, 'Reality, Soap', null, null, 'Guido Maria Kretschmer, Thorsten Schorn', null, '"Shopping Queen" is a styling documentary in which five women compete against each other on five consecutive days each week to become the woman with the best style and the best sense of fashion.', '"Shopping Queen" is a styling documentary in which five women compete against each other on five consecutive days each week to become the woman with the best style and the best sense of fashion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ucE44IzwL20BQwsCSz37vyWYtmT.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:93768'),
