  ('599876882549514942', 'Sin tu mirada', 2017, 'Family, Drama', 'Delia Fiallo, Ignacio Sada Madero', null, 'Claudia Martín, Osvaldo de León, Ana Martín, Claudia Ramírez, Luz Elena González, Eduardo Santamarina, Carlos de la Mota, Cecilia Toussaint', 'NR', 'A Mexican telenovela revolving around Marina, a blind woman who because of her disability has developed a great sensitivity.', 'A Mexican telenovela revolving around Marina, a blind woman who because of her disability has developed a great sensitivity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j76mEuvf6Lidb8U2QDEMTaJ8ZJz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78214'),
  ('150226911141554159', 'Sinatra: All or Nothing at All', 2015, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Frank Sinatra, Gina Gershon, Christine Baranski, Vincent D''Onofrio', null, 'An up-close and personal examination of the life, music and career of the legendary entertainer. Told in his own words from hours of archived interviews, along with commentary from those closest to him, the documentary weaves the music and images from Sinatra’s life together with rarely seen footage of his famous 1971 “Retirement Concert” in Los Angeles. The film’s narrative is shaped by Sinatra’s song choices for that concert, which Gibney interprets as the singer’s personal guide through his own life.', 'An up-close and personal examination of the life, music and career of the legendary entertainer. Told in his own words from hours of archived interviews, along with commentary from those closest to him, the documentary weaves the music and images from Sinatra’s life together with rarely seen footage of his famous 1971 “Retirement Concert” in Los Angeles. The film’s narrative is shaped by Sinatra’s song choices for that concert, which Gibney interprets as the singer’s personal guide through his own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iq1JA7d2UeVqViQ8jvR3i2rG4vz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76690'),
  ('395890335467406477', 'Sinbad', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Family', 'Andy Wilson', null, 'Elliot Knight, Marama Corlett, Elliot Cowan, Junix Inocian, Dimitri Leonidas, Orla Brady, Estella Daniels, Naveen Andrews', 'TV-PG', 'Sinbad accidentally kills the son of the powerful Lord Akbari in a fist fight. As recompense for the blood debt, Sinbad''s brother is killed in front of his eyes. Sinbad escapes, but his grandmother uses a magic talisman to curse him for the death of his brother. The curse prevents Sinbad from staying on land for more than one day; if he tarries the talisman will choke him to death. This prohibition against remaining on land leads to a life of adventure at sea that holds many wonders. Sinbad is unaware that he is still being hunted by Lord Akbari, who does not consider Sinbad''s brother''s death as sufficient payment of the blood debt.', 'Sinbad accidentally kills the son of the powerful Lord Akbari in a fist fight. As recompense for the blood debt, Sinbad''s brother is killed in front of his eyes. Sinbad escapes, but his grandmother uses a magic talisman to curse him for the death of his brother. The curse prevents Sinbad from staying on land for more than one day; if he tarries the talisman will choke him to death. This prohibition against remaining on land leads to a life of adventure at sea that holds many wonders. Sinbad is unaware that he is still being hunted by Lord Akbari, who does not consider Sinbad''s brother''s death as sufficient payment of the blood debt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9SaLscmXj3cJUKJaLQcA7ONuVWB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40187'),
  ('715598646776100813', 'Sindbad the Sailor', 1975, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation', null, null, 'Koji Yada, Akira Kamiya, Ichiro Nagai, Mahito Tsujimura, Noriko Ohara, Eiko Masuyama, Junko Hori, Kazuko Sugiyama', 'TV-G', 'More than 1200 years ago, the impish Sindbad, a mischievous boy full of curiosity, sneaks into the royal palace to watch the acrobatic performances and learns that a wide world awaits beyond Baghdad. Hearing of the travels of his uncle Captain Ali, Sindbad decides to become a sailor and travel around the world. Leaving behind a note to his father, young Sindbad boards Captain Ali’s ship and-accompanied by a myna called Sheila-sets out for the greatest adventure of his life.', 'More than 1200 years ago, the impish Sindbad, a mischievous boy full of curiosity, sneaks into the royal palace to watch the acrobatic performances and learns that a wide world awaits beyond Baghdad. Hearing of the travels of his uncle Captain Ali, Sindbad decides to become a sailor and travel around the world. Leaving behind a note to his father, young Sindbad boards Captain Ali’s ship and-accompanied by a myna called Sheila-sets out for the greatest adventure of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ibmiDq8v4LVkdCz8pdS0Nk9wAsm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21174'),
  ('662602036648770442', 'SING "YESTERDAY" FOR ME', 2020, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Chikahiro Kobayashi, Yume Miyamoto, Kana Hanazawa, Natsuki Hanae, Maaya Sakamoto, Tatsuhisa Suzuki', 'TV-14', 'After college, Rikuo Uozumi, a boy without much ambition in life, takes on a job at a convenience store. The days pass by uneventfully for Rikuo until he meets his former girlfriend and classmate, but especially thanks to the unusual Haru Nonaka, and her pet raven...', 'After college, Rikuo Uozumi, a boy without much ambition in life, takes on a job at a convenience store. The days pass by uneventfully for Rikuo until he meets his former girlfriend and classmate, but especially thanks to the unusual Haru Nonaka, and her pet raven...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8PSu4Mdqihe9gYjfqKDya0krhh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95550'),
  ('1086749260204723073', 'Sing Again', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Apinnat Chanbunsai, Pakapol Srirongmuang', 'Suppapong Udomkaewkanjana, Talay Sanguandikul, Nara Thepnupha, Wae Soul, Chonnikan Netjui, Chawinroj Likitchareonsakul, Patchanon Ounsa-ard, Thanavate Siriwattanakul', null, 'Twins Sol and Sun are almost as different as night from day, but one thing they have in common is their mutual love for Piano, a girl who moved into the neighborhood when they were all kids and who they''ve been besties with ever since. They also share a dream of making it big in the music industry and together they barely manage to get into the Plus Artist Academy contest that''s on the hunt for new Thai talent. A twist of fate, however, smashes their dreams, and turns Sun and Piano against Sol who got hired to be a member of a new Thai boy band by the Empire agency. But all isn''t as it seems. Can the friends reconcile or is it too late to forgive when so much hurt has happened?', 'Twins Sol and Sun are almost as different as night from day, but one thing they have in common is their mutual love for Piano, a girl who moved into the neighborhood when they were all kids and who they''ve been besties with ever since. They also share a dream of making it big in the music industry and together they barely manage to get into the Plus Artist Academy contest that''s on the hunt for new Thai talent. A twist of fate, however, smashes their dreams, and turns Sun and Piano against Sol who got hired to be a member of a new Thai boy band by the Empire agency. But all isn''t as it seems. Can the friends reconcile or is it too late to forgive when so much hurt has happened?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPRcPYkh53tdNIcsBxbUZfn5ryC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:205215'),
  ('21805996089607825', 'Sing My Crush', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Xiao Jun Wen', 'Lee Do-ah', 'Jang Do-yun, Son Hyun-woo, Bang Yoo-in, Koo Ja-geon, Kwak Tae-hyeok', null, 'After a disastrous first encounter between Ba-ram and Han-tae during their school years, the two strike up an unlikely and close friendship in the aftermath. Years later, will Ba-ram be able to keep his crush on Han-tae a secret any longer?', 'After a disastrous first encounter between Ba-ram and Han-tae during their school years, the two strike up an unlikely and close friendship in the aftermath. Years later, will Ba-ram be able to keep his crush on Han-tae a secret any longer?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z3JtBhK3zln3k7DQn5yynCwQ5Jd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:231030'),
  ('323779081441520428', 'Sing! China', 2012, 'Reality', 'Jin Lei', null, 'Emil Chau, Wilber Pan, Xue Zhiqian, Henry Lau', null, 'Sing! China (Chinese: 中国好声音; pinyin: Zhōngguó Hǎo Shēngyīn; formerly Chinese: 中国新歌声; pinyin: Zhōngguó Xīn Gēshēng) is a Chinese singing competition television series broadcast on Zhejiang Television. It is produced by Star (CM) Holdings Ltd.[1] It premiered during the summer on 15 July 2016. It is a re-branded version of The Voice of China, a show based on the original The Voice of Holland. It has aired seven seasons and aims to find new singing talent (solo or duets, professional and amateur) contested by aspiring singers, aged 18 or older (16 or older in seasons one and two), drawn from public auditions. The winner is determined by live audience voting by SMS text. They receive a record deal with various labels for winning the competition. (Wikipedia)', 'Sing! China (Chinese: 中国好声音; pinyin: Zhōngguó Hǎo Shēngyīn; formerly Chinese: 中国新歌声; pinyin: Zhōngguó Xīn Gēshēng) is a Chinese singing competition television series broadcast on Zhejiang Television. It is produced by Star (CM) Holdings Ltd.[1] It premiered during the summer on 15 July 2016. It is a re-branded version of The Voice of China, a show based on the original The Voice of Holland. It has aired seven seasons and aims to find new singing talent (solo or duets, professional and amateur) contested by aspiring singers, aged 18 or older (16 or older in seasons one and two), drawn from public auditions. The winner is determined by live audience voting by SMS text. They receive a record deal with various labels for winning the competition. (Wikipedia)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSNgXO5nUHoPQvRMZDkWznH9H84.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:108210'),
  ('92934011054146252', 'SINGER', 2013, 'Reality', null, '王婷', 'Mickey Guyton, Charlie Puth, Shan Yichun, Michael Bublé, Grace Kinstler, Beni, Chen Chusheng, GAI', null, 'SINGER, formerly known as I AM A SINGER, is a large-scale singing competition program co-produced by Hunan Broadcasting System (HBS) and Mango TV. The first four seasons were adapted from the Korean reality show I Am a Singer produced by MBC. Beginning with the 2017 season, the program was rebranded as SINGER. The series brings together established vocalists from the Chinese music industry as well as internationally renowned artists to compete on stage. In each episode, the results are determined by a panel of 500 in-studio audience judges who vote to decide the singers’ rankings and eliminations. Starting with the 2024 season, the show shifted from pre-recorded broadcasts to fully live performances and introduced an additional panel of 500 online international audience judges.', 'SINGER, formerly known as I AM A SINGER, is a large-scale singing competition program co-produced by Hunan Broadcasting System (HBS) and Mango TV. The first four seasons were adapted from the Korean reality show I Am a Singer produced by MBC. Beginning with the 2017 season, the program was rebranded as SINGER. The series brings together established vocalists from the Chinese music industry as well as internationally renowned artists to compete on stage. In each episode, the results are determined by a panel of 500 in-studio audience judges who vote to decide the singers’ rankings and eliminations. Starting with the 2024 season, the show shifted from pre-recorded broadcasts to fully live performances and introduced an additional panel of 500 online international audience judges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ndDXmRQLOEYE795Qp0FrsvtGPCF.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:107467'),
  ('236738893187024881', 'Singing All Along', 2016, 'Drama, War & Politics, Action & Adventure', null, 'Wang Xiao Quan', 'Ruby Lin, Yuan Hong, Wang Yuanke, Zong Fengyan, Kenny Kwan, Li Jiahang, Apollo Yu, Zhao Changzhou', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbjDSq281rKYQFl4w7HFFoh25nD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127086'),
  ('974173818880170523', 'Singing With Legends', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xYRk4VUQbz0kLArmscgIj5u762B.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:99496'),
  ('708087972521109159', 'Single Drunk Female', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Simone Finch', null, 'Sofia Black-D''Elia, Ally Sheedy, Sasha Compère, Lily Mae Harrington, Garrick Bernard, Ian Gomez', 'TV-14', 'A public flame-out at a New York media company forces 20-something alcoholic Samantha Fink to seize the only chance she has to sober up and avoid jail time: moving back home with her overbearing mother, Carol. Back in Greater Boston, Samantha restarts her life, working at the local grocery store while surrounded by all of the triggers that made her drink in the first place.', 'A public flame-out at a New York media company forces 20-something alcoholic Samantha Fink to seize the only chance she has to sober up and avoid jail time: moving back home with her overbearing mother, Carol. Back in Greater Boston, Samantha restarts her life, working at the local grocery store while surrounded by all of the triggers that made her drink in the first place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZ4AIq36U3SNkoHU7uQYVnNzqXk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:136739'),
  ('1046432346996947774', 'Single Father', 2010, 'Drama', 'Mick Ford', 'Mick Ford', 'David Tennant, Suranne Jones, Millie Innes, Chris Hegarty, Robert Dickson, Warren Brown, Neve McIntosh, Mark Heap', null, 'Dave is facing the seemingly impossible job of bringing up four kids alone after the sudden death of his wife. And things get even more complicated when he falls in love with his wife''s best friend, Sarah. Single Father asks how soon is too soon to fall in love again?', 'Dave is facing the seemingly impossible job of bringing up four kids alone after the sudden death of his wife. And things get even more complicated when he falls in love with his wife''s best friend, Sarah. Single Father asks how soon is too soon to fall in love again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zAV6feYF21vlptOqim5tqgLlcbt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34303'),
  ('567085984616331757', 'Single Ladies', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Stacy A. Littlejohn', null, 'LisaRaye McCoy, Travis Winfrey, LeToya Luckett, Charity Shea, Damien Dante Wayans, Harold ''House'' Moore, Melissa De Sousa', 'TV-14', 'Single Ladies is an American comedy-drama television series on VH1 that debuted on May 30, 2011, as a two-hour television film. Created by Stacy A. Littlejohn and produced by Queen Latifah''s Flavor Unit Entertainment, the series chronicles the lives of three friends — Val, Keisha and April — and their relationships.', 'Single Ladies is an American comedy-drama television series on VH1 that debuted on May 30, 2011, as a two-hour television film. Created by Stacy A. Littlejohn and produced by Queen Latifah''s Flavor Unit Entertainment, the series chronicles the lives of three friends — Val, Keisha and April — and their relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28WyPwxkMr4jhfazcl5t8Xi8jAC.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:39640'),
  ('338628092283376367', 'Single Papa', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Neeraj Udhwani, Ishita Moitra', 'Neeraj Udhwani, Ishita Moitra', 'Kunal Khemu, Neha Dhupia, Manoj Pahwa, Prajakta Koli, Ayesha Raza Mishra, Hami Ali, Suhail Nayyar, Ankur Rathee', 'TV-MA', 'When Gaurav finds a baby in the back of his car, he must defy his eccentric family, the adoption agency and societal norms to become a single papa.', 'When Gaurav finds a baby in the back of his car, he must defy his eccentric family, the adoption agency and societal norms to become a single papa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSj4h1uVAKGn9yVjJTC1tQGcnoZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:292625'),
  ('756915936519252500', 'Single Parents', 2018, 'Comedy', 'J. J. Philbin, Elizabeth Meriwether', null, 'Taran Killam, Leighton Meester, Kimrie Lewis, Jake Choi, Brad Garrett, Marlow Barkley, Tyler Wladis, Devin Trey Campbell', 'TV-PG', 'A group of single parents lean on each other to help raise their 7-year-old kids and maintain some kind of personal lives outside of parenthood.', 'A group of single parents lean on each other to help raise their 7-year-old kids and maintain some kind of personal lives outside of parenthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qL2MIOtTNLEKXGFZ0oKBqwbujIi.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:81127'),
  ('771227145145814493', 'Single Wife', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Lee In-hye', 'Uhm Hyun-kyung, Sung Hyuk, Kwak Hee-Sung, Seo Yu-na, Angus Yang', null, 'A woman prepares for her remarriage to the perfect man, a second generation chaebol, but in the midst of those proceedings, she realizes that her divorce from her ex was never legally finalized. She has to lead a double life, leading both men on until things are settled. However, her ex-husband-to be is involved in an accident and develops amnesia, completely forgetting that they''re no longer a married couple.', 'A woman prepares for her remarriage to the perfect man, a second generation chaebol, but in the midst of those proceedings, she realizes that her divorce from her ex was never legally finalized. She has to lead a double life, leading both men on until things are settled. However, her ex-husband-to be is involved in an accident and develops amnesia, completely forgetting that they''re no longer a married couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1ZmGu2P4Nlf0tZ1ttWPRAlpb5a.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73097'),
  ('341978073678629935', 'Single''s Inferno', 2021, 'Reality, Comedy, Talk', 'Kim Jae-won, Kim Na-hyun', null, 'Lee Da-hee, Cho Kyu-hyun, Hong Jin-kyung, Hanhae, Dex, Song Seung-il, Jo Yi-geon, Kim Min-ji', 'TV-PG', 'On a deserted island, flirtatious singles look for love, because only as a couple can they leave the island for a romantic date in paradise.', 'On a deserted island, flirtatious singles look for love, because only as a couple can they leave the island for a romantic date in paradise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86zkkFCrNc4VeqvCANTmpGNgFEF.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:139798'),
  ('595882312096007698', 'Single''s Inferno Reunion', 2026, 'Reality', null, null, 'Song Seung-il, Cha Been', null, '"Single''s Inferno" contestants reunite to reveal honest feelings and relationship updates — revisiting standout moments from their time on the island.', '"Single''s Inferno" contestants reunite to reveal honest feelings and relationship updates — revisiting standout moments from their time on the island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xgM5WOEzr0Y7MUK0EnuozBw3CKZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:313995'),
  ('717696504361551746', 'Sinhá Moça', 2006, 'Soap, Drama', 'Benedito Ruy Barbosa', 'Edmara Barbosa, Edilene Barbosa', 'Débora Falabella, Danton Mello, Osmar Prado, Patricia Pillar, Eriberto Leão, Vanessa Giácomo, Bruno Gagliasso, Isis Valverde', null, 'Monarchists and republicans meet in Araruna, a small fictional town in the interior of São Paulo, in 1886. The novel portrays the love story of the beautiful and wealthy Sinhá Moça - daughter of the slave, Barão Ferreira de Araruna, and sweet and submissive Mother Candida - , with the young abolitionist lawyer Dr. Rodolfo Fontes - son of Dr. Fontes, and the housewife Inêz. Together, they face the difficulties in the campaign for the abolition of slaves.', 'Monarchists and republicans meet in Araruna, a small fictional town in the interior of São Paulo, in 1886. The novel portrays the love story of the beautiful and wealthy Sinhá Moça - daughter of the slave, Barão Ferreira de Araruna, and sweet and submissive Mother Candida - , with the young abolitionist lawyer Dr. Rodolfo Fontes - son of Dr. Fontes, and the housewife Inêz. Together, they face the difficulties in the campaign for the abolition of slaves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YCyIYB9u6ghpIVB6P3jLNafO5u.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117815'),
  ('1105880438245977224', 'Sinister Beings', 2021, 'Crime, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Ga-Ho Lau, Chi Kong Chan, Sham Kwok Wing', null, 'Rosina Lin, Crystal Fung, Moon Lau, Jonathan Cheung Wing-Hong, Joman Chiang, Ruco Chan, Alex Fong Lik-Sun, Ben Wong Chi-Yin', null, 'Hui Chun-sum is an elite OCTB officer. He is fearless and competent. His boss thinks highly of him, and his colleagues really admire him. But his ultimate dream is to join SDU. Another elite OCTB officer Shum Wai-lik has a shrewd mind and extensive experience. Although the duo have different approaches, but they are like-minded and ideally complement each other. Police suffer heavy casualties as they are ambushed by thugs. To catch the culprit, Chun-sum forgets his dream and stays with OCTB. Moreover, Chun-sum and Wai-lik are faced with successive nasty cases that are tortuous, surreptitious, tricky and baffling. The duo use reverse thinking, psychological game theory and meticulous analysis to decipher the criminals’ thoughts and motives. No crook can escape the long arm of the law!', 'Hui Chun-sum is an elite OCTB officer. He is fearless and competent. His boss thinks highly of him, and his colleagues really admire him. But his ultimate dream is to join SDU. Another elite OCTB officer Shum Wai-lik has a shrewd mind and extensive experience. Although the duo have different approaches, but they are like-minded and ideally complement each other. Police suffer heavy casualties as they are ambushed by thugs. To catch the culprit, Chun-sum forgets his dream and stays with OCTB. Moreover, Chun-sum and Wai-lik are faced with successive nasty cases that are tortuous, surreptitious, tricky and baffling. The duo use reverse thinking, psychological game theory and meticulous analysis to decipher the criminals’ thoughts and motives. No crook can escape the long arm of the law!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8ygqy0d7xrW1Qhpc3Fdaio7Y2d.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:124727'),
  ('1142954631239170914', 'Sins and Roses', 2025, 'Drama', 'Yelda Eroğlu', 'Yelda Eroğlu, Birol Elginöz', 'Murat Yildirim, Cemre Baysel, Serdar Orçin, Emel Çölgeçen, Oya Unustası, Ahmet Saraçoğlu, Aleyna Solaker, Serdar Özer', null, 'As a boy, Serhat lost both his father and fortune but built an empire on family and integrity. His world shatters when his wife Berrak hides a devastating secret and falls into a coma. While searching for answers, his heart hardens—until he meets Zeynep, a passionate florist chasing the same truth, igniting a journey of trust, passion, and redemption.', 'As a boy, Serhat lost both his father and fortune but built an empire on family and integrity. His world shatters when his wife Berrak hides a devastating secret and falls into a coma. While searching for answers, his heart hardens—until he meets Zeynep, a passionate florist chasing the same truth, igniting a journey of trust, passion, and redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Qwhs7xxf9LILllWLnxbSaCBNDf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:300388'),
  ('430701857748806357', 'Sins of Kujo', 2026, 'Crime, Drama', null, 'Nonji Nemoto', 'Yuya Yagira, Hokuto Matsumura, Elaiza Ikeda, Keita Machida', 'TV-MA', 'From thugs to yakuza, Taiza Kujo wields the law to defend society''s worst. Fellow lawyer, Karasuma doubts his ethics but joins him in facing the abyss.', 'From thugs to yakuza, Taiza Kujo wields the law to defend society''s worst. Fellow lawyer, Karasuma doubts his ethics but joins him in facing the abyss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgmYNLdKLNBN5p2vPKuqlpLfeDS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:303405'),
  ('81180553659818916', 'Sins of Our Mother', 2022, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Lori Vallow, Kelsee Ryan', 'TV-14', 'When Lori Vallow''s kids vanished, the search for them unearthed a trail of suspicious deaths, a new husband who shared her doomsday views — and murder.', 'When Lori Vallow''s kids vanished, the search for them unearthed a trail of suspicious deaths, a new husband who shared her doomsday views — and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uoShYiUZU1KSlsnV1CvnkHWT5ao.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208720'),
