  ('580537859792054525', 'Sirens', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Molly Smith Metzler', null, 'Julianne Moore, Meghann Fahy, Milly Alcock, Kevin Bacon, Glenn Howerton, Bill Camp, Felix Solis, Josh Segarra', 'TV-MA', 'Worried about her sister''s too-close relationship with her billionaire boss, a scrappy everywoman seeks answers at a lavish seaside estate.', 'Worried about her sister''s too-close relationship with her billionaire boss, a scrappy everywoman seeks answers at a lavish seaside estate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mezbwX9gFWTXl0XiicS5ZMcdXVx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:246992'),
  ('1152061697493215583', 'Sirius the Jaeger', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Sayaka Ohara, Takehito Koyasu, Kenyu Horiuchi, Nobuo Tobita, Junji Majima, Nanako Mori, Yusuke Kobayashi, Shunsuke Takeuchi', 'TV-MA', 'Imperial Capital, 1930. A strange group of people carrying musical instrument cases landed on Tokyo station. They are called the "Jaegers", who came to hunt vampires. Amongst them, there stood a young man with striking serenity and unusual aura. His name is Yuliy, a werewolf whose home village was destroyed by vampires. Yuliy and the Jaegers engage in deadly battle over a mysterious holy arc only known as "The Arc of Sirius". What truth awaits them at the end...?', 'Imperial Capital, 1930. A strange group of people carrying musical instrument cases landed on Tokyo station. They are called the "Jaegers", who came to hunt vampires. Amongst them, there stood a young man with striking serenity and unusual aura. His name is Yuliy, a werewolf whose home village was destroyed by vampires. Yuliy and the Jaegers engage in deadly battle over a mysterious holy arc only known as "The Arc of Sirius". What truth awaits them at the end...?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mofkUVmQY8e5XMVmVwF5WPjFXmo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80560'),
  ('730439332201885018', 'Sisi', 2021, 'Drama', 'Sven Bohse', null, 'Dominique Devenport, Jannik Schümann, David Korbmann, Désirée Nosbusch, Tanja Schleiff, Julia Stemberger, Pauline Rénevier, Marcus Grüsser', null, '"Sisi" follows the extraordinary life of Empress Elisabeth of Austria. Modern, honest, and authentic. Told from the perspective of her closest confidants, the series takes a new look at the empress'' life and reveals a multi-layered woman.', '"Sisi" follows the extraordinary life of Empress Elisabeth of Austria. Modern, honest, and authentic. Told from the perspective of her closest confidants, the series takes a new look at the empress'' life and reveals a multi-layered woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eR54VLAOWFOR9F9T61yOZJiHnEQ.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:153282'),
  ('787218120445297671', 'Siska', 1998, 'Crime', null, null, 'Werner Schnitzer, Wolfgang Maria Bauer', null, 'Siska is a German television series created by Herbert Reinecker and Helmut Ringelmann and broadcast since October 30, 1998 on the network ZDF. In France, the series was broadcast on France 3 and rebroadcast on 13th Street. It is a police drama and follows the adventures of Peter Siska and later Victor Siska. Anyway it wasn''t the best surname for a policeman because in some languages word "Siska" has extremely close meaning to "Boob" or "Tit". So you''ll never see this series on, for example, Russian television. Croatian Radiotelevision has however shown the series, despite ''Siska'' having the same meaning in the Croatian language', 'Siska is a German television series created by Herbert Reinecker and Helmut Ringelmann and broadcast since October 30, 1998 on the network ZDF. In France, the series was broadcast on France 3 and rebroadcast on 13th Street. It is a police drama and follows the adventures of Peter Siska and later Victor Siska. Anyway it wasn''t the best surname for a policeman because in some languages word "Siska" has extremely close meaning to "Boob" or "Tit". So you''ll never see this series on, for example, Russian television. Croatian Radiotelevision has however shown the series, despite ''Siska'' having the same meaning in the Croatian language', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ccvL25pbyj0x1cC0ElDXeCe1Hmn.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:14954'),
  ('691341968067572394', 'Sistemann ut', 2023, 'Reality', null, null, 'Martin Johnsrud Sundby', null, '40 famous Norwegians are competing in 40 competitions. Each episode contains four different challenges, where the loser must go home.', '40 famous Norwegians are competing in 40 competitions. Each episode contains four different challenges, where the loser must go home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Fb8nSLxazzsECRwEFpM0oDfZeh.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:219899'),
  ('937900302548211643', 'Sister', 2023, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Olga Kartunkova, Anton Bogdanov, Софья Хурсан, Danil Tyabin, Lukerya Ilyashenko, Stepan Devonin, Pavel Rassomakhin, Маша Бриш', null, 'The owner of a popular metropolitan club is suddenly imprisoned. The brother instructs his sister, a prison guard from the outback, with whom he has not communicated for many years, to save the business from imminent loss. A simple Russian woman, far from the fashionable life of the capital, will have to level the affairs of the club and cope with the world of Moscow glamour.', 'The owner of a popular metropolitan club is suddenly imprisoned. The brother instructs his sister, a prison guard from the outback, with whom he has not communicated for many years, to save the business from imminent loss. A simple Russian woman, far from the fashionable life of the capital, will have to level the affairs of the club and cope with the world of Moscow glamour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkM3k0mME5EtgqYmcCktKDiAvDj.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:219735'),
  ('1132387510564760983', 'Sister Boniface Mysteries', 2022, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Jude Tindall', null, 'Lorna Watson, Max Brown, Jerry Iwu, Ami Metcalf', 'TV-PG', 'First there was Father Brown. Now, say hello to Sister Boniface. This clever, moped-riding nun is the police''s secret weapon for solving murders in this divine Father Brown spin-off.', 'First there was Father Brown. Now, say hello to Sister Boniface. This clever, moped-riding nun is the police''s secret weapon for solving murders in this divine Father Brown spin-off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSIPIFoIUCUOMwoAs9kiuwCz1Ju.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:157282'),
  ('966019137065750133', 'Sister Wives', 2010, 'Reality, Drama, Family', null, null, 'Kody Brown', 'TV-14', 'Husband Kody Brown, along with his four wives (only one of which is legally married to Kody) and their combined 18 children, attempts to navigate life as a "normal" family in a society that shuns their lifestyle.', 'Husband Kody Brown, along with his four wives (only one of which is legally married to Kody) and their combined 18 children, attempts to navigate life as a "normal" family in a society that shuns their lifestyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lnSXPiP9nYx23AbaekTCdTBq722.jpg', 17, 'tmdb:tv:34045'),
  ('858468446742298818', 'Sister, Sister', 1994, 'Comedy, Family, Kids, Drama', 'Fred Shafferman, Kim Bass, Gary Gilbert', null, 'Tia Mowry, Tamera Mowry-Housley, Jackée Harry, RonReaco Lee, Tim Reid, Deon Richmond', 'TV-PG', 'Twins Tia Landry and Tamera Campbell were separated and adopted at birth. Fourteen years later, they encounter each other by chance at the mall. After the families meet, Tia''s widowed father agrees to let Tamera and her single mother move in with them.', 'Twins Tia Landry and Tamera Campbell were separated and adopted at birth. Fourteen years later, they encounter each other by chance at the mall. After the families meet, Tia''s widowed father agrees to let Tamera and her single mother move in with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fzJHEbfgRM5uJaon5AVxwJxFMSF.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:3755'),
  ('471044810335940034', 'Sisters', 1991, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Daniel Lipman, Ron Cowen', null, 'Swoosie Kurtz, Sela Ward, Patricia Kalember, Sheila Kelley, Elizabeth Hoffman, Heather McAdam', 'NR', 'The Reed sisters of Winnetka, Illinois, are a close-knit group. Alex, Georgie, Teddy, and Frankie navigate the waters of life''s triumphs and tragedies with the help of their mom, Bea. And no matter what befalls them, they know they can count on their sisters to help pull them through. (Sisters is an Emmy Award-winning television drama.)', 'The Reed sisters of Winnetka, Illinois, are a close-knit group. Alex, Georgie, Teddy, and Frankie navigate the waters of life''s triumphs and tragedies with the help of their mom, Bea. And no matter what befalls them, they know they can count on their sisters to help pull them through. (Sisters is an Emmy Award-winning television drama.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejpvt6r2hNS9hjUEqLQuRmi07SV.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:5569'),
  ('653333277245760600', 'Sisters', 2017, 'Drama', 'Imogen Banks, Jonathan Gavin, Zoe Morgan', null, 'Lucy Durack, Antonia Prebble, Maria Angelico, Dan Spielman, Charlie Garber, Lindsay Farris, Zindzi Okenyo, Catherine McClements', 'TV-MA', 'A woman''s life is turned upside down when she finds out her father used his sperm in a number of IVF procedures, leading her to track down her newly discovered siblings.', 'A woman''s life is turned upside down when she finds out her father used his sperm in a number of IVF procedures, leading her to track down her newly discovered siblings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gOewLpcBU9eL7eRqXehw05AAqoC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74654'),
  ('739567596640893816', 'Sisters', 2021, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Angelina Mirimskaya, Anna Kotova, Angelina Strechina, Aleksandr Oblasov, Nikolay Shrayber, Yanina Studilina, Artyom Tkachenko, Aleksandr Metelkin', null, 'A story of three estranged sisters, Irina, Olga, and Maria, who are brought back together following their father’s death to run his car service business. It was their father that had driven them apart, but now they must resolve their issues in order to manage a team of forty men in a business they barely know or understand. The situation is further complicated by the fact that the sisters are very unlike. Irina is a self-made businesswoman from Moscow, Olga is an airy and impractical literature teacher from a small town and Maria is a hairdresser from Saratov, who dreams of earning a lot of money but is forced to live with her alcoholic husband.', 'A story of three estranged sisters, Irina, Olga, and Maria, who are brought back together following their father’s death to run his car service business. It was their father that had driven them apart, but now they must resolve their issues in order to manage a team of forty men in a business they barely know or understand. The situation is further complicated by the fact that the sisters are very unlike. Irina is a self-made businesswoman from Moscow, Olga is an airy and impractical literature teacher from a small town and Maria is a hairdresser from Saratov, who dreams of earning a lot of money but is forced to live with her alcoholic husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6cRApmbeGrfiigIOaZxuw9S2YSG.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:154260'),
