  ('679920415304463260', 'Smile Code', 2024, 'Drama', 'Zu Le', null, 'Shen Yue, Lin Yi, Ye Xiaowei, Tian Ai, Zhou Tingwei', null, 'Gu Yi is a stand-up comedian in Shanghai who juggles a day job and nighttime performances. Her simple goal is to make everyone laugh, but one day she encounters an audience member, Liang Daiwen, who seems immune to her humor. This leads to an unexpected clash between a woman driven by comedy and a man who never laughs.', 'Gu Yi is a stand-up comedian in Shanghai who juggles a day job and nighttime performances. Her simple goal is to make everyone laugh, but one day she encounters an audience member, Liang Daiwen, who seems immune to her humor. This leads to an unexpected clash between a woman driven by comedy and a man who never laughs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkBU6bt0kYlzEhyPlyXjIsg15zF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:253767'),
  ('327436523376909663', 'Smile Down the Runway', 2020, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Yumiri Hanamori, Natsuki Hanae, Ai Kayano, Yui Ishikawa, Hibiku Yamamura, Hikaru Akao, Ryohei Kimura, Ayaka Fukuhara', null, 'Chiyuki Fujito was going to be a professional runway model until she stopped growing. Poor Ikuto Tsumura is not even sure if he wants to be a fashion designer because of his family responsibilities. Faced with overwhelming adversity, they need to decide if their dreams are worth pursuing. It’s not impossible – they’ll just have to be creative in how they get there!', 'Chiyuki Fujito was going to be a professional runway model until she stopped growing. Poor Ikuto Tsumura is not even sure if he wants to be a fashion designer because of his family responsibilities. Faced with overwhelming adversity, they need to decide if their dreams are worth pursuing. It’s not impossible – they’ll just have to be creative in how they get there!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBxWnS366SFPRZJNjjI24XpYZmU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93688'),
  ('397146952263671104', 'Smile of the Arsnotoria the Animation', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Misaki Kuno, Miharu Hanai, Miyu Tomita, Eri Yukimura, Eriko Matsui, Yukana, Marina Inoue, Asuna Tomari', 'TV-14', 'Here in this magic academy city of Ashram, where everyone is required to live in dormitories, a close-knit group of girls known as “Pentagrams” pursue their studies, including training in manners and magic, to become “true ladies.” Arsnotoria, one of the students in Ashram, lives in Dorm 5 and is always with her dormmate friends: Mel, who’s the life of the party, Petit Albert, who’s quiet and does things at her own pace, Picatrix, who wants to be the class president, and Abramelin, who’s always cool. They take classes and work on their school duties together, and they throw tea parties after school in “that room”…', 'Here in this magic academy city of Ashram, where everyone is required to live in dormitories, a close-knit group of girls known as “Pentagrams” pursue their studies, including training in manners and magic, to become “true ladies.” Arsnotoria, one of the students in Ashram, lives in Dorm 5 and is always with her dormmate friends: Mel, who’s the life of the party, Petit Albert, who’s quiet and does things at her own pace, Picatrix, who wants to be the class president, and Abramelin, who’s always cool. They take classes and work on their school duties together, and they throw tea parties after school in “that room”…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ye8FMo4GmsfkN1f1CS0UUYFAOzR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:202770'),
  ('290142389193855895', 'Smiley', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Guillem Clua, Marta Pahissa', null, 'Carlos Cuevas, Miki Esparbé, Pepón Nieto, Meritxell Calvo, Cedrick Mugisha, Giannina Fruttero, Eduardo Lloveras, Ruth Llopis', 'TV-MA', 'Two men and their friends in Barcelona navigate hesitations, hangups and missed connections as they search for the true love they''ve been missing.', 'Two men and their friends in Barcelona navigate hesitations, hangups and missed connections as they search for the true love they''ve been missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9EDtDLIVHKpErMpNSREw1KcDOj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214609'),
  ('416337779625270698', 'Smiley''s People', 1982, 'Drama, Mystery', 'John le Carré', null, 'Alec Guinness', null, 'Called out of retirement to settle the affairs of a friend, Smiley finds his old organization, the Circus, so overwhelmed by political considerations that it doesn''t want to know what happened. He begins to follow up the clues of his friends past days, discovering that the clues lead to a high person in the Russian Secret service, and a secret important enough to kill for.', 'Called out of retirement to settle the affairs of a friend, Smiley finds his old organization, the Circus, so overwhelmed by political considerations that it doesn''t want to know what happened. He begins to follow up the clues of his friends past days, discovering that the clues lead to a high person in the Russian Secret service, and a secret important enough to kill for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGNRfWcIjIlVJfHsIgSfH7ZcMSq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:20053'),
  ('519850867025474180', 'SMILF', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Frankie Shaw', 'Scott King, Scott King', 'Frankie Shaw, Miguel Gómez, Samara Weaving, Alexandra Mary Reimer, Anna Chanel Reimer, Rosie O''Donnell', 'TV-MA', 'A raw and honest comedic look at a single, 20-something from Southie whose desires for relationships, sex, and a career collide with the realities of young, single motherhood.', 'A raw and honest comedic look at a single, 20-something from Southie whose desires for relationships, sex, and a career collide with the realities of young, single motherhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrHVP3NQgvMwGhjcA9W49P7uE4O.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:71733'),
  ('998724652068391019', 'Smiling Friends', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Michael Cusack, Zach Hadel', null, 'Michael Cusack, Zach Hadel, Marc Moceri', 'TV-MA', 'Smiling Friends Inc. is a small company whose main purpose is to bring happiness and make people smile. The series follows the day-to-day lives and misadventures of its representatives, the lazy, cynical Charlie, and the cheerful, optimistic Pim, as they try to cheer up and comfort the troubled people who call their company''s hotline. They receive seemingly simple requests but the jobs turn out to be more complicated than they seem, making it difficult to bring happiness to the world.', 'Smiling Friends Inc. is a small company whose main purpose is to bring happiness and make people smile. The series follows the day-to-day lives and misadventures of its representatives, the lazy, cynical Charlie, and the cheerful, optimistic Pim, as they try to cheer up and comfort the troubled people who call their company''s hotline. They receive seemingly simple requests but the jobs turn out to be more complicated than they seem, making it difficult to bring happiness to the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3CSxl3G06MBc73TpHWwBYYTPxL.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:126506'),
  ('991739534792476820', 'Smith', 2006, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'John Wells', null, 'Ray Liotta, Virginia Madsen, Simon Baker, Amy Smart, Jonny Lee Miller, Franky G, Chris Bauer, Shohreh Aghdashloo', 'TV-14', 'Though Bobby Stevens appears to be a regular family man with a nine-to-five job, he''s actually an expert thief who is seeking a few last big jobs so he can finally leave the business for a comfortable, lawful lifestyle with his wife, Hope, and their two children. While they never discuss Bobby''s illegal pursuits, Hope is growing weary of turning a blind eye.', 'Though Bobby Stevens appears to be a regular family man with a nine-to-five job, he''s actually an expert thief who is seeking a few last big jobs so he can finally leave the business for a comfortable, lawful lifestyle with his wife, Hope, and their two children. While they never discuss Bobby''s illegal pursuits, Hope is growing weary of turning a blind eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNfUhVQ4NCsILxGUAlnjPNJoLTh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1814'),
  ('490453217537331671', 'Smoke', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Dennis Lehane', null, 'Taron Egerton, Jurnee Smollett, Hannah Emily Anderson, Greg Kinnear, John Leguizamo, Ntare Guma Mbaho Mwine, Rafe Spall', 'TV-MA', 'When an arson investigator begrudgingly teams up with a police detective, their race to stop two arsonists ignites a twisted game of secrets and suspicions.', 'When an arson investigator begrudgingly teams up with a police detective, their race to stop two arsonists ignites a twisted game of secrets and suspicions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6xRvQCL07MVNamjfVU2an600q9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215995'),
  ('444198032523785748', 'Smoking', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Ryo Ishibashi, Nobuaki Kaneko, Tomomi Maruyama, Kaito Yoshimura, Rin Furukawa, Ryuhei Matsuda', null, 'Seeking a greater justice, a band of homeless assassins flays their human targets and delivers the tattooed skins as proof of a contract fulfilled.', 'Seeking a greater justice, a band of homeless assassins flays their human targets and delivers the tattooed skins as proof of a contract fulfilled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i5lw3l5HDARBK7vGXd7EwPHXWfY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81876'),
  ('443345201949712399', 'Smother', 2021, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kate O''Riordan', null, 'Dervla Kirwan, Niamh Walsh, Seána Kerslake, Gemma-Leah Devereux, Thomas Levin, Carrie Crowley, Lochlann Ó Mearáin, Elijah O''Sullivan', null, 'On the rugged coast of County Clare, Val Ahern''s husband is found dead at the foot of a cliff the morning after a family party. The matriarch starts to dig into the family''s secrets to find out who might be responsible.', 'On the rugged coast of County Clare, Val Ahern''s husband is found dead at the foot of a cliff the morning after a family party. The matriarch starts to dig into the family''s secrets to find out who might be responsible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/liE0KylYp5uzqONbDT07bVUUNUa.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:120835'),
  ('270901600379905861', 'Smother-in-Law', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Rodrigo Sant''anna', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Living with her family since the pandemic struck, the meddling Isadir does her best to disrupt the lives of her bumbling son and rival daughter-in-law.', 'Living with her family since the pandemic struck, the meddling Isadir does her best to disrupt the lives of her bumbling son and rival daughter-in-law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eAtipcahOmXbsGMP7m9N17kUOwz.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:158296'),
  ('356485055784282467', 'Snabba Cash', 2021, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jens Lapidus, Oskar Söderlund, Jesper Ganslandt', 'Oskar Söderlund', 'Evin Ahmad, Ali Alarik, Dada Fungula Bozela, Jozef Wojciechowicz, Alexander Abdallah, Ayaan Ahmed, Olle Sarri, Ghazal Khalili', 'TV-MA', 'The lives of an ambitious businesswoman, a charming gang enforcer and a troubled teen collide amidst a desperate — and sinister — pursuit of wealth.', 'The lives of an ambitious businesswoman, a charming gang enforcer and a troubled teen collide amidst a desperate — and sinister — pursuit of wealth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8cWQtIEgelb65XOpWQEljw5jSif.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:119565'),
  ('857992942500410623', 'Snack vs Chef', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Megan Stalter, Hari Kondabolu', 'TV-PG', 'Twelve chefs channel their inner food scientists to re-create classic snacks and invent their own original treats for a $50,000 prize.', 'Twelve chefs channel their inner food scientists to re-create classic snacks and invent their own original treats for a $50,000 prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5wSrfDKiQfjKmXg6qkVkpNWCXTJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213254'),
  ('45496140856404102', 'Snack World', 2017, 'Kids, Animation', null, null, 'Megumi Han, Ayana Taketatsu, Tadashi Miyazawa, Takehito Koyasu, Tomoyuki Shimura, Mitsuo Iwata', null, 'Welcome to SNACK WORLD! This is a nutty universe filled with dreams and adventures. Here, you can find everything from dragons to smart devices to Chup, the hyperactive hero of this story.', 'Welcome to SNACK WORLD! This is a nutty universe filled with dreams and adventures. Here, you can find everything from dragons to smart devices to Chup, the hyperactive hero of this story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWW1JsSfENzFrH4XPPjBUIAcEce.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88298'),
  ('712966781524903572', 'Snacked', 2021, 'Comedy, Talk', null, null, null, null, 'Welcome to Snacked: A brand new series from First We Feast where your favorite celebrities break down their most beloved snacks and candies.', 'Welcome to Snacked: A brand new series from First We Feast where your favorite celebrities break down their most beloved snacks and candies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t09ccPbAuTOZ8vHu6MBuphad5hm.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:138265'),
  ('365126921144111052', 'Snakes & Lizards', 2006, 'Soap, Comedy, Drama', 'João Emanuel Carneiro', 'João Emanuel Carneiro, Denise Bandeira, Vincent Villari', 'Mariana Ximenes, Daniel de Oliveira, Lázaro Ramos, Taís Araújo, Carolina Dieckmmann, Henri Castelli, Marília Pêra, Francisco Cuoco', null, 'Is it possible that in a world ruled by appearance, there is room for loyalty, ethics, true love, honesty and solidarity? Is it possible, today, when unrelenting consumption is a way of life, to find someone who equates more value to being rather than having? Cobras & Lagartos is an urban tragic comedy, modern and humanist, that deals with two increasingly different worlds: one which values loyalty and solidarity and the other, where the seduction of superfluity and the power of money reign.', 'Is it possible that in a world ruled by appearance, there is room for loyalty, ethics, true love, honesty and solidarity? Is it possible, today, when unrelenting consumption is a way of life, to find someone who equates more value to being rather than having? Cobras & Lagartos is an urban tragic comedy, modern and humanist, that deals with two increasingly different worlds: one which values loyalty and solidarity and the other, where the seduction of superfluity and the power of money reign.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2u5e0zlurzsyDhfb7ybhaS0cgly.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42995'),
  ('954304329457693106', 'Snakes and Ladders', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Manolo Caro', null, 'Cecilia Suárez, Juan Pablo Medina, Martiño Rivas, Marimar Vega, Benny Emmanuel, Loreto Peralta, Michelle Rodriguez, Alfredo Gatica', 'TV-MA', 'An ambitious but overlooked teacher wants to be head of a prestigious school, but must climb a slippery ladder of lies and corruption to reach the top.', 'An ambitious but overlooked teacher wants to be head of a prestigious school, but must climb a slippery ladder of lies and corruption to reach the top.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zWZ5SJznlfmT4QVGAFTnG3vIR3d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:255810'),
  ('603792364294360302', 'Snap and Spark', 2023, 'Drama', 'Park Hyun-won', 'Lee Na-won', 'Wooyeon, Jeon Geon-hu, Yoo Kang-min, Lee Jin-woo, Seo Soo-hee, E.ji', null, 'It tells a teen drama depicting the concerns of students at Korea Arts High School (Han Arts High School) who are desperate to find pink love in a world where popularity means rank and not receiving hearts makes you a loser. . An unfamiliar but bolder and more colorful story will unfold centered around the students, including their class, desires, love, and growth.', 'It tells a teen drama depicting the concerns of students at Korea Arts High School (Han Arts High School) who are desperate to find pink love in a world where popularity means rank and not receiving hearts makes you a loser. . An unfamiliar but bolder and more colorful story will unfold centered around the students, including their class, desires, love, and growth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w2vK0lTyUkyOl8tPrTkaxi69kKv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:240715'),
  ('623653728500502648', 'Snapped', 2004, 'Crime, Documentary', 'Zak Weisfeld, Stephen Land, Geoffrey Proud', null, null, 'TV-14', 'The fascinating cases of every day, seemingly average moms, wives and girlfriends accused of murder. Did they really do it? And if so, why?', 'The fascinating cases of every day, seemingly average moms, wives and girlfriends accused of murder. Did they really do it? And if so, why?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46YGiC5kJhX6ArAwOR8ONwCTgck.jpg', 36, 'tmdb:tv:10184'),
  ('630847525074689193', 'Snapped: Killer Couples', 2013, 'Crime, Documentary, Drama, Reality', 'Gregory Kohn, Christopher Mitchell, Chad Cunningham', null, null, 'TV-14', 'This extension of the long-running true-crime series ''Snapped'' shifts the focus to couples whose passion drives them to commit terrible criminal acts. Using re-creations and gripping firsthand accounts, each episode takes a deep dive into a case, telling the story of the couple''s romance, how the relationship evolved from love to manipulation, and what ultimately drove the couple to commit the crime.', 'This extension of the long-running true-crime series ''Snapped'' shifts the focus to couples whose passion drives them to commit terrible criminal acts. Using re-creations and gripping firsthand accounts, each episode takes a deep dive into a case, telling the story of the couple''s romance, how the relationship evolved from love to manipulation, and what ultimately drove the couple to commit the crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ik3N5vRpPQf1Q93XC10dsypdT6e.jpg', 18, 'tmdb:tv:91932'),
  ('515652927484555770', 'Snapphanar', 2006, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, War & Politics', 'Niclas Rockström', null, 'André Sjöberg, Tuva Novotny, Gustaf Skarsgård, Anders Ekborg, Kim Bodnia', null, 'Snapphanar is a Swedish miniseries which aired in three parts on Sveriges Television during Christmas 2006, directed by Måns Mårlind and Björn Stein. The historical drama is about the Snapphane peasant rebel movement which fought against the Swedish rule of Scania in the 17th century. The "Snapphanar" was a rebellion people, who fought secretly for Denmark during 1660-1700. The miniseries were criticised by historians due to a perceived lack of historical accuracy. The Scanian nationalist attitudes portrayed in the series did not exist in the 17th century, and the term snapphane, which is used for self-identification in the series, was in fact a derogatory term used by Swedes.', 'Snapphanar is a Swedish miniseries which aired in three parts on Sveriges Television during Christmas 2006, directed by Måns Mårlind and Björn Stein. The historical drama is about the Snapphane peasant rebel movement which fought against the Swedish rule of Scania in the 17th century. The "Snapphanar" was a rebellion people, who fought secretly for Denmark during 1660-1700. The miniseries were criticised by historians due to a perceived lack of historical accuracy. The Scanian nationalist attitudes portrayed in the series did not exist in the 17th century, and the term snapphane, which is used for self-identification in the series, was in fact a derogatory term used by Swedes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dU7BTBSh1K1nA7M5lipmeGWtXVx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:17671'),
  ('1039833802728675412', 'Snatch', 2017, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Alex De Rakoff', null, 'Luke Pasqualino, Lucien Laviscount, Rupert Grint, Phoebe Dynevor, Juliet Aubrey, Dougray Scott, Tamer Hassan', 'TV-MA', 'A group of up-and-coming hustlers stumble upon a truckload of stolen gold bullion and are suddenly thrust into the high-stakes world of organized crime.', 'A group of up-and-coming hustlers stumble upon a truckload of stolen gold bullion and are suddenly thrust into the high-stakes world of organized crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVw4hETwiZ08HjyZgOvJcU4Hwve.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69659'),
  ('550324593525641867', 'Sneakerheads', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Jay Longino', null, 'Justin Lee, Andrew Bachelor, Jearnest Corchado, Matthew Josten, Allen Maldonado, Yaani King Mondschein, Aja Evans', null, 'Family man Devin falls back into his sneaker obsession after his pal Bobby talks him into a wheeling-dealing scheme to score a mythical pair of kicks.', 'Family man Devin falls back into his sneaker obsession after his pal Bobby talks him into a wheeling-dealing scheme to score a mythical pair of kicks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nyNFE30mDGiVBxebUS38nPmmc0j.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109616'),
  ('557032482889767744', 'Sneaky Pete', 2015, 'Drama, Crime', 'David Shore, Bryan Cranston', null, 'Giovanni Ribisi, Marin Ireland, Margo Martindale, Peter Gerety, Shane McRae, Libe Barer, Efrat Dor, Lindsey Pearlman', 'TV-MA', 'A con man on the run from a vicious gangster takes cover from his past by assuming the identity of his prison cellmate, Pete, “reuniting” with Pete’s estranged family, a colorful, dysfunctional group that threatens to drag him into a world just as dangerous as the one he’s trying to escape - and, just maybe, give him a taste of the loving family he’s never had.', 'A con man on the run from a vicious gangster takes cover from his past by assuming the identity of his prison cellmate, Pete, “reuniting” with Pete’s estranged family, a colorful, dysfunctional group that threatens to drag him into a world just as dangerous as the one he’s trying to escape - and, just maybe, give him a taste of the loving family he’s never had.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNpcea9lLHI4iv8QpOIvHveVnT9.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:64199'),
