  ('1093961927442805231', 'Sophie: A Murder in West Cork', 2021, 'Documentary, Crime, Mystery', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'A shocking murder in rural Ireland sets off an increasingly convoluted quest for justice that spans decades and cuts across national borders.', 'A shocking murder in rural Ireland sets off an increasingly convoluted quest for justice that spans decades and cuts across national borders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggM1EUJ4KbxMY5uyZ6X0zfznoHY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126396'),
  ('571276685644001501', 'Sorairo Utility', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Miyu Takagi, Yurina Amami, Ayasa Goto', 'TV-14', 'High schooler Minami, ready to become the protagonist in her own story, runs away from school and finds golf at a driving range.', 'High schooler Minami, ready to become the protagonist in her own story, runs away from school and finds golf at a driving range.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/urwkLwOCg1QBFc17wVB60Rbw5yF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:245876'),
  ('876415506468496907', 'Sorcerous Stabber Orphen', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Rumi Okubo, Yusuke Kobayashi, Showtaro Morikubo, Mai Fuchigami, Marie Mizuno, Taiten Kusunoki', 'TV-14', 'Orphen is a powerful sorcerer who is notoriously lazy. Everything changes when he finds a way to save his sis, who was turned into a dragon during their days at magic academy. Betrayed by friends who refused to help, Orphen will stop at nothing to track her down, even if he has to go it alone.', 'Orphen is a powerful sorcerer who is notoriously lazy. Everything changes when he finds a way to save his sis, who was turned into a dragon during their days at magic academy. Betrayed by friends who refused to help, Orphen will stop at nothing to track her down, even if he has to go it alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWXrfd7HjbhRFTV3L2BPSNF0SK5.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:91764'),
  ('331664415180293929', 'Sordid Lives: The Series', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Del Shores', 'Del Shores', 'Bonnie Bedelia, Beth Grant, Rue McClanahan, Olivia Newton-John, Caroline Rhea, Leslie Jordan, Ann Walker, Newell Alexander', null, 'Sordid Lives: The Series is an American television series created, written, and directed by Del Shores and acts as a prequel to 2000 film Sordid Lives, also by Shores, self-described as a "Black comedy about white trash". The show is set in small town Texas and centers around the Ingram family. It stars Rue McClanahan, Olivia Newton-John, Caroline Rhea, Leslie Jordan, Beth Grant and most of the original cast of the film. It premiered on Logo in July 2008. In Canada, Sordid Lives the uncut version can be seen on Super Channel and the censored version on Out TV. According to Logo''s contact page a second season will not be produced due to a lack of funding, and the Logo online web page for the series is no longer available. The series premiered in the UK on Film24 in August 2009.', 'Sordid Lives: The Series is an American television series created, written, and directed by Del Shores and acts as a prequel to 2000 film Sordid Lives, also by Shores, self-described as a "Black comedy about white trash". The show is set in small town Texas and centers around the Ingram family. It stars Rue McClanahan, Olivia Newton-John, Caroline Rhea, Leslie Jordan, Beth Grant and most of the original cast of the film. It premiered on Logo in July 2008. In Canada, Sordid Lives the uncut version can be seen on Super Channel and the censored version on Out TV. According to Logo''s contact page a second season will not be produced due to a lack of funding, and the Logo online web page for the series is no longer available. The series premiered in the UK on Film24 in August 2009.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7OBwo48VMz9TfJCKmqALB6QW2bz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5932'),
  ('60315264103031401', 'Sorry For Your Loss', 2018, 'Drama', 'Kit Steinkellner', null, 'Elizabeth Olsen, Janet McTeer, Jovan Adepo, Mamoudou Athie, Kelly Marie Tran', null, 'The sudden death of her husband upends and transforms every relationship in Leigh Shaw’s life. It also forces her to realize there was a lot about her husband that she didn’t know.', 'The sudden death of her husband upends and transforms every relationship in Leigh Shaw’s life. It also forces her to realize there was a lot about her husband that she didn’t know.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUtM5shJF0CZn3MhEMmdSxyHJ0W.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:81991'),
  ('395714133808318545', 'Sort Of', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bilal Baig, Fab Filippo', 'Bilal Baig, Ian Iqbal Rashid, Jenn Engels', 'Bilal Baig, Kaya Kanashiro, Aden Bedard, Gray Powell, Amanda Cordner, Ellora Patnaik, Grace Lynn Kung, Supinder Wraich', 'TV-MA', 'Fluid millennial Sabi Mehboob straddles various identities from bartender at an LGBTQ bookstore/bar, to the youngest child in a Pakistani family, to the de facto parent of a downtown hipster family. Sabi feels like they’re in transition in every aspect of their life, from gender to love to sexuality to family to career.', 'Fluid millennial Sabi Mehboob straddles various identities from bartender at an LGBTQ bookstore/bar, to the youngest child in a Pakistani family, to the de facto parent of a downtown hipster family. Sabi feels like they’re in transition in every aspect of their life, from gender to love to sexuality to family to career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKWiSPk4DotlQRA5kloIk3cUO8y.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:133342'),
  ('216745394220346700', 'Sort Your Life Out', 2021, 'Family, Reality, Documentary', null, null, 'Stacey Solomon, Robert Bent, Iwan Carrington, Dilly Carter', null, 'Stacey Solomon and her crack team help families transform their homes with a life-changing declutter. All of the homeowners possessions are taken to a warehouse where they will choose what to let go and what will return to their reorganised home.', 'Stacey Solomon and her crack team help families transform their homes with a life-changing declutter. All of the homeowners possessions are taken to a warehouse where they will choose what to let go and what will return to their reorganised home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5nSVKtSA2p1v6u63VuRAgxMWHR.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:137626'),
  ('1023677117182187453', 'Sortilegio', 2009, 'Drama, Family, Soap', 'María Zarattini', 'María Zarattini, Claudia Velazco', 'Jacqueline Bracamontes, William Levy, David Zepeda, Daniela Romo, Gabriel Soto, Chantal Andere, Ana Brenda Contreras, María Victoria', null, 'Sortilegio is a Mexican telenovela produced by Carla Estrada for Televisa and stars Jacqueline Bracamontes and William Levy. It is a remake of Tú o nadie. From October 6, 2009 to February 17, 2010, Univision broadcast Sortilegio weeknights at 9pm/8c. From July 30 to September 7, 2012, Univision broadcast 2 hour reruns of Sortilegio weekdays at 1pm/12c, replacing Corazón Apasionado. From September 10 to October 19, 2012, reruns of Sortilegio were broadcast at 2pm/1c.', 'Sortilegio is a Mexican telenovela produced by Carla Estrada for Televisa and stars Jacqueline Bracamontes and William Levy. It is a remake of Tú o nadie. From October 6, 2009 to February 17, 2010, Univision broadcast Sortilegio weeknights at 9pm/8c. From July 30 to September 7, 2012, Univision broadcast 2 hour reruns of Sortilegio weekdays at 1pm/12c, replacing Corazón Apasionado. From September 10 to October 19, 2012, reruns of Sortilegio were broadcast at 2pm/1c.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ZbasUYGZxdjJ4LuiDOTHDrmFEo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18341'),
  ('612028840043845513', 'SOS Tata', 2005, 'Reality', null, null, 'Lucia Rizzi, Adriana Cantisani, Martino Campagnoli', null, 'SOS Tata is aimed at families with children under 12, where parents are completely overwhelmed by their lively, disobedient youngsters and are desperately seeking help to regain control. The featured families have the opportunity to work alongside a specialist nanny with extensive educational and pedagogical experience, who assists parents with the most challenging aspects of raising their children.', 'SOS Tata is aimed at families with children under 12, where parents are completely overwhelmed by their lively, disobedient youngsters and are desperately seeking help to regain control. The featured families have the opportunity to work alongside a specialist nanny with extensive educational and pedagogical experience, who assists parents with the most challenging aspects of raising their children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLq0rXg84FJ3AblyVlZpQi9Hx0Y.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:317044'),
  ('135983776057222835', 'SOTUS', 2016, 'Drama', 'BitterSweet', 'Chiangmun Ngamkanokwan, Phadung Samajarn', 'Prachaya Ruangroj, Perawat Sangpotirat, Patchata Janngeon, Korn Khunatipapisiri, Neen Suwanamas, Thitipoom Techa-apaikhun, Nachat Juntapun, Oranicha Krinchai', null, 'A strict senior and a defiant freshman clash under the SOTUS system—but resistance slowly turns into something tender.', 'A strict senior and a defiant freshman clash under the SOTUS system—but resistance slowly turns into something tender.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hAdBn9suCn2Devf9A19oR6otDm.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67506'),
  ('656949579159807782', 'Soul Doctor', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Li Tiannuo, Shang Siqi, Ge Xiaoxi, Waise Lee Chi-Hung, Lu Ying, Wang Ye, Xian Jiachen', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gibl3j9Aem1gjZIAlUXjzCPOSB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:232808'),
  ('262280233664087940', 'Soul Eater', 2008, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Chiaki Omigawa, Koki Uchiyama, Yumiko Kobayashi, Kaori Nazuka, Mamoru Miyano, Maaya Sakamoto, Akeno Watanabe, Rikiya Koyama', 'TV-14', 'Set in the Shinigami technical school for weapon meisters, the series revolves around 3 groups of each a weapon meister and a human weapon. Trying to make the latter a "Death Scythe" which is the highest title for a weapon and thus fit for use by the Shinigami, they must collect the souls of 99 evil humans and 1 witch. Maka & Soul Eater, Black Star & Tsubaki, and Death the Kid with Patty and Liz Thompson are the characters Soul Eater revolves around. Besides taking the time to gather souls, these students of Shibusen defend Death City from some of the most powerful of creatures while still attending school and trying to become stronger.', 'Set in the Shinigami technical school for weapon meisters, the series revolves around 3 groups of each a weapon meister and a human weapon. Trying to make the latter a "Death Scythe" which is the highest title for a weapon and thus fit for use by the Shinigami, they must collect the souls of 99 evil humans and 1 witch. Maka & Soul Eater, Black Star & Tsubaki, and Death the Kid with Patty and Liz Thompson are the characters Soul Eater revolves around. Besides taking the time to gather souls, these students of Shibusen defend Death City from some of the most powerful of creatures while still attending school and trying to become stronger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hI5AhxFTSFabTG7Fvhczyb5ZIh8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37305'),
  ('540963707240971416', 'Soul Eater Not!', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy', 'Atsushi Ohkubo', null, 'Haruka Chisuga, Aoi Yuuki, Mamoru Miyano, Saori Hayami', 'TV-14', 'Ding-dong! Dead-dong! Class is about to begin, and you don''t want to be late on your first day of school! Join Tsugumi Harudori in the "NOT" class at Death Weapon Meister Academy, a school dedicated to training transforming weapons like Tsugumi and the meisters who will wield them. Many "NOT" (Normally Overcome Target) students aspire to join the elite "EAT" (Especially Advantaged Talent) class. But it may take Tsugumi some time to find her confidence-- and a partner -- at this crazy school!', 'Ding-dong! Dead-dong! Class is about to begin, and you don''t want to be late on your first day of school! Join Tsugumi Harudori in the "NOT" class at Death Weapon Meister Academy, a school dedicated to training transforming weapons like Tsugumi and the meisters who will wield them. Many "NOT" (Normally Overcome Target) students aspire to join the elite "EAT" (Especially Advantaged Talent) class. But it may take Tsugumi some time to find her confidence-- and a partner -- at this crazy school!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1NsTn71nxSWb3JBfhuddNRdwgWv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60871'),
  ('204816067952101484', 'Soul Ferry', 2014, 'Mystery, Drama', null, 'Xiao Ji Xiang Tian', 'Liu Zhiyang, Xiao Yin, Yu Yi, Chen Jie, Yu Heng, Xuan Lu, He Hua, Yang Kun', null, 'The eyes of the flesh are dim and unclear, seeing near but not far, seeing before and behind, seeing light and not seeing darkness, what they see is not infallible. Xia Dongqing, who does not seem to have any sense of existence on the outside, has an unknown secret. He can see sentient beings in another world. He grew up in an orphanage and had just graduated from university and was preparing for the postgraduate entrance examination. At this time, he was looking for a job. During this period, Dongqing was admitted to the 444 convenience store. It is said that this convenience store will be haunted after 12 o''clock in the middle of the night. It turns out that this is the connecting point of two different latitude spaces.', 'The eyes of the flesh are dim and unclear, seeing near but not far, seeing before and behind, seeing light and not seeing darkness, what they see is not infallible. Xia Dongqing, who does not seem to have any sense of existence on the outside, has an unknown secret. He can see sentient beings in another world. He grew up in an orphanage and had just graduated from university and was preparing for the postgraduate entrance examination. At this time, he was looking for a job. During this period, Dongqing was admitted to the 444 convenience store. It is said that this convenience store will be haunted after 12 o''clock in the middle of the night. It turns out that this is the connecting point of two different latitude spaces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6KcWXw2mLRj5oV612YuvzWjFmm.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:75480'),
  ('382877417323458900', 'Soul Food', 2000, 'Drama', null, null, 'Nicole Ari Parker, Vanessa Williams, Malinda Williams, Rockmond Dunbar, Darrin Henson, Aaron Meeks', 'TV-14', 'Soul Food: The Series is a television drama that aired Wednesday nights on Showtime from June 28, 2000 to May 26, 2004. Created by filmmaker George Tillman, Jr. and developed for television by Felicia D. Henderson, Soul Food is based upon Tillman''s childhood experiences growing up in Wisconsin, and is a continuation of his successful 1997 film of the same name. Having aired for 74 episodes, it is the longest running drama with a predominantly black cast in the history of North American prime-time television.', 'Soul Food: The Series is a television drama that aired Wednesday nights on Showtime from June 28, 2000 to May 26, 2004. Created by filmmaker George Tillman, Jr. and developed for television by Felicia D. Henderson, Soul Food is based upon Tillman''s childhood experiences growing up in Wisconsin, and is a continuation of his successful 1997 film of the same name. Having aired for 74 episodes, it is the longest running drama with a predominantly black cast in the history of North American prime-time television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pHfIP0C5F0Vh5th9ru3mxhC0Zqc.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:2805'),
  ('197127893276132258', 'Soul Hunter', 1999, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Animation', null, null, 'Susumu Chiba, Hiro Yuuki, Kouki Miyata, Akira Ishida, Isao Yamagishi, Yōichi Masukawa, Megumi Ogata, Daisuke Sakaguchi', 'NR', 'Thousands of years ago, it was a time of witchcraft and dark magic. An evil sorceress has bewitched the emperor of the mighty dynasty and he has become a mindless puppet. The country is in shambles and evil spirits lurk everywhere. The human world is on the verge of utter destruction. A bold mission is planned by the Confederation of the Immortal Masters. They send a young master wizard to hung down the villains and evil warlocks in the devastated lands.', 'Thousands of years ago, it was a time of witchcraft and dark magic. An evil sorceress has bewitched the emperor of the mighty dynasty and he has become a mindless puppet. The country is in shambles and evil spirits lurk everywhere. The human world is on the verge of utter destruction. A bold mission is planned by the Confederation of the Immortal Masters. They send a young master wizard to hung down the villains and evil warlocks in the devastated lands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYUORSFHjjTFgDk4VLbYEFOPTgi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:27067'),
  ('159633764520492047', 'Soul Land', 2018, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Tang Jia San Shao', null, 'Shen Lei, Zhang Qi, Wei Zhai, Tao Dian, Zhao Lu, Zhao Qianjing, Zhihao Su, Li Chanfei', 'TV-14', 'Tang San spent his life in the Tang Outer Sect, dedicated to the creation and mastery of hidden weapons. Once he stole the secret lore of the Inner Sect to reach the pinnacle of his art, his only way out was death. But after throwing himself off the deadly Hell''s Peak he was reborn in a different world, the world of Douluo Dalu, a world where every person has a spirit of their own, and those with powerful spirits can practice their spirit power to rise and become Spirit Masters. The spirit that awakens within Tang San is Blue Silver Grass, a useless spirit. Can he overcome the difficulties to reach the high ranks of Spirit Masters and bring the glory of the Tang Sect into this new world?', 'Tang San spent his life in the Tang Outer Sect, dedicated to the creation and mastery of hidden weapons. Once he stole the secret lore of the Inner Sect to reach the pinnacle of his art, his only way out was death. But after throwing himself off the deadly Hell''s Peak he was reborn in a different world, the world of Douluo Dalu, a world where every person has a spirit of their own, and those with powerful spirits can practice their spirit power to rise and become Spirit Masters. The spirit that awakens within Tang San is Blue Silver Grass, a useless spirit. Can he overcome the difficulties to reach the high ranks of Spirit Masters and bring the glory of the Tang Sect into this new world?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ooPDiPcEPylDcFKg9koGkoW6GC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76572'),
  ('735214920047485027', 'Soul Land 2: The Peerless Tang Clan', 2023, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Tang Jia San Shao', null, 'Wei Zhai, Tao Dian, Liang Dawei, Yajing Tang, Kaiyin Sun, Xiyue Chen, Huang Ying, Chengyuan Li', null, 'The Tang Sect in a turbulent world. There is nothing but martial spirit here. Ten thousand years after the founding of the Tang Sect, it is in relative decline. An extremely talented man was born. Can the new Shrek Seven Monsters revive the Tang Sect and bring it back to glory? A soul beast of over one million years old; Electrolux who can pick stars; The new soul utensil system that led to the decline of the Tang Sect... A lot of secrets are to be revealed. Can the secret weapons of the Tang Sect be sharp again? Can the Tang Sect regain its former glory?', 'The Tang Sect in a turbulent world. There is nothing but martial spirit here. Ten thousand years after the founding of the Tang Sect, it is in relative decline. An extremely talented man was born. Can the new Shrek Seven Monsters revive the Tang Sect and bring it back to glory? A soul beast of over one million years old; Electrolux who can pick stars; The new soul utensil system that led to the decline of the Tang Sect... A lot of secrets are to be revealed. Can the secret weapons of the Tang Sect be sharp again? Can the Tang Sect regain its former glory?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzemNbETZKXRzjvBwc1hydqbEeK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:228429'),
  ('1138423219370129077', 'Soulmate', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Jo Jin Kook, Park Eun Jung, Nam Ji Yeon', 'Sa Kang, Lee Soo-kyung, Shin Dong-wook, Jang Mi-Inae, Phillip Choi, Kim Mi-Jin, Ha Joo-hee, Joo Ho', null, 'Dong-wook, a playboy who no one can even dare to follow.“My boyfriend of 5 years!! He is definitely my soulmate!!”Soo-kyung, a girl who only looks at one man like a sunflower; a perfect, pure hearted character.Two people who have never seen each other, and who live on the opposite sides of the world from each other live and love in their own way, but from some point on they start to move towards the same dream and feel the same physiological feelings.Two people who have met by fate in a world full of mixed up fates.Now, the most amazing things, which no one could have ever thought of, start to unfold between the two...', 'Dong-wook, a playboy who no one can even dare to follow.“My boyfriend of 5 years!! He is definitely my soulmate!!”Soo-kyung, a girl who only looks at one man like a sunflower; a perfect, pure hearted character.Two people who have never seen each other, and who live on the opposite sides of the world from each other live and love in their own way, but from some point on they start to move towards the same dream and feel the same physiological feelings.Two people who have met by fate in a world full of mixed up fates.Now, the most amazing things, which no one could have ever thought of, start to unfold between the two...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCEZtfdrQX7XHPFDnWPHaIhZynb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42591'),
  ('196683783065362611', 'Soulmates', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Crime, Drama', 'Brett Goldstein, William Bridges', null, null, 'TV-14', 'Fifteen years into the future, science has made a discovery that changes the lives of everyone on the planet – a test that unequivocally tells you who your soulmate is.', 'Fifteen years into the future, science has made a discovery that changes the lives of everyone on the planet – a test that unequivocally tells you who your soulmate is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g2mvINQCGACb9sswdKXh1KwpwzB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100771'),
  ('878390070871762476', 'Sound of the Sky', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Mamoru Kambe', null, 'Hisako Kanemoto, Yu Kobayashi, Eri Kitamura, Aoi Yuuki, Aya Endo, Misato Fukuen, Unsho Ishizuka, Mayuno Yasokawa', 'TV-14', 'On the outskirts of the country of Helvetia rests the tranquil town of Seize. Upon its cobbled streets, citizens go about their daily lives, undisturbed by the increasingly tense military relations between Helvetia and the neighboring Roman Empire. It is under these circumstances that the 1121st platoon of the Helvetian army, stationed at the Clocktower Fortress in Seize, receives a new recruit in the young and spirited Kanata Sorami. Having joined the military to fulfill her dream of learning to play the bugle, she excitedly accepts the tutelage of the Sergeant Major, Rio Kazumiya, who happens to be a skilled trumpeter. Working alongside them are the aloof mechanic, Noël Kannagi, the feisty gunner, Kureha Suminoya, and the compassionate Captain Felicia Heideman; together, they experience the beauty of life in Seize and the lasting joy of a community that has persevered in spite of the crumbling world around them.', 'On the outskirts of the country of Helvetia rests the tranquil town of Seize. Upon its cobbled streets, citizens go about their daily lives, undisturbed by the increasingly tense military relations between Helvetia and the neighboring Roman Empire. It is under these circumstances that the 1121st platoon of the Helvetian army, stationed at the Clocktower Fortress in Seize, receives a new recruit in the young and spirited Kanata Sorami. Having joined the military to fulfill her dream of learning to play the bugle, she excitedly accepts the tutelage of the Sergeant Major, Rio Kazumiya, who happens to be a skilled trumpeter. Working alongside them are the aloof mechanic, Noël Kannagi, the feisty gunner, Kureha Suminoya, and the compassionate Captain Felicia Heideman; together, they experience the beauty of life in Seize and the lasting joy of a community that has persevered in spite of the crumbling world around them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3pSFOc9nx5HFqIpNqlHdJ4AKQfh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35461'),
  ('398674261510334879', 'Sound! Euphonium', 2015, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Tomoyo Kurosawa, Chika Anzai, Ayaka Asai, Moe Toyota, Haruka Tomatsu', 'TV-PG', 'Spring in the first year of high school. Kumiko, a member of the brass band in junior high school, visits the high school brass band club with classmates Hazuki and Sapphire. There, she comes across Reina, her former classmate from junior high. Hazuki and Sapphire decide to join the club, but Kumiko can’t make up her mind. She recollects her experience with Reina at a competition in junior high school.', 'Spring in the first year of high school. Kumiko, a member of the brass band in junior high school, visits the high school brass band club with classmates Hazuki and Sapphire. There, she comes across Reina, her former classmate from junior high. Hazuki and Sapphire decide to join the club, but Kumiko can’t make up her mind. She recollects her experience with Reina at a competition in junior high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0hKrx6PjQRrHiMzK2Fanen2xbL.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:62564'),
  ('159657275295461946', 'Soundbreaking', 2016, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Dermot Mulroney', null, 'Explore the art of music recording with a behind-the-scenes look at the birth of brand new sounds. Featuring more than 160 original interviews with some of the most celebrated recording artists of all time, Soundbreaking explores the nexus of cutting-edge technology and human artistry that has created the soundtrack of our lives.', 'Explore the art of music recording with a behind-the-scenes look at the birth of brand new sounds. Featuring more than 160 original interviews with some of the most celebrated recording artists of all time, Soundbreaking explores the nexus of cutting-edge technology and human artistry that has created the soundtrack of our lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8Y2JWUn2I5woBsuAcLhNoqy5Zz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74811'),
  ('494688356379582202', 'Soundtrack', 2019, 'Drama', 'Joshua Safran', null, 'Paul James, Callie Hernandez, Jenna Dewan, Marianne Jean-Baptiste, Jahmil French, Megan Ferguson, Isaiah Givens, Madeleine Stowe', 'NR', 'Love, loss and transformative luck intersect in this musical drama about two struggling artists experiencing life at full volume in Los Angeles.', 'Love, loss and transformative luck intersect in this musical drama about two struggling artists experiencing life at full volume in Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1VdMlm63e5nY9BlCxk4BpotvWO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96095'),
  ('335034433235193815', 'Soundtrack #1', 2022, 'Drama', 'Kim Hee-won', 'Ahn Sae-bom', 'Park Hyung-sik, Han So-hee, Lee Jung-eun, Kim Ju-hun, Yoon Byung-hee, Kim Do-shin', null, 'Han Sun-woo is a rookie photographer. He doesn''t talk much, but he is a kind and warm-hearted man. He is friends with Lee Eun-soo. They have been close friends for 20 years. Meanwhile, Lee Eun-soo works as a lyricist to make living. She has an honest and bright personality. Due to a reason, Han Sun-woo and Lee Eun-soo begin to live together at the same house for 2 weeks. Staying together, their relationship develops romantically.', 'Han Sun-woo is a rookie photographer. He doesn''t talk much, but he is a kind and warm-hearted man. He is friends with Lee Eun-soo. They have been close friends for 20 years. Meanwhile, Lee Eun-soo works as a lyricist to make living. She has an honest and bright personality. Due to a reason, Han Sun-woo and Lee Eun-soo begin to live together at the same house for 2 weeks. Staying together, their relationship develops romantically.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hjp9921tF0S6duKUoScLOC5ABCc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137872'),
  ('46147235964327624', 'Soundtrack #2', 2023, 'Drama', 'Jung Hye-seung', 'Jung Hye-seung', 'Keum Sae-rok, Steve Sanghyun Noh, Demian, Kwon Seung-woo, Jeon Hye-jin', 'TV-PG', 'Su-ho and Hyeon-seo, who once dated for six years, meet again as a youthful rich CEO and a piano instructor. K works with Su-ho on a collaborative project and invites Hyeon-seo to join them. Su-ho and Hyeon-seo embark on a bumpy romantic journey full of twists and turns. Will history repeat itself?', 'Su-ho and Hyeon-seo, who once dated for six years, meet again as a youthful rich CEO and a piano instructor. K works with Su-ho on a collaborative project and invites Hyeon-seo to join them. Su-ho and Hyeon-seo embark on a bumpy romantic journey full of twists and turns. Will history repeat itself?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dV1JvvJtEG3Zul1vxspXtAoIm1v.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215474'),
  ('816289465014968264', 'Souryo to Majiwaru Shikiyoku no Yoru ni...', 2017, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Yuri Katou, You Suzushiro, Mutsuki Iwanaka, Paama Kurukuru, Sakura Nakamura', null, 'At a high school reunion, Mio Fukatani reunites with a classmate she has not seen in years—Takahide Kujou. She had always wanted to know more about the kind-hearted boy in high school, but once she realizes that Kujou has become a monk, she believes that any chance of getting to know him romantically is slim. Deciding to drink away her sorrows, she ends up walking home drunk, and surprisingly, running into Kujou who helps her get home. However, once inside, Kujou''s lust for Mio becomes apparent and the two share an erotic night of passion. As this steamy romance blossoms between these two unlikely lovers, Mio and Kujou will undoubtedly spend many nights together in utter ecstasy.', 'At a high school reunion, Mio Fukatani reunites with a classmate she has not seen in years—Takahide Kujou. She had always wanted to know more about the kind-hearted boy in high school, but once she realizes that Kujou has become a monk, she believes that any chance of getting to know him romantically is slim. Deciding to drink away her sorrows, she ends up walking home drunk, and surprisingly, running into Kujou who helps her get home. However, once inside, Kujou''s lust for Mio becomes apparent and the two share an erotic night of passion. As this steamy romance blossoms between these two unlikely lovers, Mio and Kujou will undoubtedly spend many nights together in utter ecstasy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ueI9EeoRdMVa7hWEm21nQEU8Zv3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70998'),
  ('1072622778808910397', 'Sous le soleil', 1996, 'Family', 'Olivier Brémond, Pascal Breton', null, 'Bénédicte Delmas, Tonya Kinzinger, Roméo Sarfati, Jean-François Garreaud', null, 'Sous le soleil is a French soap opera broadcast on French major channel TF1 since 1996.', 'Sous le soleil is a French soap opera broadcast on French major channel TF1 since 1996.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMXRmiR6nWvQf9HNz7GA3GD4ZC5.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:6833'),
  ('595647633239077945', 'South Beach Tow', 2011, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Jennifer Lopez', null, 'Robert Ashenoff Jr., Christie Ashenoff, Jerome Jackson, Eddie Del Busto, Robert Ashenoff Sr.', null, 'South Beach Tow is an American truTV reality television series that portrays dramatized reenactments of the day-to-day business of Tremont Towing. Although the program is fictionalized, Tremont Towing is a real Miami towing company. The series premiered on July 20, 2011. The first part of Season 2 premiered on September 19, 2012, and returned after a four month hiatus on May 15, 2013. Season 3 will premiere on October 30, 2013.', 'South Beach Tow is an American truTV reality television series that portrays dramatized reenactments of the day-to-day business of Tremont Towing. Although the program is fictionalized, Tremont Towing is a real Miami towing company. The series premiered on July 20, 2011. The first part of Season 2 premiered on September 19, 2012, and returned after a four month hiatus on May 15, 2013. Season 3 will premiere on October 30, 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hh2v9NGoKqEhpyBko8rWBweunNj.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:39688'),
  ('719366982504705987', 'South Central Baddies', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'With The Idea of Isaiah Carr, a.k.a and the Brain of Reality star Speshel K decides to come together and bring this idea to life and give the hood a way out and a shot of Hollywood "We putting LA on the Map" with 2 strangers meeting and a group of girls with different personalities was it a good idea or disaster?', 'With The Idea of Isaiah Carr, a.k.a and the Brain of Reality star Speshel K decides to come together and bring this idea to life and give the hood a way out and a shot of Hollywood "We putting LA on the Map" with 2 strangers meeting and a group of girls with different personalities was it a good idea or disaster?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yaJrOE4eZcLs7fJhulOsNFHRqVJ.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:206457'),
  ('528016158154302240', 'South of Hell', 2015, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Matt Lambert', 'John E. Deaver', 'Mena Suvari, Zachary Booth, Lamman Rucker, Paulina Singer, Drew Moerlein, Luna Lauren Vélez, Bill Irwin', 'TV-14', 'A supernatural thriller set in South Carolina, South Of Hell focuses on Maria Abascal (Suvari), a stunning demon-hunter-for-hire whose power stems from within. Like those she hunts, Maria is divided within herself, struggling with her own demon, Abigail, who resides inside of her, feeding on the evil Maria exorcises from others. Maria and Abigail share a soul and a destiny, but as Maria desperately tries to overtake Abigail, she will discover how far Abigail will go to remain a part of her.', 'A supernatural thriller set in South Carolina, South Of Hell focuses on Maria Abascal (Suvari), a stunning demon-hunter-for-hire whose power stems from within. Like those she hunts, Maria is divided within herself, struggling with her own demon, Abigail, who resides inside of her, feeding on the evil Maria exorcises from others. Maria and Abigail share a soul and a destiny, but as Maria desperately tries to overtake Abigail, she will discover how far Abigail will go to remain a part of her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvF3WStSLXh7ibT1OpU6XmCxtbN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64447'),
  ('137385893848382405', 'South of Nowhere', 2005, 'Drama', 'Thomas W. Lynch', null, 'Gabrielle Christian, Mandy Musgrave, Matt Cohen, Chris Hunter, Maeve Quinlan, Rob Moran, Aasha Davis, Eileen April Boylan', null, 'The Carlin family moves from small town Ohio to Los Angeles to find life''s not the same. And neither are they.', 'The Carlin family moves from small town Ohio to Los Angeles to find life''s not the same. And neither are they.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zGvtxSlopOuhXDjjQrSuPqW62kU.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2081'),
  ('385058883163958433', 'South Pacific', 2009, 'Documentary', null, 'Mark Brownlow, Huw Cordey', 'Benedict Cumberbatch', 'TV-G', 'South Pacific is a British nature documentary series from the BBC Natural History Unit, which began airing on BBC Two on 10 May 2009. The six-part series surveys the natural history of the islands of the South Pacific region, including many of the coral atolls and New Zealand. It was filmed entirely in high-definition. South Pacific was co-produced by the Discovery Channel and the series producer was Huw Cordey. It is narrated by Benedict Cumberbatch. Filming took place over 18 months in a variety of remote locations around the Pacific including: Anuta, Banks Islands, French Frigate Shoals, Papua New Guinea, Palmyra, Kingman Reef, Tuvalu, Palau, Caroline Islands, Tuamotus and Tanna Island in Vanuatu. On 6 May 2009, BBC Worldwide released a short clip of big wave surfer Dylan Longbottom surfing in slow motion, high-definition footage as a preview of the series, attracting extremely positive reactions on the video sharing website YouTube. The series was released on DVD and Blu-ray Disc on 15 June 2009. At the end of each fifty-minute episode, a ten-minute featurette takes a behind-the-scenes look at the challenges of filming the series. The series was released by Discovery International in the USA under the title Wild Pacific, with narration provided by Mike Rowe.', 'South Pacific is a British nature documentary series from the BBC Natural History Unit, which began airing on BBC Two on 10 May 2009. The six-part series surveys the natural history of the islands of the South Pacific region, including many of the coral atolls and New Zealand. It was filmed entirely in high-definition. South Pacific was co-produced by the Discovery Channel and the series producer was Huw Cordey. It is narrated by Benedict Cumberbatch. Filming took place over 18 months in a variety of remote locations around the Pacific including: Anuta, Banks Islands, French Frigate Shoals, Papua New Guinea, Palmyra, Kingman Reef, Tuvalu, Palau, Caroline Islands, Tuamotus and Tanna Island in Vanuatu. On 6 May 2009, BBC Worldwide released a short clip of big wave surfer Dylan Longbottom surfing in slow motion, high-definition footage as a preview of the series, attracting extremely positive reactions on the video sharing website YouTube. The series was released on DVD and Blu-ray Disc on 15 June 2009. At the end of each fifty-minute episode, a ten-minute featurette takes a behind-the-scenes look at the challenges of filming the series. The series was released by Discovery International in the USA under the title Wild Pacific, with narration provided by Mike Rowe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ki1kVDRB8rJhG8uS3jpCyebVAjM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19338'),
  ('136747428841898677', 'South Park', 1997, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Trey Parker, Matt Stone', null, 'Trey Parker, Matt Stone, Mona Marshall, Jennifer Howell', 'TV-MA', 'Follow the misadventures of four irreverent grade-schoolers in the quiet, dysfunctional town of South Park, Colorado.', 'Follow the misadventures of four irreverent grade-schoolers in the quiet, dysfunctional town of South Park, Colorado.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1CGwZCFX2qerXaXQJJUB3qUvxq7.jpg', 28, 'tmdb:tv:2190'),
  ('829659221065933057', 'South Riding', 2011, 'Drama', 'Andrew Davies', 'Winifred Holtby', 'Anna Maxwell Martin, David Morrissey, Penelope Wilton, Peter Firth, John Henshaw, Douglas Henshall, Katherine McGolpin, Lydia Wilson', 'TV-14', 'The lives and loves of a 1930s Yorkshire town explored in a passionate tale of politics in small places. South Riding charts the story of Sarah Burton''s homecoming to Yorkshire in 1934 after twenty years teaching in London and the Empire. After a fiery interview with a conservative interview panel, outspoken Sarah takes up her first headmistress-ship at Kiplington High School for Girls, determined to demonstrate to her new pupils that the future is theirs for the taking.', 'The lives and loves of a 1930s Yorkshire town explored in a passionate tale of politics in small places. South Riding charts the story of Sarah Burton''s homecoming to Yorkshire in 1934 after twenty years teaching in London and the Empire. After a fiery interview with a conservative interview panel, outspoken Sarah takes up her first headmistress-ship at Kiplington High School for Girls, determined to demonstrate to her new pupils that the future is theirs for the taking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bM3NfKoIR6HAlCoU0xYdckFCqW3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37686'),
  ('757334319235314409', 'South Sea Tomb', 2023, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Mystery', 'Zhang Muye', null, 'Pan Yueming, Zhang Yuqi, Jiang Chao, Kent Tong Chun-Yip, Wang Yiquan, John Ching Tung, Chen Muchi, Zhu Ziyu', null, 'Hu Bayi and Fatty Wang had planned to go abroad with Shirley Yang. However, they were entrusted by Professor Chen to travel to the Coral Spiral with Mr. Ming to search for the Qin Emperor''s Bone Mirror. They befriended Ruan Hei, Gu Cai, and Duo Ling on Coral Temple Island. Together, they set sail. One night, they were sucked into the underwater cave of Guixu.', 'Hu Bayi and Fatty Wang had planned to go abroad with Shirley Yang. However, they were entrusted by Professor Chen to travel to the Coral Spiral with Mr. Ming to search for the Qin Emperor''s Bone Mirror. They befriended Ruan Hei, Gu Cai, and Duo Ling on Coral Temple Island. Together, they set sail. One night, they were sucked into the underwater cave of Guixu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tfI2vrPXhpcwhv0CdpNeRKQEOCm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230131'),
  ('1100408395933998200', 'South Side', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Diallo Riddle, Bashir Salahuddin, Sultan Salahuddin', null, 'Sultan Salahuddin, Kareme Young, Bashir Salahuddin, Diallo Riddle, Chandra Russell, Quincy Young', 'TV-MA', 'Two recent community-college graduates get stuck working at Rent-T-Own in the Chicago neighborhood of Englewood and work to achieve their entrepreneurial dreams.', 'Two recent community-college graduates get stuck working at Rent-T-Own in the Chicago neighborhood of Englewood and work to achieve their entrepreneurial dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUQ5ApXjd1sHAyZfsuZAN7wokzq.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:91502'),
  ('837951460022816638', 'South Wind', 2020, 'Crime, Drama', null, 'Miloš Avramović', 'Miloš Biković, Bojan Lojković, Dejan Petošević, Vladimir Nićiforović, Aleksandra Ćosić, Ilir Prapashtica, Irene Chiengue Chiendjo, Lara Korać', null, 'A young member of a gang in Belgrade puts his family in danger when he angers a mafia boss.', 'A young member of a gang in Belgrade puts his family in danger when he angers a mafia boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DdgRzUGJZTKhcFIUG4Jbg5CRE6.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:99123'),
  ('839676148899043317', 'Southcliffe', 2013, 'Crime, Drama', 'Tony Grisoni', null, 'Rory Kinnear, Joe Dempsie, Sean Harris, Anatol Yusef, Shirley Henderson, Eddie Marsan, Kaya Scodelario, Al Weaver', 'TV-MA', 'Following a raft of shootings in an English market town, the crimes are retold in a nonlinear narrative structure through the eyes of a journalist and the tragedies'' victims.', 'Following a raft of shootings in an English market town, the crimes are retold in a nonlinear narrative structure through the eyes of a journalist and the tragedies'' victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8bbHIc1lk6ZOgJHlXopg18qx1ZW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:59183'),
  ('252756477455136523', 'Southern Charm', 2014, 'Reality, Drama', 'Whitney Sudler-Smith, Bryan Kestner', null, 'Craig Conover, Shep Rose, Austen Kroll, Venita Aspen, Rodrigo Reyes, Salley Carson, Madison Lecroy, Molly O''Connell', 'TV-14', 'Go behind the walls of Charleston, South Carolina''s most aristocratic families and discover a world of exclusivity, money and scandal that goes back generations. The fast-paced, drama-filled docu-series follows Charleston singles struggling with the constraints of this tight-knit, posh society.', 'Go behind the walls of Charleston, South Carolina''s most aristocratic families and discover a world of exclusivity, money and scandal that goes back generations. The fast-paced, drama-filled docu-series follows Charleston singles struggling with the constraints of this tight-knit, posh society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8HD1g48xyLW96x8LJudhQ8DOBpL.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:62185'),
  ('666931034262091757', 'Southern Hospitality', 2022, 'Reality', 'Bryan Kestner, Whitney Sudler-Smith', null, 'Leva Bonaparte, Mikel Simmons, Maddi Reese, Grace Lilly, Joe Bradley', 'TV-14', 'Following the lives of a tight-knit group of friends living and working together in Charleston, S.C. At Republic, there’s never a dull shift – where a splash of shade, a pinch of drama and rumors bubbling just beneath the surface keep the party going in the electrifying VIP world.', 'Following the lives of a tight-knit group of friends living and working together in Charleston, S.C. At Republic, there’s never a dull shift – where a splash of shade, a pinch of drama and rumors bubbling just beneath the surface keep the party going in the electrifying VIP world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8s2Ks6S8lf5IFl6mqyNtEnalB6r.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:203448'),
  ('529038398919292314', 'Southland', 2009, 'Drama', 'Ann Biderman', null, 'Ben McKenzie, Michael Cudlitz, Regina King, Shawn Hatosy, C. Thomas Howell', 'TV-14', 'A raw and authentic look into the Los Angeles crime scene, going far inside the lives of cops, criminals, victims and their families. The show centers on four main characters: Officer John Cooper, a seasoned cop who will have to prove himself again after recovering from surgery; Officer Ben Sherman, who still has much to learn after recently completing his training rotation; Detective Lydia Adams, whose unending caseload hits closer to home; and Sammy Bryant, a former detective who decided to go back to being a uniform cop after the traumatic death of his partner.', 'A raw and authentic look into the Los Angeles crime scene, going far inside the lives of cops, criminals, victims and their families. The show centers on four main characters: Officer John Cooper, a seasoned cop who will have to prove himself again after recovering from surgery; Officer Ben Sherman, who still has much to learn after recently completing his training rotation; Detective Lydia Adams, whose unending caseload hits closer to home; and Sammy Bryant, a former detective who decided to go back to being a uniform cop after the traumatic death of his partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/flj41WynQKea6DVHgRbbPSWOB1t.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:17611'),
  ('928290544621586903', 'Soy Luna', 2016, 'Soap, Family, Comedy, Mystery', 'Jorge Edelstein', 'Laura Farhi, Carmen López Areal, Romina Ballester', 'Karol Sevilla, Ruggero Pasquarelli, Valentina Zenere, Michael Ronda, Carolina Kopelioff, Malena Ratner, Katja Martínez, Ana Jara Martínez', 'NR', 'Luna Valente lives with her family in Cancún, Mexico. She goes to school, has her own group of friends, has a job, and loves to skate. However, her life changes when her parents are given a job offer that moves them to Buenos Aires, Argentina. There she finds a new skating rink (named Jam & Roller), learns freestyling, makes new friends, and even falls in love.', 'Luna Valente lives with her family in Cancún, Mexico. She goes to school, has her own group of friends, has a job, and loves to skate. However, her life changes when her parents are given a job offer that moves them to Buenos Aires, Argentina. There she finds a new skating rink (named Jam & Roller), learns freestyling, makes new friends, and even falls in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4JDmIzhNF7aMsDGlxVwkQ9kv9E6.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:66203'),
  ('461142716864882370', 'Soy tu dueña', 2010, 'Drama', 'Inés Rodena, Kary Fajer', null, 'Lucero, Fernando Colunga, Gabriela Spanic, Sergio Goyri, David Zepeda, Jacqueline Andere, Ana Martín, Eduardo Capetillo', 'TV-PG', 'Soy Tu Dueña is a Mexican telenovela produced by Nicandro Díaz González for Televisa. It starred Lucero, Gabriela Spanic, Fernando Colunga, David Zepeda, Sergio Goyri and Jacqueline Andere.', 'Soy Tu Dueña is a Mexican telenovela produced by Nicandro Díaz González for Televisa. It starred Lucero, Gabriela Spanic, Fernando Colunga, David Zepeda, Sergio Goyri and Jacqueline Andere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Ey5MIVKGDXPo4TMZy2FkB7FxUH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32218'),
  ('482972822163168293', 'Soy tu fan', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Ana Claudia Talancón, Martín Altomaro, Juan Pablo Medina, Gonzalo García Vivanco, Maya Zapata, Marcela Guirado, Flor Eduarda Gurrola', 'NR', 'We all have someone that we obsess over. We all are capable of loving irrationally what we don’t have and construct an unattainable charm in the people we admire. Sometimes we want to be someone else, to be with someone else. Sometimes we settle on appreciating from afar. Other times, we seek out an encounter. To be a fan means, by definition, to be on unequal terms. One loves beforehand, falling for a facade that could very well be invented. This mexican romcom explores these feelings in depth as examined through the eyes of a fan.', 'We all have someone that we obsess over. We all are capable of loving irrationally what we don’t have and construct an unattainable charm in the people we admire. Sometimes we want to be someone else, to be with someone else. Sometimes we settle on appreciating from afar. Other times, we seek out an encounter. To be a fan means, by definition, to be on unequal terms. One loves beforehand, falling for a facade that could very well be invented. This mexican romcom explores these feelings in depth as examined through the eyes of a fan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bOgm5lY1z9KcgJmG9Cpxvppdw0X.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:34327'),
  ('551628495870838413', 'Soy un Simple Mortal', 2026, null, null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4CT7SIiAfVq2Vexcuf9pr6cpUdK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:315659'),
  ('582604710681482042', 'Söz', 2017, 'War & Politics, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, 'Ethem Özışık', 'Tolga Sarıtaş, Nihat Altınkaya, Deniz Baysal, Eren Vurdem, Burak Sevinç, Aytaç Şaşmaz, Ilayda Ildir, Meriç Aral', null, 'Yavuz Karasu, a well-trained Turkish soldier, is in Istanbul with his fiance where a terrorist operation takes place. Dr. Bahar, who is not a surgeon, tries to save his fiance. After this incident, Yavuz goes back to Karabayir and Bahar follows him all the way to give him something that belongs to him. Another incident happens and he is chosen to be the commander of a team whose mission is to catch a terrorist and protect Karabiyir and their country Turkey. The whole team is solid, consistent, and willing to sacrifice their lives for the sake of their country.', 'Yavuz Karasu, a well-trained Turkish soldier, is in Istanbul with his fiance where a terrorist operation takes place. Dr. Bahar, who is not a surgeon, tries to save his fiance. After this incident, Yavuz goes back to Karabayir and Bahar follows him all the way to give him something that belongs to him. Another incident happens and he is chosen to be the commander of a team whose mission is to catch a terrorist and protect Karabiyir and their country Turkey. The whole team is solid, consistent, and willing to sacrifice their lives for the sake of their country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/orUokYSO7obeN8T1AhgbMNHb4FB.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:71096'),
  ('835449014834416471', 'Space', 2001, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Sam Neill', null, 'Sam Neill takes an amazing journey across the Universe and finds beauty and danger on the way.', 'Sam Neill takes an amazing journey across the Universe and finds beauty and danger on the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ahxlw5xWnaR5SiavBXzIpykZAZt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16055'),
  ('472682517638803305', 'Space Battleship Yamato', 1974, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Kei Tomiyama, Gorō Naya, Shūsei Nakamura, Yoko Asagami, Takeshi Aono, Ichiro Nagai, Kenichi Ogata, Yoshito Yasuhara', null, 'Space Battleship Yamato is a Japanese science fiction anime series featuring an eponymous spacecraft. It is also known to English-speaking audiences as Space Cruiser Yamato; an English-dubbed and heavily edited version of the series was broadcast on North American and Australian television as Star Blazers. The first two seasons of this version were broadcast in Greece in 1981-82 as Διαστημόπλοιο Αργώ. An Italian-language version was also broadcast under the name Star Blazers in Italy, and a Portuguese-language version was successfully shown in Brazil under the title Patrulha Estelar and Viaje a la Ultima Galaxia or Astronave Intrepido in Spain and Latin America. It is a seminal series in the history of anime, marking a turn towards more complex serious works and influencing works such as Mobile Suit Gundam and Neon Genesis Evangelion; Hideaki Anno has ranked Yamato his favorite anime and credited it with sparking his interest in anime. Yamato was the first anime series or movie to win the Seiun Award, a feat not repeated until the 1985 Nausicaä of the Valley of the Wind.', 'Space Battleship Yamato is a Japanese science fiction anime series featuring an eponymous spacecraft. It is also known to English-speaking audiences as Space Cruiser Yamato; an English-dubbed and heavily edited version of the series was broadcast on North American and Australian television as Star Blazers. The first two seasons of this version were broadcast in Greece in 1981-82 as Διαστημόπλοιο Αργώ. An Italian-language version was also broadcast under the name Star Blazers in Italy, and a Portuguese-language version was successfully shown in Brazil under the title Patrulha Estelar and Viaje a la Ultima Galaxia or Astronave Intrepido in Spain and Latin America. It is a seminal series in the history of anime, marking a turn towards more complex serious works and influencing works such as Mobile Suit Gundam and Neon Genesis Evangelion; Hideaki Anno has ranked Yamato his favorite anime and credited it with sparking his interest in anime. Yamato was the first anime series or movie to win the Seiun Award, a feat not repeated until the 1985 Nausicaä of the Valley of the Wind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Zzgx624eyFOmZxvmETLGlZTg20.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:13339'),
  ('432244480630376183', 'Space Brothers', 2012, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hiroaki Hirata, KENN, Masayuki Katou, Miyuki Sawashiro, Masako Ikeda, Yuko Sanpei, Shô Ryûzanji, Ryou Naitou', 'TV-14', 'When they were young, the brothers Mutta and Hibito promised each other they would become astronauts. Now, in 2025, Hibito has followed his dream to become the first Japanese on the moon, but Mutta has just been fired from his job. His brother reminds him of their childhood promise, and Mutta decides once again to aim for space.', 'When they were young, the brothers Mutta and Hibito promised each other they would become astronauts. Now, in 2025, Hibito has followed his dream to become the first Japanese on the moon, but Mutta has just been fired from his job. His brother reminds him of their childhood promise, and Mutta decides once again to aim for space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bie7Iaz3C1Pdd5FDwvqZNfbhCJE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:45209'),
  ('477905798860738055', 'Space Cobra', 1982, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Buichi Terasawa', null, 'Nachi Nozawa, Yoshiko Sakakibara, Reiko Tajima, Gara Takashima', null, 'Cobra lived an adventurous life until his enemies began to hunt him down. He surgically altered his face and erased his own memory in order to hide from his foes and lead a normal life. Eventually, he regains his memories and re-unites with his old partner Lady Armaroid and his ship Tortuga. Cobra travels the galaxy, fighting the outlaw Pirate Guild, but also fleeing the law-enforcing Milky Way Patrol.', 'Cobra lived an adventurous life until his enemies began to hunt him down. He surgically altered his face and erased his own memory in order to hide from his foes and lead a normal life. Eventually, he regains his memories and re-unites with his old partner Lady Armaroid and his ship Tortuga. Cobra travels the galaxy, fighting the outlaw Pirate Guild, but also fleeing the law-enforcing Milky Way Patrol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7mbZ8zYkm2tMP3WnKgcFN2tNuN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8880'),
  ('229469080945916970', 'Space Dandy', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Junichi Suwabe, Uki Satake, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Banjo Ginga, Kousuke Hatakeyama, Chiaki Yurin, Houko Kuwashima, Unsho Ishizuka', 'TV-14', 'Space Dandy is a dandy in space! This dreamy adventurer with a to-die-for pompadour travels across the galaxy in search of aliens no one has ever laid eyes on. Each new species he discovers earns him a hefty reward, but this dandy has to be quick on his feet because it’s first come – first served! Accompanied by his sidekicks, a rundown robot named QT and Meow the cat-looking space alien, Dandy bravely explores unknown worlds inhabited by a variety aliens. Join the best dressed alien hunter in all of space and time as he embarks on an adventure that ends at the edge of the universe!', 'Space Dandy is a dandy in space! This dreamy adventurer with a to-die-for pompadour travels across the galaxy in search of aliens no one has ever laid eyes on. Each new species he discovers earns him a hefty reward, but this dandy has to be quick on his feet because it’s first come – first served! Accompanied by his sidekicks, a rundown robot named QT and Meow the cat-looking space alien, Dandy bravely explores unknown worlds inhabited by a variety aliens. Join the best dressed alien hunter in all of space and time as he embarks on an adventure that ends at the edge of the universe!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNjRKE4W2ZJIoCDA2o6brNqpjg7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:60874'),
  ('631166061346037884', 'Space Force', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Greg Daniels, Steve Carell', 'Sarah Moses, Esmé Park, Mamoudou N’Diaye', 'Steve Carell, John Malkovich, Ben Schwartz, Diana Silvers, Tawny Newsome, Don Lake, Jimmy O. Yang', 'TV-MA', 'A four-star general begrudgingly teams up with an eccentric scientist to get the U.S. military''s newest agency — Space Force — ready for lift-off.', 'A four-star general begrudgingly teams up with an eccentric scientist to get the U.S. military''s newest agency — Space Force — ready for lift-off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgu3p4NvisS8CI68cUfBKbvAvu8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:85922'),
  ('790935086874829178', 'Space Ghost and Dino Boy', 1966, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Alex Toth', null, 'Gary Owens, Ginny Tyler, Tim Matheson, Don Messick, Keye Luke, Ted Cassidy, Regis Cordic, Vic Perrin', 'TV-Y7', 'Intergalactic policeman Space Ghost navigates the cosmos in his tricked-out spaceship, The Phantom Cruiser, battling villains like Brak and Zorak in his legendary suit and powerful wristbands. Dino Boy teams with caveman Ugh and dinosaur Bronty to go primeval on the ancient menaces of their primitive home.', 'Intergalactic policeman Space Ghost navigates the cosmos in his tricked-out spaceship, The Phantom Cruiser, battling villains like Brak and Zorak in his legendary suit and powerful wristbands. Dino Boy teams with caveman Ugh and dinosaur Bronty to go primeval on the ancient menaces of their primitive home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hD2ciSqTHxnvF0MQbJdMBmi6XM4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3303'),
  ('1118518223074430061', 'Space Ghost Coast to Coast', 1994, 'Animation, Comedy, Talk', 'Mike Lazzo, Khaki Jones', null, 'George Lowe, C. Martin Croker', 'TV-PG', 'A cartoon superhero interacts with live guests via his television set in this parody talk show based on 1960s Hanna-Barbera cartoon character Space Ghost.', 'A cartoon superhero interacts with live guests via his television set in this parody talk show based on 1960s Hanna-Barbera cartoon character Space Ghost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sjTe8T7FRhNcSlmT4XF38dd1BEF.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:2798'),
  ('803214161805016003', 'Space Goofs', 1997, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Kids', 'Philippe Traversat, Jean-Yves Raimbaud', null, 'Charlie Adler, Billy West, Bernard Alane, Jean-Claude Donda, Patrick Préjean, Patrick Guillemin, Gérard Surugue, Eric Métayer', 'TV-Y7', 'Five peculiar monsters from a distant galaxy crash land on Earth. Quickly, realizing that if discovered by the government they will end up as laboratory experiments, they hide in the attic of an empty house. But the house is for rent! Our alien friends have a hard and hilarious time getting rid of each new tenant, as they discover that this world of "strange earthlings" is even more bizarre than the world they left behind.', 'Five peculiar monsters from a distant galaxy crash land on Earth. Quickly, realizing that if discovered by the government they will end up as laboratory experiments, they hide in the attic of an empty house. But the house is for rent! Our alien friends have a hard and hilarious time getting rid of each new tenant, as they discover that this world of "strange earthlings" is even more bizarre than the world they left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDy5TItuydtcMIGubp13GBZsQZ1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11801'),
  ('868024499418336229', 'Space Odyssey: Voyage To The Planets', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Joe Ahearne', null, 'David Suchet, Michelle Joseph, Martin McDougall, Mark Dexter, Rad Lazar, Mark Tandy', null, 'Imagine crashing through the acid storms of Venus, taking a space walk in the magnificent rings of Saturn, or collecting samples on the disintegrating surface of an unstable comet. Seen through the eyes of five astronauts on a six-year mission to the new frontiers that make up our solar system, it reveals the spectacle - and the dangers - they face when landing on and exploring the exotic worlds of our neighbouring planets.', 'Imagine crashing through the acid storms of Venus, taking a space walk in the magnificent rings of Saturn, or collecting samples on the disintegrating surface of an unstable comet. Seen through the eyes of five astronauts on a six-year mission to the new frontiers that make up our solar system, it reveals the spectacle - and the dangers - they face when landing on and exploring the exotic worlds of our neighbouring planets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vPFmAuVtO7dj7WhuD3OPbPJSCU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6300'),
  ('169113672888202975', 'Space Patrol', 1966, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Hans Gottschalk, Rolf Honold', null, 'Dietmar Schönherr, Eva Pflug, Wolfgang Völz, Charlotte Kerr, Claus Holm, Friedrich G. Beckhaus, Ursula Lillig, Benno Sterzenbach', 'NR', 'Raumpatrouille – Die phantastischen Abenteuer des Raumschiffes Orion, also known as Raumpatrouille Orion, and Space Patrol Orion in English, was the first German science fiction television series. Its seven episodes were broadcast by ARD beginning September 17, 1966 six years before Star Trek first aired in West Germany. Being a huge success with several reruns audience ratings went up to 56%. Over the years, the series acquired a distinct cult status in Germany.', 'Raumpatrouille – Die phantastischen Abenteuer des Raumschiffes Orion, also known as Raumpatrouille Orion, and Space Patrol Orion in English, was the first German science fiction television series. Its seven episodes were broadcast by ARD beginning September 17, 1966 six years before Star Trek first aired in West Germany. Being a huge success with several reruns audience ratings went up to 56%. Over the years, the series acquired a distinct cult status in Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8GnYoNNt4FbuNm39t0TK0wPMmV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13834'),
  ('933443093886458769', 'Space Patrol Luluco', 2016, 'Comedy, Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mao Ichimichi, Junya Enoki, Mayumi Shintani, Tetsu Inada, Mitsuo Iwata, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Yoko Honna, Junichi Gotou', 'TV-14', 'The show takes place in Ogikubo, which is the name of the specially designated area in space in the Milky Way where Earthlings and aliens can live together. Luluco is a female middle school student who lives with her father, and no matter where she is, Luluco is a common, "super normal" girl. As she is living her normal life, one day the mysterious transfer student ΑΩ Nova abruptly appears before her. That meeting will change Luluco''s fate.', 'The show takes place in Ogikubo, which is the name of the specially designated area in space in the Milky Way where Earthlings and aliens can live together. Luluco is a female middle school student who lives with her father, and no matter where she is, Luluco is a common, "super normal" girl. As she is living her normal life, one day the mysterious transfer student ΑΩ Nova abruptly appears before her. That meeting will change Luluco''s fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/53e5gXs127DquTuoPsrYzfGDllQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66107'),
  ('1118315553939021627', 'Space Pirate Captain Harlock', 1978, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Leiji Matsumoto', 'Shozo Uehara, Haruya Yamazaki', 'Makio Inoue, Akira Kamiya, Noriko Ohara, Chiyoko Kawashima, Haruko Kitahama, Joji Yanami, Hiroshi Otake, Kenichi Ogata', 'TV-14', 'When a mysterious invader from the stars catches Earth unawares, only the legendary space pirate Captain Harlock and the crew of the Arcadia have the will to stand against them.', 'When a mysterious invader from the stars catches Earth unawares, only the legendary space pirate Captain Harlock and the crew of the Arcadia have the will to stand against them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uxME9jveTHhoKKqN0e2PaotoJmv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31714'),
  ('948511169849157677', 'Space Pirate Captain Herlock: Outside Legend - The Endless Odyssey', 2002, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Leiji Matsumoto', 'Sadayuki Murai', 'Koichi Yamadera, Kappei Yamaguchi, Yuko Minaguchi, Rei Sakuma, Tomokazu Seki, Naoki Tatsuta, Mika Kanai, Katsunosuke Hori', null, 'On an archaeological mission to the end of the known universe, Professor Daiba unwitting unleashes an ancient horror from its confines. Five years later the malevolent alien force sets in motion a plan which reunites the various crewmembers of the Arcadia to sail the stars once more as well as bring Tadashi Daiba to meet Harlock for the first time (again).', 'On an archaeological mission to the end of the known universe, Professor Daiba unwitting unleashes an ancient horror from its confines. Five years later the malevolent alien force sets in motion a plan which reunites the various crewmembers of the Arcadia to sail the stars once more as well as bring Tadashi Daiba to meet Harlock for the first time (again).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVvC1B72AAlHX4g6Sh02MTylNiD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61155'),
  ('159028088870185873', 'Space Precinct', 1994, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Gerry Anderson', null, 'Ted Shackelford, Jerome Willis, Mary Woodvine, Simone Bendix, Rob Youngblood, Gary Martin, Megan Olive, Nancy Paul', null, 'An NYPD officer transfers his family to a space station.', 'An NYPD officer transfers his family to a space station.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5Gdg0wmhWQQZmHmBtOyHEiPtaJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3129'),
  ('856936193146682085', 'Space Race', 2005, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Christopher Spencer, Mark Everest', null, 'Richard Dillane, Steve Nicolson, Ravil Isyanov, Max Bollinger', null, 'The untold true story behind the Cold War race to put man into space.', 'The untold true story behind the Cold War race to put man into space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54tkCalnQcchkUQ4p59uNcy5oDL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:887'),
  ('536664113839292775', 'Space Rangers', 1993, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Pen Densham', null, 'Jeff Kaake, Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa, Gottfried John, Danny Quinn, Jack McGee, Linda Hunt, Clint Howard, Marjorie Monaghan', 'NR', 'Space Rangers is an American futuristic science fiction drama. The short lived series aired on CBS in 1993. The show was created by Pen Densham and Trilogy Entertainment Group.', 'Space Rangers is an American futuristic science fiction drama. The short lived series aired on CBS in 1993. The show was created by Pen Densham and Trilogy Entertainment Group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QIAQDc0MWdhkoQtNUswst8nizZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5026'),
  ('577238609462272133', 'Space Sheriff Gavan', 1982, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Kenji Ohba, Wakiko Kano, Kyoko Nashiro, Sonny Chiba, Tamie Kubota, Masayuki Suzuki, Toshiaki Nishizawa, Miyuki Nagato', null, 'Earth is invaded by the criminal organization known as Makuu, led by Don Horror, who had first destroyed a space colony near Earth. Don Horror wants to dominate the whole universe, and the Earth represents an obstacle that he has to overcome by turning it into a domain for all evil. In response to Makuu''s attack, Space Sheriff Gavan of the Galaxy Federal Police is deployed to Earth to defend his mother''s home world.', 'Earth is invaded by the criminal organization known as Makuu, led by Don Horror, who had first destroyed a space colony near Earth. Don Horror wants to dominate the whole universe, and the Earth represents an obstacle that he has to overcome by turning it into a domain for all evil. In response to Makuu''s attack, Space Sheriff Gavan of the Galaxy Federal Police is deployed to Earth to defend his mother''s home world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/at88mussBVC0lFy4f2yZgvSmWEL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4937'),
  ('429618754349097627', 'Space Stars', 1981, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Family, Mystery, Kids', null, null, 'Michael Winslow, Darryl Hickman, Frank Welker, Michael Bell, Lennie Weinrib, Don Messick, Gary Owens, B.J. Ward', null, 'As the entire world went "space action" crazy at the end of the Seventies, Hanna-Barbera reconvened its Sci-Fi superstars Space Ghost and the Herculoids for another round of adventures. Joining the sixties sci-fi faves in their interstellar battle against evil were newcomers Teen Force and Astro and the Space Mutts (yes, that Astro!).', 'As the entire world went "space action" crazy at the end of the Seventies, Hanna-Barbera reconvened its Sci-Fi superstars Space Ghost and the Herculoids for another round of adventures. Joining the sixties sci-fi faves in their interstellar battle against evil were newcomers Teen Force and Astro and the Space Mutts (yes, that Astro!).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gdP5vPS2pJrPYrVLt6Kl4VIDl3O.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11067'),
  ('392544955612931946', 'Space: 1999', 1975, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Sylvia Anderson, Gerry Anderson', null, 'Martin Landau, Barbara Bain, Catherine Schell, Tony Anholt', 'TV-14', 'The crew of Moonbase Alpha must struggle to survive when a massive explosion throws the Moon from orbit into deep space.', 'The crew of Moonbase Alpha must struggle to survive when a massive explosion throws the Moon from orbit into deep space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/77Jn71Aw4mct3phi7wpjLdvO9U5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:134'),
  ('698105978988491670', 'Space: Above and Beyond', 1995, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Glen Morgan, James Wong', null, 'Morgan Weisser, Kristen Cloke, Rodney Rowland, Joel de la Fuente, Lanei Chapman, James Morrison', null, 'Set in the years 2063–2064, the show focuses on the "Wildcards", members of the United States Marine Corps Space Aviator Cavalry, 58th Squadron. They are stationed on the space carrier USS Saratoga, and act as infantry and pilots of SA-43 Endo/Exo-Atmospheric Attack Jet fighters.', 'Set in the years 2063–2064, the show focuses on the "Wildcards", members of the United States Marine Corps Space Aviator Cavalry, 58th Squadron. They are stationed on the space carrier USS Saratoga, and act as infantry and pilots of SA-43 Endo/Exo-Atmospheric Attack Jet fighters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bybuA80TNiuDFrxS8Pxlpi2APls.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3534'),
  ('933554534994906104', 'Spaceballs: The Animated Series', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Thomas Meehan, Mel Brooks', null, 'Mel Brooks, Daphne Zuniga, Rino Romano, Tino Insana, Dee Bradley Baker, Joan Rivers', 'TV-PG', 'Spaceballs: The Animated Series, also known as Spaceballs: The Series, is an animated television series that premiered in 2008 on G4 and Canada''s Super Channel, and is loosely based on the parody science fiction film Spaceballs. Similarly to how the original film parodied the original Star Wars films and the Star Trek universe, each episode of the series parodies a different film or other aspect of popular culture, such as the Star Wars prequel trilogy, The Lord of the Rings, or the Grand Theft Auto video games.', 'Spaceballs: The Animated Series, also known as Spaceballs: The Series, is an animated television series that premiered in 2008 on G4 and Canada''s Super Channel, and is loosely based on the parody science fiction film Spaceballs. Similarly to how the original film parodied the original Star Wars films and the Star Trek universe, each episode of the series parodies a different film or other aspect of popular culture, such as the Star Wars prequel trilogy, The Lord of the Rings, or the Grand Theft Auto video games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fvCjSavlPxibHoqVljboyaFBNL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12785'),
  ('749167033890614478', 'Spaced', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Simon Pegg, Jessica Hynes, Edgar Wright', null, 'Simon Pegg, Jessica Hynes, Nick Frost, Mark Heap, Julia Deakin', 'TV-14', 'Spaced: the anti-Friends, in that it examines the lives of common 20 somethings, but in a way that is more down to earth and realistic. Here we have Daisy and Tim; two ''young'' adults with big dreams just trying to get by in this crazy world. They are thrown together in a common pursuit of tenancy, which they find by posing as a couple. The house has a landlady and an oddball artist living there. The series explores the ins and outs of London living.', 'Spaced: the anti-Friends, in that it examines the lives of common 20 somethings, but in a way that is more down to earth and realistic. Here we have Daisy and Tim; two ''young'' adults with big dreams just trying to get by in this crazy world. They are thrown together in a common pursuit of tenancy, which they find by posing as a couple. The house has a landlady and an oddball artist living there. The series explores the ins and outs of London living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igZWEYUohDxlLodq8RkeJa7jBna.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:745'),
  ('528630483268669620', 'Spaceship Sagittarius', 1986, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Bin Shimada, Kenichi Ogata, Yoku Shioya', 'TV-G', 'Uchūsen Sagittarius is a 77-episode Japanese science fiction anime series directed by Kazuyoshi Yokota and created by Nippon Animation and TV Asahi. It aired from January 10, 1986 to October 3, 1987. The series is based on Altri Mondi, an Italian comic book drawn by physicist Andrea Romol.', 'Uchūsen Sagittarius is a 77-episode Japanese science fiction anime series directed by Kazuyoshi Yokota and created by Nippon Animation and TV Asahi. It aired from January 10, 1986 to October 3, 1987. The series is based on Altri Mondi, an Italian comic book drawn by physicist Andrea Romol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGlKqwpaqdig9208sgJQCi65YnB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44371'),
  ('496736478434347778', 'Spacey Unmasked', 2024, 'Documentary, Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Kevin Spacey, Randall Fowler, Andy Holtzman, Adam B. Vary, Daniel Alfonso Contreras, Chloe Melas, Scott Levy', 'TV-MA', 'In 2023, Kevin Spacey was acquitted of sexual offences against four men in a UK trial. This documentary investigates Spacey''s conduct and talks to multiple men, unconnected to that case, about their experiences with Kevin Spacey, almost all of whom have never spoken before.', 'In 2023, Kevin Spacey was acquitted of sexual offences against four men in a UK trial. This documentary investigates Spacey''s conduct and talks to multiple men, unconnected to that case, about their experiences with Kevin Spacey, almost all of whom have never spoken before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2PEaTdXkmztlGmsAuFtIJsJsSYF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:252727'),
  ('1019337813400242034', 'Spain''s Elite Force: Beyond Limits', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Jorge Pérez Vega, José Ignacio Corrales, David Miralles', null, null, 'TV-14', 'For the first time in the history of the Spanish Police, a camera crew has been granted exclusive access to the selection process for new members of the Special Group of Operations (G.E.O.), which lasts for more than seven months. Dozens of officers start, but only a few will finish the course.', 'For the first time in the history of the Spanish Police, a camera crew has been granted exclusive access to the selection process for new members of the Special Group of Operations (G.E.O.), which lasts for more than seven months. Dozens of officers start, but only a few will finish the course.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nyWRLBHO18qtBRsz9dCigsG0iFm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:133765'),
  ('13120926588904796', 'Spanish Shame', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Juan Cavestany, Álvaro Fernández Armero', null, 'Malena Alterio, Vito Sanz, Javier Gutiérrez, Lola Casamayor, Miguel Rellán', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dy2NquFtD1LFE85aBndkuWwnBGj.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:75275'),
  ('691902528255539825', 'Spare Me Your Mercy', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Sammon', null, 'Thanapob Leeratanakachorn, Kritsanapoom Pibulsonggram, Arisara Wongchalee, Pongsatorn Jongwilas, Atchareeya Potipipittanakorn, Gandhi​ Wasuvitchayagit', null, 'A cop investigating suspicious patient deaths falls for the doctor he fears may be involved, forcing a painful choice between love and justice.', 'A cop investigating suspicious patient deaths falls for the doctor he fears may be involved, forcing a painful choice between love and justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oenmdVhY2EN91cywmIz8jdyP1vC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:242326'),
  ('752374322518765181', 'Spare Me, Great Lord!', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Hui Shuohua De Zhouzi', null, 'Yang Tianxiang, Shuang Zhao, Nie Xiying, Ajie, Liu Cong, Wei Chao, Lan Taoyi', 'TV-PG', 'Lü Shu is a frail teenager with an iron will. After losing his parents, he enrolls in a prestigious high school while working for a living and looking after his adoptive sister, Lü Xiaoyu. However, Lü Shu''s quiet life abruptly changes when a car accident awakens his latent cultivation superpowers. Now cured of his physical weakness, he decides to hide his newfound abilities, as the art of cultivation is still shrouded in mystery—and the fate of cultivators uncertain. Meanwhile, Tian Luo Di Wang, the international foundation responsible for monitoring the cultivators, sets its plans in motion. Under the impetus of their member Xi Fei, a special cultivation training group is established in Lü Shu''s high school. Although Lü Shu is forced to join the program, he is determined to hide the nature of his fearsome power, for his cultivation draws from an unlimited resource: the negative emotions of others brought about by his actions.', 'Lü Shu is a frail teenager with an iron will. After losing his parents, he enrolls in a prestigious high school while working for a living and looking after his adoptive sister, Lü Xiaoyu. However, Lü Shu''s quiet life abruptly changes when a car accident awakens his latent cultivation superpowers. Now cured of his physical weakness, he decides to hide his newfound abilities, as the art of cultivation is still shrouded in mystery—and the fate of cultivators uncertain. Meanwhile, Tian Luo Di Wang, the international foundation responsible for monitoring the cultivators, sets its plans in motion. Under the impetus of their member Xi Fei, a special cultivation training group is established in Lü Shu''s high school. Although Lü Shu is forced to join the program, he is determined to hide the nature of his fearsome power, for his cultivation draws from an unlimited resource: the negative emotions of others brought about by his actions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jO4DI02wo9hqimvELQGPa44T47Q.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:146339'),
  ('560625256734967375', 'Sparking Joy with Marie Kondo', 2021, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, 'Marie Kondo', null, 'In this reality series, Marie Kondo brings her joyful tidying tactics to people struggling to balance work and home life and shares her own world.', 'In this reality series, Marie Kondo brings her joyful tidying tactics to people struggling to balance work and home life and shares her own world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wkj1lWFFj7JXw49epNUgb2Vi4w1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130245'),
  ('810109930104239568', 'Sparkling Girls', 2012, 'Soap, Comedy', 'Filipe Miguez, Izabel de Oliveira', 'Daisy Chaves, Sérgio Marques, Paula Amaral', 'Taís Araújo, Leandra Leal, Isabelle Drummond, Cláudia Abreu, Ricardo Tozzi, Humberto Carrão, Jonatas Faro, Jayme Matarazzo', null, '"Sparkling Girls" centers around three young and beautiful, hard-working housekeepers who reach stardom instantly when an online video clip of them singing, surprisingly becomes a hit. Their success provokes the wrath of a glamorously gaudy and outspoken famous singer who will do anything to ruin the girls'' friendship and career. With humor, romance, over the top characters, and bright, glittery stage performances set to catchy tunes, "Sparkling Girls" delivers all of the expected delights and shows that dreams really do come true.', '"Sparkling Girls" centers around three young and beautiful, hard-working housekeepers who reach stardom instantly when an online video clip of them singing, surprisingly becomes a hit. Their success provokes the wrath of a glamorously gaudy and outspoken famous singer who will do anything to ruin the girls'' friendship and career. With humor, romance, over the top characters, and bright, glittery stage performances set to catchy tunes, "Sparkling Girls" delivers all of the expected delights and shows that dreams really do come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Y9thXfqqeeBCLuf9JKrPaMhGGp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45865'),
  ('791694661378913433', 'Sparrow', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, War & Politics', null, 'Fei Hai', 'Li Yifeng, Zhou Dongyu, Zhang Luyi, Zhang Ruoyun, Kan Qingzi, Wang Jinsong, 郑言, Chen Guanning', null, 'This drama is set during the revolutionary time in Shanghai, based on a novel of the same name of Hai Fei. During the republican revolution, Chen Shen is a secret agent under Special Operations Executive Director Bi Zhongliang, among the agents called “sparrow” (similar to the program “zero” in Japan)', 'This drama is set during the revolutionary time in Shanghai, based on a novel of the same name of Hai Fei. During the republican revolution, Chen Shen is a secret agent under Special Operations Executive Director Bi Zhongliang, among the agents called “sparrow” (similar to the program “zero” in Japan)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hjRxDSbLt7oXuvyfrGa7y6Hfg7m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67727'),
  ('245117993467217703', 'Sparta', 2018, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Ilya Tilkin', null, 'Valeriya Shkirando, Artyom Tkachenko, Alexander Petrov, Oksana Bazilevich, Olga Sutulova, Mikhail Grubov, Fillip Gorenshtein, Marina Kaletskaya', null, 'If you ever asked yourself what if there is any place where all your desires could suddenly come true, you should play «Sparta». «Sparta» is a game without any rules. Experiencing the game will change your life by the reason of virtual world crossing the borders and becoming the part of our daily routine.', 'If you ever asked yourself what if there is any place where all your desires could suddenly come true, you should play «Sparta». «Sparta» is a game without any rules. Experiencing the game will change your life by the reason of virtual world crossing the borders and becoming the part of our daily routine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkr1UIvkfAmx2MCudh3aBXURVUV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81007'),
  ('1151582980469720788', 'Spartacus', 2004, 'Action & Adventure, War & Politics, Drama', null, null, 'Goran Višnjić, Alan Bates, Angus Macfadyen, Rhona Mitra, Ian McNeice, James Frain, Henry Simmons, Ben Cross', null, 'Spartacus, who was enslaved by the Romans after they murdered his father, leads fellow slaves in an attempt to overthrow the repressive Roman Empire.', 'Spartacus, who was enslaved by the Romans after they murdered his father, leads fellow slaves in an attempt to overthrow the repressive Roman Empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xA7kXbi26FcjbgXdbMjUs3m6xvr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:49258'),
  ('5800944875480154', 'Spartacus', 2010, 'Drama', 'Steven S. DeKnight', 'Miranda Kwok, Tracy Bellomo', 'Liam McIntyre, Manu Bennett, Dustin Clare, Cynthia Addai-Robinson, Jaime Murray, Ellen Hollman, Luna Rioumina, Marisa Ramirez', 'TV-MA', 'Torn from his homeland and the woman he loves, Spartacus is condemned to the brutal world of the arena where blood and death are primetime entertainment.', 'Torn from his homeland and the woman he loves, Spartacus is condemned to the brutal world of the arena where blood and death are primetime entertainment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c2GKN4VHCj1dnjFMANRpGkCVBae.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:46296'),
  ('475334718366990741', 'Spartacus: House of Ashur', 2025, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Steven S. DeKnight', null, 'Nick E. Tarabay, Graham McTavish, Tenika Davis, Jamaica Vaughan, Ivana Baquero, Jordi Webber, Claudia Black, India Shaw-Smith', 'TV-MA', 'In a world where he survived the events of Spartacus, Ashur clawed his way to power, owning the same ludus that once owned him. Allying with a fierce gladiatrix, Ashur ignites a new kind of spectacle that offends the elite.', 'In a world where he survived the events of Spartacus, Ashur clawed his way to power, owning the same ludus that once owned him. Allying with a fierce gladiatrix, Ashur ignites a new kind of spectacle that offends the elite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNByuzy60v31nmUVPMA8oAtneUK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:240459'),
  ('7806095166107791', 'Spartakus and the Sun Beneath the Sea', 1985, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Nina Wolmark', null, 'Jeanine Forney, Chris Benard, Marc Moro, Jean Négroni, Perrette Pradier, Albert Augier, Yves-Marie Maurin, Louis Arbessier', null, 'The Arkadians are a civilization that survived a great cataclysm and moved to the center of the earth, thriving under the power of their artificial sun, The Tehra, until one day it began to fail. In desperation, the Arkadians broke the ancient law and entered the Forbidden Archives to search for an answer. They used their special powers and created a messenger to the people above, naming her Arkana. She meets up with Matt and Rebecca, two ordinary kids from the surface world, Bic and Bac, two strange anteaters from Arkadia, and Spartakus, a mysterious warrior. Together they search the worlds of the strata for a way to save a people and possibly the world.', 'The Arkadians are a civilization that survived a great cataclysm and moved to the center of the earth, thriving under the power of their artificial sun, The Tehra, until one day it began to fail. In desperation, the Arkadians broke the ancient law and entered the Forbidden Archives to search for an answer. They used their special powers and created a messenger to the people above, naming her Arkana. She meets up with Matt and Rebecca, two ordinary kids from the surface world, Bic and Bac, two strange anteaters from Arkadia, and Spartakus, a mysterious warrior. Together they search the worlds of the strata for a way to save a people and possibly the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/TVspJ6AZPEl4emcKRSzoyzEnin.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:12407'),
  ('309842101804348964', 'Spawn', 1997, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Todd McFarlane', 'Rebekah Bradford, John Leekley', 'Todd McFarlane, Keith David, Richard Dysart, Dominique Jennings, James Keane, Michael McShane, John Rafter Lee, Michael Nicolosi', 'TV-MA', 'Todd McFarlane''s Spawn is an animated television series which aired on HBO from 1997 through 1999. It is also released on DVD as a film series. It is based on the Spawn comic series from Image Comics, and was nominated for and won an Emmy in 1999 for Outstanding Animation Program. An unrelated series titled Spawn: The Animation is in production since 2009, with Keith David reprising his role as the titular character. Like the comic book, the series features graphic violence, sexual scenes, and extensive use of profanity. Todd McFarlane''s Spawn was ranked 5th on IGN''s list of The Greatest Comic Book Cartoons Of All Time.', 'Todd McFarlane''s Spawn is an animated television series which aired on HBO from 1997 through 1999. It is also released on DVD as a film series. It is based on the Spawn comic series from Image Comics, and was nominated for and won an Emmy in 1999 for Outstanding Animation Program. An unrelated series titled Spawn: The Animation is in production since 2009, with Keith David reprising his role as the titular character. Like the comic book, the series features graphic violence, sexual scenes, and extensive use of profanity. Todd McFarlane''s Spawn was ranked 5th on IGN''s list of The Greatest Comic Book Cartoons Of All Time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKZR2IIrPPo2LnMdYfxvOlXFls7.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:10331'),
  ('585685741667075244', 'Speakerine', 2018, 'Drama', 'Laurent Tuel', 'Nicole Jamet, Valentine Milville, Sylvain Saada', 'Baptiste Carrion-Weiss, Guillaume de Tonquédec, Grégory Fitoussi, Barbara Probst, Marie Gillain, Christiane Millet, Clément Aubert, Anne-Sophie Soldaini', null, 'July 1962. Christine Beauval, star speaker of the RTF, is a fulfilled woman who leads her life as a wife and mother, as well as an ambitious professional career. But in the spotlight, when she should speak, her body suddenly falls, bloody. A few days earlier, her husband Pierre was appointed head of Mondovision by his friend Eric Jauffret, Minister of Information.', 'July 1962. Christine Beauval, star speaker of the RTF, is a fulfilled woman who leads her life as a wife and mother, as well as an ambitious professional career. But in the spotlight, when she should speak, her body suddenly falls, bloody. A few days earlier, her husband Pierre was appointed head of Mondovision by his friend Eric Jauffret, Minister of Information.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vyXiCkNUEREdIFNIzVdoVUuL9r4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78835'),
  ('544186268685879561', 'SPEC ~ First Blood', 2010, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Erika Toda, Ryo Kase, Raita Ryu, Ryunosuke Kamiki, Kippei Shiina, Saki Fukuda, Yu Shirota, Ken Yasuda', 'TV-MA', 'An eccentric genius and a demoted special forces officer team up in Tokyo''s Unidentified Crimes Unit to tackle criminals with supernatural abilities.', 'An eccentric genius and a demoted special forces officer team up in Tokyo''s Unidentified Crimes Unit to tackle criminals with supernatural abilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUYbksMk7IkvKWDUPr9zq76562K.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45923'),
  ('707284244585205738', 'Special', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Ryan O''Connell', null, 'Ryan O''Connell, Punam Patel, Jessica Hecht', 'TV-MA', 'A gay man with mild cerebral palsy decides to rewrite his identity as an accident victim and finally go after the life he wants.', 'A gay man with mild cerebral palsy decides to rewrite his identity as an accident victim and finally go after the life he wants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rc6jiKt7R4rwpeUdEXhhUK0WYA8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:87194'),
  ('1016009387350677359', 'Special 7: Special Crime Investigation Unit', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Crime', null, null, 'Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Yuhko Kaida, Ari Ozawa, Hiroaki Hirata, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Kenjiro Tsuda, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', null, 'Set in a different Tokyo on a different world than ours, the story follows Tokunana, a unit of assembled misfits in the Metropolitan Police Department. Tokunana battles against "Nine" — an organization commiting crimes in their zealous worship of the dragons that once roamed the world.', 'Set in a different Tokyo on a different world than ours, the story follows Tokunana, a unit of assembled misfits in the Metropolitan Police Department. Tokunana battles against "Nine" — an organization commiting crimes in their zealous worship of the dragons that once roamed the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mOQ5aM5tLHJcszNcuwBQXHOiSq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93647'),
  ('1011552156804564828', 'Special A', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ami Koshimizu, Kazuma Horie, Yuko Goto, Kisho Taniyama, Hiro Shimono, Ayahi Takagaki', 'TV-14', 'When Hikari was little, she and her father liked to watch professional wrestling, and she became very good at it. She is the pride of her family until she is introduced to Kei, the son of her father''s friend.', 'When Hikari was little, she and her father liked to watch professional wrestling, and she became very good at it. She is the pride of her family until she is introduced to Kei, the son of her father''s friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3U8ku4H36yH0IzfR3C3yfxiEdyX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37195'),
  ('65915111563493198', 'Special Agent Oso', 2009, 'Animation, Kids', 'Ford Riley', null, 'Cam Clarke, Phill Lewis, Gary Anthony Williams, Sean Astin', null, 'Special Agent Oso is an adorable stuffed bear and an agent-in-training! Oso is always eager to help, even if he doesn''t always get things right.', 'Special Agent Oso is an adorable stuffed bear and an agent-in-training! Oso is always eager to help, even if he doesn''t always get things right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2oxmUFLw7T37G9nKRAV5BtJaHgK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:18351'),
  ('457548126032709344', 'Spécial cinéma', 1974, 'Talk', 'Christian Defaye, Christian Zeender', null, 'Christian Defaye', 'NR', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Isabelle Adjani, Alain Delon, Martin Scorsese, Woody Allen... the biggest stars in cinema were welcomed by Christian Defaye on his show Spécial cinéma. Between intimate confessions from actors and immersion in the world of the greatest filmmakers, Christian Defaye took viewers on a journey into the fascinating world of cinema for nearly thirty years.', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Isabelle Adjani, Alain Delon, Martin Scorsese, Woody Allen... the biggest stars in cinema were welcomed by Christian Defaye on his show Spécial cinéma. Between intimate confessions from actors and immersion in the world of the greatest filmmakers, Christian Defaye took viewers on a journey into the fascinating world of cinema for nearly thirty years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jONImBKU4sK9mBcK5cx7a4R4h5v.jpg', 24, 'tmdb:tv:244224'),
  ('781004381767591339', 'Special Forces: World''s Toughest Test', 2023, 'Reality', null, null, 'Rudy Reyes, Mark Billingham, Jason Fox, Remi Adeleke, Teresa Giudice, Gia Giudice, Shawn Johnson, Ravi Patel', null, 'Celebrities endure some of the harshest, most grueling challenges from the playbook of the actual special forces selection process; their goal is not to win votes and face eliminations — for them it is just about survival.', 'Celebrities endure some of the harshest, most grueling challenges from the playbook of the actual special forces selection process; their goal is not to win votes and face eliminations — for them it is just about survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utHIefqz4rxTh6JntqSOST8rroS.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:216562'),
  ('489796042327771030', 'Special Investigation Nine', 2018, 'Drama', null, null, 'Yoshihiko Inohara, Michiko Hada, Kanji Tsuda, Mitsuru Fukikoshi, Hiromasa Taguchi, Yuki Yamada, Sachie Hara', null, 'The #9 investigation team has been disbanded and members of the #9 investigation team have been scattered around. One year later, the Chief of the National Police Agency, Sojiro Kandagawa, orders the creation of a special investigation team to cover from the initial investigation until it is sent to the prosecutor''s office. Sojiro Kandagawa appoints Sakutaro Munakata as the leader of the special investigation team. Former #9 investigation team members join the special investigation team.', 'The #9 investigation team has been disbanded and members of the #9 investigation team have been scattered around. One year later, the Chief of the National Police Agency, Sojiro Kandagawa, orders the creation of a special investigation team to cover from the initial investigation until it is sent to the prosecutor''s office. Sojiro Kandagawa appoints Sakutaro Munakata as the leader of the special investigation team. Former #9 investigation team members join the special investigation team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DjEaKL54XISjwXzCj8LgyLV5bY.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:106370'),
  ('459745290520304763', 'Special Investigation Robo Janperson', 1993, 'Action & Adventure, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tomoko Kawashima, Shoya Torie, Yuichi Komine, Bomber Morio', null, 'Special Investigation Robo Janperson was the 1993 installment in Toei Company’s Metal Hero Series. The series revolved around Janperson, a robotic detective who patrolled the streets of Tokyo and fought against three different underworld organizations who used super technology to subjugate the masses. Unlike most Metal Heroes, a monster-of-the-week was rarely shown and most of the villains are criminals akin to television police dramas. The name given to this series by Toei for international distribution is Jumperson.', 'Special Investigation Robo Janperson was the 1993 installment in Toei Company’s Metal Hero Series. The series revolved around Janperson, a robotic detective who patrolled the streets of Tokyo and fought against three different underworld organizations who used super technology to subjugate the masses. Unlike most Metal Heroes, a monster-of-the-week was rarely shown and most of the villains are criminals akin to television police dramas. The name given to this series by Toei for international distribution is Jumperson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8SpoCyMwwtgn3vjAKpdX2YZNQ8v.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1303'),
  ('508536564346473273', 'Special Ops', 2020, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Neeraj Pandey', 'Neeraj Pandey', 'Kay Kay Menon, Gautami Kapoor, Vinay Pathak, Parmeet Sethi, Prakash Raj, Karan Tacker, Tahir Raj Bhasin, Saiyami Kher', 'TV-MA', 'The series follows Himmat Singh of Research and Analysis Wing who draws similar patterns in terrorist attacks and is convinced a single person is behind all the attacks. His task force team of five agents living in various parts of the world aim to catch the mastermind. The story is based on an inspiration taken from nineteen years worth of national significant events.', 'The series follows Himmat Singh of Research and Analysis Wing who draws similar patterns in terrorist attacks and is convinced a single person is behind all the attacks. His task force team of five agents living in various parts of the world aim to catch the mastermind. The story is based on an inspiration taken from nineteen years worth of national significant events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rTOGcNzVMYGezpx9AxX7ilzLNEp.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:100612'),
  ('217668099877033929', 'Special Ops 1.5 The Himmat Story', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', null, 'Deepak Kingrani, Neeraj Pandey, Benazir Ali Fida', 'Kay Kay Menon, Vinay Pathak, Aftab Shivdasani, Parmeet Sethi, Kali Prasad Mukherjee, Gautami Kapoor, Shivjyoti Rajput, Aishwarya Sushmita', 'TV-MA', 'After the 2001 Parliament attack, a young and idealistic RA&W officer had a theory. In 2003, he had a mystery. This is the story of Himmat Singh', 'After the 2001 Parliament attack, a young and idealistic RA&W officer had a theory. In 2003, he had a mystery. This is the story of Himmat Singh', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nH5LDmNofN4p5mldUxxhVzfn4sk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138396'),
  ('234640536359749260', 'Special Rescue Exceedraft', 1992, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shigeki Kagemaru, Mamoru Kawai, Iori Sakakibara, Yuri Nakamura, Yoshinari Torii, Akira Murayama, Masaki Terasoma', null, 'To protect innocents from ever-evolving crime, three souls burn brightly! This is the story of the Special Emergency Investigation Unit, striving for love and kindness in the Earth of tomorow!', 'To protect innocents from ever-evolving crime, three souls burn brightly! This is the story of the Special Emergency Investigation Unit, striving for love and kindness in the Earth of tomorow!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ASMflM9O3QZwAHr2ZdyeKWwjVf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6605'),
  ('1113438015354312491', 'Special Rescue Police Winspector', 1990, 'Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Masaru Yamashita, Kaoru Shinoda, Seiichi Hirai, Mami Nakanishi, Hiroshi Miyauchi, Sachiko Oguri, Masaru Ōbayashi, Yura Hoshikawa', null, 'In 1999, advanced science and technology enriched people''s lives, but the damage caused when they were misused for crimes or went out of control and went out of control was also great. The Special Rescue Police Winspector (abbreviated as WSP) was established to deal with such a situation. Their purpose is not only to investigate crimes and arrest suspects but also to save the lives of those involved in crimes and disasters.', 'In 1999, advanced science and technology enriched people''s lives, but the damage caused when they were misused for crimes or went out of control and went out of control was also great. The Special Rescue Police Winspector (abbreviated as WSP) was established to deal with such a situation. Their purpose is not only to investigate crimes and arrest suspects but also to save the lives of those involved in crimes and disasters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itQUGtMTczHI0zuSksGBEGVWPBk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3917'),
  ('596577541201617783', 'Special Squad', 2002, 'Action & Adventure, War & Politics', 'Andrey Malyukov', null, 'Aleksandr Baluev, Vladislav Galkin, Aleksei Kravchenko, Igor Lifanov, Andrey Zibrov, Aleksandr Nosik, Gosha Kutsenko, Mikhail Porechenkov', null, 'Spetsnaz is a 2002 Russian TV miniseries directed by Andrei Malyukov.', 'Spetsnaz is a 2002 Russian TV miniseries directed by Andrei Malyukov.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7g2lkhCUtNCIN6tFK5JqdOLTKPJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:16869'),
  ('411933475094917203', 'Special Unit 2', 2001, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Evan Katz', null, 'Michael Landes, Alexondra Lee, Danny Woodburn, Richard Gant', null, 'Detectives Nick O''Malley and Kate Benson work in Special Unit 2, a secret precinct of the Chicago Police Department whose sole charge is to protect the city''s citizens from Links, a malicious paranormal species that is the missing link between man and beast.', 'Detectives Nick O''Malley and Kate Benson work in Special Unit 2, a secret precinct of the Chicago Police Department whose sole charge is to protect the city''s citizens from Links, a malicious paranormal species that is the missing link between man and beast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hGc06r4JZlGOZFDs5yqPtTDj1vE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:6177'),
  ('995582631626887845', 'Spector', 2022, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Phil Spector, Lana Clarkson, Nicole Spector, Darlene Love, Jeff Barry, Mick Brown, Carol Connors, Nedra Talley', 'TV-MA', 'A four-part documentary series about enigmatic, legendary music producer Phil Spector and what happened on the fateful night of February 3, 2003 when actress Lana Clarkson was shot dead in his mansion.', 'A four-part documentary series about enigmatic, legendary music producer Phil Spector and what happened on the fateful night of February 3, 2003 when actress Lana Clarkson was shot dead in his mansion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pvzeidl7miKcbqQA5YxIe3lydcv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211179'),
  ('889856230972579602', 'Spectreman', 1971, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, null, null, 'Spectreman is the name and title superhero of a tokusatsu sci-fi TV series. Produced by P Productions and created by producer Souji Ushio, this series aired on Fuji TV from January 2, 1971 to March 25, 1972 with a total of 63 episodes, not counting the pre-series pilot episode. This was the first major superhero show of the 1970s.', 'Spectreman is the name and title superhero of a tokusatsu sci-fi TV series. Produced by P Productions and created by producer Souji Ushio, this series aired on Fuji TV from January 2, 1971 to March 25, 1972 with a total of 63 episodes, not counting the pre-series pilot episode. This was the first major superhero show of the 1970s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/to3562OLM5FX8dEvyqqiqfGFg0j.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:20653'),
  ('1109747959208416513', 'Spectros', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Cláudia Okuno, Danilo Mesquita, Mariana Sena', 'TV-MA', 'A group of teenagers gets unintentionally involved in a conflict between Japanese Shinto ghosts and Brazilian witchcraft.', 'A group of teenagers gets unintentionally involved in a conflict between Japanese Shinto ghosts and Brazilian witchcraft.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXOKRYeo6V45d1JM0ich86F6LTe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99573'),
  ('365587036129614673', 'Speechless', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Scott Silveri', null, 'Minnie Driver, John Ross Bowie, Mason Cook, Micah Fowler, Kyla Kenedy, Cedric Yarbrough', 'TV-PG', 'Maya DiMeo is a mom on a mission who will do anything for her husband, Jimmy, and kids Ray, Dylan, and JJ, her eldest son with special needs. As Maya fights injustices both real and imagined, the family works to make a new home for themselves and searches for just the right person to give JJ his “voice.”', 'Maya DiMeo is a mom on a mission who will do anything for her husband, Jimmy, and kids Ray, Dylan, and JJ, her eldest son with special needs. As Maya fights injustices both real and imagined, the family works to make a new home for themselves and searches for just the right person to give JJ his “voice.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7EHM9vaAWBBWgBJnQapYKjGIVHt.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:67040'),
  ('1138138299187314946', 'Speed and Love', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Yu Shuxin, He Yu', null, 'After her parents'' divorce, Jiang Mu reunites with her adopted brother Jin Chao, now a hardened young man living a dangerous life in Thailand. Despite their growing distance, Jiang Mu''s unwavering love helps bridge the gap between them, leading to a journey of healing and redemption as they fight to rebuild their bond and face their struggles together.', 'After her parents'' divorce, Jiang Mu reunites with her adopted brother Jin Chao, now a hardened young man living a dangerous life in Thailand. Despite their growing distance, Jiang Mu''s unwavering love helps bridge the gap between them, leading to a journey of healing and redemption as they fight to rebuild their bond and face their struggles together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnN7OcVOfIhJATSquVzvMoxLPoR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:279041'),
  ('422180595261403018', 'Speed Buggy', 1973, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Michael Bell, Mel Blanc, Arlene Golonka, Phil Luther Jr.', null, 'Set in an assortment of locations around the world, the series follows three teenagers (Mark, Debbie, and Tinker) and a talking dune buggy as they partake in various adventures.', 'Set in an assortment of locations around the world, the series follows three teenagers (Mark, Debbie, and Tinker) and a talking dune buggy as they partake in various adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sDfNsTKBSDwgvXHSsrSfeXzRgAe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10476'),
  ('1044083325403691553', 'SPEED GRAPHER', 2005, 'Animation, Crime', null, null, 'Kei Shindo, Yuji Takada, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Hiro Yuuki, Hisao Egawa, Kenjiro Tsuda, Takako Honda', 'TV-MA', 'In the new Tokyo, where every fetish has a face, burned-out war photographer Tatsumi Saiga is slumming in the tabloid wasteland. Sent to dig up dirt on the underground elite, he stumbles upon a depraved ritual below the city—and before the night ends, a single kiss from a young beauty named Kagura Tennouzu ignites a chain of events that could force the entire ruling class to their knees.', 'In the new Tokyo, where every fetish has a face, burned-out war photographer Tatsumi Saiga is slumming in the tabloid wasteland. Sent to dig up dirt on the underground elite, he stumbles upon a depraved ritual below the city—and before the night ends, a single kiss from a young beauty named Kagura Tennouzu ignites a chain of events that could force the entire ruling class to their knees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5OOEt14tCMakadSZDCwRA6yD4R6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:20432'),
  ('360368642995108359', 'Speed Racer', 1967, 'Animation, Family, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids, Comedy', 'Tatsuo Yoshida', null, 'Katsuji Mori, Teiji Ōmiya, Ryoko Kinomiya, Kei Tomiyama, Kenji Utsumi, Hiroshi Otake, Kin''ya Aikawa, Michiko Nomura', 'TV-Y7', 'Speed ​​Racer is a teenage driver who races around the world in his super-technological car, the Mach 5, created by his father, a former racer. The car has several special features that help Speed ​​tackle difficult terrain and get rid of dishonest opponents—which happens frequently. He experiences these adventures alongside his girlfriend Trixie, his younger brother Spridle, and his pet monkey, Chim-Chim. Together, they face thrilling challenges and show that courage and fair play make all the difference.', 'Speed ​​Racer is a teenage driver who races around the world in his super-technological car, the Mach 5, created by his father, a former racer. The car has several special features that help Speed ​​tackle difficult terrain and get rid of dishonest opponents—which happens frequently. He experiences these adventures alongside his girlfriend Trixie, his younger brother Spridle, and his pet monkey, Chim-Chim. Together, they face thrilling challenges and show that courage and fair play make all the difference.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7o9x0cdLjNXLeKfPM7p8h7DBL9B.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:30986'),
  ('669863011815234804', 'Speed Racer X', 1997, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Masaaki Sakurai', 'Motoko Kumai, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Minoru Inaba, Atsuko Tanaka, Kaneto Shiozawa, Yoko Soumi, Koichi Tochika, Kazusa Murai', null, 'Following the footsteps of his brother, who was apparently killed in a race accident, Go Hibiki races the competition in the Mach 5—a special race car built by his father.', 'Following the footsteps of his brother, who was apparently killed in a race accident, Go Hibiki races the competition in the Mach 5—a special race car built by his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ivLUW0AJzShFmfG64jr8u8r9lxd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37568'),
  ('26383732229242741', 'Spell Keepers', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Michal Cooper Keren, Sivan Shiknagi, Einat Shahak', null, 'Avia Malka, Gily Itskovitch', null, '“Spell Keepers” is an exciting, mysterious and fantastical suspense series. It focuses on two strong and determined girl heroines – Kirki and Laila who have set out to perform their crucial roles in the world. As they strive to save humanity, they must choose between their own personal happiness and fulfill their destinies, while facing an inevitable collision between good and evil.', '“Spell Keepers” is an exciting, mysterious and fantastical suspense series. It focuses on two strong and determined girl heroines – Kirki and Laila who have set out to perform their crucial roles in the world. As they strive to save humanity, they must choose between their own personal happiness and fulfill their destinies, while facing an inevitable collision between good and evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZkgR7kuTPQ2r6NF6peO36J7bvR.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:70616'),
  ('126897461874616320', 'Spellbinder', 1995, 'Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Mark Shirrefs, John Thomson', null, 'Heather Mitchell, Lauren Hewett, Ryan Kwanten, Leonard Fung, Lenore Smith, Peter O''Brien', null, 'A group of teenagers go on a school camp in the Blue Mountains in Australia. While at the camp, Paul Reynolds accidentally goes into a parallel universe. This other world is inhabited by a more hierarchic and technologically different society, ruled by a group of people known as Spellbinders.', 'A group of teenagers go on a school camp in the Blue Mountains in Australia. While at the camp, Paul Reynolds accidentally goes into a parallel universe. This other world is inhabited by a more hierarchic and technologically different society, ruled by a group of people known as Spellbinders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/loc9hb3ybciLZNmDzvWMJSFmJ0E.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1455'),
  ('901198975887209453', 'Spenser: For Hire', 1985, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Robert B. Parker, John Wilder', null, 'Robert Urich, Avery Brooks, Barbara Stock, Ron McLarty', null, 'Mystery and suspense series based on Robert Parker''s "Spenser" novels. Spenser, a private investigator living in Boston, gets involved in a new murder mystery each episode.', 'Mystery and suspense series based on Robert Parker''s "Spenser" novels. Spenser, a private investigator living in Boston, gets involved in a new murder mystery each episode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8n4O7Reyk5es5iyzQk7zfNvuMJ9.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:996'),
  ('557092622305162670', 'Spice and Wolf', 2008, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Jun Fukuyama, Ami Koshimizu, Mai Nakahara, Kaori Nazuka, Daisuke Namikawa, Hochu Otsuka', 'TV-14', 'Lawrence, a traveling merchant searching for profit, finds a naked girl with the ears and tail of a wolf asleep in his cart. Her name is Holo – a harvest goddess with an untamed beast lurking inside who longs to return to her beloved northern home. Armed with his street smarts and her animal instincts, a simple peddler and a forgotten deity begin a journey through the wild countryside. Along their path, the riches of happiness shall be reaped, even as the bankruptcy which dwells in the human heart is exposed.', 'Lawrence, a traveling merchant searching for profit, finds a naked girl with the ears and tail of a wolf asleep in his cart. Her name is Holo – a harvest goddess with an untamed beast lurking inside who longs to return to her beloved northern home. Armed with his street smarts and her animal instincts, a simple peddler and a forgotten deity begin a journey through the wild countryside. Along their path, the riches of happiness shall be reaped, even as the bankruptcy which dwells in the human heart is exposed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qy5enaLa2Iy8zJAnXC1UNA1Ssjc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:26707'),
  ('425949560271487138', 'Spice and Wolf: MERCHANT MEETS THE WISE WOLF', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Jun Fukuyama, Ami Koshimizu', null, 'Lawrence is a traveling merchant selling various goods from a horse-drawn cart. One day, he arrives at a village and meets a beautiful girl with the ears and tail of an animal! Her name is Holo the Wisewolf and she brings bountiful harvests. She wishes to return to her homeland, and Lawrence offers to take her. Now, the once-lonely merchant and the once-lonely wisewolf begin their journey north.', 'Lawrence is a traveling merchant selling various goods from a horse-drawn cart. One day, he arrives at a village and meets a beautiful girl with the ears and tail of an animal! Her name is Holo the Wisewolf and she brings bountiful harvests. She wishes to return to her homeland, and Lawrence offers to take her. Now, the once-lonely merchant and the once-lonely wisewolf begin their journey north.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxzL2EWdiv19eZAoC8s7zuGCJG1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:229676'),
  ('1079314307106137437', 'Spice Up Our Love', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kim Hye-young', null, 'Han Ji-hyeon, Lee Sang-yi, Lee You-jin, Kim Yong-myung', null, 'The R-rated web novel author, Nam Ja-yeon finds herself magically swapped with the female protagonist of her own novel! An unpredictable romance fantasy unfolds between the forever-alone author and the male lead of her romance novel, Kang Ha-jun.', 'The R-rated web novel author, Nam Ja-yeon finds herself magically swapped with the female protagonist of her own novel! An unpredictable romance fantasy unfolds between the forever-alone author and the male lead of her romance novel, Kang Ha-jun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8l3HvnkmpLnFrhvyHOgyacvHSn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:273307'),
  ('288922776453117381', 'Spicks and Specks', 2005, 'Comedy', null, null, null, null, 'Adam Hills, one of Australia''s favourite comedians and winner of Edinburgh''s Best of the Fest award, is joined by two team captains, comedian and actor Alan Brough and radio breakfast announcer Myf Warhurst, as well as brave personalities who enjoy having long forgotten embarrassing stories laughed about on national television. Two teams go head to head as they sing, shout and delve deep into the recesses of their collective minds to help earn their team an extremely inglorious victory.', 'Adam Hills, one of Australia''s favourite comedians and winner of Edinburgh''s Best of the Fest award, is joined by two team captains, comedian and actor Alan Brough and radio breakfast announcer Myf Warhurst, as well as brave personalities who enjoy having long forgotten embarrassing stories laughed about on national television. Two teams go head to head as they sing, shout and delve deep into the recesses of their collective minds to help earn their team an extremely inglorious victory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZYdnKd3sxg2RkPcAr7YZ0s3CBw.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:1642'),
  ('1134317441106148696', 'Spicy City', 1997, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ralph Bakshi', null, 'Michelle Phillips', 'TV-MA', 'In a neo-noir future, nightclub hostess and classy femme fatale Raven presents various stories that either involve some of her guests or even herself. Some are sleazy, some violent, some about love, and some about loneliness, some darkly humorous, and some bittersweet and tragic, some are gritty cyberpunk thrillers and some are more fantastical and lighthearted, but they are all spicy and original.', 'In a neo-noir future, nightclub hostess and classy femme fatale Raven presents various stories that either involve some of her guests or even herself. Some are sleazy, some violent, some about love, and some about loneliness, some darkly humorous, and some bittersweet and tragic, some are gritty cyberpunk thrillers and some are more fantastical and lighthearted, but they are all spicy and original.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQL4kqDuBfD1ClkTc1s0Ahm7SVY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6259'),
  ('656211995309008926', 'Spider-Man', 1967, 'Kids, Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Stan Lee', null, 'Bernard Cowan, Paul Soles, Paul Kligman, Peg Dixon, Billie Mae Richards, Corinne Conley, Larry D. Mann, Len Carlson', 'TV-G', 'The bite of a radioactive spider transforms a teen into a superhero.', 'The bite of a radioactive spider transforms a teen into a superhero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y85QOYMhcZsEfHbrntBv5SZXH1w.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1482'),
  ('618127098935256100', 'Spider-Man', 1981, 'Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Stan Lee', null, 'Ted Schwartz, Morgan Lofting, Linda Gary, Mona Marshall, William Woodson, Buster Jones', 'TV-Y7', 'The web-slinging superhero battles crime in New York City.', 'The web-slinging superhero battles crime in New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Y43QSDxYivUkmw7eFm1JR3Qqwc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3973'),
  ('869798781845416456', 'Spider-Man', 1994, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Christopher Daniel Barnes, Sara Ballantine, Jennifer Hale, Gary Imhoff, Ed Asner, Rodney Saulsberry, Roscoe Lee Browne', 'TV-Y7', 'Bitten by a neogenetic spider, Peter Parker develops spider-like superpowers. He uses these to fight crime while trying to balance it with the struggles of his personal life.', 'Bitten by a neogenetic spider, Peter Parker develops spider-like superpowers. He uses these to fight crime while trying to balance it with the struggles of his personal life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXthtEN5kdWA1bHz03lkuCJS6hA.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:888'),
  ('660673452936879449', 'Spider-Man and His Amazing Friends', 1981, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Stan Lee', null, 'Dan Gilvezan, Kathy Garver, Frank Welker', 'TV-Y7', 'Spider-Man and His Amazing Friends is an American animated television series produced by Marvel Productions starring established Marvel Comics characters Spider-Man and Iceman and an original character, Firestar. As a trio called the Spider-Friends, they fought against various villains.', 'Spider-Man and His Amazing Friends is an American animated television series produced by Marvel Productions starring established Marvel Comics characters Spider-Man and Iceman and an original character, Firestar. As a trio called the Spider-Friends, they fought against various villains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fG5wT0tJ8HIqGBSHe47uQJhmI1A.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1269'),
  ('614910634863523847', 'Spider-Man Unlimited', 1999, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Avi Arad, Will Meugniot', null, 'Rino Romano, John Payne, Brian Drummond, Michael Donovan, Richard Newman, David Sobolov, Jennifer Hale, Ron Halder', 'TV-Y7', 'Spider-Man travels to Counter-Earth to rescue a Terran shuttle crew trapped there and discovers a tyrannical & warped version of his world.', 'Spider-Man travels to Counter-Earth to rescue a Terran shuttle crew trapped there and discovers a tyrannical & warped version of his world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hNdf1WmFil9IV7rabBe6PnAmYnI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10079'),
  ('771061871140087462', 'Spider-Man: The New Animated Series', 2003, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Marsha Griffin, Morgan Gendel, Brian Michael Bendis', null, 'Neil Patrick Harris, Lisa Loeb, Ian Ziering', 'TV-PG', 'Bitten by an irradiated spider, teenager Peter Parker gains arachnid-like powers that make him both a hero to those in need and a vigilante wanted by the police.', 'Bitten by an irradiated spider, teenager Peter Parker gains arachnid-like powers that make him both a hero to those in need and a vigilante wanted by the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZBACkiW46U4SrORWl16KbjaBZ1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1664'),
  ('685669481203117587', 'Spider-Thony', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Anthony Morales', null, 'Anthony Morales', null, 'Anthony (spider-thony) and his brother spider-Brian just doing whatever', 'Anthony (spider-thony) and his brother spider-Brian just doing whatever', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2vj5vlf2sxHQW672cgASV6WK5iA.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:318428'),
  ('474542179787294384', 'Spider-Woman', 1979, 'Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Stan Lee', null, 'Joan Van Ark, Dick Tufeld, Bruce Millar, Bryan Scott, Lou Krugman, Larry Carroll, Vic Perrin', 'TV-Y', 'When Jessica Drew was bitten by a poisonous spider as a child, her father saved her life by injecting her with an experimental "spider serum," which also granted her superhuman powers. As an adult, Jessica works as editor of Justice Magazine but when trouble arises, Jessica slips away to change into her secret identity of Spider-Woman.', 'When Jessica Drew was bitten by a poisonous spider as a child, her father saved her life by injecting her with an experimental "spider serum," which also granted her superhuman powers. As an adult, Jessica works as editor of Justice Magazine but when trouble arises, Jessica slips away to change into her secret identity of Spider-Woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cXiD1jVLjTyvO3w2jKq9QdlAYag.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4784'),
  ('1088277601171199980', 'Spides', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Lion-Russell Baumann, Falk Hentschel, Rosabell Laurenti Sellers, Florence Kasumba, Désirée Nosbusch, Susanne Wuest, Francis Fulton-Smith, Artjom Gilz', null, 'Young Nora from Berlin wakes up from a coma after taking a new party drug and can no longer remember anything. When investigators Nique Navar and David Leonhart find out that numerous teenagers have disappeared as part of the spread of the party drug "Bliss", Nora begins to investigate. She uncovers an uncanny conspiracy: Aliens use the drug to use the bodies of their victims as hosts.', 'Young Nora from Berlin wakes up from a coma after taking a new party drug and can no longer remember anything. When investigators Nique Navar and David Leonhart find out that numerous teenagers have disappeared as part of the spread of the party drug "Bliss", Nora begins to investigate. She uncovers an uncanny conspiracy: Aliens use the drug to use the bodies of their victims as hosts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6x2Y8tAy1XVA3EfRgZzo0JHxAT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97724'),
  ('184956556784226102', 'Spidey and His Amazing Friends', 2021, 'Animation, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Alkaio Thiele, Audrey Bennett, Carter Young', 'TV-Y', 'Follow Peter Parker, Gwen Stacy and Miles Morales and their adventures as the young heroes team up with Hulk, Ms. Marvel and Black Panther to defeat foes like Rhino, Doc Ock and Green Goblin and learn that teamwork is the best way to save the day.', 'Follow Peter Parker, Gwen Stacy and Miles Morales and their adventures as the young heroes team up with Hulk, Ms. Marvel and Black Panther to defeat foes like Rhino, Doc Ock and Green Goblin and learn that teamwork is the best way to save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etO5jDS5WgR4Y1lTyXhQcilJ6u2.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:127635'),
  ('870883359571696715', 'Spies of Warsaw', 2013, 'Drama', 'Dick Clement, Ian La Frenais', 'Alan Furst, Ian La Frenais', 'David Tennant, Tusse Silberg, Richard Lintern, Janet Montgomery, Julian Glover, Fenella Woolgar, Marcin Dorociński, Tuppence Middleton', 'TV-14', 'A military attaché at the French embassy is drawn into a world of abduction, betrayal and intrigue in the diplomatic salons and back alleys of Warsaw. A classic tale of spying, intrigue, and romance, based on the novels of Alan Furst and adapted by Dick Clement and Ian La Frenais.', 'A military attaché at the French embassy is drawn into a world of abduction, betrayal and intrigue in the diplomatic salons and back alleys of Warsaw. A classic tale of spying, intrigue, and romance, based on the novels of Alan Furst and adapted by Dick Clement and Ian La Frenais.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s76PIU65SPAhdWho32UGnwUampm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:48433'),
  ('535089668025185521', 'Spillet', 2024, 'Reality', null, null, 'Harald Eia, Truls Svendsen, Martine Lunde, Ingrid Gjessing Linhave, Sebastian Solberg, Eveline Karlsen, Line Verndal, Simon Nitsche', null, 'Spillet is a game about money, status, relationships, and power. The participants are taken to an unknown destination where they will live together, compete, and try to avoid elimination.', 'Spillet is a game about money, status, relationships, and power. The participants are taken to an unknown destination where they will live together, compete, and try to avoid elimination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9bWMnPH5mYFLl5HlsDj4MpZMWL.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:243518'),
  ('343656340164397847', 'Spin', 2012, 'Drama, War & Politics, Comedy', 'Charline de Lépine, Frédéric Tellier, Emmanuel Daucé', null, 'Marianne Fabbro, Bruno Wolkowitch, Nicolas Marié, Philippe Magnan, Grégory Fitoussi, Yves Pignot', 'TV-PG', 'The President of the French Republic, visiting Saint-Etienne in the Loire, in a striking plant dies, victim of a bomb attack. The political world is agitated: early presidential elections to be held within the next thirty-five days. There is no doubt that Philip Deleuvre, the prime minister, will run for the Elysee. But what few people know is that the leader of the government knows more things he claimed. This state causes lie back to business Kapita Simon, a former communications adviser (spin doctor) of the late president. Anxious to preserve the honor of his deceased friend and some form of political ethics, the man of the shadows has now set a goal: to find a candidate who will be able to beat Deleuvre.', 'The President of the French Republic, visiting Saint-Etienne in the Loire, in a striking plant dies, victim of a bomb attack. The political world is agitated: early presidential elections to be held within the next thirty-five days. There is no doubt that Philip Deleuvre, the prime minister, will run for the Elysee. But what few people know is that the leader of the government knows more things he claimed. This state causes lie back to business Kapita Simon, a former communications adviser (spin doctor) of the late president. Anxious to preserve the honor of his deceased friend and some form of political ethics, the man of the shadows has now set a goal: to find a candidate who will be able to beat Deleuvre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBtORP6UHMVAOcR9G3Rbp1tjyDa.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:61777'),
  ('356415698268423388', 'Spin City', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gary David Goldberg, Bill Lawrence', null, 'Charlie Sheen, Heather Locklear, Barry Bostwick, Richard Kind, Alan Ruck, Michael Boatman', 'TV-14', 'Workaholic Mike Flaherty is the Deputy Mayor of New York City, serving as Mayor Randall Winston''s key strategist and much-needed handler. Mike runs the city with the help of his oddball staff: an anxious and insecure press secretary; a sexist, boorish chief of staff; an impeccably groomed gay activist running minority affairs; a sharp and efficient, man-crazy accountant; and an idealistic young speechwriter. Like Mike, they are all professionally capable but personally challenged.', 'Workaholic Mike Flaherty is the Deputy Mayor of New York City, serving as Mayor Randall Winston''s key strategist and much-needed handler. Mike runs the city with the help of his oddball staff: an anxious and insecure press secretary; a sexist, boorish chief of staff; an impeccably groomed gay activist running minority affairs; a sharp and efficient, man-crazy accountant; and an idealistic young speechwriter. Like Mike, they are all professionally capable but personally challenged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Ksmbpg33PigXKWncD8rFMl24vF.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:2359'),
  ('9944464653627276', 'Spinning Out', 2020, 'Drama', 'Samantha Stratton', null, 'Kaya Scodelario, January Jones, Willow Shields, Evan Roderick, Sarah Wright, Svetlana Efremova, Mitchell Edwards, Will Kemp', 'TV-MA', 'A figure skating Olympic hopeful struggles to balance love, family and fragile mental health as her dream of winning takes a dizzying hold.', 'A figure skating Olympic hopeful struggles to balance love, family and fragile mental health as her dream of winning takes a dizzying hold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bAEGuEK0z4KTlrsx5UYpIvmPIPc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83050'),
  ('155408345324653623', 'Spiral', 2005, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Alexandra Clert, Guy-Patrick Sainderichin', null, 'Caroline Proust, Audrey Fleurot, Thierry Godard, Tewfik Jallab, Valentin Merlet, Clara Bonnet, Louis-Do de Lencquesaing, Bruno Debrandt', null, 'This gritty crime drama set in the dark underbelly of Paris follows police officers and lawyers as they investigate and prosecute crimes. Throw any romantic notion of Paris out the window. Crime is dark. The legal system is darker. This is Spiral.', 'This gritty crime drama set in the dark underbelly of Paris follows police officers and lawyers as they investigate and prosecute crimes. Throw any romantic notion of Paris out the window. Crime is dark. The legal system is darker. This is Spiral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4i4wJCRUDkblYaqp3ln4vENQdC.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:11726'),
  ('1037143714863076636', 'Spirit Blade Mountain', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Guowang Bixia', null, 'Hao Xianghai, Li Xiaomeng, Tong Xinzhu, Chen Zhangtaikang, Meme Yan, Li Lu, Ding Dang', null, 'A comet falling will bring about a great calamity, and in order to choose a child fated by the falling comet, the family of the "Reiken" clan with a long storied history is once again resuming its entrance examination process to find disciples. The protagonist Wang Lu, who possesses a special soul that is only available once in a thousand years, decides to take the exam, and he starts down the path toward becoming an exceptional sage.', 'A comet falling will bring about a great calamity, and in order to choose a child fated by the falling comet, the family of the "Reiken" clan with a long storied history is once again resuming its entrance examination process to find disciples. The protagonist Wang Lu, who possesses a special soul that is only available once in a thousand years, decides to take the exam, and he starts down the path toward becoming an exceptional sage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/moQ6vnO8QEd9wSmQuj1Uf8mrnrf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:65206'),
  ('299651317286309440', 'Spirit Fingers', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lee Cheol-ha, Kwon Yi-ji', 'Kwon Yi-ji', 'Park Ji-hu, Cho Jun-young, Choi Bo-min, Park You-na, Kwon So-hyun, Kim Seul-gi, Lim Cheol-soo, Lee Jin-hyuk', null, 'About an ordinary high school sophomore, Song Woo-yeon, who joins a drawing club called Spirit Fingers and paints the story of finding her own color, personality, and dream.', 'About an ordinary high school sophomore, Song Woo-yeon, who joins a drawing club called Spirit Fingers and paints the story of finding her own color, personality, and dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aM28UXrgZoNNk4ZBfSs9lzw6HeI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223896'),
  ('880442945163802266', 'Spirit Rangers', 2022, 'Kids, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Karissa Valencia', null, 'Esther Mbire, Talon Proc Alford, Kimberly Guerrero, Jaylan Evans, G.K. Bowes, Jake Hart, Bobby Wilson, Adrianne Chalepah', 'TV-Y', 'Native American siblings Kodi, Summer and Eddy have a secret: They’re "Spirit Rangers" who help protect the national park they call home!', 'Native American siblings Kodi, Summer and Eddy have a secret: They’re "Spirit Rangers" who help protect the national park they call home!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o7NV5naNFB1kv0NZTJMKPQ4H0gl.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:119847'),
  ('815106578967614496', 'Spirit Riding Free: Pony Tales', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids', 'Jim Schumann', null, 'Bailey Gambertoglio, Amber Frank, Sydney Park', 'TV-Y7', 'Find the fun and adventure of "Spirit Riding Free" in this mix of music videos and short episodes featuring Lucky and all of her friends!', 'Find the fun and adventure of "Spirit Riding Free" in this mix of music videos and short episodes featuring Lucky and all of her friends!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lsk3FCjcLW9Jekzprn4W9aCFud9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:92204'),
  ('871094901315852979', 'Spirit Riding Free: Riding Academy', 2020, 'Kids, Animation, Family, Action & Adventure', 'Jim Schumann, Aury Wallington', null, 'Roshni Edwards, Duncan Joiner, Georgia Dolenz, Amber Frank, Bailey Gambertoglio, Sydney Park', 'TV-Y7', 'In a small Western town a young girl from the city forms a tight bond with wild horse Spirit while having adventures with her friends.', 'In a small Western town a young girl from the city forms a tight bond with wild horse Spirit while having adventures with her friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1P73hdMxOmxeWySMA8RDvmS1dQ4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:101400'),
  ('794399493626714347', 'Spirit Sword Sovereign', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Shuai Guan, Sen Zhongren, Zhang Ni, Qiege Qin', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oUxi7LUppbzgiRe9u1QIIe5YZKS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88639'),
  ('443712809096020905', 'Spirit: Riding Free', 2017, 'Kids, Animation', 'Aury Wallington', null, 'Amber Frank, Sydney Park, Bailey Gambertoglio, Darcy Rose Byrnes', 'TV-Y7', 'In a small Western town, spunky ex-city girl Lucky forms a tight bond with wild horse Spirit while having adventures with best pals Pru and Abigail.', 'In a small Western town, spunky ex-city girl Lucky forms a tight bond with wild horse Spirit while having adventures with best pals Pru and Abigail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jRJYUWTH1qyTL0us4dix6wasN0A.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:71680'),
  ('867554351637884757', 'Spirited', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Claudia Karvan, Jacquelin Perske', 'Tony McNamara, Claudia Karvan', 'Claudia Karvan, Matt King, Rodger Corser, Belinda Bromilow, Sarah Snook', null, 'Spirited is a romantic look at life and love after death with a rock ''n'' roll twist. Uptight dentist Suzy Darling leaves her egotistical husband Steve and moves into a penthouse to start a new life with her children. Seemingly a well orchestrated plan, she quickly discovers that she has to share her penthouse with Henry, who is no ordinary man. Henry is apparently a ghost. Henry awakens form 20 years of deathly slumber when Suzy and her kids move into the apartment. He''s a British Rock Star and struggles to understand what is happening to him... or even who he is.', 'Spirited is a romantic look at life and love after death with a rock ''n'' roll twist. Uptight dentist Suzy Darling leaves her egotistical husband Steve and moves into a penthouse to start a new life with her children. Seemingly a well orchestrated plan, she quickly discovers that she has to share her penthouse with Henry, who is no ordinary man. Henry is apparently a ghost. Henry awakens form 20 years of deathly slumber when Suzy and her kids move into the apartment. He''s a British Rock Star and struggles to understand what is happening to him... or even who he is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/buBGMxaSCVh36cJ7XOcZ7Z8PuCT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:33836'),
  ('1083997714002080061', 'Spiritpact', 2016, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Li Lanling, Liu Mingyue, Shen Nianru, Yang Tianxiang, Ding Dang, Li Xiaomeng, 金琪, Tong Xinzhu', null, 'Heir of an old famous family of exorcist, Yang Jinghua(You Keika in Japanese) is stricken by poverty after losing his parents. He struggles as a street fortune teller and computer recovery part timer to earn money. One night in a junkyard, he meets the mysterious yet charismatic exorcist, Duanmu Xi(Tanmoku Ki in Japanese) , fighting an evil spirit. This encounter is the beginning of a fated story for Yang Jinghua. Unfortunately for him, he was actually hit by a car and became a ghost. That was when the handsome exorcist Duanmu Xi appeared and asked Yang Jinghua to make a "pact" with him to fight evil spirits together. Here starts the friendship of our heroes!', 'Heir of an old famous family of exorcist, Yang Jinghua(You Keika in Japanese) is stricken by poverty after losing his parents. He struggles as a street fortune teller and computer recovery part timer to earn money. One night in a junkyard, he meets the mysterious yet charismatic exorcist, Duanmu Xi(Tanmoku Ki in Japanese) , fighting an evil spirit. This encounter is the beginning of a fated story for Yang Jinghua. Unfortunately for him, he was actually hit by a car and became a ghost. That was when the handsome exorcist Duanmu Xi appeared and asked Yang Jinghua to make a "pact" with him to fight evil spirits together. Here starts the friendship of our heroes!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/657mCsZKc58PbX4VCv4BL9giFo2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69344'),
  ('910745035816681112', 'Spitting Image', 1984, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Harry Enfield, Chris Barrie, Steve Coogan, Hugh Dennis, Jon Glover, Alistair McGowan, John Sessions, Enn Reitel', null, 'Spitting Image is an award winning British satirical puppet show, created by Peter Fluck, Roger Law and Martin Lambie-Nairn. The series was produced by Spitting Image Productions for Central Independent Television over 18 series which aired on the ITV from 1984 to 1996. The series was nominated and won numerous awards during its run including 10 BAFTA Awards, including one for editing in 1989, and even won two Emmy Awards in 1985 and 1986 in the Popular Arts Category. The series featured puppet caricatures of celebrities famous during the 1980s and 1990s, including British Prime Minister Margaret Thatcher and fellow Tory politicians, American president Ronald Reagan, and the British Royal Family. The Series was the first to caricature the Queen mother.', 'Spitting Image is an award winning British satirical puppet show, created by Peter Fluck, Roger Law and Martin Lambie-Nairn. The series was produced by Spitting Image Productions for Central Independent Television over 18 series which aired on the ITV from 1984 to 1996. The series was nominated and won numerous awards during its run including 10 BAFTA Awards, including one for editing in 1989, and even won two Emmy Awards in 1985 and 1986 in the Popular Arts Category. The series featured puppet caricatures of celebrities famous during the 1980s and 1990s, including British Prime Minister Margaret Thatcher and fellow Tory politicians, American president Ronald Reagan, and the British Royal Family. The Series was the first to caricature the Queen mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3t6nGVtQfuT12AfdpNDOLyZsuFe.jpg', 18, 'tmdb:tv:2040'),
  ('1147467603080222640', 'Spitting Image', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Peter Fluck, Roger Law', null, null, null, 'The weekly puppet-based sketch show that skewers the politicians and celebrities who need it the most. With a cast of characters from Britain, America, and around the world, no one is safe from a satirical roasting.', 'The weekly puppet-based sketch show that skewers the politicians and celebrities who need it the most. With a cast of characters from Britain, America, and around the world, no one is safe from a satirical roasting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3k9nkXD8K4HvyBK3bkg6gQVWQd2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:110982'),
  ('636962107272564499', 'Splash Splash Love', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Kim Ji-hyun', 'Kim Seul-gi, Yoon Doo-joon, Jin Ki-joo, Ahn Hyo-seop, Im Ye-jin', null, 'Dan-Bi is a senior high school student. She has a special ability which allows her to transport to anywhere on rainy days. For her university entrance exam, Dan-Bi can''t deal with the pressure and runs off to a playground. Without knowing why, she goes into a puddle and finds herself transported to the Joseon period. There, she meets Lee Do. He is a young King of the Joseon period. Lee Do is in a difficult situation due to droughts and the spread of an epidemic.', 'Dan-Bi is a senior high school student. She has a special ability which allows her to transport to anywhere on rainy days. For her university entrance exam, Dan-Bi can''t deal with the pressure and runs off to a playground. Without knowing why, she goes into a puddle and finds herself transported to the Joseon period. There, she meets Lee Do. He is a young King of the Joseon period. Lee Do is in a difficult situation due to droughts and the spread of an epidemic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1lmYkqv7n1lrvjS91EIvyYjAlU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65355'),
  ('459559678811562379', 'Splinter Cell: Deathwatch', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Derek Kolstad', null, 'Liev Schreiber, Kirby Howell-Baptiste, Bella Dayne, Janet Varney, Kari Wahlgren, Aleks Le, Kiff VandenHeuvel, Joel Oulette', 'TV-MA', 'In the shadowy world of espionage, Sam Fisher is a rumor and a legend. Pulled back into action, he must help a new recruit unravel a global conspiracy.', 'In the shadowy world of espionage, Sam Fisher is a rumor and a legend. Pulled back into action, he must help a new recruit unravel a global conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38XJlQAYMcPjgqVhBO8VjkufSEx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127366'),
  ('119220387195655352', 'Splitting Up Together', 2018, 'Family, Comedy', 'Emily Kapnek', null, 'Jenna Fischer, Oliver Hudson, Bobby Lee, Diane Farr, Lindsay Price, Olivia Keville, Van Crosby, Sander Thomas', 'TV-14', 'Lena and Martin were once madly in love. But, like many marriages, time and circumstance eventually took their toll, and they decide that everyone''s lives would be better if they got a divorce. Facing a daunting real estate market, the couple decide not to sell their house and to "Bird Nest" instead. The ''on-duty'' parent will live in the house while the ''off-duty'' parent will live in the detached garage. As Lena begins to dip her toes into the dating waters, Martin begins to see his own culpability in his marriage falling apart.', 'Lena and Martin were once madly in love. But, like many marriages, time and circumstance eventually took their toll, and they decide that everyone''s lives would be better if they got a divorce. Facing a daunting real estate market, the couple decide not to sell their house and to "Bird Nest" instead. The ''on-duty'' parent will live in the house while the ''off-duty'' parent will live in the detached garage. As Lena begins to dip her toes into the dating waters, Martin begins to see his own culpability in his marriage falling apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMxlolm8TcNKNNMRyjxWqvpiIQ8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:71764'),
  ('880740662839038388', 'Spoed', 2000, 'Drama', 'Herman Verbaet', 'Hola Guapa', 'Veerle Dobbelaere, Ann Van den Broeck, Magda Cnudde, Govert Deploige, Amaryllis Temmerman, Trine Thielen, Sven Ronsijn, Lore Dejonckheere', null, 'Spoed is a Belgian action drama TV series produced in the Dutch language in Belgium since 2000. The series is also shown on both Flemish/Belgian TV and Dutch TV. The series is directed by Johan Thiels and Guy Thys. The series has produced 217 episodes to date. It may be compared to the American TV programs ER or Chicago Hope.', 'Spoed is a Belgian action drama TV series produced in the Dutch language in Belgium since 2000. The series is also shown on both Flemish/Belgian TV and Dutch TV. The series is directed by Johan Thiels and Guy Thys. The series has produced 217 episodes to date. It may be compared to the American TV programs ER or Chicago Hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fx3RfdKZ066UTbnA7DYHkt77eQl.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:12788'),
  ('861110991401331134', 'SpongeBob DocuPants', 2020, 'Documentary, Family, Comedy', null, null, 'Kent Shocknek', 'TV-PG', 'Imagine classic SpongeBob moments being told through the lens of documentary shows like E! True Hollywood Stories, Dateline, Behind the Music etc. Each episode takes an overly dramatic look into classic SpongeBob storylines.', 'Imagine classic SpongeBob moments being told through the lens of documentary shows like E! True Hollywood Stories, Dateline, Behind the Music etc. Each episode takes an overly dramatic look into classic SpongeBob storylines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7EOKLK1VngbYZBG63PcEhGzlyH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121021'),
  ('940282386006832458', 'SpongeBob SquarePants', 1999, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Stephen Hillenburg', null, 'Tom Kenny, Bill Fagerbakke, Rodger Bumpass, Clancy Brown, Carolyn Lawrence, Mary Jo Catlett, Mr. Lawrence', 'TV-Y7', 'Deep down in the Pacific Ocean in the subterranean city of Bikini Bottom lives a square yellow sponge named SpongeBob SquarePants. SpongeBob lives in a pineapple with his pet snail, Gary, loves his job as a fry cook at the Krusty Krab, and has a knack for getting into all kinds of trouble without really trying. When he''s not getting on the nerves of his cranky next door neighbor Squidward, SpongeBob can usually be found smack in the middle of all sorts of strange situations with his best buddy, the simple yet lovable starfish, Patrick, or his thrill-seeking surfer-girl squirrel pal, Sandy Cheeks.', 'Deep down in the Pacific Ocean in the subterranean city of Bikini Bottom lives a square yellow sponge named SpongeBob SquarePants. SpongeBob lives in a pineapple with his pet snail, Gary, loves his job as a fry cook at the Krusty Krab, and has a knack for getting into all kinds of trouble without really trying. When he''s not getting on the nerves of his cranky next door neighbor Squidward, SpongeBob can usually be found smack in the middle of all sorts of strange situations with his best buddy, the simple yet lovable starfish, Patrick, or his thrill-seeking surfer-girl squirrel pal, Sandy Cheeks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5h0EU2lqBb03dp5vtRuUHJwqzem.jpg', 17, 'tmdb:tv:387'),
  ('774939294548091691', 'Sponsor', 2022, 'Drama', 'Park Gye Hyung', 'Park Gye Hyung', 'Han Chae-young, Lee Ji-hoon, Koo Ja-sung, Ji Su-yeon, Kim Yoon-seo, Park Keun-hyong, Kim Jung-tae, Lee Yoon-mi', null, 'A romance thriller between four men and women running like a runaway locomotive toward different desires, including success, revenge, children and love. Lee Sun Woo, is a photographer and editor in magazine. He keeps a burning ambition and heartfelt desire for revenge hidden behind his warm exterior. Han Chae Rin is the CEO of a cosmetics company. She is greedy and ambitious despite her success. Park Da Som is a rising actress. She does anything for success. At the same time, she struggles to protect her son who has a rare disease. She’s internally struggling between motherhood and success, and despite her cold exterior, she truly loves her ill son. Hyun Seung Hoon, Park Da Som’s husband is an aspiring model. His life goals are: overcome poverty and failures. He dreams of succeeding in life.', 'A romance thriller between four men and women running like a runaway locomotive toward different desires, including success, revenge, children and love. Lee Sun Woo, is a photographer and editor in magazine. He keeps a burning ambition and heartfelt desire for revenge hidden behind his warm exterior. Han Chae Rin is the CEO of a cosmetics company. She is greedy and ambitious despite her success. Park Da Som is a rising actress. She does anything for success. At the same time, she struggles to protect her son who has a rare disease. She’s internally struggling between motherhood and success, and despite her cold exterior, she truly loves her ill son. Hyun Seung Hoon, Park Da Som’s husband is an aspiring model. His life goals are: overcome poverty and failures. He dreams of succeeding in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXSGl8C2KPTxP169xKxMR5Vo9hk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132926'),
  ('384748866734767510', 'Spooks', 2002, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'David Wolstencroft', null, 'Peter Firth, Nicola Walker, Max Brown, Lara Pulver, William Hope, Alex Lanipekun, Geoffrey Streatfeild, Tom Weston-Jones', 'TV-14', 'Tense drama series about the different challenges faced by the British Security Service as they work against the clock to safeguard the nation. The title is a popular colloquialism for spies, and the series follows the work of a group of MI5 officers based at the service''s Thames House headquarters, in a highly secure suite of offices known as The Grid.', 'Tense drama series about the different challenges faced by the British Security Service as they work against the clock to safeguard the nation. The title is a popular colloquialism for spies, and the series follows the work of a group of MI5 officers based at the service''s Thames House headquarters, in a highly secure suite of offices known as The Grid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kODxCYihuM49oQWke6GfHdsRT6.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:4046'),
  ('1041614543174902483', 'Spooks: Code 9', 2008, 'Mystery, Drama', 'David Wolstencroft', null, 'Liam Boyle, Ruta Gedmintas, Christopher Simpson, Georgia Tennant, Andrew Knott, Heshima Thompson, Lorraine Burroughs', 'NR', 'Spooks: Code 9 is a 2008 six-episode BBC spin-off of the spy drama Spooks. In a near-future 2013 Britain following a devastating London terror attack, a new, younger team of MI5 recruits—including Charlie, Rachel, Jez, Vik, Rob, and Kylie—work from a new Manchester headquarters to battle terrorism in a highly surveilled, post-attack world. It offers a younger, more ''maverick'' perspective on the Spooks universe, focusing on the challenges of liberty and security in a tense society. The series was commissioned by BBC Fiction''s controller Jane Tranter as a spin-off of their long-running drama Spooks in order to attract a younger audience. The decision to relate the new project to the original Spooks was controversial; but there are no crossover characters or storylines and, most importantly, is set in a completely new world.', 'Spooks: Code 9 is a 2008 six-episode BBC spin-off of the spy drama Spooks. In a near-future 2013 Britain following a devastating London terror attack, a new, younger team of MI5 recruits—including Charlie, Rachel, Jez, Vik, Rob, and Kylie—work from a new Manchester headquarters to battle terrorism in a highly surveilled, post-attack world. It offers a younger, more ''maverick'' perspective on the Spooks universe, focusing on the challenges of liberty and security in a tense society. The series was commissioned by BBC Fiction''s controller Jane Tranter as a spin-off of their long-running drama Spooks in order to attract a younger audience. The decision to relate the new project to the original Spooks was controversial; but there are no crossover characters or storylines and, most importantly, is set in a completely new world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8bvPqARATbLRPv9aEntDABCDwob.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:22956'),
  ('965798494558345236', 'Spooksville', 2013, 'Comedy, Family', 'Dan Angel, Billy Brown', null, 'Keean Johnson, Nick Purcha, Katie Douglas', 'TV-PG', 'Searching for a new start after the mysterious disappearance of his mother, Adam Freeman and his dad move to the small town of Springville. Actually, the town is better known as "Spooksville" because, well, weird things seem to have been happening there for centuries. At first Adam doesn''t believe in the tales of supernatural occurrences but soon begins to learn firsthand why the nickname was attached to his adopted hometown. Along with new friends Sally and Watch, Adam intends to save the town from surreal forces and solve the mystery of the supposed age-old curse. "Spooksville" is based on the acclaimed book series by author Christopher Pike.', 'Searching for a new start after the mysterious disappearance of his mother, Adam Freeman and his dad move to the small town of Springville. Actually, the town is better known as "Spooksville" because, well, weird things seem to have been happening there for centuries. At first Adam doesn''t believe in the tales of supernatural occurrences but soon begins to learn firsthand why the nickname was attached to his adopted hometown. Along with new friends Sally and Watch, Adam intends to save the town from surreal forces and solve the mystery of the supposed age-old curse. "Spooksville" is based on the acclaimed book series by author Christopher Pike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3V0hFx8NgYXVfHfoMOuAXs3rb1J.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46404'),
  ('1034574939336525229', 'Sport Billy', 1979, 'Animation, Family', 'Lou Scheimer', 'Paul Dini', 'Lane Scheimer, Frank Welker, Joyce Bulifant, Lou Scheimer', null, 'Sport Billy is a 1979 animated television cartoon made by Filmation Associates, initially for broadcast in Germany. In 1982, Filmation carried the show over to the United States for syndication, and as a summer replacement in NBC''s Saturday morning children''s programming. It was the last first-run series produced by Filmation Associates to air on NBC.', 'Sport Billy is a 1979 animated television cartoon made by Filmation Associates, initially for broadcast in Germany. In 1982, Filmation carried the show over to the United States for syndication, and as a summer replacement in NBC''s Saturday morning children''s programming. It was the last first-run series produced by Filmation Associates to air on NBC.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPbpBJ99fkwe96mSFAuI9UCyUmT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11019'),
  ('846625915500603338', 'Sports Night', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Aaron Sorkin', null, 'Josh Charles, Peter Krause, Felicity Huffman, Joshua Malina, Sabrina Lloyd, Robert Guillaume', null, 'The offbeat cast and crew of a sports news show deal with professional, personal, and ethical challenges while functioning in a pressure-cooker work environment.', 'The offbeat cast and crew of a sports news show deal with professional, personal, and ethical challenges while functioning in a pressure-cooker work environment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zIQdj3rmx036qCNYcZlLvmqcCPW.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2003'),
  ('510177178534767290', 'Sports Show with Norm Macdonald', 2011, 'Comedy, Talk, News', 'Mike Gibbons, Daniel Kellison, Norm Macdonald', null, 'Norm Macdonald', null, 'There''s a new Norm in sports. Funnyman Norm Macdonald returns to the desk to give you an update on the week''s dropped passes, foul balls and unnecessary roughness--and that''s just what happened off the field. Sports, you''ve finally met your match.', 'There''s a new Norm in sports. Funnyman Norm Macdonald returns to the desk to give you an update on the week''s dropped passes, foul balls and unnecessary roughness--and that''s just what happened off the field. Sports, you''ve finally met your match.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dlhIGB3AMRuSeMuINR2wzYMBB01.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38663'),
  ('623735000184309953', 'SportsCenter', 1979, 'News, Talk', 'John A. Walsh', null, 'Keith Olbermann, Dan Patrick, Bill Clement, Chris Berman, Linda Cohn, Peter Gammons, Rich Eisen, Stephen A. Smith', 'NR', 'ESPN''s flagship program provides TV''s most thorough presentation of sports news, highlights and analysis.', 'ESPN''s flagship program provides TV''s most thorough presentation of sports news, highlights and analysis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vND6n2S47U80S6Zbxyslk1RUm5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:704'),
  ('653316775165656795', 'Spotless', 2015, 'Drama, Crime', 'Ed McCardie, Corinne Marrinan', null, 'Denis Ménochet, Marc-André Grondin, Miranda Raison, Brendan Coyle', 'TV-MA', 'In London, the life of Jean, a troubled crime scene cleaner, is turned upside down when his outlaw brother Martin crash lands into his world, entangling them in the deadly dynamics of organized crime.', 'In London, the life of Jean, a troubled crime scene cleaner, is turned upside down when his outlaw brother Martin crash lands into his world, entangling them in the deadly dynamics of organized crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lARKdHXgWomQDiSjG5XqlVLhTWt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62202'),
  ('845299285635325588', 'SPRIGGAN', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, War & Politics, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Chiaki Kobayashi, Yohei Azakami, Kenji Hamada, Mariya Ise, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Ken Narita, Ayumu Murase, Ryota Takeuchi', 'TV-MA', 'An ancient civilization''s relics on Earth hold dangerous powers — it''s up to ARCAM Corporation''s Spriggan agents to keep them out of the wrong hands.', 'An ancient civilization''s relics on Earth hold dangerous powers — it''s up to ARCAM Corporation''s Spriggan agents to keep them out of the wrong hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xw3wplPpAweQG0Na1KmAdrx90lx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94925'),
