  ('1001832669422139637', 'Sprung', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Greg Garcia', null, 'Garret Dillahunt, Martha Plimpton, Shakira Barrera, Phillip Garcia, James Earl, Clare Gillies', null, 'A convicted criminal is determined to turn his life around after serving more than two decades in prison. When he is released unexpectedly from prison due to the pandemic with no place to live and the world on lockdown, Jack shelters-in-place with an unlikely group of former inmates, who band together and use their criminal expertise for good.', 'A convicted criminal is determined to turn his life around after serving more than two decades in prison. When he is released unexpectedly from prison due to the pandemic with no place to live and the world on lockdown, Jack shelters-in-place with an unlikely group of former inmates, who band together and use their criminal expertise for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNrpWMnKhTnSXHBfXsTRGeyZmQX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204698'),
  ('712729265463145683', 'Spy', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Simeon Goulden', null, 'Mark Heap, Dolly Wells, Miles Jupp, Ed Coleman, Terence Maynard, Mathew Baynton, Darren Boyd, Jude Wright', null, 'When an underachieving single father inadvertently becomes an MI5 agent, he must keep his government job a secret while battling his ex-wife for custody of their precocious son.', 'When an underachieving single father inadvertently becomes an MI5 agent, he must keep his government job a secret while battling his ex-wife for custody of their precocious son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8ACo2NVcTBz2HF7VxhKdtLd9sG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:41703'),
  ('403849272079415118', 'Spy City', 2020, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'William Boyd', null, 'Dominic Cooper, Johanna Wokalek, Leonie Benesch, Ben Münchow, Romane Portail, Seumas F. Sargent, Adrian Lukis', 'TV-MA', 'After a defector is murdered, British agent Fielding Scott is assigned to track down a mole in his own ranks in 1961 Berlin. His investigation leads him into a deadly web of crime, betrayal and paranoia. Who can Scott trust in the city of spies?', 'After a defector is murdered, British agent Fielding Scott is assigned to track down a mole in his own ranks in 1961 Berlin. His investigation leads him into a deadly web of crime, betrayal and paranoia. Who can Scott trust in the city of spies?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJZF8UweljPpUOdedfHttBGK0nU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113828'),
  ('262891877852148606', 'Spy Classroom', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Mystery, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Sora Amamiya, Miku Ito, Nao Toyama, Aoi Yuuki, Sumire Uesaka, Ayane Sakura, Tomori Kusunoki, Yuuichirou Umehara', 'TV-14', 'Spy-in-training Lily is desperate to score a passing grade. Eager to prove herself, she leaps at the chance to join the mysterious team Lamplight and beat the Impossible Mission. Too bad the task ahead is even more harrowing than she imagined…', 'Spy-in-training Lily is desperate to score a passing grade. Eager to prove herself, she leaps at the chance to join the mysterious team Lamplight and beat the Impossible Mission. Too bad the task ahead is even more harrowing than she imagined…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cjZL1z71AbNWVSs3ZpBcZ0LWac6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:194986'),
  ('448024417094078235', 'Spy Game', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Han Geng, Wei Daxun, Li Yitong, Zhou Fang, Wang Likun, Tony Yang, Wang Yang, Zhu Yuchen', null, 'In Jinhai, a wildly popular spy game secretly created by a foreign intelligence group manipulates young players into real espionage. As the game’s hidden threat spreads, national security officers Gao Tianyang and Wu Xi investigate a major data leak and uncover a dangerous conspiracy. With help from Huang Zicheng, a trusted insider, they race to stop the enemy and protect the city.', 'In Jinhai, a wildly popular spy game secretly created by a foreign intelligence group manipulates young players into real espionage. As the game’s hidden threat spreads, national security officers Gao Tianyang and Wu Xi investigate a major data leak and uncover a dangerous conspiracy. With help from Huang Zicheng, a trusted insider, they race to stop the enemy and protect the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hh9nlLlZSsAUb5cqzwGouWLTnwv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233688'),
  ('197144577787654082', 'Spy Hunter', 2019, 'Drama', null, 'Zhang Yong', 'Qin Junjie, Xu Lu, Lu Yi, Zhang Zhixi, Zhao Yingzi, Zhu Gangrirao, Ding Haifeng, Guo Zhe', null, 'In the spring of 1931, after the Communist Party successfully set up many communication stations in China, they set their sight on Western Europe and assigned two of their agents ”Asthray''” and “Porcelain” to Paris. From there on, the stories of secret deal, hidden betrayal, questionable death, forbidden love, and brotherhood among the military and a prominent family’s members were unraveled.', 'In the spring of 1931, after the Communist Party successfully set up many communication stations in China, they set their sight on Western Europe and assigned two of their agents ”Asthray''” and “Porcelain” to Paris. From there on, the stories of secret deal, hidden betrayal, questionable death, forbidden love, and brotherhood among the military and a prominent family’s members were unraveled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5JDj5pNVcUABjF6gm3ywXHAwqr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85989'),
