  ('148952804520346592', 'Star Wars: Visions', 2021, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, 'George Lucas', null, 'TV-PG', 'This anthology of animated shorts from around the world celebrates the mythos of Star Wars through unique cultural lenses.', 'This anthology of animated shorts from around the world celebrates the mythos of Star Wars through unique cultural lenses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lG9ltUP4FwvsQBcwOJYceDbP48E.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:114478'),
  ('1021716622748744422', 'Star Wars: Young Jedi Adventures', 2023, 'Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Michael Olson', null, 'JeCobi Swain, Juliet Donenfeld, Dee Bradley Baker, Emma Berman, Jonathan Lipow', 'TV-Y', 'Set during the High Republic era and the prime of the Jedi Order, follow Jedi younglings as they study the ways of the Force, explore the galaxy, help citizens and creatures in need, and learn valuable skills needed to become Jedi along the way.', 'Set during the High Republic era and the prime of the Jedi Order, follow Jedi younglings as they study the ways of the Force, explore the galaxy, help citizens and creatures in need, and learn valuable skills needed to become Jedi along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bC2Mix1WPUiY6pldh77oiFl1MvI.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:202998'),
  ('529178382349771209', 'Star-Crossed', 2014, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Meredith Averill', null, 'Aimee Teegarden, Matt Lanter, Grey Damon, Greg Finley', 'TV-14', 'Passion and politics threaten the peace and an epic romance ignites between a human girl and an alien boy when he and eight others of his kind (The Orion 9) are integrated into a suburban high school 10 years after they and hundreds of others landed on Earth and were immediately consigned to an internment camp where they’ve been imprisoned ever since.', 'Passion and politics threaten the peace and an epic romance ignites between a human girl and an alien boy when he and eight others of his kind (The Orion 9) are integrated into a suburban high school 10 years after they and hundreds of others landed on Earth and were immediately consigned to an internment camp where they’ve been imprisoned ever since.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xcKlTgoRlVMyIG8t9c1br8RO7zI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:51168'),
  ('437905246108698038', 'Star☆Twinkle PreCure', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Family, Kids', null, null, 'Eimi Naruse, Konomi Kohara, Kiyono Yasuno, Mikako Komatsu, Sumire Uesaka, Hina Kino, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Miki Ito', null, 'When Hikaru Hoshina transforms into Cure Star, she embarks on an outer space adventure to find the rest of the Star Twinkle Cures and save the universe!', 'When Hikaru Hoshina transforms into Cure Star, she embarks on an outer space adventure to find the rest of the Star Twinkle Cures and save the universe!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7y1FvOFTXcYSLRSabHlfDHixNYl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85322'),
  ('413280450374516340', 'StarBeam', 2020, 'Animation, Kids', 'Loris Kramer Lunsford, Jason Netter', null, 'Zachary Timmis, Dean Petriw, Terry Klassen, Nahanni Mitchell, Sarah Almonte Peguero', 'TV-Y', 'Zoey is excited to tackle second grade, but when danger beckons, she sneaks away and with her signature call out and transforms into StarBeam, the speediest, most powerful and most enthusiastic superhero to ever sip from a juicebox.', 'Zoey is excited to tackle second grade, but when danger beckons, she sneaks away and with her signature call out and transforms into StarBeam, the speediest, most powerful and most enthusiastic superhero to ever sip from a juicebox.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijJruqW5r7YtxUfWHbcV49y8NJ8.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:101396'),
  ('270791318615716381', 'Stardom on Stardom World', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Comedy', 'Rossy Ogawa, Fuka Kakimoto, Nanae Takahashi', null, null, null, 'Stardom World is the VOD network for World Wonder Ring Stardom. WWR Stardom is a Japanese women''s promotion started in 2011 featuring matches of many varieties including high speed octane action, long brutal brawls, and even costume battle royals. In 2019, the promotion was acquired by Bushiroad and has since become one of the top wrestling promotions in Japan.', 'Stardom World is the VOD network for World Wonder Ring Stardom. WWR Stardom is a Japanese women''s promotion started in 2011 featuring matches of many varieties including high speed octane action, long brutal brawls, and even costume battle royals. In 2019, the promotion was acquired by Bushiroad and has since become one of the top wrestling promotions in Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wf0RlfTSuO95lpTNq7BWXYKRR55.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:121651'),
  ('22865858276748862', 'Stardust Telepath', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Kaori, Natsuko Takahashi', 'Yurie Funato, Seria Fukagawa, Moe Nagamuta, Shiki Aoki, Natsumi Takamori, Hina Youmiya', 'TV-14', 'Umika is a sweet yet shy high school girl. She has trouble speaking to others and dreams of having a friend from another planet. But her lonely school life takes a cosmic turn when she meets transfer student Yu, an alien with telepathic powers! The two become close and promise to go to space one day. So, they decide to build a rocket and shoot for the stars, making new friends along the way.', 'Umika is a sweet yet shy high school girl. She has trouble speaking to others and dreams of having a friend from another planet. But her lonely school life takes a cosmic turn when she meets transfer student Yu, an alien with telepathic powers! The two become close and promise to go to space one day. So, they decide to build a rocket and shoot for the stars, making new friends along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axZH2f5yrJAhpSn2UX0LkI6zlNE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217404'),
  ('812925128929975553', 'Stargate Atlantis', 2004, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Robert C. Cooper, Brad Wright', null, 'Joe Flanigan, David Hewlett, Rachel Luttrell, Jewel Staite, Robert Picardo, Jason Momoa', 'TV-PG', 'With the Ancients'' city of Atlantis discovered in the Pegasus Galaxy by Stargate Command, Dr. Elizabeth Weir and Major Sheppard lead a scientific expedition to the ancient abandoned city. Once there, the team not only find themselves unable to contact Earth, but their explorations unexpectedly reawaken the Ancients'' deadly enemies, The Wraith, who hunger for this new prey. Now with the help of newfound local allies like Teyla Emmagan, the Atlantis Team sets about to uncover their new home''s secrets even as their war of survival against the Wraith begins.', 'With the Ancients'' city of Atlantis discovered in the Pegasus Galaxy by Stargate Command, Dr. Elizabeth Weir and Major Sheppard lead a scientific expedition to the ancient abandoned city. Once there, the team not only find themselves unable to contact Earth, but their explorations unexpectedly reawaken the Ancients'' deadly enemies, The Wraith, who hunger for this new prey. Now with the help of newfound local allies like Teyla Emmagan, the Atlantis Team sets about to uncover their new home''s secrets even as their war of survival against the Wraith begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0JYr2iqwId6VOmCV8dHzlIM6Wd.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:2290'),
  ('1118785858215287699', 'Stargate Infinity', 2002, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Mark Edward Edens, Michael Edens, Kaaren Lee Brown', null, 'Dale Wilson, Tifanie Christun, Kathleen Barr, Mark Hildreth, Mackenzie Gray, Mark Acheson, Jim Byrnes, Cathy Weseluck', 'NR', 'This DIC animated action-adventure series follows four exceptional Air Force Academy cadets and a wrongly court-martialed Stargate veteran as they travel planets through gated wormholes protecting a myst. Based on MGMs successful sci-fi franchise Stargate.', 'This DIC animated action-adventure series follows four exceptional Air Force Academy cadets and a wrongly court-martialed Stargate veteran as they travel planets through gated wormholes protecting a myst. Based on MGMs successful sci-fi franchise Stargate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fvcZJmspoiAeWNYeVmjfExea1FY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2580'),
  ('321310854608953339', 'Stargate Origins', 2018, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Mercedes Bryce Morgan, Justin Michael Terry, Mark Ilvedson', null, 'Ellie Gall, Aylam Orian, Philip Alexander, Shvan Aladdin, Sarah Navratil, Connor Trinneer', 'TV-14', 'Follow Catherine Langford, the young woman who witnessed her father uncover the Stargate in Giza in 1928, as she embarks on an unexpected adventure to unlock the mystery of what lies beyond the Stargate in order to save Earth from unimaginable darkness.', 'Follow Catherine Langford, the young woman who witnessed her father uncover the Stargate in Giza in 1928, as she embarks on an unexpected adventure to unlock the mystery of what lies beyond the Stargate in order to save Earth from unimaginable darkness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/esec4AKT1BVNeQbPMO9rCHHvSvd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72925'),
  ('991347056594519331', 'Stargate SG-1', 1997, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Brad Wright, Jonathan Glassner', 'Dean Devlin', 'Ben Browder, Amanda Tapping, Christopher Judge, Michael Shanks, Claudia Black, Beau Bridges', 'TV-PG', 'The story of Stargate SG-1 begins about a year after the events of the feature film, when the United States government learns that an ancient alien device called the Stargate can access a network of such devices on a multitude of planets. SG-1 is an elite Air Force special operations team, one of more than two dozen teams from Earth who explore the galaxy and defend against alien threats such as the Goa''uld, Replicators, and the Ori.', 'The story of Stargate SG-1 begins about a year after the events of the feature film, when the United States government learns that an ancient alien device called the Stargate can access a network of such devices on a multitude of planets. SG-1 is an elite Air Force special operations team, one of more than two dozen teams from Earth who explore the galaxy and defend against alien threats such as the Goa''uld, Replicators, and the Ori.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQjmI7XxI47v8IM2MUysHG0LuU2.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:4629'),
  ('618343809087369083', 'Stargate Universe', 2009, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Robert C. Cooper, Brad Wright', null, 'Robert Carlyle, Louis Ferreira, David Blue, Elyse Levesque, Brian J. Smith, Alaina Huffman, Jamil Walker Smith', 'TV-14', 'The adventures of a present-day, multinational exploration team traveling on the Ancient spaceship Destiny many billions of light years distant from the Milky Way Galaxy. They evacuated there and are now trying to figure out a way to return to Earth, while simultaneously trying to explore and to survive in their unknown area of the universe.', 'The adventures of a present-day, multinational exploration team traveling on the Ancient spaceship Destiny many billions of light years distant from the Milky Way Galaxy. They evacuated there and are now trying to figure out a way to return to Earth, while simultaneously trying to explore and to survive in their unknown area of the universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHOaOZGUhnoRXeK9mhYeSRPh59H.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:5148'),
