  ('542338694729929829', 'Story of a Mermaid', 2002, 'Drama, Family', 'Im Sung-han', 'Im Sung-han', 'Jang Seo-hee, Woo Hee-jin, Kim Sung-min, Jung Bo-seog, Park Tam-hee, Kim Byeong-gi, Choi Sun-ja, Jeon Mi-seon', 'TV-PG', 'An estranged daughter vows to take revenge on her father, who abandoned her and her mother.', 'An estranged daughter vows to take revenge on her father, who abandoned her and her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6fGAljQDfHDbYNKSAkUZ5RQVYLJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:24633'),
