  ('447164156372045713', 'Studio Tarara', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Tim van Aelst', 'David Vennix, Tim van Aelst', 'Koen De Graeve, Ruth Beeckmans, Peter van den Begin, Janne Desmet, Geert Van Rampelberg, Frances Lefebure, Charlotte Timmers, Jonas Vermeulen', null, '1993, behind the scenes of Belgium''s first commercial television channel VTM. The actors of the popular sketch show "Studio Tarara" gradually lose themselves in a spiral of self-destruction that culminates in a mysterious suicide.', '1993, behind the scenes of Belgium''s first commercial television channel VTM. The actors of the popular sketch show "Studio Tarara" gradually lose themselves in a spiral of self-destruction that culminates in a mysterious suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFUJBUKOpZDdyfsvCinbvzmyg22.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92132'),
  ('792659044566185424', 'Study Group', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Lee Jang-hoon', null, 'Minhyun, Park Yoon-ho, Cha Woo-min, Shin Su-hyun, Hong Min-gi, Lee Jong-hyun, Han Ji-eun, Yun Sang-jeong', null, 'struggling student at Korea''s worst high school forms a study group while protecting his classmates with his fighting skills, hoping to overcome academic challenges and secure a spot in college.', 'struggling student at Korea''s worst high school forms a study group while protecting his classmates with his fighting skills, hoping to overcome academic challenges and secure a spot in college.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1x3xfnXQpxVfiRXUTqzX4CxU8yf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:233347'),
  ('180498845644722993', 'Stumble', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Liz Astrof, Jeff Astrof', null, 'Jenn Lyon, Taran Killam, Ryan Pinkston, Jarrett Austin Brown, Anissa Borrego, Arianna Davis, Taylor Dunbar, Georgie Murphy', 'TV-14', 'Courteney Potter is determined to rally her newly recruited junior college cheer squad to win her record-breaking 15th championship and improve their lives along the way.', 'Courteney Potter is determined to rally her newly recruited junior college cheer squad to win her record-breaking 15th championship and improve their lives along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yb9x05LNrgs06QjAYZE7A4UvSuj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:296579'),
  ('1006814016462850807', 'Stumptown', 2019, 'Drama', 'Jason Richman', null, 'Cobie Smulders, Jake Johnson, Michael Ealy, Cole Sibus, Adrian Martinez, Camryn Manheim, Tantoo Cardinal', 'TV-14', 'Dex Parios is a strong, assertive, and unapologetically sharp-witted Army veteran working as a P.I. in Portland, Oregon. With a complicated personal history and only herself to rely on, she solves other people’s messes with a blind eye toward her own.', 'Dex Parios is a strong, assertive, and unapologetically sharp-witted Army veteran working as a P.I. in Portland, Oregon. With a complicated personal history and only herself to rely on, she solves other people’s messes with a blind eye toward her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KphzAbThulphwHGCu22RzFlhqR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89440'),
  ('194334357935630311', 'Stupid Wife', 2022, 'Family, Drama', 'Nathália Sodré, Fábio Brito, Priscilla Pugliese', null, 'Priscila Buiar, Priscila Reis, Thomás de Araújo, Ingrïd Pedroza, Marcelo Petzen', null, 'Luíza and Valentina are law students and classmates, but from totally different worlds and personalities. Luiza sees in Valentina all the flaws she believes someone can have, and hates her. One day, however, Luiza wakes up to find herself ten years older and, to her horror, married to Valentina. It turns out that now, Luíza was the victim of a trauma, which she is still unaware of and which led her to a process of Dissociative Amnesia; not remembering her marriage to Valentina, much less her son Leo. In this process, she will need to rediscover herself, who she has become. At the same time, Valentina seeks to win back her wife.', 'Luíza and Valentina are law students and classmates, but from totally different worlds and personalities. Luiza sees in Valentina all the flaws she believes someone can have, and hates her. One day, however, Luiza wakes up to find herself ten years older and, to her horror, married to Valentina. It turns out that now, Luíza was the victim of a trauma, which she is still unaware of and which led her to a process of Dissociative Amnesia; not remembering her marriage to Valentina, much less her son Leo. In this process, she will need to rediscover herself, who she has become. At the same time, Valentina seeks to win back her wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3JT5euoYrdGU08UCpyp7FNxGUI.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:210026'),
  ('443624007237021445', 'Sturm der Liebe', 2005, 'Drama, Soap', 'Bea Schmidt', null, 'Dirk Galuba, Sepp Schauer, Antje Hagen', 'NR', 'These are the stories of relationships taking place in the fictional five-star hotel Fürstenhof, located in Feldkirchen-Westerham near Rosenheim with the plot revolving around members of the family room area, the hotel owners, and employees.', 'These are the stories of relationships taking place in the fictional five-star hotel Fürstenhof, located in Feldkirchen-Westerham near Rosenheim with the plot revolving around members of the family room area, the hotel owners, and employees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfFNydakwvbeACEwSd2Gh8UWtba.jpg', 22, 'tmdb:tv:45789'),
  ('370110419837074734', 'Şubat', 2012, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Funda Alp', 'Funda Alp', 'Alican Yücesoy, Melisa Sözen, Musa Uzunlar, Serkan Ercan, Özkan Uğur, Ülkü Duru, Tansu Biçer, Nadir Sarıbacak', 'TV-MA', 'An orphan subjected to tests that gave him superpowers is rescued and raised on Istanbul''s streets, where he falls for a reporter linked to his past.', 'An orphan subjected to tests that gave him superpowers is rescued and raised on Istanbul''s streets, where he falls for a reporter linked to his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RA8ZosnmkldgRrviakUAjHxV5i.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69754'),
  ('642677562418908536', 'Súbete a mi moto', 2020, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Mary Black Suarez', null, 'Sian Chiong, Rocío Verdejo, Ethan Schwartz, Felipe Albors, Alejandro Bermúdez, Yamil Ureña, Marisol Calero, Josette Vidal Restifo', 'NR', 'The Story behind the the iconic boy band Menudo according to the creator and manager of the band', 'The Story behind the the iconic boy band Menudo according to the creator and manager of the band', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHbHQ1FdcVGXftkztSHB06n4xKm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111119'),
  ('251109511530737524', 'Submission', 2016, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Jacky St. James, Paul Fishbein', 'Jacky St. James, Paul Fishbein', 'Ashlynn Yennie, Justin Berti, Skin Diamond, Victoria Levine, Kevin Nelson, Nika Khitrova, Brent Harvey', 'TV-MA', 'Beautiful but unfulfilled Ashley has her eyes opened to the tantalizing possibilities of BDSM when she discovers the popular erotic novel SLAVE by Nolan Keats. But her fascination with the mysterious Mr. Keats leads her into a sexy but dangerous love triangle, and tests the boundaries of her own sexual limitations.', 'Beautiful but unfulfilled Ashley has her eyes opened to the tantalizing possibilities of BDSM when she discovers the popular erotic novel SLAVE by Nolan Keats. But her fascination with the mysterious Mr. Keats leads her into a sexy but dangerous love triangle, and tests the boundaries of her own sexual limitations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uD2J4giOBcTRUOwcoN33WYCDuKF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66389'),
  ('871729690435686596', 'Subs', 1987, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Mieczysław Hryniewicz, Ewa Błaszczyk, Kazimierz Kaczor, Irena Kwiatkowska, Krystyna Kołodziejczyk, Bronisław Pawlik, Piotr Pręgowski, Krzysztof Kowalewski', null, '"Zmiennicy" is a grotesque comedy of absurdity and reality that masterfully blends slapstick, satire, and surrealism to expose the absurdities of life under communist rule in the People''s Republic of Poland (PRL). The story follows Jacek Żytkiewicz, a taxi driver in Warsaw, and his mysterious new shift partner, Katarzyna Piórecka, who disguises herself as a man to get the job. The series is a comedy of the grotesque, filled with exaggerated characters, nonsensical bureaucracy, and surreal plot twists. It mocks the inefficiencies and contradictions of PRL institutions—from corrupt officials and inept police to bizarre workplace dynamics and social hypocrisy. Underneath the absurdity lies a thriller-like subplot: a drug trafficking operation smuggling heroin from Thailand to West Germany. This storyline, featuring shady sports officials, a Thai student, and a crooked firefighter, adds a layer of intrigue reminiscent of American crime dramas.', '"Zmiennicy" is a grotesque comedy of absurdity and reality that masterfully blends slapstick, satire, and surrealism to expose the absurdities of life under communist rule in the People''s Republic of Poland (PRL). The story follows Jacek Żytkiewicz, a taxi driver in Warsaw, and his mysterious new shift partner, Katarzyna Piórecka, who disguises herself as a man to get the job. The series is a comedy of the grotesque, filled with exaggerated characters, nonsensical bureaucracy, and surreal plot twists. It mocks the inefficiencies and contradictions of PRL institutions—from corrupt officials and inept police to bizarre workplace dynamics and social hypocrisy. Underneath the absurdity lies a thriller-like subplot: a drug trafficking operation smuggling heroin from Thailand to West Germany. This storyline, featuring shady sports officials, a Thai student, and a crooked firefighter, adds a layer of intrigue reminiscent of American crime dramas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rcXq4QnzsmG5UdJnFxMSVbnpcnT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32533'),
