  ('763987355003995410', 'Super Cub', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tone Koken', null, 'Yuki Yomichi, Ayaka Nanase', 'TV-PG', 'Koguma is a high school girl in Yamanashi. She has no parents, friends, or hobbies, and her daily life is empty. One day, Koguma gets a used Honda Super Cub motorcycle. This is her first time going to school on a motorcycle. Running out of gas and hitting detours become a small source of adventure in Koguma''s life. She is satisfied with this strange transformation, but her classmate Reiko ends up talking to her about how she also goes to school by motorcycle. One Super Cub begins to open up a lonely girl''s world, introducing her to a new everyday life and friendship.', 'Koguma is a high school girl in Yamanashi. She has no parents, friends, or hobbies, and her daily life is empty. One day, Koguma gets a used Honda Super Cub motorcycle. This is her first time going to school on a motorcycle. Running out of gas and hitting detours become a small source of adventure in Koguma''s life. She is satisfied with this strange transformation, but her classmate Reiko ends up talking to her about how she also goes to school by motorcycle. One Super Cub begins to open up a lonely girl''s world, introducing her to a new everyday life and friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcJLrikS9bsYsKn6U0ttx4NmJcP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95631'),
  ('224657754018793579', 'Super Cube', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Xinran Yang, Ye Zhiqiu, Jiang Yingjun, Chen Zhangtaikang, Zhenyan Liu, Tong Yin', 'TV-14', 'In an accident, an ordinary boy, Wang Xiaoxiu, obtains a space system called "Superpower Cube" from a high-latitude cosmic civilization and gains extraordinary powers. When the school belle, Shen Yao, Wang Xiaoxiu’s longtime crush, confesses her love to him, the delinquent Sun Jun, who also has a crush on her, is provoked. Wang Xiaoxiu resolves the crisis with his wit and extraordinary powers, but it also brings more disasters as a result. Shen Yao is taken to the world of extraordinary beings by a mysterious person, and Wang Xiaoxiu embarks on a journey to rescue her. Fighting in the bizarre universe, he finds the meaning of fairness and justice on the path to becoming a peerless powerhouse.', 'In an accident, an ordinary boy, Wang Xiaoxiu, obtains a space system called "Superpower Cube" from a high-latitude cosmic civilization and gains extraordinary powers. When the school belle, Shen Yao, Wang Xiaoxiu’s longtime crush, confesses her love to him, the delinquent Sun Jun, who also has a crush on her, is provoked. Wang Xiaoxiu resolves the crisis with his wit and extraordinary powers, but it also brings more disasters as a result. Shen Yao is taken to the world of extraordinary beings by a mysterious person, and Wang Xiaoxiu embarks on a journey to rescue her. Fighting in the bizarre universe, he finds the meaning of fairness and justice on the path to becoming a peerless powerhouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkeiYRYgQjJBItx9x3Fnia2XT3t.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:279182'),
  ('463400444925123137', 'Super Dad', 1993, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Şevket Altuğ, Ümit Çırak', null, 'A family father struggles in maintaining lifelong relationships with three of his growing children ,after he divorced with his wife. In the unique Çengelköy district Fikret struggles with life, beside love, pain, hope.', 'A family father struggles in maintaining lifelong relationships with three of his growing children ,after he divorced with his wife. In the unique Çengelköy district Fikret struggles with life, beside love, pain, hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwXS0mQ5NSNG0I4qb0X9upkTkTZ.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:42717'),
  ('344504875536788653', 'Super Dimension Century Orguss', 1983, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, 'Hiroshi Onogi', 'Kumiko Takizawa, Chika Sakamoto, Sanae Miyuki, Show Hayami, Run Sasaki, Banjo Ginga, Koichi Hashimoto, Kiyomi Hanasaki', null, 'Kei Katsuragi''s only concern is the love of his life. It doesn''t really matter to him that he has more than one love - after all, as a pilot for the Freedom Space Corps, he might be dead tomorrow! In the future, war has changed, and Kei is all too familiar with the horrors it can bring. Atomic, biological, and chemical weapons are all in use, but even worse than those are the dimensional weapons, ordnance capable of tearing apart even time and space!', 'Kei Katsuragi''s only concern is the love of his life. It doesn''t really matter to him that he has more than one love - after all, as a pilot for the Freedom Space Corps, he might be dead tomorrow! In the future, war has changed, and Kei is all too familiar with the horrors it can bring. Atomic, biological, and chemical weapons are all in use, but even worse than those are the dimensional weapons, ordnance capable of tearing apart even time and space!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jFpI4tXbAFCocWnfMRMpN2C9gaT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43209'),
  ('861497729177011244', 'Super Dimension Fortress Macross', 1982, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics', null, 'Kenichi Matsuzaki', 'Arihiro Hase, Mari Iijima, Mika Doi, Akira Kamiya, Eiji Kanie, Eri Takeda, Hiromi Tsuru, Hirotaka Suzuoki', 'TV-PG', 'After a mysterious spaceship crashes on Earth a fleet of spaceships belonging to a race of aliens known as the Zentradi descend upon Earth sparking an intergalactic war.', 'After a mysterious spaceship crashes on Earth a fleet of spaceships belonging to a race of aliens known as the Zentradi descend upon Earth sparking an intergalactic war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15JJd47Wy6enQS3roKSdK1ouce7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21734'),
  ('1001961934079636602', 'Super Doll★Licca-chan', 1998, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Drama, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tomo Sakurai, Michiko Neya, Kentaro Ito, Yuka Kono, Atsuko Tanaka, Ikue Otani, Junko Takeuchi, Kazue Komiya', null, 'Super Doll★Licca-chan (スーパードール★リカちゃん Sūpā Dōru Rika-chan?) is TV anime series which ran on TV Tokyo from 1998–1999. Kodansha also serialized a manga based on the anime series in its monthly manga magazine Nakayoshi. The story follows an ordinary elementary school girl named Licca Kayama and the strange circumstances surrounding her origins, as well as the origins of her protector, Doll Licca. The series is an original story spin-off inspired by the long-selling and popular Takara doll lineup "Licca-chan", created by Miyako Maki, designed to expand the regular dress-up doll series into a line of action figures. However, the new figures were only a mild success, and did not remain in production for long.', 'Super Doll★Licca-chan (スーパードール★リカちゃん Sūpā Dōru Rika-chan?) is TV anime series which ran on TV Tokyo from 1998–1999. Kodansha also serialized a manga based on the anime series in its monthly manga magazine Nakayoshi. The story follows an ordinary elementary school girl named Licca Kayama and the strange circumstances surrounding her origins, as well as the origins of her protector, Doll Licca. The series is an original story spin-off inspired by the long-selling and popular Takara doll lineup "Licca-chan", created by Miyako Maki, designed to expand the regular dress-up doll series into a line of action figures. However, the new figures were only a mild success, and did not remain in production for long.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51gWIq2Fzi6abizaKrBI07uX0uq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21268'),
  ('298747199584934488', 'Super Dragon Ball Heroes', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Masako Nozawa, Ryo Horikawa, Takeshi Kusao, Kappei Yamaguchi', null, 'Trunks returns from the future to train with Goku and Vegeta. However, it disappears without warning. Then the mysterious Fu bursts in, telling them that Trunks has been imprisoned in the Prison Planet, a mysterious complex in an unknown place in the universes. The group seeks the dragon balls to free Trunks, but an endless battle awaits them! Will Goku and the others rescue Trunks and escape the Prison Planet?', 'Trunks returns from the future to train with Goku and Vegeta. However, it disappears without warning. Then the mysterious Fu bursts in, telling them that Trunks has been imprisoned in the Prison Planet, a mysterious complex in an unknown place in the universes. The group seeks the dragon balls to free Trunks, but an endless battle awaits them! Will Goku and the others rescue Trunks and escape the Prison Planet?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jq6xv5c1WK7KAPOXCsodm8eUxp.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:80020'),
  ('918552679297088459', 'Super Drags', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Anderson Mahanski, Fernando Mendonça, Paulo Lescaut', null, 'Sérgio Cantú, Wagner Follare, Rapha Véles, Fernando Mendonça, Pabllo Vittar, Silvetty Montilla, Sylvia Salustti, Marcelo Souza', 'TV-MA', 'In this adult animated series, three gay co-workers lead double lives as drag queen superheroes, saving the LGBTQ community from evil nemeses.', 'In this adult animated series, three gay co-workers lead double lives as drag queen superheroes, saving the LGBTQ community from evil nemeses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/phHxgPrZf980OQ6VoQejR0fTLhA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83414'),
  ('155908681029462989', 'Super Force', 1990, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ken Olandt, Larry B. Scott, Patrick Macnee', null, 'Super Force is an action-adventure TV series about a former astronaut who uses an advanced combat suit and motorcycle to fight crime in the city of Metroplex during the year 2020. Among the features of the suit were enhanced strength and armament, whereas the motorcycle had an array of James Bond-type gadgets and weapons.', 'Super Force is an action-adventure TV series about a former astronaut who uses an advanced combat suit and motorcycle to fight crime in the city of Metroplex during the year 2020. Among the features of the suit were enhanced strength and armament, whereas the motorcycle had an array of James Bond-type gadgets and weapons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2n539x75lXDvNVXJpHvUe6bfrdh.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1771'),
  ('957186825993841231', 'Super Friends', 1973, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Danny Dark, Adam West, Casey Kasem, Mark L. Taylor, Frank Welker, William Callaway, Ernie Hudson, B.J. Ward', 'TV-Y7', 'The most powerful heroes ever--Superman, Wonder Woman, Aquaman, Batman and Robin--join forces with teenagers Wendy and Marvin and their dog, Marvel the Wonderdog, to defend justice and guard the innocent.', 'The most powerful heroes ever--Superman, Wonder Woman, Aquaman, Batman and Robin--join forces with teenagers Wendy and Marvin and their dog, Marvel the Wonderdog, to defend justice and guard the innocent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3AvUm2Lf7YnEb7yHIJmC87mh0kK.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:936'),
  ('662507451089159718', 'Super Friends: The Legendary Super Powers Show', 1984, 'Animation, Kids, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Buster Jones, B.J. Ward, Jack Angel, Adam West, Olan Soule, Mark L. Taylor, Danny Dark, Stan Jones', null, 'Super Friends: The Legendary Super Powers Show is an American animated television series about a team of superheroes which ran from 1984 to 1985 on ABC. It was produced by Hanna-Barbera and is based on the Justice League and associated comic book characters published by DC Comics.', 'Super Friends: The Legendary Super Powers Show is an American animated television series about a team of superheroes which ran from 1984 to 1985 on ABC. It was produced by Hanna-Barbera and is based on the Justice League and associated comic book characters published by DC Comics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8MtDyP4wqqhTIbwEGA8UINVMb40.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10157'),
  ('741650846156694429', 'Super Fun Night', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Conan O''Brien, Rebel Wilson', null, 'Rebel Wilson, Lauren Ash, Liza Lapira, Kate Jenkinson, Kevin Bishop', null, 'Junior attorney Kimmie Boubier and her two best friends, Helen-Alice and Marika, have had a standing date every Friday night for the last 13 years. They even have a motto for what they call "Friday Night Fun Night": "Always together! Always Inside!" However Kimmie''s recent promotion throws a monkey wrench into the tradition. Not only is she now working with her idol, "Lady Lawyer of the Year" Felicity Vanderstone, but she meets a dashingly handsome British attorney, Richard Lovell, who invites her to his party at a trendy club. Determined to spend time with Richard and heed Felicity''s advice to network, Kimmie sets out to convince her friends to take Super Fun Night on the road.', 'Junior attorney Kimmie Boubier and her two best friends, Helen-Alice and Marika, have had a standing date every Friday night for the last 13 years. They even have a motto for what they call "Friday Night Fun Night": "Always together! Always Inside!" However Kimmie''s recent promotion throws a monkey wrench into the tradition. Not only is she now working with her idol, "Lady Lawyer of the Year" Felicity Vanderstone, but she meets a dashingly handsome British attorney, Richard Lovell, who invites her to his party at a trendy club. Determined to spend time with Richard and heed Felicity''s advice to network, Kimmie sets out to convince her friends to take Super Fun Night on the road.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92euIThzlIO7PGaAWUXjwQJrroO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:49007'),
  ('596688400223155331', 'Super Giant Robot Brothers', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Víctor Maldonado, Alfredo Torres Martínez', 'Marcelina Chavira, Yael Galena', 'Eric Lopez, Chris Diamantopoulos, Marisa Davila, Delbert Hunt, Sitara Attaie, Gina Ravera, Jared Farid Ward, Chris Jai Alex', 'TV-Y7', 'Once the squabbling stops, the battling begins! Robot siblings Shiny and Thunder and their whiz inventor must defend Earth when space monsters attack.', 'Once the squabbling stops, the battling begins! Robot siblings Shiny and Thunder and their whiz inventor must defend Earth when space monsters attack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ysuYGkRtZgaP4mL9nbRmCU3vMd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158138'),
  ('619298987171860712', 'Super Gran', 1985, 'Comedy, Family, Crime', 'Jenny McDade, Forrest Wilson', 'Jenny McDade', 'Gudrun Ure, Iain Cuthbertson, Bill Shine, Alan Snell, Brian Lewis', null, 'Adapted from Forrest Wilson''s books, the children''s programme revolves around a grandmother with super powers and her arch nemesis, The Scunner Campbell.', 'Adapted from Forrest Wilson''s books, the children''s programme revolves around a grandmother with super powers and her arch nemesis, The Scunner Campbell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhWPC6GG63zC8RulWI3lleEnLCx.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:818'),
  ('862313733093635468', 'Super Heroes', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Themis Gyrtis', 'Themis Gyrtis, Vasilis Tsigristaris, Margarita Gerogianni', 'Giannis Bezos, Alexandros Hrysanthopoulos, Natasa Exintaveloni, Eleana Stravodimou, Stavros Markalas, Aineias Tsamatis, Alexandros Zouridakis, Katerina Patsiani', null, 'Real heroes live among us. Because lies are bad, sometimes you need to be a superhero to get through the week...', 'Real heroes live among us. Because lies are bad, sometimes you need to be a superhero to get through the week...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYZFyXbh0GITY1TrzK6XiYW4EZS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:316872'),
  ('455896115716237487', 'SUPER HxEROS', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Ai Kakuma, Sayuri Yahagi, Ai Kayano, Yuuki Kuwahara, Nichika Omori, Shin-ichiro Miki, Daisuke Kishio', 'TV-14', 'Earth faces an unprecedented threat from an invasion by the mysterious Kiseichuu. The Kiseichuu feed on human sexual energy, also known as “H-energy,” and weaken the human population. High school student Retto Enjo is a member of the hero group HxEROS, who fight together to save the earth from the Kiseichuu.', 'Earth faces an unprecedented threat from an invasion by the mysterious Kiseichuu. The Kiseichuu feed on human sexual energy, also known as “H-energy,” and weaken the human population. High school student Retto Enjo is a member of the hero group HxEROS, who fight together to save the earth from the Kiseichuu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/myqtIeEhLxtU5eOfv0tjRhoLod8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96120'),
  ('235242005634219784', 'Super JoJo', 2019, 'Kids, Animation', '宝宝巴士', null, null, null, 'The age of enlightenment, parents and children learn together. [1] Baby''s growth starts from many first time, the first time to learn to speak, the first time to learn to walk. "Super baby JOJO" is a nursery rhyme designed for 1-3-year-old babies. It is designed for 1-3-year-old babies. It attracts babies to imitate and learn from the common scenes and interesting events in their growth and life, and stimulates their language expression and exploration desire. To help children learn and understand the world at the right age, support parents to easily raise children, encourage parents to appreciate together, and accompany their children to grow up happily.', 'The age of enlightenment, parents and children learn together. [1] Baby''s growth starts from many first time, the first time to learn to speak, the first time to learn to walk. "Super baby JOJO" is a nursery rhyme designed for 1-3-year-old babies. It is designed for 1-3-year-old babies. It attracts babies to imitate and learn from the common scenes and interesting events in their growth and life, and stimulates their language expression and exploration desire. To help children learn and understand the world at the right age, support parents to easily raise children, encourage parents to appreciate together, and accompany their children to grow up happily.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5aba73pZKD3k6Aj3c5oTHGikWq.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:106142'),
  ('606108585437048149', 'Super League: The War for Football', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Jeff Zimbalist', 'Jeff Zimbalist', 'Gianni Infantino, Edwin van der Sar, Gary Neville, Rio Ferdinand, Pep Guardiola', 'TV-MA', 'The past, present, and future of European football collide when plans for a breakaway league emerge, leaving the game’s most powerful leaders to defend—or upend—the traditions of the sport.', 'The past, present, and future of European football collide when plans for a breakaway league emerge, leaving the game’s most powerful leaders to defend—or upend—the traditions of the sport.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d8HIv69R76QVCNy3wIL1etDwI0W.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216343'),
  ('1136071358639456633', 'SUPER LOVERS', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Junko Minagawa, Tomoaki Maeno, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Takuma Terashima, Ayumu Murase, Atsuko Tanaka, Ryotaro Okiayu', 'TV-MA', 'While spending summer with his mother, Haru meets Ren, a boy newly adopted by his mother. Getting along with Ren isn''t easy as Haru''s goal is to "civilize" him by the time summer ends. Their relationship slowly improves as Haru spends more time with Ren and in return Ren steadily warms up to him. Can they really become a "family" at the end of summer?!', 'While spending summer with his mother, Haru meets Ren, a boy newly adopted by his mother. Getting along with Ren isn''t easy as Haru''s goal is to "civilize" him by the time summer ends. Their relationship slowly improves as Haru spends more time with Ren and in return Ren steadily warms up to him. Can they really become a "family" at the end of summer?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YJDDmLwjnuc3CF8J1JeLaFvGTh.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66104'),
