  ('180805434411496988', 'Super Space Sheriff Gavan Infinity', 2026, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Kids', 'Saburo Yatsude', 'Atsuhiro Tomioka', 'Kohei Nagata, Arihiro Matsunaga, Kohana Arisaka', null, 'The universe is not just one. Within the overlapping layers of the multiverse, there exists another Earth that looks exactly like EarthIcon-wikipedia. In "MultiEarth Α0073", which has entered an era of cosmic coexistence, crimes involving the exploitation of energy-based lifeforms known as "Emorgy" are breaking out one after another. Reiji Doki, an investigator for the Galaxy Federal Police, is Gavan Infinity, the only person in the universe permitted to claim the title of "Space Sheriff Gavan". However, he is stationed in the backwater Archives Department. His true objective is to investigate Emorgy crimes across dimensions. Chasing these inter-dimensional threats, Reiji leaps through space-time, encountering the Gavans of various dimensions and joining forces to bring justice to the multiverse. "Jo-Chaku!" The Space Sheriff Gavans transcend the boundaries of the universe to strike down evil!', 'The universe is not just one. Within the overlapping layers of the multiverse, there exists another Earth that looks exactly like EarthIcon-wikipedia. In "MultiEarth Α0073", which has entered an era of cosmic coexistence, crimes involving the exploitation of energy-based lifeforms known as "Emorgy" are breaking out one after another. Reiji Doki, an investigator for the Galaxy Federal Police, is Gavan Infinity, the only person in the universe permitted to claim the title of "Space Sheriff Gavan". However, he is stationed in the backwater Archives Department. His true objective is to investigate Emorgy crimes across dimensions. Chasing these inter-dimensional threats, Reiji leaps through space-time, encountering the Gavans of various dimensions and joining forces to bring justice to the multiverse. "Jo-Chaku!" The Space Sheriff Gavans transcend the boundaries of the universe to strike down evil!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5kYFqiuqBjTgirXrsHM4dett8N.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:319154'),
  ('357202436882495518', 'Super Trio Series', 1995, 'Reality', 'Wilson Chin Kwok-Wai, 陈志球', null, 'Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Chin Ka-Lok, Louis Yuen Siu-Cheung, Mayanne Mak, Hellston Ching, Amisha Ng', null, 'The Super Trio Series is a Hong Kong variety show produced by TVB. The series debuted in 1995, and remained in production for eighteen years due to its popularity. The show was hosted by Eric Tsang and his two assistants - Jerry Lamb and Chin Kar-lok. The show initially ended its run with the airing of the final episode on July 16, 2005. However, on March 9, 2008, the first episode of the show''s spin-off series Super Trio Wonder Trip was aired; its main purpose was to introduce a series of new games that are to be imported from various game shows all over the world and would appear in series 8, Super Trio Supreme.', 'The Super Trio Series is a Hong Kong variety show produced by TVB. The series debuted in 1995, and remained in production for eighteen years due to its popularity. The show was hosted by Eric Tsang and his two assistants - Jerry Lamb and Chin Kar-lok. The show initially ended its run with the airing of the final episode on July 16, 2005. However, on March 9, 2008, the first episode of the show''s spin-off series Super Trio Wonder Trip was aired; its main purpose was to introduce a series of new games that are to be imported from various game shows all over the world and would appear in series 8, Super Trio Supreme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Sw4nK25cYJs6DQYPKqC54FWTik.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:91755'),
  ('146183146064740909', 'Super Why!', 2007, 'Animation, Family, Kids', 'Angela Santomero', null, 'Tajja Isen, Johnny Orlando, T.J. McGibbon, Samuel Faraci, Joanne Vannicola', 'TV-Y', 'Super Why! or The Reading Adventures of Super Why! is a CGI animated show developed by Angela C. Santomero and Samantha Freeman Alpert. The TV series is produced by New York City-based Out of the Blue Enterprises and Toronto-based DHX Media through its Decode Entertainment division. The show debuted on PBS stations on September 3, 2007. The series airs on PBS Kids and PBS Kids Sprout in the USA, Kids'' CBC in Canada. Thai PBS from Thailand broadcasts the shortened version, the episodes are 5 years behind the U.S.', 'Super Why! or The Reading Adventures of Super Why! is a CGI animated show developed by Angela C. Santomero and Samantha Freeman Alpert. The TV series is produced by New York City-based Out of the Blue Enterprises and Toronto-based DHX Media through its Decode Entertainment division. The show debuted on PBS stations on September 3, 2007. The series airs on PBS Kids and PBS Kids Sprout in the USA, Kids'' CBC in Canada. Thai PBS from Thailand broadcasts the shortened version, the episodes are 5 years behind the U.S.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJttSVfKx56a2wN2pg2yR4IHzwy.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:14766'),
  ('130530407594412657', 'Super Wings', 2014, 'Animation, Kids', 'Jung Gil-hoon', 'Anne D. Bernstein, Pammy Salmon', 'Moon Nam-sook, Chang Eun-sook, Hong So-young, Jeon Tae-yeol, Jeong Yeong-wung, Lim Chae-heon', 'TV-Y', 'An action-packed preschool series about an adorable jet plane named Jett who travels the world delivering packages to children. On every delivery, Jett encounters a new problem that the he and his friends the Super Wings must work together to solve!', 'An action-packed preschool series about an adorable jet plane named Jett who travels the world delivering packages to children. On every delivery, Jett encounters a new problem that the he and his friends the Super Wings must work together to solve!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lu2DNsIQgn1Jb6djHvrqJSUQXXl.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:71026'),
  ('115372004921032066', 'Super/Natural', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Matt Brandon, Bill Markham', null, 'Benedict Cumberbatch', 'TV-PG', 'Utilizing the latest scientific innovations and leading-edge filmmaking technology, this documentary reveals the secret powers and super-senses of the world’s most extraordinary animals, and invites viewers to see and hear beyond normal human perception to experience the natural world as a specific species does — from seeing flowers in bee-vision to eavesdropping on a conversation between elephant seals to soaring the length of a football field with glow-in-the-dark squirrels.', 'Utilizing the latest scientific innovations and leading-edge filmmaking technology, this documentary reveals the secret powers and super-senses of the world’s most extraordinary animals, and invites viewers to see and hear beyond normal human perception to experience the natural world as a specific species does — from seeing flowers in bee-vision to eavesdropping on a conversation between elephant seals to soaring the length of a football field with glow-in-the-dark squirrels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m50q06XxSU8mjErAt3QMJnMkwqI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157202'),
  ('338329949519079109', 'Superb Song of the Valkyries: Symphogear', 2012, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Aoi Yuuki, Nana Mizuki, Ayahi Takagaki, Yuka Iguchi, Hideo Ishikawa, Yoko Hikasa, Ai Kayano, Yoshino Nanjo', null, 'During a concert by idol group Zwei Wing, an alien force known as the Noise attack the stage. Group members Tsubasa Kazanari and Kanade Amou suppress the attack using their Symphogear armor, but despite their best efforts, innocent bystander Hibiki Tachibana is fatally injured. Distraught and much to Tsubasa''s dismay, Kanade sacrifices herself in the process to save Hibiki. Two years later, Hibiki lives on. Tsubasa now fights alone. With the threat of the Noise increasing, Hibiki finds herself encountering the Noise once again but this time she is granted a chance to become attuned with the same Symphogear that Kanade wielded.', 'During a concert by idol group Zwei Wing, an alien force known as the Noise attack the stage. Group members Tsubasa Kazanari and Kanade Amou suppress the attack using their Symphogear armor, but despite their best efforts, innocent bystander Hibiki Tachibana is fatally injured. Distraught and much to Tsubasa''s dismay, Kanade sacrifices herself in the process to save Hibiki. Two years later, Hibiki lives on. Tsubasa now fights alone. With the threat of the Noise increasing, Hibiki finds herself encountering the Noise once again but this time she is granted a chance to become attuned with the same Symphogear that Kanade wielded.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g0jsgViN4aBybkgTmr4XgZHluxX.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:63322'),
  ('230407866203823377', 'Superbook', 1981, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Kids, Family', null, null, 'Masako Sugaya, Katsue Miwa, Hiroshi Masuoka, Fumio Matsuoka, Runa Akiyama, Eiji Maruyama, Masako Sugaya, Asami Mukaidono', 'TV-G', 'Superbook, also known as Animated Parent and Child Theatre, is an anime television series initially produced by Tatsunoko Productions in Japan in conjunction with the Christian Broadcasting Network in the United States and more recently solely produced by CBN for global distribution and broadcast. The series chronicled the events of the Bible''s Old and New Testaments in its 52 episode run. The first 26 episodes aired from October 1, 1981 to March 29, 1982. The series returned as Superbook II with 26 episodes to air from April 4, 1983 to September 26, 1983. Between both series in the first run was the companion series The Flying House. The Christian Broadcasting Network is currently producing a new Superbook series and has released fourteen episodes.', 'Superbook, also known as Animated Parent and Child Theatre, is an anime television series initially produced by Tatsunoko Productions in Japan in conjunction with the Christian Broadcasting Network in the United States and more recently solely produced by CBN for global distribution and broadcast. The series chronicled the events of the Bible''s Old and New Testaments in its 52 episode run. The first 26 episodes aired from October 1, 1981 to March 29, 1982. The series returned as Superbook II with 26 episodes to air from April 4, 1983 to September 26, 1983. Between both series in the first run was the companion series The Flying House. The Christian Broadcasting Network is currently producing a new Superbook series and has released fourteen episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iIXRDcfqVMQZc5IFSLQluZfKL9F.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:21269'),
  ('1028513335066850291', 'Superbook', 2011, 'Animation, Kids, Family', 'Bryant Paul Richardson', null, 'Nicole Oliver, Colin Murdock, Sam Vincent, Shannon Chan-Kent, Cathy Weseluck, Jan Rabson', 'TV-G', 'Chris Quantum is your typical Middle School student -- except if you take into account one of his best friends is a robot named Gizmo. Add his best friend Joy Pepper into the mix and you have a recipe for adventure. The adventures begin for this trio when a mysterious device appears and takes them on journeys throughout the Bible. Travel back in time and get ready for the journey of a lifetime!', 'Chris Quantum is your typical Middle School student -- except if you take into account one of his best friends is a robot named Gizmo. Add his best friend Joy Pepper into the mix and you have a recipe for adventure. The adventures begin for this trio when a mysterious device appears and takes them on journeys throughout the Bible. Travel back in time and get ready for the journey of a lifetime!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gxPU54vvA5ZGaICzwDXAQY5SvR.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:44931'),
  ('90195057114581376', 'Superboy', 1988, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Alexander Salkind, Ilya Salkind', null, 'Gerard Christopher, Stacy Haiduk, Peter Jay Fernandez, Robert Levine', 'TV-PG', 'Superboy is a half-hour live-action television series based on Kal-El''s early years as Superboy. It depicted Superboy''s adventures during his college years, his meetings with Lex Luthor and his romance with Lana Lang. The series was brought to the screen by executive producers Ilya and Alexander Salkind, who were the producers of the first three Superman movies and the 1984 Supergirl movie.', 'Superboy is a half-hour live-action television series based on Kal-El''s early years as Superboy. It depicted Superboy''s adventures during his college years, his meetings with Lex Luthor and his romance with Lana Lang. The series was brought to the screen by executive producers Ilya and Alexander Salkind, who were the producers of the first three Superman movies and the 1984 Supergirl movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8QxvkOSGiGRk0nW6U8QLX0Y8NV.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:4532'),
  ('102118372815813426', 'Supercar', 1961, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Gerry Anderson', null, 'Sylvia Anderson, Cyril Shaps, David Graham, George Murcell, Graydon Gould', null, 'Follows the adventures of Mike Mercury and the test crew at Black Rock Laboratory in the Nevada Desert in 1962, as they test out Supercar, a prototype vehicle capable of traveling on land, can dive underwater, and can fly through the air.', 'Follows the adventures of Mike Mercury and the test crew at Black Rock Laboratory in the Nevada Desert in 1962, as they test out Supercar, a prototype vehicle capable of traveling on land, can dive underwater, and can fly through the air.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLUML86KIWdewA7NFCOVNpoZugq.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:551'),
  ('535770504619198627', 'Supergirl', 2015, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Greg Berlanti, Andrew Kreisberg, Ali Adler', null, 'Melissa Benoist, Chyler Leigh, David Harewood, Katie McGrath, Jesse Rath, Nicole Maines, Azie Tesfai, Julie Gonzalo', 'TV-14', 'Twenty-four-year-old Kara Zor-El, who was taken in by the Danvers family when she was 13 after being sent away from Krypton, must learn to embrace her powers after previously hiding them. The Danvers teach her to be careful with her powers, until she has to reveal them during an unexpected disaster, setting her on her journey of heroism.', 'Twenty-four-year-old Kara Zor-El, who was taken in by the Danvers family when she was 13 after being sent away from Krypton, must learn to embrace her powers after previously hiding them. The Danvers teach her to be careful with her powers, until she has to reveal them during an unexpected disaster, setting her on her journey of heroism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cFO65xb0xiXKqk5BmgHawCXB1i0.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:62688'),
  ('47973623969606933', 'Superheroes: A Never-Ending Battle', 2013, 'Documentary, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Michael Kantor', null, 'Grant Morrison, Joe Quesada, Stan Lee, Mark Waid, Neal Adams, Adam West, Jim Steranko, Michael Chabon', null, 'Examines the dawn of the comic book genre and its powerful legacy, as well as the evolution of the characters who leapt from the pages over the last 75 years and their ongoing worldwide cultural impact. It chronicles how these disposable diversions were subject to intense government scrutiny for their influence on American children and how they were created in large part by the children of immigrants whose fierce loyalty to a new homeland laid the foundation for a multi-billion-dollar industry that is an influential part of our national identity.', 'Examines the dawn of the comic book genre and its powerful legacy, as well as the evolution of the characters who leapt from the pages over the last 75 years and their ongoing worldwide cultural impact. It chronicles how these disposable diversions were subject to intense government scrutiny for their influence on American children and how they were created in large part by the children of immigrants whose fierce loyalty to a new homeland laid the foundation for a multi-billion-dollar industry that is an influential part of our national identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIL7JhjNEea8EuW25CTZAcdQwch.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60289'),
  ('1143054852562506354', 'Superior Donuts', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Neil Goldman, Bob Daily, Garrett Donovan', null, 'Jermaine Fowler, Judd Hirsch, Katey Sagal, David Koechner, Maz Jobrani, Darien Sills-Evans, Rell Battle, Diane Guerrero', null, 'The relationship between Arthur, the gruff owner of a small donut shop, his enterprising new young employee, Franco, and their loyal patrons in a quickly gentrifying Chicago neighborhood.', 'The relationship between Arthur, the gruff owner of a small donut shop, his enterprising new young employee, Franco, and their loyal patrons in a quickly gentrifying Chicago neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5wBoPar2t9yV9lkwnMZLOcxwga.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69632'),
  ('482186233638162802', 'Superjail!', 2008, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy', 'Ben Gruber, Stephen Warbrick, Christy Karacas', null, 'David Wain, Christopher McCulloch, Eric Bauza, Teddy Cohn, Christy Karacas, Richard Mather', 'TV-MA', 'An eccentric warden and his staff run a bizarre maximum security prison full of dangerous prisoners.', 'An eccentric warden and his staff run a bizarre maximum security prison full of dangerous prisoners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNw5w1YfQDgT8cJoqW38q8BVZUY.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:3108'),
  ('212414740063313831', 'SUPERKID', 1983, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Family, Kids', null, null, 'Katsue Miwa, Hiroshi Otake, Eiko Masuyama, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Yoshito Yasuhara', null, 'Mitsuo encountered Superman, an alien who is a part of a federation that tries to maintain peace in the galaxy. He then received a helmet (that also serves as a mask) that gives superhuman strength, a cape that enables the wearer to fly, and a badge that allows him to breathe underwater and communicate with his fellow comrades whom he met soon after he utilized these gifts. Superman made it clear to all Permans that their identity must be kept a secret or their brain will be destroyed should it ever be revealed and they are given a special doppelganger robot that can replace them while they are away to achieve this feat, although it is not entirely foolproof nor is it free from potential problems. These equipments then allowed them to be young Permans who try to maintain peace and help the people who are in need.', 'Mitsuo encountered Superman, an alien who is a part of a federation that tries to maintain peace in the galaxy. He then received a helmet (that also serves as a mask) that gives superhuman strength, a cape that enables the wearer to fly, and a badge that allows him to breathe underwater and communicate with his fellow comrades whom he met soon after he utilized these gifts. Superman made it clear to all Permans that their identity must be kept a secret or their brain will be destroyed should it ever be revealed and they are given a special doppelganger robot that can replace them while they are away to achieve this feat, although it is not entirely foolproof nor is it free from potential problems. These equipments then allowed them to be young Permans who try to maintain peace and help the people who are in need.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCGbsqKiOvRICllC4AgZ67zjrSL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132791'),
  ('296967792524711973', 'Superman', 1988, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Beau Weaver, Ginny McSwain, Mark L. Taylor, Michael Bell, Alan Oppenheimer, Tress MacNeille, Lynne Marie Stewart, Stanley Ralph Ross', null, 'One of the greatest superheroes of all time, Superman, takes to the air in this action-packed animated series. Disguised as Clark Kent, Superman uses his powers to overcome the forces of evil in a tireless crusade against crime and injustice.', 'One of the greatest superheroes of all time, Superman, takes to the air in this action-packed animated series. Disguised as Clark Kent, Superman uses his powers to overcome the forces of evil in a tireless crusade against crime and injustice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3f7IqbwUqtp5iRNMHXj7cUoTPOk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10223'),
  ('734958919299954567', 'Superman & Lois', 2021, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Greg Berlanti, Todd Helbing', null, 'Tyler Hoechlin, Elizabeth Tulloch, Alex Garfin, Michael Bishop', 'TV-14', 'After years of facing megalomaniacal supervillains, monsters wreaking havoc on Metropolis, and alien invaders intent on wiping out the human race, The Man of Steel aka Clark Kent and Lois Lane come face to face with one of their greatest challenges ever: dealing with all the stress, pressures and complexities that come with being working parents in today''s society.', 'After years of facing megalomaniacal supervillains, monsters wreaking havoc on Metropolis, and alien invaders intent on wiping out the human race, The Man of Steel aka Clark Kent and Lois Lane come face to face with one of their greatest challenges ever: dealing with all the stress, pressures and complexities that come with being working parents in today''s society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlv1gn98GqMnKHLSh0dNciqGfBl.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:95057'),
  ('24154737252352375', 'Superman: The Animated Series', 1996, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Bruce Timm, Alan Burnett', null, 'Tim Daly, Dana Delany', 'TV-PG', 'Superman, an incredibly powerful alien from the planet Krypton, defends Metropolis from supercriminals. Superman hides his identity behind the glasses of Clark Kent; a mild-mannered reporter for the newspaper the Daily Planet. At the Daily Planet Superman works with fellow reporter Lois Lane and photographer Jimmy Olsen.', 'Superman, an incredibly powerful alien from the planet Krypton, defends Metropolis from supercriminals. Superman hides his identity behind the glasses of Clark Kent; a mild-mannered reporter for the newspaper the Daily Planet. At the Daily Planet Superman works with fellow reporter Lois Lane and photographer Jimmy Olsen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p7FauEh0yeZtIPWnD3pBvG6j8sd.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:4303'),
  ('1106124409675438947', 'SuperMansion', 2015, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Zeb Wells, Matthew Senreich, Bryan Cranston', null, 'Bryan Cranston, Seth Green, Keegan-Michael Key, Jillian Bell, Tucker Gilmore, Tom Root, Zeb Wells, Chris Pine', 'NR', 'Aging superhero, Titanium Rex, and his has-been team known as The League of Freedom struggle to stay relevant in a changing world.', 'Aging superhero, Titanium Rex, and his has-been team known as The League of Freedom struggle to stay relevant in a changing world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Mv6oIo8bkWATYpZUzzvxT63Qyl.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:63214'),
  ('491813276773900732', 'Supermax', 2016, 'Crime, Mystery', 'José Alvarenga Jr., Fernando Bonassi, Marçal Aquino', 'Fernando Bonassi, Marçal Aquino', 'Mariana Ximenes, Cleo, Erom Cordeiro, Nicolas Trevijano, Rui Ricardo Diaz, Ravel Andrade, Maria Clara Spinelli, Bruno Bellarmino', 'TV-MA', 'Twelve people are confined together in an abandoned maximum security prison in the middle of the Amazon forest, and end up having to fight for their lives against unknown creatures and supernatural odds.', 'Twelve people are confined together in an abandoned maximum security prison in the middle of the Amazon forest, and end up having to fight for their lives against unknown creatures and supernatural odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qlZat8PZQjTxz3lUSoh9eDO8FVM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66890'),
  ('942300376969970691', 'Supernanny', 2005, 'Reality', null, null, 'Jo Frost', 'TV-Y7', 'Jo Frost, a modern day, tough-love "Mary Poppins" is placed with families in need of guidance or care. She spends an extended period of time with a family, observing their issues and then, using a series of her own tried-and-true methods, offer solutions. Problems can range from discipline to sloppiness or anything in between.', 'Jo Frost, a modern day, tough-love "Mary Poppins" is placed with families in need of guidance or care. She spends an extended period of time with a family, observing their issues and then, using a series of her own tried-and-true methods, offer solutions. Problems can range from discipline to sloppiness or anything in between.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ioSnygEfQ3nH26D6qEgDDOiXawm.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:26353'),
  ('640103465150185930', 'Supernatural', 1977, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Paul Müller', null, null, null, 'Supernatural is a 1977 British anthology television programme broadcast on BBC One. Each episode follows the Club of the Damned, where a prospective member is required to tell a horror story, and their application would be judged on how fright factor. Applicants who fail to tell a sufficiently frightening story are killed.', 'Supernatural is a 1977 British anthology television programme broadcast on BBC One. Each episode follows the Club of the Damned, where a prospective member is required to tell a horror story, and their application would be judged on how fright factor. Applicants who fail to tell a sufficiently frightening story are killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWCmwXnHdAF7lhhRkhwxspR8Y0a.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13836'),
  ('48603513638496880', 'Supernatural', 2005, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Eric Kripke', 'Talli Buchanan', 'Jared Padalecki, Jensen Ackles, Misha Collins', 'TV-14', 'When they were boys, Sam and Dean Winchester lost their mother to a mysterious and demonic supernatural force. Subsequently, their father raised them to be soldiers. He taught them about the paranormal evil that lives in the dark corners and on the back roads of America ... and he taught them how to kill it. Now, the Winchester brothers crisscross the country in their ''67 Chevy Impala, battling every kind of supernatural threat they encounter along the way.', 'When they were boys, Sam and Dean Winchester lost their mother to a mysterious and demonic supernatural force. Subsequently, their father raised them to be soldiers. He taught them about the paranormal evil that lives in the dark corners and on the back roads of America ... and he taught them how to kill it. Now, the Winchester brothers crisscross the country in their ''67 Chevy Impala, battling every kind of supernatural threat they encounter along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8iixmfGx5EIFPdpNvB2JvI3VIqX.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:1622'),
  ('34967031031465525', 'Supernatural Academy', 2022, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shannon Chan-Kent, Bethany Brown, Alessandro Juliani, Gigi Saul Guerrero, Cardi Wong, Kathleen Barr, Barbara Kottmeier, Larissa Albuquerque', 'TV-14', 'After discovering they are dragon-marked and cursed to serve the evil Dragon King, adversarial werewolf twins must trust each other to save themselves, their Supernatural Academy and the world.', 'After discovering they are dragon-marked and cursed to serve the evil Dragon King, adversarial werewolf twins must trust each other to save themselves, their Supernatural Academy and the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ZCngZIuBPaocJyiQHlyFecUpru.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:153268'),
  ('327754298704032532', 'Supernatural: The Anime Series', 2011, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Eric Kripke', null, 'Hiroki Touchi, Yuuya Uchida, Takashi Taniguchi, Takaya Hashi, Naoya Uchida, Nana Mizuki, Mie Sonozaki, Seiko Tamura', 'TV-14', 'The anime re-imagining of the original live-action series follows the Winchester brothers Sam and Dean as they hunt creatures and other supernatural phenomena in the American countryside. The storyline covers the first two seasons of the live-action version, as well as original episodes.', 'The anime re-imagining of the original live-action series follows the Winchester brothers Sam and Dean as they hunt creatures and other supernatural phenomena in the American countryside. The storyline covers the first two seasons of the live-action version, as well as original episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4dHiX4cui1Zk0d6nwONSx3jQ8Zf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32871'),
  ('526999650510045829', 'Supernova', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Ruggero Pasquarelli, Carolina Kopelioff, Nancy Dupláa, Inés Estévez, Johanna Chiefo, Marina Bellati, Diego Cremonesi', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdD3N9sSUMuBkWFXYv5fShMANVs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:136947'),
  ('371809207288762658', 'Superpowered: The DC Story', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Rebecca Ratliff Cameron', null, 'Rosario Dawson', 'TV-14', 'This docuseries takes an unprecedented look at the enduring and influential legacy of DC, allowing fans to rediscover the universe of characters, as well as the iconic comic book company’s origins, its evolution and its nearly nine-decade cultural impact across every artistic medium.', 'This docuseries takes an unprecedented look at the enduring and influential legacy of DC, allowing fans to rediscover the universe of characters, as well as the iconic comic book company’s origins, its evolution and its nearly nine-decade cultural impact across every artistic medium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MKY8LIUIXPNUHIWneadd5dqPXF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229516'),
