  ('539855738109713617', 'Suppose a Kid from the Last Dungeon Boonies Moved to a Starter Town?', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Madoka Asahina, Yumiri Hanamori, Miku Ito, Ai Kayano, Minami Tsuda, Natsumi Hioka, Mao Ichimichi, Seiichiro Yamashita', 'TV-14', 'Lloyd is a novice adventurer whose dream is to discover “true strength” in the capital he’s always admired, despite growing up with neighbors who always considered him weak. The story starts with him departing from his hometown, which just so happens to be located right next to…one of the most dangerous dungeons in the world?!', 'Lloyd is a novice adventurer whose dream is to discover “true strength” in the capital he’s always admired, despite growing up with neighbors who always considered him weak. The story starts with him departing from his hometown, which just so happens to be located right next to…one of the most dangerous dungeons in the world?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5UqT4a8ep7vI9D1XrucBYKV4CB8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100825'),
