  ('1015202737989455915', 'Taiketsu', 2026, 'Mystery', null, null, 'Wakana Matsumoto, Honami Suzuki, Atsuko Takahata, Hana Toyoshima, Koji Ishizaka, Sakurako Ohara, Koji Ohkura, Ikkei Watanabe', null, 'When a sharp-eyed newspaper journalist begins investigating a powerful medical university director, two women hardened by injustice in a male-dominated world find themselves on opposing sides—locked in a fierce clash of ambition, belief, and truth.', 'When a sharp-eyed newspaper journalist begins investigating a powerful medical university director, two women hardened by injustice in a male-dominated world find themselves on opposing sides—locked in a fierce clash of ambition, belief, and truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ygfB3iJBktJzksJl9BSdRDhXRJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:313899'),
  ('773264956397013491', 'Taikouki', 1965, 'Drama', null, null, 'Sunaga Hiroshi, Ken Ogata, Shiho Fujimura, Yoshiko Mita, Chieko Naniwa, Masakazu Tamura, Shūji Sano, Kyū Sazanka', null, 'Based on the life of Hideyoshi Toyotomi (February 2, 1537 – September 18, 1598) a Sengoku period daimyo who unified Japan.', 'Based on the life of Hideyoshi Toyotomi (February 2, 1537 – September 18, 1598) a Sengoku period daimyo who unified Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdTjNOEAxpL9r0l72BwOzVpv2sD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:118138'),
  ('373880708112423827', 'Taira no Kiyomori', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Kenichi Matsuyama, Kiichi Nakai, Shota Matsuda, Arata Iura, Fumiyo Kohinata, Yudai Chiba, Hiroshi Tamaki, Rei Dan', null, 'Villain or hero, Taira no Kiyomori changed Japanese history forever 900 years ago. Without ever knowing his real father, Kiyomori was raised as a samurai. Together with his stepfather, he wiped out piracy along Japan''s western coast, becoming a full-fledged warrior samurai. In an age when samurai were looked down on as members of the lower class, Kiyomori was skillful at winning the hearts and minds of the people. By rounding up surrendered pirates and achieving other successes, Kiyomori eventually became the de facto ruler of Japan.', 'Villain or hero, Taira no Kiyomori changed Japanese history forever 900 years ago. Without ever knowing his real father, Kiyomori was raised as a samurai. Together with his stepfather, he wiped out piracy along Japan''s western coast, becoming a full-fledged warrior samurai. In an age when samurai were looked down on as members of the lower class, Kiyomori was skillful at winning the hearts and minds of the people. By rounding up surrendered pirates and achieving other successes, Kiyomori eventually became the de facto ruler of Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azpWUUJBApctlG8cJoCTpFPLuyk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:41099'),
  ('742037267646900208', 'Taisho Era Contract Marriage ~ The Substitute Bride and a Soldier''s Fierce Love', 2024, 'Animation', null, null, 'Junta Terashima, Yua Miyuki, Mashiro Satou', null, 'I used to think there was no love in marriage... Until I met a fierce and passionate soldier! Despite being the daughter of a viscount, Asako is rejected by high society and treated as a nuisance by her parents. When a marriage proposal arrives suddenly for Asako''s younger sister from none other than Captain Kido, a soldier known for his coldness, she doesn''t hesitate for a moment. To protect her precious younger sister, Asako volunteers as... a substitute bride!', 'I used to think there was no love in marriage... Until I met a fierce and passionate soldier! Despite being the daughter of a viscount, Asako is rejected by high society and treated as a nuisance by her parents. When a marriage proposal arrives suddenly for Asako''s younger sister from none other than Captain Kido, a soldier known for his coldness, she doesn''t hesitate for a moment. To protect her precious younger sister, Asako volunteers as... a substitute bride!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/adLuRUaIzy44nUExYjUix2ZKjqM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:271026'),
  ('142417047277109728', 'Taisho Otome Fairy Tale', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Yusuke Kobayashi, Saya Aizawa, Yume Miyamoto, Chika Anzai, Ayasa Ito, Shunichi Toki', 'TV-14', 'Tamahiko Shima has been exiled to the country because of his disability, but the sudden arrival of an arranged bride upends his lonely life.', 'Tamahiko Shima has been exiled to the country because of his disability, but the sudden arrival of an arranged bride upends his lonely life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZps2MzUSyrXUu6cq40oivxaxU6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114937'),
  ('894497462646949167', 'Taiwan Crime Stories', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Anthology crime television series inspired by four real-life cold cases in Taiwan, exploring themes such as faith, temptation, redemption, and obligation through the eyes of the people of Taiwan.', 'Anthology crime television series inspired by four real-life cold cases in Taiwan, exploring themes such as faith, temptation, redemption, and obligation through the eyes of the people of Taiwan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aAruJgIiauzZXhxvRUm8IyoQq9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197294'),
  ('291399785299741103', 'Taiwan Tornado', 2004, 'Drama, Soap', null, null, 'Chen Chao-jung, Elsie Yeh, Franco Chiang, Miao Ke-li, Grace Chen, Daisy Fong, Rene Hou, Hung-Hsuan Fan', null, 'Chi-Chung Huang is the second son of the Huang family, which owns Taiwan Chao-Lian Group. Chi-Chung and his older brother, Chi-Long Huang, bribe the prosecutor for a death penalty case that his family is involved in. However, the prosecutor changes his mind about the matter. Chi-Chung leads his men to confront the prosecutor, who later falls off an elevated expressway and dies. To lay low for a while, Chi-Chung accepts his brother''s arrangement and goes into hiding in the southern region of Taiwan. However, after he arrives there, he is controlled by a crime syndicate. After he is drugged and becomes hardly conscious, he inadvertently rapes Chia-Yi, who is a nice good girl. After the rape, Chia-Yi swears to get Chi-Chung to face up the legal consequences; later, she finds she is impregnated by Chi-Chung, and this strengthens her will to fight a battle between the rich (Chi-Chung) and the poor (herself). As a storm is quietly approaching, who will turn out to be the winner?', 'Chi-Chung Huang is the second son of the Huang family, which owns Taiwan Chao-Lian Group. Chi-Chung and his older brother, Chi-Long Huang, bribe the prosecutor for a death penalty case that his family is involved in. However, the prosecutor changes his mind about the matter. Chi-Chung leads his men to confront the prosecutor, who later falls off an elevated expressway and dies. To lay low for a while, Chi-Chung accepts his brother''s arrangement and goes into hiding in the southern region of Taiwan. However, after he arrives there, he is controlled by a crime syndicate. After he is drugged and becomes hardly conscious, he inadvertently rapes Chia-Yi, who is a nice good girl. After the rape, Chia-Yi swears to get Chi-Chung to face up the legal consequences; later, she finds she is impregnated by Chi-Chung, and this strengthens her will to fight a battle between the rich (Chi-Chung) and the poor (herself). As a storm is quietly approaching, who will turn out to be the winner?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7CtR5Pe8BqAMCwd109bvT0Tv66m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:225041'),
  ('953567241773892222', 'Taiyo Sentai Sun Vulcan', 1981, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Kids', null, null, 'Takayuki Godai, Ryusuke Kawasaki, Kinya Sugi, Asao Kobayashi, Yumi Nemoto, Shin Kishida, Shozo Iizuka, Machiko Soga', null, 'Taiyo Sentai Sun Vulcan is the fifth season in Toei Company''s Super Sentai tokusatsu television series. It was broadcast from February 7, 1981, to January 30, 1982, and is the only Super Sentai series to serve as a direct sequel to its previous series and the only all-male Super Sentai team. Its international English title as listed by Toei is simply Sun Vulcan. This was the last Sentai season to be co-produced with Marvel Comics.', 'Taiyo Sentai Sun Vulcan is the fifth season in Toei Company''s Super Sentai tokusatsu television series. It was broadcast from February 7, 1981, to January 30, 1982, and is the only Super Sentai series to serve as a direct sequel to its previous series and the only all-male Super Sentai team. Its international English title as listed by Toei is simply Sun Vulcan. This was the last Sentai season to be co-produced with Marvel Comics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNuKqRZjPMnlQQXV5k7tZ1USgR5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2847'),
  ('936697678374064553', 'Tak and the Power of Juju', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Jed Spingarn', null, 'Hal Sparks, Kari Wahlgren, John DiMaggio, Lloyd Sherr, Maurice LaMarche, Patrick Warburton, Dannah Feinglass Phirman', 'TV-Y7', 'Tak is a preteen shaman tasked with protecting the Pupununu tribe from certain destruction with his newfound gift: the power of juju. With it, he can cast spells, explore new worlds, and summon powerful creatures at the wave of his magic staff. Unfortunately, however, Tak''s magic has a habit of causing more trouble than it fixes.', 'Tak is a preteen shaman tasked with protecting the Pupununu tribe from certain destruction with his newfound gift: the power of juju. With it, he can cast spells, explore new worlds, and summon powerful creatures at the wave of his magic staff. Unfortunately, however, Tak''s magic has a habit of causing more trouble than it fixes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hnrB9flPVeV9BuZknPXGhPhdSi3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5340'),
  ('585318446793969598', 'Takara-kun and Amagi-kun', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hanage no Mai', null, 'Arata Sato, Oriyama Nao, Rio Komiya, Kosuke Suzuki, Nasu Taito, Futa Sakaguchi, Sakai Sho', null, 'A popular teen and a cheerful classmate fall into a secret romance, facing insecurities and learning to meet each other halfway.', 'A popular teen and a cheerful classmate fall into a secret romance, facing insecurities and learning to meet each other halfway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82hbx0gesxl2nNEM12mk3wvM7dH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:205988'),
  ('1055701913203448949', 'Takara''s Treasure', 2024, 'Drama', 'Suzumaru Minta', null, 'Yoji Iwase, Eito Konishi, Ui Mihara, Kento Yamada, Gaku Sano, Mari Nishio', null, 'Taishin moves to Tokyo to reunite with Takara, who once comforted him, only to face initial rejection. Undeterred, he pursues a heartfelt connection.', 'Taishin moves to Tokyo to reunite with Takara, who once comforted him, only to face initial rejection. Undeterred, he pursues a heartfelt connection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4o4Q4KHzdfrz0HnhGLOlNX1wF0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:254724'),
  ('871858563579182075', 'Take Care Your Highness', 1985, 'Drama', null, null, 'Andy Lau, Carina Lau, Paul Chun Pui, Sean Lau Ching-wan, Vivian Tsang, Maggie Shiu, Danny Poon Wang-Ban, Ha Yue', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQmS41UFo0drBwfFmWE0fpPcWcv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108063'),
  ('220137925589568516', 'Take Two', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Andrew W. Marlowe, Terri Edda Miller', null, 'Eddie Cibrian, Rachel Bilson, Xavier de Guzman, Alice Lee, Aliyah O''Brien', 'TV-PG', 'Sam Swift, the former star of a hit cop series whose epic breakdown is broadcast to the public and sends her to rehab. Desperate to restart her career, she talks her way into shadowing lone-wolf private investigator Eddie Valetik as research for a potential comeback role. Though Eddie resents the babysitting gig, high-spirited Sam uses the skills she learned as an actor playing a cop and proves herself to be surprisingly valuable.', 'Sam Swift, the former star of a hit cop series whose epic breakdown is broadcast to the public and sends her to rehab. Desperate to restart her career, she talks her way into shadowing lone-wolf private investigator Eddie Valetik as research for a potential comeback role. Though Eddie resents the babysitting gig, high-spirited Sam uses the skills she learned as an actor playing a cop and proves herself to be surprisingly valuable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rpC3eIoOyRY8LwDohZ8QehpeU7R.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79928'),
  ('146052979046459275', 'Take Two with Phineas and Ferb', 2010, 'Talk, Kids, Animation, Comedy', 'Jeff ''Swampy'' Marsh, Dan Povenmire', null, null, 'TV-G', 'Have you ever wanted to see Jack Black interviewed by cartoon characters? Now''s your chance. Step brothers Phineas Flynn and Ferb Fletcher have an animated talk show set complete with a desk, chairs and skyline backdrop. Each episode, a celebrity (in live-action form) takes a seat on the cartoon set and answers questions posed by the titular pair.', 'Have you ever wanted to see Jack Black interviewed by cartoon characters? Now''s your chance. Step brothers Phineas Flynn and Ferb Fletcher have an animated talk show set complete with a desk, chairs and skyline backdrop. Each episode, a celebrity (in live-action form) takes a seat on the cartoon set and answers questions posed by the titular pair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGYkSD9wyazXtMlIEXNhpf8slXz.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:34406'),
  ('613578335076729332', 'Take Us Home: Leeds United', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Russell Crowe, Andrea Radrizzani, Marcelo Bielsa, Kalvin Phillips', 'TV-14', 'English football''s famous ''fallen giant'' Leeds United is at the start of a journey: to win promotion back to the Premier League. New owner Andrea Radrizzani has recruited a world-class head coach, Marcelo Bielsa, to lead the team back to the promised land. This will be one of the most dramatic seasons in the club''s history as fans, players and a city start to dream of a return to the top flight.', 'English football''s famous ''fallen giant'' Leeds United is at the start of a journey: to win promotion back to the Premier League. New owner Andrea Radrizzani has recruited a world-class head coach, Marcelo Bielsa, to lead the team back to the promised land. This will be one of the most dramatic seasons in the club''s history as fans, players and a city start to dream of a return to the top flight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWZhvLFWVz0C6eOXZqPXsQ6AORp.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:92432'),
  ('245254290920003707', 'Taken', 2002, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Leslie Bohem', null, 'Dakota Fanning, Matt Frewer, Emily Bergl, Heather Donahue, Joel Gretsch, Adam Kaufman, Camille Sullivan', null, 'The show takes place from 1944 to 2002 and follows the lives of three families: the Crawfords, who seek to cover up the Roswell crash and the existence of aliens; the Keys, who are subject to frequent experimentation by the aliens; and the Clarkes, who sheltered one of the surviving aliens from the crash.', 'The show takes place from 1944 to 2002 and follows the lives of three families: the Crawfords, who seek to cover up the Roswell crash and the existence of aliens; the Keys, who are subject to frequent experimentation by the aliens; and the Clarkes, who sheltered one of the surviving aliens from the crash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFMBPZvgbvhnpCW8YfYakNB2xrT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2432'),
  ('750809819237023090', 'Taken', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Alexander Cary', null, 'Clive Standen, Jennifer Beals, Adam Goldberg, Jessica Camacho', 'TV-MA', 'The origin story of younger, hungrier, former Green Beret Bryan Mills as he deals with a personal tragedy that shakes his world. As he fights to overcome the incident and exact revenge, Mills is pulled into a career as a deadly CIA operative, a job that awakens his very particular, and very dangerous, set of skills.', 'The origin story of younger, hungrier, former Green Beret Bryan Mills as he deals with a personal tragedy that shakes his world. As he fights to overcome the incident and exact revenge, Mills is pulled into a career as a deadly CIA operative, a job that awakens his very particular, and very dangerous, set of skills.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5TgdridU2w1pVsbQB2pt1xvazBX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:68006'),
  ('458653922501625435', 'Takeshi''s Castle', 2002, 'Comedy, Reality', 'Takeshi Kitano', null, 'Mary Scheer, Joey de Leon, Craig Charles, John Cervenka, Takeshi Kitano, Saburo Ishikura', null, 'Takeshi''s Castle was a Japanese game show that aired between 1986 and 1990 on the Tokyo Broadcasting System. It featured the Japanese actor Takeshi Kitano as a count who owns a castle and sets up difficult challenges for players to get to him. Contestants throw themselves into daunting physical challenges as they attempt to storm Takeshi''s Castle and win the grand prize of one million yen. The show has become a cult television hit around the world. A special live "revival" was broadcast on April 2, 2005, for TBS''s 50th anniversary celebrations.', 'Takeshi''s Castle was a Japanese game show that aired between 1986 and 1990 on the Tokyo Broadcasting System. It featured the Japanese actor Takeshi Kitano as a count who owns a castle and sets up difficult challenges for players to get to him. Contestants throw themselves into daunting physical challenges as they attempt to storm Takeshi''s Castle and win the grand prize of one million yen. The show has become a cult television hit around the world. A special live "revival" was broadcast on April 2, 2005, for TBS''s 50th anniversary celebrations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rSiau1StRsoiaR9Jdxa2rQIML2.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:5689'),
  ('572987266812689270', 'Takeshi''s Castle Japan', 2023, 'Reality, Comedy', null, null, 'Takeshi Kitano, Hayato Tani, Kuro-chan, Hollywood Zakoshisyoh', null, 'Worldwide sensation Takeshi''s Castle returns after 34 years! Popular games are revived on a larger scale and new, terrifying obstacles appear one after another. The lord of the castle, Beat Takeshi, entrusts BANANAMAN to protect it. Subaru Kimura is the attack force''s new leader. The elite team gathers to bring down the revived Takeshi''s Castle. The greatest battle in history begins!', 'Worldwide sensation Takeshi''s Castle returns after 34 years! Popular games are revived on a larger scale and new, terrifying obstacles appear one after another. The lord of the castle, Beat Takeshi, entrusts BANANAMAN to protect it. Subaru Kimura is the attack force''s new leader. The elite team gathers to bring down the revived Takeshi''s Castle. The greatest battle in history begins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4Yeff1QRH6YbAXMXbsnIVp0Qrq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:225072'),
  ('789261200847446907', 'Takin'' Over the Asylum', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Donna Franceschild', null, 'David Tennant, Angus Macfadyen, Ken Stott, Katy Murphy, Angela Bruce, Elizabeth Spriggs, Ruth McCabe, Kenneth Bryans', 'TV-14', 'A salesman starts to run a hospital radio station inside a facility for people with mental heath needs.', 'A salesman starts to run a hospital radio station inside a facility for people with mental heath needs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y8jjCpykDbgyz98K54uRWIZmEo1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2601'),
  ('30689637751237883', 'Takkema', 2026, 'Drama, Family', null, null, null, null, 'TAKKEMA follows the journey of brilliant, independent women facing the challenge of finding a partner who can match their ambitions. In a male-dominated society, they search for that rare bird: a husband willing to step aside and let them shine. Confronted with growing loneliness, these women decide to break the mold and take control of their own happiness. This quest for love, full of twists and turns, will shake up both their certainties and societal prejudices.', 'TAKKEMA follows the journey of brilliant, independent women facing the challenge of finding a partner who can match their ambitions. In a male-dominated society, they search for that rare bird: a husband willing to step aside and let them shine. Confronted with growing loneliness, these women decide to break the mold and take control of their own happiness. This quest for love, full of twists and turns, will shake up both their certainties and societal prejudices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LL1dSxjYTylLBncRcqyBARVzD8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:318864'),
  ('329859204518432074', 'Takopi''s Original Sin', 2025, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kurumi Mamiya, Reina Ueda, Konomi Kohara, Anna Nagase', null, 'A Happy alien, Takopi, lands on Earth with one mission: to spread happiness! When he meets Shizuka, a lonely fourth grader, he vows to bring back her smile using his magical Happy Gadgets. But as he uncovers the pain in her life, Takopi learns that true happiness may require more than gadgets.', 'A Happy alien, Takopi, lands on Earth with one mission: to spread happiness! When he meets Shizuka, a lonely fourth grader, he vows to bring back her smile using his magical Happy Gadgets. But as he uncovers the pain in her life, Takopi learns that true happiness may require more than gadgets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPXDVhVKt0XM34ihoUVMHtLYTw8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:284445'),
  ('777940249823779721', 'takt op.Destiny', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Koki Uchiyama, Shion Wakayama, Kaede Hondo', 'TV-14', 'Music is the light that illuminates people''s hearts-- and that "light" was suddenly taken from the world. The world changed the night the black "Kuroya Meteorite" fell. Grotesque monsters known as D2 emerged from the meteorite and began to overrun the land and people. As the D2 were drawn to melodies people played, eventually "music" itself became taboo. However, those who opposed the monsters appeared. They the "Musicart," girls who draw power from music. They possess the great operas and musical scores of humanity history and use them to defeat the D2.', 'Music is the light that illuminates people''s hearts-- and that "light" was suddenly taken from the world. The world changed the night the black "Kuroya Meteorite" fell. Grotesque monsters known as D2 emerged from the meteorite and began to overrun the land and people. As the D2 were drawn to melodies people played, eventually "music" itself became taboo. However, those who opposed the monsters appeared. They the "Musicart," girls who draw power from music. They possess the great operas and musical scores of humanity history and use them to defeat the D2.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6oN7SJPj62Q04tRy9LLI3DrYTc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121787'),
  ('559284995042728646', 'Tal para cual', 2022, 'Comedy, Family', 'César González, Alonso Villalpando, Reynaldo Lopéz Lopéz', null, 'Consuelo Duval, Reynaldo Rossano, Lorena de la Garza, Maribel Fernández, Nicole Vale, Javier Carranza, Hugo Villafuerte Alcantara', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rv1wZJQYfBKD708SJxduxIYjWtd.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:212361'),
  ('242487860767277452', 'Talamasca: The Secret Order', 2025, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'John Lee Hancock', null, 'Nicholas Denton, Céline Buckens, Maisie Richardson-Sellers, William Fichtner, Elizabeth McGovern', 'TV-MA', 'Guy Anatole joins the clandestine world of the Talamasca, an international spy agency for the immortal universe, as he searches for answers to his family''s own part in the supernatural world.', 'Guy Anatole joins the clandestine world of the Talamasca, an international spy agency for the immortal universe, as he searches for answers to his family''s own part in the supernatural world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmmHl3EiFKuDLTVYHGwlV9UhtNw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:256624'),
  ('227017194697086849', 'Tale of Arang', 2012, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Lee Joon-gi, Shin Min-a, Han Jung-soo, Hwang Bo-ra, Yoo Seung-ho, Yeon Woo-jin, Min Sung-wook, Park Jun-gyu', null, 'The foolhardy ghost of the young girl Arang seeks to discover the truth behind her unjust death and meets a magistrate named Eunoh, who has the ability to see ghosts.', 'The foolhardy ghost of the young girl Arang seeks to discover the truth behind her unjust death and meets a magistrate named Eunoh, who has the ability to see ghosts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yCe8tPm3PqY0HRq9UJeaMWTmn7m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44952'),
  ('404689093441747825', 'Tale of the Nine Tailed', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Comedy, Mystery', 'Han Woo-ri', 'Han Woo-ri', 'Lee Dong-wook, Cho Bo-ah, Kim Bum, Kim Yong-ji, Hwang Hee, Kim Jung-nan, An Kil-kang, Kim Hee-jung', 'TV-14', 'A TV producer discovers a secret supernatural world as she becomes entangled with a former deity who''s spent centuries searching for his lost lover.', 'A TV producer discovers a secret supernatural world as she becomes entangled with a former deity who''s spent centuries searching for his lost lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jXx9vLO9bwKxl81oVQnzEH7960V.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108284'),
  ('620596167509899740', 'Tale of the Nine Tailed 1938', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Jo Nam-hyung, Kang Shin-hyo', 'Han Woo-ri', 'Lee Dong-wook, Kim So-yeon, Kim Bum, Ryu Kyung-soo, Kim Yong-ji, Kim Jung-nan, Hwang Hee, An Kil-kang', null, 'A K-fantasy action unfolds as the Nine-tailed fox makes a crash landing in the year 1938, an era of chaos, and he struggles to return to the present.', 'A K-fantasy action unfolds as the Nine-tailed fox makes a crash landing in the year 1938, an era of chaos, and he struggles to return to the present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xB55oDrJiIYn2yeC9YNy1KJ4rl5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201019'),
  ('1090183125672943760', 'Talentless Nana', 2020, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', null, null, 'Rumi Okubo, Hiro Shimono, Yuichi Nakamura, Mai Nakahara, Toshiki Masuda, Takuya Nakashima, Yuki Inoue, Takeo Otsuka', 'TV-14', 'It is the year 20XX. Earth was assaulted by monsters that would come to be known as "the Enemy of Humanity." In order to deal with this threat, special schools composed of teenagers with extraordinary abilities were formed. These people, who came to be known as "the Talented," had abilities that could defy the rules of reality. Among these people with supernatural powers was an outlier, an individual who was sent to one of these schools despite having no innate special abilities whatsoever. This is the story of our protagonist, who attempts to defeat the Enemies of Humanity through the use of intelligence and manipulation alone.', 'It is the year 20XX. Earth was assaulted by monsters that would come to be known as "the Enemy of Humanity." In order to deal with this threat, special schools composed of teenagers with extraordinary abilities were formed. These people, who came to be known as "the Talented," had abilities that could defy the rules of reality. Among these people with supernatural powers was an outlier, an individual who was sent to one of these schools despite having no innate special abilities whatsoever. This is the story of our protagonist, who attempts to defeat the Enemies of Humanity through the use of intelligence and manipulation alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/erj3B3eRpcd9CEPN55IAY8aupwc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:101571'),
  ('624538181947036569', 'Tales', 2017, 'Drama', 'Irv Gotti', null, 'Shariff Earp, Gjee Wade II', 'TV-MA', 'A one-hour anthology series that distills classic hip-hop records and reimagines them as cinematic love letters.', 'A one-hour anthology series that distills classic hip-hop records and reimagines them as cinematic love letters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23r1202xCi2ojbj61COCsa1KGt6.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:72432'),
  ('557197448714393279', 'Tales by Light', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Abraham Joffe', 'Abraham Joffe, Fred El-Harris', null, null, 'Behind every powerful image is a powerful story. Uniting exploration, photography and the natural world, Tales By Light follows photographers from Australia and around the world as they push the limits of their craft.', 'Behind every powerful image is a powerful story. Uniting exploration, photography and the natural world, Tales By Light follows photographers from Australia and around the world as they push the limits of their craft.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ox7D4DIe5jW1MzMzn43yc3OE6ES.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:73061'),
