  ('95201189880825141', 'Tales from the Crypt', 1989, 'Comedy, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'William M. Gaines, Steven Dodd', null, 'John Kassir', 'TV-MA', 'Cadaverous scream legend the Crypt Keeper is your macabre host for these forays of fright and fun based on the classic E.C. Comics tales from back in the day. So shamble up to the bar and pick your poison. Will it be an insane Santa on a personal slay ride? Honeymooners out to fulfill the "til death do we part" vow ASAP?', 'Cadaverous scream legend the Crypt Keeper is your macabre host for these forays of fright and fun based on the classic E.C. Comics tales from back in the day. So shamble up to the bar and pick your poison. Will it be an insane Santa on a personal slay ride? Honeymooners out to fulfill the "til death do we part" vow ASAP?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/265Gpw7wSwwMkUQlksot8B2chRg.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:2391'),
  ('114667987388167907', 'Tales from the Cryptkeeper', 1993, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Libby Hinson, Ben Joseph', null, 'John Kassir', 'TV-Y7', 'Tales from the Cryptkeeper is an animated series aimed at children made by Nelvana Limited, PeaceArch Entertainment, kaBOOM! Entertainment and Warner Bros. Television Animation. It was shown on TVO and ABC, and is still shown near Halloween on Teletoon. It was based on the live-action television show, Tales from the Crypt, which aired concurrently on HBO. Being directed at children, Tales From the Cryptkeeper was significantly milder than the live-action HBO version.', 'Tales from the Cryptkeeper is an animated series aimed at children made by Nelvana Limited, PeaceArch Entertainment, kaBOOM! Entertainment and Warner Bros. Television Animation. It was shown on TVO and ABC, and is still shown near Halloween on Teletoon. It was based on the live-action television show, Tales from the Crypt, which aired concurrently on HBO. Being directed at children, Tales From the Cryptkeeper was significantly milder than the live-action HBO version.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ycalUVnbEHj6LC8EMSI73jSOCu.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:13455'),
  ('348934923000939200', 'Tales from the Darkside', 1984, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'George A. Romero', null, 'Paul Sparer', 'TV-14', 'Tales from the Darkside is an anthology horror TV series created by George A. Romero, each episode was an individual short story that ended with a plot twist. The series'' episodes spanned the genres of horror, science fiction, and fantasy, and some episodes featured elements of black comedy or more lighthearted themes.', 'Tales from the Darkside is an anthology horror TV series created by George A. Romero, each episode was an individual short story that ended with a plot twist. The series'' episodes spanned the genres of horror, science fiction, and fantasy, and some episodes featured elements of black comedy or more lighthearted themes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dlpqUF9io9Sl00jb7vhlqaTyFvq.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1386'),
  ('120264305035569765', 'Tales from the Loop', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Nathaniel Halpern', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'The story of the town and people who live above “The Loop,” a machine built to unlock and explore the mysteries of the universe – making things possible that were previously relegated only to science fiction.', 'The story of the town and people who live above “The Loop,” a machine built to unlock and explore the mysteries of the universe – making things possible that were previously relegated only to science fiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/56D0QFyLhrRp1ZTBz8Gw10qtZas.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93784'),
  ('85305207431138701', 'Tales from the Neverending Story', 2001, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Kids', 'Leila Basen, Michael Springat, David Preston', null, 'Mark Rendall, Johnny Griffin, Brittany Drisdelle, Valérie Chiniara, Stefano Faustini', null, 'Twelve-year-old Bastian Balthazar Bux had lost the wonderful imagination he had as a child somewhere between growing older, watching TV, going to school and playing with his Gameboy. But when his mother dies suddenly, Bastian''s limitless imagination is reborn. Bastian comes across a magical book, ''The Neverending Story,'' in a curious little bookstore. Inspired by the book, Bastian creates an enchanted world called Fantasia, inhabited by dragons, dark knights and assorted heroes and villains.', 'Twelve-year-old Bastian Balthazar Bux had lost the wonderful imagination he had as a child somewhere between growing older, watching TV, going to school and playing with his Gameboy. But when his mother dies suddenly, Bastian''s limitless imagination is reborn. Bastian comes across a magical book, ''The Neverending Story,'' in a curious little bookstore. Inspired by the book, Bastian creates an enchanted world called Fantasia, inhabited by dragons, dark knights and assorted heroes and villains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5WsO2qPQNdr7njiFg6XurxrEXp1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1479'),
  ('868570070488337440', 'Tales of Demons and Gods', 2017, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Su Shangqing, Zhixiao Liu, Zhang Ni, Qiege Qin, 柳川鱼', 'TV-14', 'In his past life, although too weak to protect his home when it counted, out of grave determination Nie Li became the strongest Demon Spiritist and stood at the pinnacle of the martial world. However, he lost his life during the battle with the Sage Emperor and six deity-ranked beasts. His soul was then brought back to when he was still 13 years old. Although he''s the weakest in his class with the lowest talent, having only a red soul realm and a weak one at that, with the aid of the vast knowledge which he accumulated from his previous life, he decided to train faster than anyone could expect. He also decided to help those who died nobly in his previous life to train faster as well. He aims to protect the city from the coming future of being devastated by demon beasts and the previous fate of ending up destroyed. He aims to protect his lover, friends, family and fellow citizens who died in the beast assault or its aftermath.', 'In his past life, although too weak to protect his home when it counted, out of grave determination Nie Li became the strongest Demon Spiritist and stood at the pinnacle of the martial world. However, he lost his life during the battle with the Sage Emperor and six deity-ranked beasts. His soul was then brought back to when he was still 13 years old. Although he''s the weakest in his class with the lowest talent, having only a red soul realm and a weak one at that, with the aid of the vast knowledge which he accumulated from his previous life, he decided to train faster than anyone could expect. He also decided to help those who died nobly in his previous life to train faster as well. He aims to protect the city from the coming future of being devastated by demon beasts and the previous fate of ending up destroyed. He aims to protect his lover, friends, family and fellow citizens who died in the beast assault or its aftermath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1YzVxVFGGskTPNm31Je266Mtrne.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76806'),
  ('553296725899389127', 'Tales of Herding Gods', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Zhai Zhu', null, 'Zhang Ruoyu, Yao Mingshun, Xin Li, Cheng Yuzhu, Du Qingqing, Xiao Xu YU, Gao Sihang, Tang Hao', 'TV-14', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6q3k6lUvjbYdgQyqIGVaY9VlAm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:236534'),
  ('392336362989452693', 'Tales of Innocence', 2018, 'Drama', 'Feride Kaytan, Barış Erçetin', null, 'Ayça Ayşin Turan, Furkan Andıç, Cemal Toktas, Açelya Topaloğlu, Bestemsu Özdemir, Sema Öztürk, Uğur Çavuşoğlu, Serenay Aktaş', 'NR', 'In the aftermath of an accident, a naive girl finds herself torn between an unscrupulous prosecutor, and a vindictive plaintiff.', 'In the aftermath of an accident, a naive girl finds herself torn between an unscrupulous prosecutor, and a vindictive plaintiff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bLKk3uwRERJasM9gMoTB7AQIjFp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77551'),
  ('360053742824110449', 'Tales of Little Women', 1987, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Rei Sakuma, Ranko Mizuki, Keiko Han, Kozo Shioya, Eiko Yamada, Mayumi Shou, Nobuo Tobita, Osamu Saka', null, 'Meg, Jo, Beth and Amy are four loving March sisters living with their mother in the USA during the Civil War. Their father is a military doctor fighting in the Union Army. After a terrible battle in a neighbour town, the Confederates pass through their town and burn it. Over the ruins of their house the March family also learn that the factory in which their father invested all his money has been burnt too. Homeless and pennyless, the family heads towards Newcord, where the father''s aunt lives, hoping for the old lady to help them. The girls try to adjust to their new life, face many hardships, meet new friends and wish to the war to be over at last.', 'Meg, Jo, Beth and Amy are four loving March sisters living with their mother in the USA during the Civil War. Their father is a military doctor fighting in the Union Army. After a terrible battle in a neighbour town, the Confederates pass through their town and burn it. Over the ruins of their house the March family also learn that the factory in which their father invested all his money has been burnt too. Homeless and pennyless, the family heads towards Newcord, where the father''s aunt lives, hoping for the old lady to help them. The girls try to adjust to their new life, face many hardships, meet new friends and wish to the war to be over at last.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9R3NbsclWBNZwaK9hRd2in3aUl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21618'),
  ('778770655815811262', 'Tales of the Bizarre', 1990, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', null, null, 'Tamori', null, 'Inspired by American TV movies like "Hitchcock Theater" and "The Twilight Zone," the show features multiple works with Tamori as the storyteller and actors as the main characters. While horror and supernatural themes are predominant, a variety of genres like comedy and drama are also produced. Most episodes, however, have a bad ending.', 'Inspired by American TV movies like "Hitchcock Theater" and "The Twilight Zone," the show features multiple works with Tamori as the storyteller and actors as the main characters. While horror and supernatural themes are predominant, a variety of genres like comedy and drama are also produced. Most episodes, however, have a bad ending.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7XVTRl17sNGh8tRzSczEZXaiwPG.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:71488'),
  ('491023248281154676', 'Tales of the City', 1993, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Armistead Maupin, Richard Kramer', null, 'Olympia Dukakis, Donald Moffat, Chloe Webb, Laura Linney, Marcus D''Amico, Thomas Gibson, Paul Gross, Barbara Garrick', null, 'Mary Ann Singleton, a naïve young secretary from the mid-west, tumbles head first into the colorful world of San Francisco, where carefree chaos revolves around the funky old apartment house at 28 Barbary Lane.', 'Mary Ann Singleton, a naïve young secretary from the mid-west, tumbles head first into the colorful world of San Francisco, where carefree chaos revolves around the funky old apartment house at 28 Barbary Lane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/EfM6EHyzr2q7TWFO5uEBNssgo4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18745'),
  ('752503836983213226', 'Tales of the City', 2019, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Lauren Morelli', null, 'Laura Linney, Elliot Page, Paul Gross, Murray Bartlett, Charlie Barnett, Garcia, May Hong, Olympia Dukakis', 'TV-MA', 'Mary Ann returns to present-day San Francisco and is reunited with her daughter and ex-husband, twenty years after leaving them behind to pursue her career. Fleeing the midlife crisis that her picture-perfect Connecticut life created, Mary Ann is quickly drawn back into the orbit of Anna Madrigal, her chosen family and a new generation of queer young residents living at 28 Barbary Lane.', 'Mary Ann returns to present-day San Francisco and is reunited with her daughter and ex-husband, twenty years after leaving them behind to pursue her career. Fleeing the midlife crisis that her picture-perfect Connecticut life created, Mary Ann is quickly drawn back into the orbit of Anna Madrigal, her chosen family and a new generation of queer young residents living at 28 Barbary Lane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wAvniCqQPlgX4wEgfGimZs5rzVn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87731'),
  ('643832995179462226', 'Tales of the Gold Monkey', 1982, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Donald P. Bellisario', null, 'Stephen Collins, Caitlin O''Heaney, Jeff MacKay, Roddy McDowall, Marta DuBois, John Fujioka, John Calvin', null, 'In a backwater corner of the South Pacific in 1938, a young American adventurer and his ragtag group of friends become involved in death-defying hi-jinx, transporting people-on-the-run in a well-worn Grumman Goose seaplane.', 'In a backwater corner of the South Pacific in 1938, a young American adventurer and his ragtag group of friends become involved in death-defying hi-jinx, transporting people-on-the-run in a well-worn Grumman Goose seaplane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yuWusb0dvhuw6fuKlVCgXgIh93g.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2999'),
  ('607052344750672400', 'Tales of the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family, Comedy', 'Christopher L. Yost', null, 'Micah Abbey, Shamon Brown Jr., Nicolas Cantu, Brady Noon', 'TV-Y7', 'The Turtles — Leo, Raph, Donnie and Mikey — each will go it alone for the first time. Faced with new threats and teaming up with old allies, the Turtles will discover who they really are when they don’t have their brothers at their sides.', 'The Turtles — Leo, Raph, Donnie and Mikey — each will go it alone for the first time. Faced with new threats and teaming up with old allies, the Turtles will discover who they really are when they don’t have their brothers at their sides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0ZlpvK0Ewd3iJYUyYPfwAAeR88.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:231394'),
  ('923546566520583658', 'Tales of the Unexpected', 1979, 'Drama', 'Roald Dahl', null, null, null, 'A British television anthology of stories, often with sinister and wryly comedic undertones, and a twist at the end. With early episodes written and presented by Roald Dahl, the series featured a plethora of big name guest stars.', 'A British television anthology of stories, often with sinister and wryly comedic undertones, and a twist at the end. With early episodes written and presented by Roald Dahl, the series featured a plethora of big name guest stars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfG5gafbtxtfMvgDdNi56evx4Og.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:2199'),
  ('47662238048078742', 'Tales of the Walking Dead', 2022, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Channing Powell, Scott M. Gimple', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'An episodic anthology series focused on both new and established characters set in the world of "The Walking Dead."', 'An episodic anthology series focused on both new and established characters set in the world of "The Walking Dead."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRMUHvTgQ79zteQafNI46Nd9XFm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:136248'),
  ('793469273619750519', 'Tales of Wedding Rings', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Gen Sato, Akari Kito, Miyuri Shimabukuro, Hitomi Ueda, Ai Kakuma, Mikako Komatsu, Shigeru Chiba, Shogo Sakata', 'TV-MA', 'Sato is a high school boy in love with his best friend Hime, an unearthly beauty from another realm. So when she moves back to her home world to get married, Sato doesn’t think twice—he follows her and crashes the wedding. Then, after a kiss from Hime, he suddenly becomes the new groom! But here, Hime is a Ring Princess and her husband is destined to be the Ring King: a hero of immense power.', 'Sato is a high school boy in love with his best friend Hime, an unearthly beauty from another realm. So when she moves back to her home world to get married, Sato doesn’t think twice—he follows her and crashes the wedding. Then, after a kiss from Hime, he suddenly becomes the new groom! But here, Hime is a Ring Princess and her husband is destined to be the Ring King: a hero of immense power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNuV7Jti0jYQh34OP2WdmhflTDQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218493'),
  ('959647700162640756', 'Tales of Wells Fargo', 1957, 'Western, Drama', 'Gene Reynolds', null, 'Dale Robertson', 'TV-14', 'Jim Hardie helps Wells Fargo agents battle the bad guys.', 'Jim Hardie helps Wells Fargo agents battle the bad guys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqm4UkpOT7pno9zt25nSmbt7MIh.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:13795'),
  ('663299973443373638', 'Tales of Zestiria the X', 2016, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, 'Hikaru Kondô', 'Ryohei Kimura, Ryota Osaka, Ai Kayano, Kenichi Ogata, Takehito Koyasu, Mikako Komatsu', 'TV-14', 'Legends speak of the Shepherd, a savior who will bring peace to the seraphim and human worlds. Sorey has spent his life studying ancient books and exploring ruins to learn more about this legendary savior. When he and his seraphim companion Mikleo encounter a mysterious girl in the ruins, the stories of the Shepherd become Sorey''s reality.', 'Legends speak of the Shepherd, a savior who will bring peace to the seraphim and human worlds. Sorey has spent his life studying ancient books and exploring ruins to learn more about this legendary savior. When he and his seraphim companion Mikleo encounter a mysterious girl in the ruins, the stories of the Shepherd become Sorey''s reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8cvnUjctdbExvnRyo8AVDvo2KaT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66991'),
  ('723025843439153976', 'Tales to Keep You Awake', 1966, 'Drama, Comedy, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Chicho Ibáñez Serrador', null, 'Chicho Ibáñez Serrador', 'NR', 'Tales of terror by established authors such as Ray Bradbury or Edgar Allan Poe, as well as original scripts.', 'Tales of terror by established authors such as Ray Bradbury or Edgar Allan Poe, as well as original scripts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lTwy9MLcpyLOwI3ZoyaYL0Hio3H.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:44495'),
  ('1008858018884106683', 'TaleSpin', 1990, 'Family, Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure', 'Jymn Magon', null, 'Ed Gilbert, Sally Struthers', 'TV-Y7', 'Baloo the Bear stars in an adventurous comedy of love and conflict with his friend Kit Cloudkicker. Rebecca Cunningham and her daughter Molly purchase Baloo''s failing company and Baloo must fly transport runs to clear his debt while dodging Don Karnage and his sky pirates.', 'Baloo the Bear stars in an adventurous comedy of love and conflict with his friend Kit Cloudkicker. Rebecca Cunningham and her daughter Molly purchase Baloo''s failing company and Baloo must fly transport runs to clear his debt while dodging Don Karnage and his sky pirates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gObO6CMSRbQNehvJyF4CwOHC5VI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2720'),
  ('798841608862344426', 'Talia in the Kitchen', 2015, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Maria Quezada, Galilea La Salvia, Jeannette Lehr, Ellis Ann Jackson, Joshua Hoffman, Liam Obergfoll, Miguel Luciano', 'TV-G', 'When 14-year-old Talia visits her grandmother for the summer and starts spending time in her family''s restaurant, she discovers she''s got a gift. With the help of her special "salt and pepper sense" and her late father''s magical spices, Talia can whip up some truly life changing cuisine and cook just what each customer needs. She''s making magic in the kitchen.', 'When 14-year-old Talia visits her grandmother for the summer and starts spending time in her family''s restaurant, she discovers she''s got a gift. With the help of her special "salt and pepper sense" and her late father''s magical spices, Talia can whip up some truly life changing cuisine and cook just what each customer needs. She''s making magic in the kitchen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfHy8YDHmzsrA6n0tHh5ABnkXZS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:63240'),
  ('603305932156646152', 'Talking Bad', 2013, 'Talk', null, null, 'Chris Hardwick', null, 'Talking Bad was a weekly half-hour after-show on AMC that served as an accompaniment to the last eight episodes of Breaking Bad. The host, Chris Hardwick, who had already worked on Talking Dead, the live talk show program for AMC''s The Walking Dead, analyzes and discuses the latest episodes with special guests.', 'Talking Bad was a weekly half-hour after-show on AMC that served as an accompaniment to the last eight episodes of Breaking Bad. The host, Chris Hardwick, who had already worked on Talking Dead, the live talk show program for AMC''s The Walking Dead, analyzes and discuses the latest episodes with special guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/amTHoRxnho70p0xpbEOuS2GwR2x.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64902'),
  ('320262461970193395', 'Talking Bones', 2018, 'Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Zhang Lingxin, Gao Yiren, Cai Yida, Li Hanlin, Jiang Anjing', null, 'The story revolves around Shang Jie, the overly critical head of a crime investigation team; Xia Ying, a forensic examiner who is completely engrossed with her profession; Li Xue Kai, a detective and a good tracker; Song Mi, an innocent and ditsy analyst and Ying Ming, a second-generation rich who works as a criminal psychologist. The five form an unlikely team as they are the rejects of the department, yet through teamwork and dedication, they succeed in solving the most unusual murder cases.', 'The story revolves around Shang Jie, the overly critical head of a crime investigation team; Xia Ying, a forensic examiner who is completely engrossed with her profession; Li Xue Kai, a detective and a good tracker; Song Mi, an innocent and ditsy analyst and Ying Ming, a second-generation rich who works as a criminal psychologist. The five form an unlikely team as they are the rejects of the department, yet through teamwork and dedication, they succeed in solving the most unusual murder cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkY7YZ4wQWYmCvy26PhkVg5Hfgr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:92246'),
  ('363746941970981899', 'Talking Dead', 2011, 'Talk', null, null, 'Chris Hardwick', 'TV-14', 'Host Chris Hardwick discusses episodes of the AMC television series The Walking Dead with guests, including celebrity fans, cast members, and crew from the series.', 'Host Chris Hardwick discusses episodes of the AMC television series The Walking Dead with guests, including celebrity fans, cast members, and crew from the series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEsDfVvYNsAgmJeynSQGuLKyhcJ.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:42021'),
  ('1062137917269303463', 'Talking Tom and Friends', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Samo Login, Tom Martin, Boris Dolenc', null, 'Colin Hanks, Lisa Schwartz, James Adomian, Maria Bamford, Tom Kenny', 'TV-G', 'Armed with technological gear, great ideas and an unfailing sense of humour, Talking Tom and his friends are on a mission to reach stardom at all costs.', 'Armed with technological gear, great ideas and an unfailing sense of humour, Talking Tom and his friends are on a mission to reach stardom at all costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6We7ht3z8bSIaUF8P7DEwopOPi.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:81425'),
  ('1113190565518221048', 'Tall Tales & Legends', 1985, 'Family, Kids, Comedy, Drama', 'Shelley Duvall', null, 'Shelley Duvall', null, 'An anthology series that showcases various mythical characters and incidents throughout history.', 'An anthology series that showcases various mythical characters and incidents throughout history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cFGFFuHmpq9R0QqqW5NYJ3DFMqJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:20473'),
  ('962853671483287991', 'Tamagon the Counselor', 1972, 'Animation', null, null, 'Hiroshi Otake, Tōru Ōhira', null, 'Tamagon the Counselor, also known as Eggzavier the Eggasaurus, is a Japanese anime television series created by Tatsunoko Production. Tatsunoko''s description of the series reads as follows: "Tamagon is a cute monster who is fond of eggs. He acts as a counselor to those in trouble, asking only eggs in payment. He goes to work as soon as he has eaten his fee. However, despite his schemes, his service usually ends in failure and he winds up being chased by his irate clients. Short as it is, this program is full of lively laughs and humor."', 'Tamagon the Counselor, also known as Eggzavier the Eggasaurus, is a Japanese anime television series created by Tatsunoko Production. Tatsunoko''s description of the series reads as follows: "Tamagon is a cute monster who is fond of eggs. He acts as a counselor to those in trouble, asking only eggs in payment. He goes to work as soon as he has eaten his fee. However, despite his schemes, his service usually ends in failure and he winds up being chased by his irate clients. Short as it is, this program is full of lively laughs and humor."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3JsMawNivbEzuOn34wdi0eCySi1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44654'),
  ('19368747787626855', 'Tamako Market', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Aya Suzaki, Takumi Yamazaki, Yuki Kaneko, Juri Nagatsuma', 'TV-14', 'Tamako is just a normal young girl whose family has been making mochi for generations. As her birthday approaches, she happens to meet a talking bird who claims to be a royal court attendant looking for a bride for his master. After the encounter, Dera the bird decides to stay around her and becomes a part of Tamako''s life and the neighborhood that she lives in.', 'Tamako is just a normal young girl whose family has been making mochi for generations. As her birthday approaches, she happens to meet a talking bird who claims to be a royal court attendant looking for a bride for his master. After the encounter, Dera the bird decides to stay around her and becomes a part of Tamako''s life and the neighborhood that she lives in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcukkGngZn4O5KjrTGXr2FYk9LJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:48561'),
  ('1129780869334089423', 'TAMAYOMI: The Baseball Girls', 2020, 'Animation', null, null, 'Kaori Maeda, Satomi Amano, Nao Shiraki, Miyu Tomita, Rina Kitagawa, Marie Hashimoto, Yume Miyamoto, Airi Eino', 'TV-14', 'In her Junior High years, the pitcher Yomi Takeda was not able to get very far in a cross-school baseball tournament. Since the catcher on her team wasn''t at her level, she couldn''t use her signature move, the "Magic Throw," and eventually regretted not being able to use it. After Junior High, she decided to stop playing baseball and went to Shin Koshigaya High School, a school without a baseball club. There, she found her long lost childhood friend, Tamaki Yamazaki, who used to play catchball with her when they were kids. Tamaki also played baseball during her Junior High years as a catcher, and could even catch Yomi''s "Magic Throw!" Their promise with each other during their childhood could now be fulfilled! Walking together on the road of baseball once again... The story of the girls who love baseball will begin!', 'In her Junior High years, the pitcher Yomi Takeda was not able to get very far in a cross-school baseball tournament. Since the catcher on her team wasn''t at her level, she couldn''t use her signature move, the "Magic Throw," and eventually regretted not being able to use it. After Junior High, she decided to stop playing baseball and went to Shin Koshigaya High School, a school without a baseball club. There, she found her long lost childhood friend, Tamaki Yamazaki, who used to play catchball with her when they were kids. Tamaki also played baseball during her Junior High years as a catcher, and could even catch Yomi''s "Magic Throw!" Their promise with each other during their childhood could now be fulfilled! Walking together on the road of baseball once again... The story of the girls who love baseball will begin!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aoTY6IXfNYxWBJyNPI792y6CpYW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93890'),
  ('205529821112866175', 'Tamayura', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Ayana Taketatsu, Kana Asumi, Yuko Gibu, Yuka Iguchi', 'TV-14', 'As a little girl, Fuu Sawatari’s father taught her to love photography. They took pictures everywhere they went. But after he passed away, seeing those photographs only served as a reminder of her loss, so she locked them away to be forgotten. Years later, the pictures remind Fuu of all the happy memories of her father that she will carry with her forever.', 'As a little girl, Fuu Sawatari’s father taught her to love photography. They took pictures everywhere they went. But after he passed away, seeing those photographs only served as a reminder of her loss, so she locked them away to be forgotten. Years later, the pictures remind Fuu of all the happy memories of her father that she will carry with her forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9q4V0FVwoVK9qo7d3aKLAzMNXk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83621'),
  ('576911465650637931', 'Tamayura: Hitotose', 2011, 'Comedy, Animation', null, null, 'Ayana Taketatsu, Kana Asumi, Yuka Iguchi, Yuko Gibu, Ai Kayano, Sayaka Ohara, Minako Kotobuki, Junji Majima', null, 'As a little girl, Fuu Sawatari’s father taught her to love photography. They took pictures everywhere they went. But after he passed away, seeing those photographs only served as a reminder of her loss, so she locked them away to be forgotten. Years later, her brother Kou finds their father’s picture album, and as he flips through its pages, the pictures remind Fuu of all the happy memories of her father that she will carry with her forever. Now, as the shy Fuu enters her first year of high school, she once again takes up her father’s old camera, determined to take wonderful pictures that will bring joy and happiness to others.', 'As a little girl, Fuu Sawatari’s father taught her to love photography. They took pictures everywhere they went. But after he passed away, seeing those photographs only served as a reminder of her loss, so she locked them away to be forgotten. Years later, her brother Kou finds their father’s picture album, and as he flips through its pages, the pictures remind Fuu of all the happy memories of her father that she will carry with her forever. Now, as the shy Fuu enters her first year of high school, she once again takes up her father’s old camera, determined to take wonderful pictures that will bring joy and happiness to others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h2lrJMzxHHRgT33PLspZ38OXbxK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:45088'),
  ('850334265969610858', 'Tamizha Tamizha', null, null, null, null, null, null, 'Film director and actor Karu Pazhaniappan hosts debates on current affairs and topics which can bring about change in the society.', 'Film director and actor Karu Pazhaniappan hosts debates on current affairs and topics which can bring about change in the society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nPTBIzDyiRacWtkBlERyIhyY59r.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:127453'),
  ('294112205438269345', 'Tamon''s B-Side', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Saori Hayami, Kakeru Hatano, Shoya Chiba, Tasuku Hatanaka, Kohei Amasaki, Ryuho Nagaoka', null, 'Utage Kinoshita is a high school girl who works part-time as a housekeeper. She has devoted her life to her favorite idol, Tamon Fukuhara, from the group F/ACE. Then one day, Utage ends up being assigned to Tamon’s house! There she discovers that off-stage, he is nothing like his wild idol persona. A gloomy, introverted boy with no self-confidence, Utage still finds herself falling for him anyway.', 'Utage Kinoshita is a high school girl who works part-time as a housekeeper. She has devoted her life to her favorite idol, Tamon Fukuhara, from the group F/ACE. Then one day, Utage ends up being assigned to Tamon’s house! There she discovers that off-stage, he is nothing like his wild idol persona. A gloomy, introverted boy with no self-confidence, Utage still finds herself falling for him anyway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1iTCxEIK1xlmIXjHcLjt0UyOU8w.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:276393'),
  ('421562918324305200', 'Tamron Hall', 2019, 'Talk', 'Tamron Hall', null, 'Tamron Hall', 'TV-PG', 'Former news host and journalist Tamron Hall discusses all things topical and engages those she interviews in thorough meaningful and entertaining conversations.', 'Former news host and journalist Tamron Hall discusses all things topical and engages those she interviews in thorough meaningful and entertaining conversations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pOqHc6Q47uGqnCps1DGVMaWyd9v.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:93449'),
  ('1083674719618290350', 'Tanaka-kun Is Always Listless', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Kensho Ono, Yoshimasa Hosoya', null, 'A lethargic student dozes through class, activities and pretty much everything, frustrating his best friend but attracting the affections of others.', 'A lethargic student dozes through class, activities and pretty much everything, frustrating his best friend but attracting the affections of others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3TdnhtfXh6yfrHuZO0hEmkjjnr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66077'),
  ('257516849741007887', 'Tandav', 2021, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Ali Abbas Zafar', 'Gaurav Solanki, Ali Abbas Zafar', 'Saif Ali Khan, Dimple Kapadia, Mohammed Zeeshan Ayyub, Sunil Grover, Sarah-Jane Dias, Kritika Kamra, Bhavna Choudhary, Vikhyat Gulati', null, 'Tandav is the coming together of different worlds under the gamut of politics. It is a dramatic take of the powerplay between people at the highest level where they get overthrown by others to secure their position. Young and upcoming student politicians are also featured and we get to see where their future is headed in this dark abyss of politics.', 'Tandav is the coming together of different worlds under the gamut of politics. It is a dramatic take of the powerplay between people at the highest level where they get overthrown by others to secure their position. Young and upcoming student politicians are also featured and we get to see where their future is headed in this dark abyss of politics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dB5a1M02ZydD4PfgWEPU8Zdvypi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114796'),
  ('193263360444018315', 'Tanglin', 2015, 'Drama', 'media corp', 'Yvonne Loh', 'Eden Ang, Eswari Gunasagar, James Kumar, Jae Liew, Margaret Lim, Kiki Lim, Richard Low, Mastura Ahmad', null, 'Daily drama centring on a number of multiracial and multi-generational families in modern Singapore.', 'Daily drama centring on a number of multiracial and multi-generational families in modern Singapore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rxRTWNOQWM638069ffFLOu6obUd.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:83162'),
  ('466219615316020178', 'Tanked', 2011, 'Reality', null, null, 'Wayde King, Brett Raymer, Irwin Raymer, Heather King, Robert Christlieb, Agnes Wilczynski', 'TV-PG', 'Following the antics of two brothers-in-law as they run the largest aquarium manufacturing company in the nation, Tanked dunks viewers into the high-decibel, family-owned business of Acrylic Tank Manufacturing (ATM). Led by business partners, best friends and constant rivals Wayde King and Brett Raymer, this 13,000 square foot facility, located in Las Vegas, produces some of the most outrageous, larger-than-life and one-of-a-kind tanks for some of the most striking fish and clients around.', 'Following the antics of two brothers-in-law as they run the largest aquarium manufacturing company in the nation, Tanked dunks viewers into the high-decibel, family-owned business of Acrylic Tank Manufacturing (ATM). Led by business partners, best friends and constant rivals Wayde King and Brett Raymer, this 13,000 square foot facility, located in Las Vegas, produces some of the most outrageous, larger-than-life and one-of-a-kind tanks for some of the most striking fish and clients around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/njjzKLWtJ3IZVxG0A5vm0FWIAiz.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:61329'),
  ('590596777431986442', 'Tanken Driland - 1000-nen no Mahō -', 2013, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Mayumi Yamaguchi, Motoko Kumai, Yu Shimamura, Hideyuki Tanaka, Kenji Nojima, Tetsuya Yanagisawa, Kanako Miyamoto', null, '1,000 years after Princess Mikoto''s era, all hunters have been sealed into cards due to a certain incident in the past. Adventurous boy Hagan becomes the key to freeing these sealed hunters, and travels along with his friends to find these cards, sometimes facing treacherous battles.', '1,000 years after Princess Mikoto''s era, all hunters have been sealed into cards due to a certain incident in the past. Adventurous boy Hagan becomes the key to freeing these sealed hunters, and travels along with his friends to find these cards, sometimes facing treacherous battles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j1qOcw070gH7z5yaMHTuWislOXX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123597'),
  ('306931617792646341', 'Tankki täyteen', 1978, 'Comedy, Family', null, 'Esko Leimu, Neil Hardwick', 'Tuire Salenius, Ilmari Saarelainen, Tenho Saurén, Tauno Karvonen, Sylvi Salonen', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DpgQkTCcbBkpT0pXogxSqwagos.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:70693'),
  ('967441243609920985', 'Tapas & Beijos', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Cláudio Paiva', 'Cláudio Lisboa, Nilton Braga', 'Andréa Beltrão, Fernanda Torres, Vladimir Brichta, Otávio Müller, Érico Brás, Fernanda de Freitas, Flávio Migliaccio, Kiko Mascarenhas', null, 'The daily life of two friends, Sueli and Fátima, whom despite being independent and single women, always feel smothered.', 'The daily life of two friends, Sueli and Fátima, whom despite being independent and single women, always feel smothered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7STF15AEhpBsIErShwlonj8klQa.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:46021'),
  ('1087335652067515082', 'Taqdeer', 2020, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Syed Ahmed Shawki', 'Neamoth Ullah Masum, Syed Ahmed Shawki Syed Ahmed Shawki', 'Chanchal Chowdhury, Sanjida Preeti, Manoj Kumar Pramanik, Shohel Mondol, Partha Barua', null, 'Freezer van driver Taqdeer spirals into a dark game of destiny after he finds the unclaimed dead body of a woman in his truck.', 'Freezer van driver Taqdeer spirals into a dark game of destiny after he finds the unclaimed dead body of a woman in his truck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmkU2VXEBxLfh92xjXQsctTdFDW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114809'),
  ('963744043008990845', 'Taratata', 1993, 'Reality', 'Nagui, Gérard Pullicino', null, 'Nagui', 'TV-G', 'Taratata was a French TV show showcasing live and pre-recorded footage of current rock acts. Presented by Nagui since its début in 1993, the show was initially shown on France 2. The show often involved surprise and unlikely duets, as well as brief interviews with the artists. Taratata was cancelled in 2000, but returned in April 2005 on the public French network France 4 once a week on prime time, France 3, and late night once a month France 2 and Virgin Radio. Artists including Devendra Banhart, Katie Melua, and Ayo made their French TV debut on the show. The show''s chief lighting technician, Jean-Philippe Bourdon, was awarded two Sept d''or in 1994 and 1995. The show featured unique duets and highlights new artists and uses different presenters for each episode. These aspects, and the general emphasis on original music, led the Conseil supérieur de l''audiovisuel to identify Taratata as a uniquely creative show on French TV in April 2009. The show aired throughout Europe on TV5MONDE Europe on Saturday nights. The show is also franchised to Dubai Television in Arabic with an almost identical format to its French counterpart. On 31 May 2013, France Télévisions announced that the show was cancelled. Despite the announcement, the show will continue in a web only format and that a concert will be oragnized at Zénith de Paris on 10 October 2013. The last show was recorded on 13 June 2013 and was broadcast on 12 July 2013.', 'Taratata was a French TV show showcasing live and pre-recorded footage of current rock acts. Presented by Nagui since its début in 1993, the show was initially shown on France 2. The show often involved surprise and unlikely duets, as well as brief interviews with the artists. Taratata was cancelled in 2000, but returned in April 2005 on the public French network France 4 once a week on prime time, France 3, and late night once a month France 2 and Virgin Radio. Artists including Devendra Banhart, Katie Melua, and Ayo made their French TV debut on the show. The show''s chief lighting technician, Jean-Philippe Bourdon, was awarded two Sept d''or in 1994 and 1995. The show featured unique duets and highlights new artists and uses different presenters for each episode. These aspects, and the general emphasis on original music, led the Conseil supérieur de l''audiovisuel to identify Taratata as a uniquely creative show on French TV in April 2009. The show aired throughout Europe on TV5MONDE Europe on Saturday nights. The show is also franchised to Dubai Television in Arabic with an almost identical format to its French counterpart. On 31 May 2013, France Télévisions announced that the show was cancelled. Despite the announcement, the show will continue in a web only format and that a concert will be oragnized at Zénith de Paris on 10 October 2013. The last show was recorded on 13 June 2013 and was broadcast on 12 July 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHBWAHqMBlnjGTxHoPz3XXmi6QF.jpg', 25, 'tmdb:tv:13480'),
