  ('700600795841855908', 'Te Doy La Vida', 2020, 'Drama, Soap, Family, Kids', 'María José Galleguillos', null, 'José Ron, Eva Cedeño, Jorge Salinas, Erika Buenfil, César Évora Díaz, Omar Fierro, Nuria Bages, Leonardo Herrea', null, 'A couple adopts a boy named Nicolás. Over the months, Nicolás is diagnosed with leukemia, and to try to recover, he will need the help of his biological father, whom he does not know.', 'A couple adopts a boy named Nicolás. Over the months, Nicolás is diagnosed with leukemia, and to try to recover, he will need the help of his biological father, whom he does not know.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jyZD48yf8P3j8QOY9MMRFf5qiDB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:102182'),
